AY / ROOT\n==================================================\n\nConfronta:\n\n- edge-to-edge\n- WindowInsets.safeDrawing\n- transparent root\n- status bar\n- navigation bar\n- status icon behavior\n- canvas sizing\n- S formula\n- H formula\n- P = 0.84 × S\n- horizontal centering\n- vertical placement\n- bottom alignment\n- top spacer\n- weighted spacer\n- bottom safe gap\n\nPer ogni differenza indica:\n\nCANONICAL\nCURRENT\nSTATUS\nSOURCE\n\n==================================================\n3. GEOMETRIA\n==================================================\n\nConfronta esattamente:\n\nUPPER CONTAINER\n- width\n- composition/height\n- horizontal padding\n- vertical padding\n- radius\n- elevation\n- background\n- clipping\n\nFAV PANEL\n- width\n- height\n- radius\n- background\n- alignment\n- padding\n\nPANEL 1\n- width\n- height\n- padding X/Y\n- radius\n- background\n\nPANEL 2\n- width\n- height\n- padding X/Y\n- radius\n- background\n\nDOCK\n- width\n- height\n- padding\n- radius\n- elevation\n- background\n\nPer valori formula-based confronta la FORMULA,\nnon soltanto il risultato numerico a 411 dp.\n\n==================================================\n4. SPACING\n==================================================\n\nConfronta:\n\n- outer side margin\n- container horizontal padding\n- container vertical padding\n- Fav internal inset\n- Fav → Panel 1\n- Panel 1 → Panel 2\n- Panel 2/container → Dock\n- Dock → safe bottom\n- panel row gap\n- panel horizontal distribution\n- dock horizontal distribution\n- Fav text gaps\n- clock gaps\n- Dynamic Fav gaps\n\nCanonical Pixel 10 / S=411 reference:\n\nP = 345.240 dp\n\nouter side margin = 32.880 dp\ncontainer horizontal padding = 11.048 dp\ncontainer vertical padding = 11.976 dp\nFav internal horizontal inset = 17.952 dp\nFav → P1 = 9.214 dp\nP1 → P2 = 9.214 dp\ncontainer → Dock = 16.137 dp\nDock → safe bottom = 1 dp\npanel row gap = 27.550 dp\n\nUsa questi numeri soltanto come validazione.\nLa formula resta la source of