\n==================================================\n\nSettings modifica solo DRAFT/preferences appropriate.\n\nNON deve possedere:\n\ncatalog\nHome snapshot\nP1/P2 runtime\nDock runtime\nicon cache\n\n==================================================\n11. SAVED / DRAFT\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il contract stabile:\n\nSettings edits:\nDRAFT\n\nSave:\nDRAFT → SAVED\n\nRestore:\nSAVED → DRAFT\n\nReset:\ndefaults → DRAFT\n\nHome:\nSAVED only\n\n==================================================\n12. ICON PACK\n==================================================\n\nSettings può cambiare icon pack.\n\nMa deve usare il resolver/cache stabile corrente.\n\nNON importare il vecchio resolver pre-rebase.\n\n==================================================\n13. DYNAMIC MEDIA\n==================================================\n\nRipristina la UI dell'ultima Settings.\n\nMantieni però il backend stabile corrente.\n\nNessun permission loop.\n\n==================================================\n14. SET AS HOME\n==================================================\n\nRipristina la riga/pagina UI precedente.\n\nMantieni RoleManager backend stabile.\n\nNo prompt loop.\n\n==================================================\n15. ABOUT / CHANGELOG\n==================================================\n\nRipristina l'ultima UI approvata.\n\nMantieni:\n\nAbout\nChangelog\n\nNessuna animazione first-install.\n\n==================================================\n16. SETTINGS NAVIGATION\n==================================================\n\nRecupera la navigazione visuale precedente,\nma semplifica eventuali route morte.\n\nBack:\nsempre deterministico.\n\nSettings → Home:\nnon deve modificare Home state.\n\n==================================================\n17. INPUT SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nSettings rows:\n\nun solo clickable owner.\n\nSwitch:\nnessun double-toggle.\n\nNessun pointerInput custom.\n\nNessun horizontal gesture.\n\n==================================================\n18. RETURN-HOME SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL:\n\nDopo qualsiasi Settings page:\n\nBack/Home\n→ P1/P2/Dock già presenti\n→ catalog non svuotato\n→ icon cache non svuotata\n→ first touch works\n\nSettings NON deve chiamare reloadHome() su exit.\n\n==================================================\n19. NEW APP ICON\n==================================================\n\nMantieni anche la nuova launcher icon approvata:\n\nwhite background\nblack hexagon\nsmall white X\n\nNON ripristinare la vecchia icona dal checkpoint.\n\n==================================================\n20. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n21. CREATE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_LAST_SETTINGS_RESTORE.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- checkpoint source usato\n- Settings files analizzati\n- UI elements restored\n- functional options restored\n- obsolete options excluded\n- adapters creati\n- confirmation no Home/input code imported\n- build\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nSettings visual source:\nPRE_REBASE_LAST_VERSION\n\nOld stable Settings visual:\nNOT_USED_AS_TARGET\n\nHome code imported from broken backup:\n0\n\nGesture code imported:\n0\n\nSearch runtime imported:\n0\n\nLifecycle code imported:\n0\n\nSettings UI restored:\nYES\n\nP1 editor:\n8\n\nP2 editor:\n8\n\nDock editor:\n5\n\nP2 suggestions:\n0\n\nHorizontal gestures:\n0\n\nSearch history:\n0\n\nNew hexagon/X launcher icon:\nPRESERVED\n\nSettings→Home regression:\nNONE\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME LAST SETTINGS RESTORED\n\nPre-rebase checkpoint used: <path>\nSettings files analyzed: <numero>\nSettings UI files restored/adapted: <numero>\nSettings resources restored: <numero>\nRoot Settings rows: <numero>\nP1 editable slots: <numero>\nP2 editable slots: <numero>\nDock editable slots: <numero>\nP2 suggested paths: <numero>\nObsolete options restored: <numero>\nHome runtime files imported from pre-rebase: <numero>\nGesture files imported from pre-rebase: <numero>\nSearch runtime files imported from pre-rebase: <numero>\nLifecycle files imported from pre-rebase: <numero>\nNew launcher icon preserved: <YES/NO>\nSettings→Home state regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\nAudit: /opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_LAST_SETTINGS_RESTORE.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:191:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787141438,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — SETTINGS UI RECONSTRUCTION V2\nREFERENCE-DRIVEN / STABLE BACKEND\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nVISUAL REFERENCES PROVIDED BY USER:\n- Settings root screenshot\n- Home configuration/editor screenshot\n- Changelog & Roadmap screenshot\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRicostruire le Settings prendendo come riferimento VISIVO gli screenshot forniti.\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nGli screenshot rappresentano la famiglia UI corretta,\nma la nuova implementazione deve essere:\n\n- più pulita\n- più coerente\n- più stabile\n- meno affollata\n- senza codice legacy\n\nNON ripristinare vecchio runtime Settings.\n\nUsare:\n\nREFERENCE VISUAL UI\n+\nCURRENT STABLE BACKEND\n\n==================================================\n1. SETTINGS ROOT — VISUAL TARGET\n==================================================\n\nStruttura:\n\nMachina\n\nImpostazioni\n\n[ Home ]\nLauncher, icone Home e Dock\n\n[ Aspetto ]\nColori, wallpaper e icone\n\n[ Smart Drawer ]\nApp, ricerca e app nascoste\n\n[ Interazione ]\nFeedback tattile e media\n\n[ Informazioni ]\nPackage, versione e profilo display\n\n[ Changelog & Roadmap ]\nNovità e prossimi passi\n\n==================================================\n2. ROOT STYLE\n==================================================\n\nBackground:\n#0D0D0D circa\n\nContent horizontal padding:\n20–24dp\n\nTop spacing:\ngeneroso\n\nSmall brand:\n\"Machina\"\n\nfont:\n12–13sp\nSemiBold\nletterSpacing leggero\n\ncolor:\nsecondary\n\nMain title:\n\"Impostazioni\"\n\n34–38sp\nBold\n\n==================================================\n3. CATEGORY CARDS\n==================================================\n\nOgni categoria è una card separata.\n\nTarget:\n\nbackground:\n#1B1B1B / #1C1C1C\n\nradius:\n20–22dp\n\nmin height:\n90–100dp\n\nhorizontal padding:\n20dp\n\nvertical padding:\n18dp\n\ngap fra cards:\n12dp\n\nNO shadow.\nNO gradient.\nNO glossy effect.\n\n==================================================\n4. CATEGORY CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nPrima riga:\n\nsmall line icon\n+\ntitle\n\nTitle:\n20–22sp\nSemiBold/Bold\n#F4F4F4\n\nSeconda riga:\n\nsubtitle\n15–16sp\n#AAAAAA\n\nNon usare emoji Unicode come icone.\n\nUsa vector icons monocromatiche coerenti.\n\n==================================================\n5. ROOT CATEGORIES\n==================================================\n\nHOME\n\nContiene:\n- configurazione P1\n- configurazione P2\n- configurazione Dock\n- eventuali Home defaults realmente supportati\n\nASPETTO\n\nContiene:\n- Home wallpaper\n- Fav wallpaper\n- Icon shape\n- Icon pack\n- Status bar\n\nSMART DRAWER\n\nContiene:\n- All Apps\n- Hidden Apps\n- Profiles\n- Search behavior realmente supportato\n\nNON:\nSearch history\n\nINTERAZIONE\n\nContiene:\n- Haptic feedback\n- Dynamic Media\n\nNON:\ngesture configuration\nNON:\nanimations\nNON:\nswipe left/right\n\nINFORMAZIONI\n\nContiene:\n- package\n- version\n- build\n- display/profile information utile\n\nCHANGELOG & ROADMAP\n\nPagina dedicata.\n\n==================================================\n6. HOME EDITOR\n==================================================\n\nRicostruisci la pagina Home ispirandoti allo screenshot fornito.\n\nParte superiore:\n\npreview configurazione corrente.\n\nP1:\n8 slots\n\nP2:\n8 slots\n\nDock:\n5 slots\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nP2 = 8 MANUAL.\n\nNessuna suggestion.\nNessun random.\nNessun automatic refill.\n\n==================================================\n7. HOME PREVIEW\n==================================================\n\nUsa card scure coerenti.\n\nMostra:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\ncon icone correnti.\n\nNon deve essere un secondo launcher completo:\nsolo preview configurazione.\n\n==================================================\n8. HOME EDITOR ACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nSotto preview:\n\nSALVA CONFIGURAZIONE\n\"Applica P1, P2 e Dock alla Home.\"\n\nRIPRISTINA\n\"Annulla le modifiche non salvate e ricarica l'ultima configurazione applicata.\"\n\nRIPRISTINA PREDEFINITI\n\"Carica i valori predefiniti nel preview. Premi Salva per applicarli alla Home.\"\n\n==================================================\n9. ACTION ROW STYLE\n==================================================\n\nNON creare tre enormi card indipendenti.\n\nPreferire una singola Settings section/card con:\n\nrow\ndivider\nrow\ndivider\nrow\n\nPiù pulita dello screenshot storico.\n\n==================================================\n10. APP PICKER\n==================================================\n\nSotto:\n\nSCEGLI APP · P1\noppure\nSCEGLI APP · P2\noppure\nSCEGLI APP · DOCK\n\nMostra lista compatta:\n\nicon\napp name\neventuale profile badge\n\nDivider leggerissimo.\n\nNo card per ogni app.\n\n==================================================\n11. SLOT SELECTION\n==================================================\n\nPrima l'utente seleziona uno slot nella preview.\n\nPoi il picker sotto mostra:\n\nSCEGLI APP · P2 · 6\n\nTap app:\nassegna a DRAFT slot selezionato.\n\nNon applicare alla Home finché non viene premuto Salva.\n\n==================================================\n12. EMPTY SLOT\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi nel picker:\n\n\"Nessuna app\"\n\nper svuotare esplicitamente lo slot.\n\nExplicit empty:\nPRESERVED.\n\nMai auto-fill.\n\n==================================================\n13. PERSISTENCE\n==================================================\n\nMantieni:\n\nDRAFT\nSAVED\nMETA\n\nEditor:\nDRAFT\n\nSalva:\nDRAFT → SAVED\n\nRipristina:\nSAVED → DRAFT\n\nRipristina predefiniti:\nDEFAULTS → DRAFT\n\nHome:\nSAVED only.\n\n==================================================\n14. APPEARANCE PAGE\n==================================================\n\nStesso visual language.\n\nSections pulite per:\n\nWallpaper Home\nWallpaper Fav\nIcon Shape\nIcon Pack\nStatus Bar\n\nNO:\n\nshadow\nradius sliders\nopacity\nglobal scale\ngrid tuning\nlayout tuning\n\n==================================================\n15. SMART DRAWER PAGE\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il nome visuale:\n\nSmart Drawer\n\nma backend semplice.\n\nContiene:\n\nTutte le app\nApp nascoste\nProfili\n\nSearch:\nsolo se serve una row informativa/funzionale reale.\n\nNO history.\n\nNO recents configuration se non realmente utilizzata.\n\n==================================================\n16. INTERACTION PAGE\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il look storico,\nma riduci drasticamente le opzioni.\n\nSolo:\n\nFeedback tattile\nDynamic Media\n\nSe esiste una voce realmente utile per comportamento Home:\ndocumentala prima di aggiungerla.\n\nNO:\n\nSwipe Left\nSwipe Right\nSwipe Down\nGesture mapping\nAnimation speed\n\n==================================================\n17. INFORMATION PAGE\n==================================================\n\nVisual semplice.\n\nMostra:\n\nMachina Home\nversionName\nversionCode/build\npackage\nprofilo/display info utile\n\nNiente metadata tecnici inutili.\n\n==================================================\n18. CHANGELOG PAGE\n==================================================\n\nRicostruisci la pagina mostrata nello screenshot.\n\nHeader:\n\nMachina\n\n← Indietro\n\nⓘ Changelog & Roadmap\n\nsubtitle:\n\"Novità e prossimi passi\"\n\nVersion:\ncurrent actual version\n\n==================================================\n19. CHANGELOG CARDS\n==================================================\n\nCard scure espandibili.\n\nCollapsed:\n\nTitle\nversion/date\n+\n \nExpanded:\nmostra 2–5 punti concisi.\n\nRadius:\n18–20dp\n\nbackground:\n#171714 / #191917\n\n==================================================\n20. ACCENT\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il piccolo accent giallo/oro del reference SOLO per:\n\nsection heading CHANGELOG\n+\nexpand/collapse symbol\n\nTarget:\n#F4C430 circa\n\nNON usare accent ovunque.\n\n==================================================\n21. CHANGELOG CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nNON copiare testi obsoleti dello screenshot.\n\nGenera contenuto coerente con feature realmente presenti.\n\nEsempi:\n\nSTABILITY BASELINE\n- Home lifecycle stabilizzato\n- Input semplificato\n- gesture orizzontali rimosse\n\nHOME CUSTOMIZATION\n- P1 completamente personalizzabile\n- P2 con 8 slot manuali\n- Dock personalizzabile\n\nSEARCH\n- ricerca app\n- app nascoste\n- impostazioni\n- azioni\n\nAPPEARANCE\n- wallpaper Home/Fav\n- icon shape\n- icon pack\n\nNon dichiarare feature non implementate.\n\n==================================================\n22. NO SETTINGS ANIMATIONS\n==================================================\n\nPer stabilità:\n\ncard navigation:\nimmediate\n\nchangelog expand:\nimmediate oppure semplice state change\n\nNO:\nspring\nbounce\nscale\ncomplex fade\n\n==================================================\n23. INPUT MODEL\n==================================================\n\nSettings:\n\nstandard clickable only.\n\nNO pointerInput.\nNO gesture detectors.\nNO horizontal swipes.\n\nUna row:\nun click owner.\n\n==================================================\n24. BACK NAVIGATION\n==================================================\n\nUsa back navigation semplice e deterministica.\n\nSubpage:\n→ Settings root\n\nSettings root:\n→ Home / system behavior corrente\n\nNessuna gesture custom.\n\n==================================================\n25. HOME STATE IS NOT OWNED BY SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL:\n\nSettings non deve ricostruire:\n\ncatalog\nicon cache\nHome snapshot\n\nSettings → Home:\n\nP1/P2/Dock già disponibili.\n\n==================================================\n26. NEW MACHINA ICON\n==================================================\n\nMantieni/aggiungi la nuova icona approvata:\n\nWHITE BACKGROUND\nBLACK HEXAGON\nSMALL WHITE X\n\nFlat.\n\nNo shadow.\nNo gradient.\nNo shine.\n\nAggiorna:\n\nadaptive\nmonochrome\nlegacy\n\n==================================================\n27. SETTINGS ICON LANGUAGE\n==================================================\n\nUsa icone lineari semplici che richiamano il reference.\n\nHome:\noutline house\n\nAspetto:\ndiamond/spark outline\n\nSmart Drawer:\nsearch/drawer outline\n\nInterazione:\nsimple interaction/haptic icon\n\nInformazioni:\ncircle-info\n\nChangelog:\ncircle-info/history appropriate\n\nNo emoji glyphs.\n\n==================================================\n28. CLEAN CODE\n==================================================\n\nImplementa Settings con componenti riutilizzabili semplici:\n\nSettingsScaffold\nSettingsCategoryCard\nSettingsRow\nSettingsSection\nSettingsBackHeader\n\nNon creare framework complesso.\n\n==================================================\n29. REMOVE OLD SETTINGS IMPLEMENTATIONS\n==================================================\n\nDopo nuova UI funzionante:\n\nrimuovi Settings UI legacy non più raggiungibile.\n\nRimuovi:\n\ndead routes\ndead composables\ndead strings\ndead settings-only resources\n\nNON toccare Home runtime stabile.\n\n==================================================\n30. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n31. DOCUMENT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_SETTINGS_UI_V2.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- screenshot references\n- root structure\n- visual tokens\n- subpages\n- Home editor\n- P2 8 manual\n- changelog\n- removed legacy options\n- stability constraints\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nReference family matched:\nYES\n\nSettings root cards:\n6\n\nHistorical visual language:\nRESTORED_AND_REFINED\n\nOld broken Settings runtime imported:\nNO\n\nHome editor:\nIMPLEMENTED\n\nP1 editable:\n8\n\nP2 editable:\n8\n\nP2 suggestions:\n0\n\nDock editable:\n5\n\nAppearance:\nIMPLEMENTED\n\nSmart Drawer:\nIMPLEMENTED\n\nInteraction:\nMINIMAL\n\nChangelog:\nIMPLEMENTED\n\nHorizontal gestures in Settings:\n0\n\nSettings animations:\n0 complex\n\nNew hexagon/X icon:\nPRESERVED\n\nHome runtime modified:\nNO unless required adapter\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME SETTINGS UI V2 COMPLETE\n\nReference screenshots used: 3\nRoot cards: <numero>\nSettings visual family: <REFERENCE_REFINED/FAILED>\nHome editor: <IMPLEMENTED/FAILED>\nP1 editable slots: <numero>\nP2 editable slots: <numero>\nP2 suggested paths: <numero>\nDock editable slots: <numero>\nAppearance page: <YES/NO>\nSmart Drawer page: <YES/NO>\nInteraction page: <YES/NO>\nInformation page: <YES/NO>\nChangelog page: <YES/NO>\nComplex Settings animation paths: <numero>\nHorizontal gesture paths: <numero>\nLegacy Settings routes removed: <numero>\nNew launcher icon preserved: <YES/NO>\nHome runtime files modified: <numero>\nSettings→Home regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\nSpec: /opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_SETTINGS_UI_V2.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:192:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787142530,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — BUGFIX ONLY / INPUT + HORIZONTAL FLASH\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREFERENCE BACKUP:\n/mnt/data/MachinaHome-FULL-CODE-14-08-2026_05-39-58-PM.tar.gz\n\nREFERENCE DOCS:\nMACHINA_HOME_FULL_CHECKUP.md\nMACHINA_HOME_FAV_LIFT_BASELINE.md\nMACHINA_HOME_PRODUCTION_GRADE_AUDIT.md\nMACHINA_HOME_RECONSTRUCTION_LOG.md\n\nPRIORITÀ:\nP0 BUGFIX ONLY\n\n==================================================\n0. HARD RULE\n==================================================\n\nNON REDESIGN.\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- Settings UI\n- Settings tree\n- colori\n- Home geometry\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- icon size\n- icon pack\n- wallpapers\n- launcher icon\n- Search UI\n- persistence model\n\nQuesta patch deve correggere SOLO bug runtime.\n\n==================================================\n1. DEVICE BUGS\n==================================================\n\nBug osservati:\n\nA.\nSwipe orizzontale LEFT/RIGHT produce una mini-apparizione / flash.\n\nB.\nIn precedenza gesture orizzontali hanno prodotto:\n- Home vuota\n- crash\n- state corruption\n\nC.\nSono stati osservati anche first-touch/multi-touch failures.\n\nObiettivo:\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nABSOLUTE NO-OP\n\nFirst tap:\n1 touch\n\nVertical swipe:\n1 gesture\n\nCrash:\n0\n\n==================================================\n2. USE OLD BACKUP ONLY AS BEHAVIOR REFERENCE\n==================================================\n\nNON copiare codice vecchio nel progetto.\n\nIspeziona dal backup solamente:\n\n- gesture ownership\n- Settings input ownership\n- lifecycle handling\n- interaction rules\n\nIl backup storico usa UI e runtime differenti.\n\n==================================================\n3. INVENTORY CURRENT POINTER STACK\n==================================================\n\nCerca nel progetto corrente TUTTI:\n\npointerInput\ndetectDragGestures\ndetectVerticalDragGestures\ndetectHorizontalDragGestures\ndetectTapGestures\nawaitPointerEventScope\nawaitFirstDown\nawaitTouchSlopOrCancellation\ndraggable\nscrollable\nnestedScroll\nclickable\ncombinedClickable\ntoggleable\n\nCrea una mappa temporanea:\n\nFILE\nCOMPOSABLE\nOWNER\nGESTURE\nCONSUMES EVENTS\nSTATE WRITES\n\n==================================================\n4. ONE GLOBAL HOME GESTURE OWNER\n==================================================\n\nLa Home deve avere al massimo:\n\n1 global gesture detector.\n\nQuesto detector serve SOLO allo swipe verticale approvato.\n\nNessun detector dedicato a:\n\nLEFT\nRIGHT\n\nNessun classifier orizzontale con side effects.\n\n==================================================\n5. HORIZONTAL SWIPE = PURE IGNORE\n==================================================\n\nQuando:\n\nabs(dx) > abs(dy)\n\nla gesture deve semplicemente terminare senza fare nulla.\n\nNO:\n\nstate write\nalpha\ntranslation\nscale\nvisibility\nnavigation\nquery clear\nfocus clear\nHome reload\nsnapshot reset\ncatalog refresh\nicon invalidation\nanimation progress\n\n==================================================\n6. FIX THE MINI-FLASH ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nCerca pattern del tipo:\n\nDOWN\n→ set dragging = true\n→ change UI\n→ gesture becomes horizontal\n→ cancel\n→ restore UI\n\nQuesto produce esattamente una mini-apparizione/flash.\n\nÈ VIETATO modificare UI mentre la direzione non è ancora confermata.\n\n==================================================\n7. DEFER ALL STATE WRITES\n==================================================\n\nDurante DOWN/MOVE:\n\nmantieni delta SOLO in variabili locali alla gesture coroutine.\n\nNON scrivere Compose State.\n\nSolo quando:\n\nvertical dominance confirmed\nAND\ntouchSlop crossed\nAND\nvertical gesture threshold completed\n\nallora:\n\ncommit ONE state change.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO DRAG-PROGRESS UI\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dal runtime gesture:\n\ndragProgress\nswipeProgress\ngestureFraction\ntemporaryOffset\ntemporaryAlpha\npreviewExpanded\npreviewCollapsed\n\nse usati per rendere UI mentre il dito si muove.\n\nLa Home non deve seguire il dito.\n\n==================================================\n9. REMOVE HORIZONTAL BRANCHES\n==================================================\n\nCerca e rimuovi path runtime come:\n\nif (dx > ...)\nif (dx < ...)\nSwipeDirection.Left\nSwipeDirection.Right\nonSwipeLeft\nonSwipeRight\n\nSe non servono ad altra feature reale.\n\nTarget:\n\nhorizontal Home action paths = 0\n\n==================================================\n10. DO NOT CONSUME NORMAL TAP\n==================================================\n\nIl global detector non deve consumare DOWN/UP di un tap.\n\nTap con movimento sotto touchSlop:\n\ndeve raggiungere il clickable figlio.\n\nNon chiamare consume() su DOWN.\n\nNon consumare l'intero event stream preventivamente.\n\n==================================================\n11. CHILD CLICK OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\nogni cella deve avere UN SOLO clickable launch owner.\n\nFav:\n\nun solo owner.\n\nSettings rows:\n\nun solo owner.\n\nNessun parent clickable duplicato per la stessa azione.\n\n==================================================\n12. REMOVE INVISIBLE HIT LAYERS\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nfillMaxSize\nmatchParentSize\nalpha(0f)\ntransparent Box\nAnimatedVisibility hidden content\n\ncombinati con:\n\npointerInput\nclickable\nfocusable\ntoggleable\n\nUn layer invisibile non deve intercettare touch.\n\n==================================================\n13. SEARCH HIDDEN STATE\n==================================================\n\nQuando Search è hidden/collapsed:\n\nTextField/BasicTextField deve essere realmente fuori composition.\n\nNON:\n\nalpha(0f)\nheight(0dp) focusable\ninvisible TextField\n\nQuesto evita first-touch stealing.\n\n==================================================\n14. ANIMATION AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nanimateDpAsState\nanimateFloatAsState\nanimateContentSize\nAnimatedVisibility\ngraphicsLayer\ntranslationX\ntranslationY\n\nnelle parti legate alla gesture.\n\nNON rimuovere animazioni unrelated.\n\nMa nessuna animation deve partire su horizontal movement.\n\n==================================================\n15. VERTICAL GESTURE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nMantieni SOLO il comportamento verticale attuale approvato.\n\nRiconoscimento:\n\ntouch slop prima\nvertical dominance\nthreshold\none completion\n\nUna gesture valida:\n1 state change\n\nNo toggle multiplo nello stesso stream.\n\n==================================================\n16. GESTURE RESET\n==================================================\n\nOgni pointer stream deve terminare correttamente su:\n\nUP\nCANCEL\n\nNessuno stato persistente tipo:\n\nisDragging\ndirection\naccumulatedDrag\n\ndeve sopravvivere alla gesture.\n\n==================================================\n17. POINTERINPUT KEYS\n==================================================\n\nAudit keys.\n\nNon usare key volatili:\n\nsearchQuery\nIME visible\nanimation fraction\ncatalog\ntime\nicon revision\n\nIl detector non deve essere cancellato/ricreato continuamente.\n\n==================================================\n18. FIRST TOUCH TRACE\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi TEMPORANEAMENTE logging debug:\n\nWINDOW_DOWN\nWINDOW_UP\nWINDOW_CANCEL\nHOME_GESTURE_START\nHOME_GESTURE_DIRECTION\nHOME_GESTURE_ACCEPT\nAPP_CELL_CLICK\nLAUNCH_REQUEST\nLAUNCH_SUCCESS\n\nTest logico:\n\ntap app once.\n\nDeve risultare:\n\nDOWN\nUP\nAPP_CELL_CLICK\nLAUNCH_REQUEST\n\nal primo tentativo.\n\nPoi rimuovi logging verboso.\n\n==================================================\n19. RETURN HOME\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nHome\n→ launch external app\n→ return Home\n\nNON devono avvenire:\n\ncatalog = empty\nslots = empty\nicon cache clear\nselected icon pack reset\nHome snapshot reset\n\nIl primo tap dopo return deve funzionare.\n\n==================================================\n20. NO EMPTY INTERMEDIATE HOME\n==================================================\n\nDurante refresh:\n\nOLD VALID SNAPSHOT\n→ NEW VALID SNAPSHOT\n\nMai:\n\nVALID\n→ EMPTY\n→ VALID\n\n==================================================\n21. SETTINGS MUST NOT BE PATCHED\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANTE.\n\nNon modificare l'aspetto o la struttura Settings in questa fase.\n\nIl backup conferma che la UI storica è un lavoro separato.\n\nQuesta fase NON deve provare a \"sistemare\" Settings visualmente.\n\n==================================================\n22. SETTINGS INPUT AUDIT ONLY\n==================================================\n\nÈ consentito modificare Settings SOLO se trovi un bug input concreto come:\n\nduplicate clickable\ntoggle double owner\ninvisible overlay\nlifecycle state corruption\n\nIn quel caso:\n\npatch minima\nNO visual diff.\n\n==================================================\n23. CRASH AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca nei gesture/state path:\n\nIndexOutOfBoundsException\nIllegalStateException\nNullPointerException\nCancellationException\nConcurrentModificationException\n\nCorreggi solo path realmente raggiungibili.\n\n==================================================\n24. REQUIRED ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nPrima del SUCCESS devi indicare:\n\nHorizontal flash root cause:\n<exact file/symbol/state write>\n\nFirst-touch root cause:\n<exact file/symbol> oppure NOT_REPRODUCIBLE_STATICALLY\n\nCrash path:\n<exact path> oppure NOT_PRESENT_CURRENTLY\n\nNon inventare.\n\n==================================================\n25. NO FEATURE WORK\n==================================================\n\nNON implementare:\n\n- Search history\n- onboarding\n- dim\n- shadows\n- new Settings\n- new gestures\n- animations\n- P2 redesign\n- launcher icon redesign\n\n==================================================\n26. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n27. AUDIT FILE\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_INPUT_BUGFIX_ONLY.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- pointer ownership before\n- pointer ownership after\n- horizontal flash root cause\n- state writes removed\n- invisible layers found\n- first-touch trace\n- lifecycle return check\n- crash paths fixed\n- exact files modified\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nVisual Settings changes:\n0\n\nHome visual changes:\n0\n\nHorizontal gesture actions:\n0\n\nHorizontal visual state writes:\n0\n\nHorizontal route writes:\n0\n\nHorizontal flash:\n0 paths\n\nGlobal Home gesture owners:\n1 max\n\nDuplicate launch click owners:\n0\n\nInvisible touch overlays:\n0\n\nFirst tap:\n1\n\nValid vertical swipe:\n1\n\nHome snapshot empty during return:\nNO\n\nCrash paths from LEFT/RIGHT:\n0\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME BUGFIX-ONLY PATCH COMPLETE\n\nHorizontal flash root cause: <value>\nFirst-touch root cause: <value>\nCrash root cause: <value>\n\nGlobal Home gesture owners: <numero>\nHorizontal gesture handlers remaining: <numero>\nHorizontal state writes remaining: <numero>\nHorizontal visual writes remaining: <numero>\nInvisible input overlays removed: <numero>\nDuplicate click owners removed: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch failures after patch: <numero>\nVertical swipe attempts required: <numero>\nHome snapshot clears on return: <numero>\nCatalog clears on return: <numero>\nIcon cache clears on return: <numero>\n\nSettings visual files modified: <numero>\nHome visual token files modified: <numero>\nFeature additions: <numero>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_INPUT_BUGFIX_ONLY.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:193:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787143113,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — BUGFIX ONLY / INPUT + HORIZONTAL FLASH\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREFERENCE BACKUP:\n/mnt/data/MachinaHome-FULL-CODE-14-08-2026_05-39-58-PM.tar.gz\n\nREFERENCE DOCS:\nMACHINA_HOME_FULL_CHECKUP.md\nMACHINA_HOME_FAV_LIFT_BASELINE.md\nMACHINA_HOME_PRODUCTION_GRADE_AUDIT.md\nMACHINA_HOME_RECONSTRUCTION_LOG.md\n\nPRIORITÀ:\nP0 BUGFIX ONLY\n\n==================================================\n0. HARD RULE\n==================================================\n\nNON REDESIGN.\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- Settings UI\n- Settings tree\n- colori\n- Home geometry\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- icon size\n- icon pack\n- wallpapers\n- launcher icon\n- Search UI\n- persistence model\n\nQuesta patch deve correggere SOLO bug runtime.\n\n==================================================\n1. DEVICE BUGS\n==================================================\n\nBug osservati:\n\nA.\nSwipe orizzontale LEFT/RIGHT produce una mini-apparizione / flash.\n\nB.\nIn precedenza gesture orizzontali hanno prodotto:\n- Home vuota\n- crash\n- state corruption\n\nC.\nSono stati osservati anche first-touch/multi-touch failures.\n\nObiettivo:\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nABSOLUTE NO-OP\n\nFirst tap:\n1 touch\n\nVertical swipe:\n1 gesture\n\nCrash:\n0\n\n==================================================\n2. USE OLD BACKUP ONLY AS BEHAVIOR REFERENCE\n==================================================\n\nNON copiare codice vecchio nel progetto.\n\nIspeziona dal backup solamente:\n\n- gesture ownership\n- Settings input ownership\n- lifecycle handling\n- interaction rules\n\nIl backup storico usa UI e runtime differenti.\n\n==================================================\n3. INVENTORY CURRENT POINTER STACK\n==================================================\n\nCerca nel progetto corrente TUTTI:\n\npointerInput\ndetectDragGestures\ndetectVerticalDragGestures\ndetectHorizontalDragGestures\ndetectTapGestures\nawaitPointerEventScope\nawaitFirstDown\nawaitTouchSlopOrCancellation\ndraggable\nscrollable\nnestedScroll\nclickable\ncombinedClickable\ntoggleable\n\nCrea una mappa temporanea:\n\nFILE\nCOMPOSABLE\nOWNER\nGESTURE\nCONSUMES EVENTS\nSTATE WRITES\n\n==================================================\n4. ONE GLOBAL HOME GESTURE OWNER\n==================================================\n\nLa Home deve avere al massimo:\n\n1 global gesture detector.\n\nQuesto detector serve SOLO allo swipe verticale approvato.\n\nNessun detector dedicato a:\n\nLEFT\nRIGHT\n\nNessun classifier orizzontale con side effects.\n\n==================================================\n5. HORIZONTAL SWIPE = PURE IGNORE\n==================================================\n\nQuando:\n\nabs(dx) > abs(dy)\n\nla gesture deve semplicemente terminare senza fare nulla.\n\nNO:\n\nstate write\nalpha\ntranslation\nscale\nvisibility\nnavigation\nquery clear\nfocus clear\nHome reload\nsnapshot reset\ncatalog refresh\nicon invalidation\nanimation progress\n\n==================================================\n6. FIX THE MINI-FLASH ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nCerca pattern del tipo:\n\nDOWN\n→ set dragging = true\n→ change UI\n→ gesture becomes horizontal\n→ cancel\n→ restore UI\n\nQuesto produce esattamente una mini-apparizione/flash.\n\nÈ VIETATO modificare UI mentre la direzione non è ancora confermata.\n\n==================================================\n7. DEFER ALL STATE WRITES\n==================================================\n\nDurante DOWN/MOVE:\n\nmantieni delta SOLO in variabili locali alla gesture coroutine.\n\nNON scrivere Compose State.\n\nSolo quando:\n\nvertical dominance confirmed\nAND\ntouchSlop crossed\nAND\nvertical gesture threshold completed\n\nallora:\n\ncommit ONE state change.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO DRAG-PROGRESS UI\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dal runtime gesture:\n\ndragProgress\nswipeProgress\ngestureFraction\ntemporaryOffset\ntemporaryAlpha\npreviewExpanded\npreviewCollapsed\n\nse usati per rendere UI mentre il dito si muove.\n\nLa Home non deve seguire il dito.\n\n==================================================\n9. REMOVE HORIZONTAL BRANCHES\n==================================================\n\nCerca e rimuovi path runtime come:\n\nif (dx > ...)\nif (dx < ...)\nSwipeDirection.Left\nSwipeDirection.Right\nonSwipeLeft\nonSwipeRight\n\nSe non servono ad altra feature reale.\n\nTarget:\n\nhorizontal Home action paths = 0\n\n==================================================\n10. DO NOT CONSUME NORMAL TAP\n==================================================\n\nIl global detector non deve consumare DOWN/UP di un tap.\n\nTap con movimento sotto touchSlop:\n\ndeve raggiungere il clickable figlio.\n\nNon chiamare consume() su DOWN.\n\nNon consumare l'intero event stream preventivamente.\n\n==================================================\n11. CHILD CLICK OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\nogni cella deve avere UN SOLO clickable launch owner.\n\nFav:\n\nun solo owner.\n\nSettings rows:\n\nun solo owner.\n\nNessun parent clickable duplicato per la stessa azione.\n\n==================================================\n12. REMOVE INVISIBLE HIT LAYERS\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nfillMaxSize\nmatchParentSize\nalpha(0f)\ntransparent Box\nAnimatedVisibility hidden content\n\ncombinati con:\n\npointerInput\nclickable\nfocusable\ntoggleable\n\nUn layer invisibile non deve intercettare touch.\n\n==================================================\n13. SEARCH HIDDEN STATE\n==================================================\n\nQuando Search è hidden/collapsed:\n\nTextField/BasicTextField deve essere realmente fuori composition.\n\nNON:\n\nalpha(0f)\nheight(0dp) focusable\ninvisible TextField\n\nQuesto evita first-touch stealing.\n\n==================================================\n14. ANIMATION AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nanimateDpAsState\nanimateFloatAsState\nanimateContentSize\nAnimatedVisibility\ngraphicsLayer\ntranslationX\ntranslationY\n\nnelle parti legate alla gesture.\n\nNON rimuovere animazioni unrelated.\n\nMa nessuna animation deve partire su horizontal movement.\n\n==================================================\n15. VERTICAL GESTURE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nMantieni SOLO il comportamento verticale attuale approvato.\n\nRiconoscimento:\n\ntouch slop prima\nvertical dominance\nthreshold\none completion\n\nUna gesture valida:\n1 state change\n\nNo toggle multiplo nello stesso stream.\n\n==================================================\n16. GESTURE RESET\n==================================================\n\nOgni pointer stream deve terminare correttamente su:\n\nUP\nCANCEL\n\nNessuno stato persistente tipo:\n\nisDragging\ndirection\naccumulatedDrag\n\ndeve sopravvivere alla gesture.\n\n==================================================\n17. POINTERINPUT KEYS\n==================================================\n\nAudit keys.\n\nNon usare key volatili:\n\nsearchQuery\nIME visible\nanimation fraction\ncatalog\ntime\nicon revision\n\nIl detector non deve essere cancellato/ricreato continuamente.\n\n==================================================\n18. FIRST TOUCH TRACE\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi TEMPORANEAMENTE logging debug:\n\nWINDOW_DOWN\nWINDOW_UP\nWINDOW_CANCEL\nHOME_GESTURE_START\nHOME_GESTURE_DIRECTION\nHOME_GESTURE_ACCEPT\nAPP_CELL_CLICK\nLAUNCH_REQUEST\nLAUNCH_SUCCESS\n\nTest logico:\n\ntap app once.\n\nDeve risultare:\n\nDOWN\nUP\nAPP_CELL_CLICK\nLAUNCH_REQUEST\n\nal primo tentativo.\n\nPoi rimuovi logging verboso.\n\n==================================================\n19. RETURN HOME\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nHome\n→ launch external app\n→ return Home\n\nNON devono avvenire:\n\ncatalog = empty\nslots = empty\nicon cache clear\nselected icon pack reset\nHome snapshot reset\n\nIl primo tap dopo return deve funzionare.\n\n==================================================\n20. NO EMPTY INTERMEDIATE HOME\n==================================================\n\nDurante refresh:\n\nOLD VALID SNAPSHOT\n→ NEW VALID SNAPSHOT\n\nMai:\n\nVALID\n→ EMPTY\n→ VALID\n\n==================================================\n21. SETTINGS MUST NOT BE PATCHED\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANTE.\n\nNon modificare l'aspetto o la struttura Settings in questa fase.\n\nIl backup conferma che la UI storica è un lavoro separato.\n\nQuesta fase NON deve provare a \"sistemare\" Settings visualmente.\n\n==================================================\n22. SETTINGS INPUT AUDIT ONLY\n==================================================\n\nÈ consentito modificare Settings SOLO se trovi un bug input concreto come:\n\nduplicate clickable\ntoggle double owner\ninvisible overlay\nlifecycle state corruption\n\nIn quel caso:\n\npatch minima\nNO visual diff.\n\n==================================================\n23. CRASH AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca nei gesture/state path:\n\nIndexOutOfBoundsException\nIllegalStateException\nNullPointerException\nCancellationException\nConcurrentModificationException\n\nCorreggi solo path realmente raggiungibili.\n\n==================================================\n24. REQUIRED ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nPrima del SUCCESS devi indicare:\n\nHorizontal flash root cause:\n<exact file/symbol/state write>\n\nFirst-touch root cause:\n<exact file/symbol> oppure NOT_REPRODUCIBLE_STATICALLY\n\nCrash path:\n<exact path> oppure NOT_PRESENT_CURRENTLY\n\nNon inventare.\n\n==================================================\n25. NO FEATURE WORK\n==================================================\n\nNON implementare:\n\n- Search history\n- onboarding\n- dim\n- shadows\n- new Settings\n- new gestures\n- animations\n- P2 redesign\n- launcher icon redesign\n\n==================================================\n26. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n27. AUDIT FILE\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_INPUT_BUGFIX_ONLY.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- pointer ownership before\n- pointer ownership after\n- horizontal flash root cause\n- state writes removed\n- invisible layers found\n- first-touch trace\n- lifecycle return check\n- crash paths fixed\n- exact files modified\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nVisual Settings changes:\n0\n\nHome visual changes:\n0\n\nHorizontal gesture actions:\n0\n\nHorizontal visual state writes:\n0\n\nHorizontal route writes:\n0\n\nHorizontal flash:\n0 paths\n\nGlobal Home gesture owners:\n1 max\n\nDuplicate launch click owners:\n0\n\nInvisible touch overlays:\n0\n\nFirst tap:\n1\n\nValid vertical swipe:\n1\n\nHome snapshot empty during return:\nNO\n\nCrash paths from LEFT/RIGHT:\n0\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME BUGFIX-ONLY PATCH COMPLETE\n\nHorizontal flash root cause: <value>\nFirst-touch root cause: <value>\nCrash root cause: <value>\n\nGlobal Home gesture owners: <numero>\nHorizontal gesture handlers remaining: <numero>\nHorizontal state writes remaining: <numero>\nHorizontal visual writes remaining: <numero>\nInvisible input overlays removed: <numero>\nDuplicate click owners removed: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch failures after patch: <numero>\nVertical swipe attempts required: <numero>\nHome snapshot clears on return: <numero>\nCatalog clears on return: <numero>\nIcon cache clears on return: <numero>\n\nSettings visual files modified: <numero>\nHome visual token files modified: <numero>\nFeature additions: <numero>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_INPUT_BUGFIX_ONLY.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:194:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787143698,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — ULTRA MINIMAL CORE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRidurre Machina Home al solo core visibile e necessario.\n\nRESTANO SOLO:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n\nTUTTO IL RESTO VA RIMOSSO DAL RUNTIME.\n\n==================================================\n1. FINAL RUNTIME\n==================================================\n\nHOME ROOT\n\ncontiene soltanto:\n\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nNessun'altra UI.\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE COMPLETELY\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dal runtime:\n\n- Search\n- App Drawer\n- Settings\n- Clock\n- Dynamic Media\n- Search history\n- Settings search\n- Web search\n- Hidden Apps UI/runtime se non necessaria\n- Recents\n- Suggested apps\n- Home Role UI\n- onboarding\n- changelog UI\n- first-run animation\n- dim background\n- shadow settings\n- motion settings\n- haptic settings\n- gesture settings\n- horizontal swipe handlers\n\n==================================================\n3. P1\n==================================================\n\nP1:\n\n8 slot manuali.\n\nNo suggested.\nNo automatic refill.\nNo recents.\n\n==================================================\n4. P2\n==================================================\n\nP2:\n\n8 slot manuali.\n\nTutti scegliibili/persistiti.\n\nNo:\n\n- suggested\n- recents\n- random\n- catalog refill\n- automatic replacement\n\n==================================================\n5. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock:\n\n5 slot persistiti.\n\nNo automatic refill dopo configurazione.\n\n==================================================\n6. SLOT SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nHome legge soltanto:\n\nP1 SAVED 0..7\nP2 SAVED 0..7\nDock SAVED 0..4\n\n==================================================\n7. FAV\n==================================================\n\nFav resta visualmente come adesso.\n\nCount:\n\nP1 resolved\n+\nP2 resolved\n\nDock esclusa.\n\n==================================================\n8. REMOVE SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nSearchBar\nSearch state\nSearch index\nSearch matcher\nSearch result model\nSearch focus\nIME handling\nSearch gestures\nSearch resources\n\n==================================================\n9. REMOVE APP DRAWER\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nAppDrawerScreen\ndrawer destination\ndrawer callbacks\ndrawer navigation\ndrawer gesture\n\n==================================================\n10. REMOVE SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nSettingsScreen\nSettings routes\nSettings components\nSettings navigation\nSettings-specific resources\n\nMantieni SOLO backend persistence indispensabile agli slot già configurati.\n\n==================================================\n11. REMOVE CLOCK\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nClock composable\nshow_clock\nClock tokens\nClock receiver\n\nSe Fav usa data:\nmantieni soltanto il minimo necessario alla data Fav.\n\n==================================================\n12. REMOVE DYNAMIC MEDIA\n==================================================\n\nFav torna sempre statico.\n\nRimuovi:\n\nMediaSessionReader\nNotificationListenerService\nmedia access\nmedia controls\nDynamic Media state\n\nSe nessun altro codice usa il Notification Listener:\nrimuovi anche declaration Manifest.\n\n==================================================\n13. REMOVE SUGGESTIONS / RECENTS\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nSuggestedAppsResolver\nRecentIdentityOrder\nrecent persistence\nsuggested migration runtime\n\nP2 diventa completamente manuale.\n\n==================================================\n14. P2 MIGRATION\n==================================================\n\nMigra one-shot:\n\nvecchio P2:\n4 manual + 4 suggested\n\nnuovo P2:\n8 manual\n\nPer slot 4..7:\n\nse esiste valore persistito legacy:\nmantienilo.\n\nAltrimenti:\nusa una volta il valore attualmente mostrato se recuperabile.\n\nPoi persisti.\n\nDopo migration:\nnessun suggested path.\n\n==================================================\n15. APP CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nMantieni SOLO ciò che serve a:\n\n- risolvere slot salvati\n- lanciare app\n- recuperare icone\n\nNessun catalog UI.\n\n==================================================\n16. ICONS\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il rendering icon corrente necessario a P1/P2/Dock.\n\nNon aggiungere UI per scegliere icon pack.\n\nSe esiste un pack già persistito:\npuoi continuare a rispettarlo solo se il supporto è stabile e semplice.\n\nAltrimenti preferire fallback System/Original.\n\n==================================================\n17. WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il comportamento visivo Home/Fav corrente.\n\nNessun picker.\n\nNessuna Settings UI.\n\nSe URI già persistito esiste:\ncontinua a usarlo.\n\n==================================================\n18. GESTURES\n==================================================\n\nPer la baseline minima:\n\nNO horizontal gestures.\n\nLEFT:\nNO-OP\n\nRIGHT:\nNO-OP\n\nSe non serve più swipe-up:\nrimuovi anche il detector verticale.\n\nTarget preferito:\nglobal gesture detectors = 0\n\n==================================================\n19. TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\nun solo clickable per cella.\n\nTap:\nlaunch immediato.\n\nFav:\nnessun click se non necessario.\n\n==================================================\n20. NO ANIMATIONS\n==================================================\n\nRuntime animation paths:\n\n0\n\nRimuovi:\n\nanimate*\nAnimatedVisibility\nAnimatedContent\nupdateTransition\nspring\ntween\ngraphicsLayer motion\npress scale\n\n==================================================\n21. LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nHome → app → Home:\n\nP1:\ngià pronta\n\nP2:\ngià pronta\n\nDock:\ngià pronta\n\nFav:\ngià pronto\n\nNessun empty intermediate state.\n\n==================================================\n22. NO HOME RELOAD\n==================================================\n\nOnResume NON deve:\n\n- clear slots\n- clear catalog\n- clear icons\n- rebuild defaults\n- run migration repeatedly\n\n==================================================\n23. CLEANUP\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dead code confermato dopo la semplificazione:\n\n- routes\n- composables\n- services\n- resources\n- preference keys runtime\n- imports\n- helpers\n- models\n\nNON cancellare dati utente necessari ai 21 slot.\n\n==================================================\n24. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nMantieni soltanto componenti realmente necessari.\n\nSe Media viene rimosso:\nrimuovi NotificationListenerService.\n\nMantieni launcher HOME activity.\n\n==================================================\n25. FINAL SOURCE MODEL\n==================================================\n\nTarget concettuale:\n\nMainActivity\nAppCatalog minimal\nLauncherActions\nLauncherPreferences minimal\nHomeScreen\nHomePanels\nFavPanel\nAppVisuals\n\nPochi file chiari.\n\n==================================================\n26. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nVisible runtime sections:\n5\n\nHome:\nYES\n\nFav:\nYES\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nSearch runtime:\n0\n\nDrawer runtime:\n0\n\nSettings runtime:\n0\n\nClock runtime:\n0\n\nDynamic Media runtime:\n0\n\nSuggested runtime:\n0\n\nRecents runtime:\n0\n\nHorizontal gestures:\n0\n\nRuntime animations:\n0\n\nGlobal gesture detectors:\n0 preferred\n\nFirst tap:\n1\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME ULTRA MINIMAL CORE COMPLETE\n\nVisible runtime:\nHome/Fav/P1/P2/Dock\n\nP1 manual slots: <numero>\nP2 manual slots: <numero>\nDock slots: <numero>\n\nSearch paths: <numero>\nDrawer paths: <numero>\nSettings paths: <numero>\nClock paths: <numero>\nDynamic Media paths: <numero>\nSuggested paths: <numero>\nRecents paths: <numero>\nAnimation paths: <numero>\nGesture detectors: <numero>\n\nHome reload paths on resume: <numero>\nFirst-touch failures: <numero>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nFiles removed: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:195:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787144765,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — POST-MINIMAL FULL CHECK-UP + HARDENING\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPREREQUISITO\n\nLa build ULTRA MINIMAL CORE deve essere completata con SUCCESS.\n\nRuntime target già ridotto a:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nNON reintrodurre altre feature.\n\n==================================================\n1. GOAL\n==================================================\n\nFare un check-up completo dell'app minimale.\n\nObiettivi:\n\n- struttura codice chiara\n- ownership dello state chiara\n- lifecycle stabile\n- primo touch affidabile\n- app sempre disponibili al ritorno Home\n- persistence robusta\n- niente crash da stato parziale\n- niente reload inutili\n- niente race semplici\n- niente callback/listener leak\n- fallback sicuri\n- error handling Android mirato\n- dead code minimo\n\n==================================================\n2. HARD RULE — NO FEATURE CHANGES\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\n- Search\n- Settings\n- Drawer\n- Clock\n- Dynamic Media\n- gesture\n- animations\n- suggested\n- recents\n- haptics configurabili\n- onboarding\n- shadow system\n\nNON modificare visuale Home salvo bug confermato.\n\n==================================================\n3. ARCHITECTURE TARGET\n==================================================\n\nPreferire una struttura semplice:\n\nMainActivity\n├── HomeScreen\n├── Home state orchestration\n\ncatalog/\n└── AppCatalog\n\nactions/\n└── LauncherActions\n\nstorage/\n└── LauncherPreferences\n\nmodel/\n└── LaunchableApp / slot identity\n\nui/home/\n├── HomeScreen\n├── FavPanel\n└── HomePanels\n\nui/common/\n└── AppVisuals\n\nNON creare nuovi layer/framework se non necessari.\n\n==================================================\n4. STATE OWNERSHIP AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nPer ogni state identifica UN owner.\n\nCatalog:\none owner\n\nP1/P2/Dock SAVED:\nLauncherPreferences\n\nResolved Home snapshot:\none owner\n\nUI-only state:\nHomeScreen\n\nNessun duplicated mutable state.\n\n==================================================\n5. HOME SNAPSHOT CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nFormalizza uno snapshot completo valido:\n\nHomeSnapshot(\n    p1 = 8,\n    p2 = 8,\n    dock = 5\n)\n\nLa UI non deve mai ricevere uno snapshot parziale.\n\nMai:\n\nP1 loaded\nP2 empty\nDock stale\n\nPreferire replacement atomico dello snapshot.\n\n==================================================\n6. NO EMPTY INTERMEDIATE STATE\n==================================================\n\nDurante startup/refresh:\n\nNON:\n\nvalid\n→ empty\n→ new\n\nUsare:\n\nold valid\n→ new valid\n\nSe non esiste ancora alcun valid snapshot al primo launch:\n\nmostra placeholder interno non-interattivo\noppure attendi il primo snapshot.\n\nNON inizializzare con slot casuali.\n\n==================================================\n7. LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nAudit:\n\nonCreate\nonStart\nonResume\nonPause\nonStop\nonDestroy\n\nOnResume NON deve:\n\n- clear catalog\n- clear Home snapshot\n- clear slot resolution\n- reset app identities\n- rerun migrations\n- rebuild defaults\n\n==================================================\n8. APP CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nCatalog deve aggiornarsi solo per eventi reali:\n\n- package added\n- package removed\n- package changed\n- profile available/unavailable se ancora supportato\n\nNo full scan inutile a ogni resume.\n\n==================================================\n9. CATALOG THREADING\n==================================================\n\nPackage enumeration / sorting / icon extraction:\n\nNON main thread.\n\nUsa un solo executor/coroutine dispatcher appropriato.\n\nEvita thread nuovi per ogni refresh.\n\n==================================================\n10. REFRESH COALESCING\n==================================================\n\nSe arrivano più package callbacks ravvicinati:\n\ncoalescili.\n\nNo refresh storm.\n\nUn refresh in corso:\npuò assorbire richieste duplicate.\n\n==================================================\n11. STALE RESULT PROTECTION\n==================================================\n\nSe un refresh vecchio termina dopo uno nuovo:\n\nNON deve sovrascrivere il catalogo recente.\n\nUsa:\n\ngeneration/version\noppure cancellation coerente.\n\n==================================================\n12. SLOT PERSISTENCE\n==================================================\n\nVerifica i 21 slot:\n\nP1 8\nP2 8\nDock 5\n\nIdentity:\nprofile-safe se già supportata.\n\nExplicit empty:\npreserved.\n\n==================================================\n13. SLOT MIGRATION\n==================================================\n\nLa migration P2 4+4 → 8 manual deve essere:\n\n- one-shot\n- versionata\n- idempotente\n\nNON deve rieseguire a ogni startup.\n\nNON deve sovrascrivere scelte utente.\n\n==================================================\n14. SAVE ATOMICITY\n==================================================\n\nVerifica che un gruppo completo di slot venga scritto con una singola\nEditor transaction per store.\n\nMai salvare slot uno per uno durante un'operazione batch.\n\n==================================================\n15. FAILURE DURING SAVE\n==================================================\n\nSe una write fallisce:\n\nnon pubblicare una revision/snapshot che dichiari successo.\n\nUI continua a usare l'ultimo SAVED valido.\n\n==================================================\n16. APP RESOLUTION\n==================================================\n\nSlot identity non risolvibile:\n\nNON crash.\n\nNON auto-sostituire con altra app.\n\nRender:\nempty/unresolved safe.\n\nSe l'app torna disponibile:\npuò risolversi nuovamente.\n\n==================================================\n17. APP UNINSTALL\n==================================================\n\nApp scelta disinstallata:\n\n- Home resta stabile\n- slot non genera exception\n- nessun IndexOutOfBounds\n- nessun auto-refill\n\n==================================================\n18. LAUNCH PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nUnica pipeline:\n\nAppCell tap\n→ LauncherActions.launch(identity)\n\nNessun launch duplicato in P1/P2/Dock.\n\n==================================================\n19. FIRST-TOUCH RELIABILITY\n==================================================\n\nOgni cella:\n\nun solo clickable.\n\nNessun parent overlay.\n\nNessun pointerInput globale.\n\nTarget:\n\nfirst tap → launch request\n\n==================================================\n20. LAUNCH FAILURE\n==================================================\n\nGestisci in modo mirato:\n\nSecurityException\nActivityNotFoundException\nIllegalStateException platform-specific se realmente possibile\n\nFailure:\nno crash Home.\n\n==================================================\n21. NO GLOBAL INPUT LOCK\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi/evita:\n\ninteractionLocked\nisLaunching globale\ngestureLocked\nisAnimating\n\nse impediscono il primo tap.\n\n==================================================\n22. RETURN HOME\n==================================================\n\nCaso critico:\n\nHome\n→ launch app\n→ return Home\n\nTarget:\n\nP1 già renderizzato\nP2 già renderizzato\nDock già renderizzato\n\nFirst tap:\nworks immediately.\n\n==================================================\n23. ICON PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nMantieni la pipeline minimale.\n\nNon risolvere icone ripetutamente ad ogni recomposition.\n\nCache key stabile:\n\nidentity\n+\neventuale persisted icon visual state ancora supportato\n\n==================================================\n24. ICON FALLBACK\n==================================================\n\nDrawable mancante/failure:\n\nfallback sicuro.\n\nMai null dereference.\n\nMai crash del composable.\n\n==================================================\n25. BITMAP / DRAWABLE MEMORY\n==================================================\n\nNon conservare Context Activity in cache long-lived.\n\nUsa application context dove necessario.\n\nNon accumulare bitmap duplicate per la stessa app.\n\n==================================================\n26. FAV\n==================================================\n\nFav deve essere presentation-only.\n\nCount:\n\nresolved P1\n+\nresolved P2\n\nNo side effect durante composition.\n\n==================================================\n27. FAV DATE\n==================================================\n\nSe la data Fav resta:\n\nmantieni un solo receiver minimale.\n\nRegistrazione:\ncomposition/lifecycle scoped.\n\nCleanup:\nobbligatorio.\n\nNo timer/polling.\n\nSe la data non serve più:\nrimuovi receiver.\n\n==================================================\n28. WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nSe wallpaper corrente resta:\n\ndecode fuori main thread.\n\nCenter crop invariato.\n\nFailure:\nfallback sicuro.\n\nNo raw thread per ogni recomposition.\n\n==================================================\n29. COMPOSE EFFECT AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nInventaria:\n\nLaunchedEffect\nDisposableEffect\nproduceState\nremember\nrememberSaveable\nSideEffect\nsnapshotFlow\n\nPer ogni effect:\n\n- key stabile\n- ownership\n- cleanup\n- no write loop\n\n==================================================\n30. NO STATE WRITE DURING COMPOSITION\n==================================================\n\nCerca setter/preferences writes direttamente durante render/remember init.\n\nSpostare fuori se possono essere eseguiti ripetutamente.\n\nMigration:\nbootstrap controllato, non render side effect.\n\n==================================================\n31. RECOMPOSITION STABILITY\n==================================================\n\nUsa key stabili per app cells.\n\nPreferire identity completa.\n\nNon usare list index come unica identity se lo slot può cambiare.\n\n==================================================\n32. COLLECTION SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nMai assumere list size senza clamp/validation.\n\nP1:\npad/take exactly 8\n\nP2:\npad/take exactly 8\n\nDock:\npad/take exactly 5\n\nPreviene IndexOutOfBounds su dati legacy/corrotti.\n\n==================================================\n33. CORRUPTED PREFERENCES\n==================================================\n\nSe una slot string è malformed:\n\n- ignore/mark unresolved\n- log una volta\n- non crash\n- non distruggere intero store\n\n==================================================\n34. PROFILE SERIAL SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nSe un user serial/profile non esiste più:\n\nslot unresolved safe.\n\nNon associare automaticamente l'app a un altro profilo\nsalvo legacy migration esplicitamente prevista.\n\n==================================================\n35. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nAudit minimale:\n\nLauncher Activity HOME/DEFAULT\nexported corretto\ntheme\nicon\n\nRimuovi componenti non più usati dopo semplificazione.\n\n==================================================\n36. RESOURCES\n==================================================\n\nInventaria:\n\ndrawables\nmipmap\nstrings\ncolors\nxml\n\nRimuovi solo resources con ZERO call site confermato.\n\nNon fare cleanup aggressivo.\n\n==================================================\n37. DEPENDENCIES\n==================================================\n\nAudit Gradle.\n\nRimuovi dipendenze usate esclusivamente dalle feature eliminate,\nsolo se zero call site.\n\nNON aggiornare versioni.\n\n==================================================\n38. ERROR HANDLING\n==================================================\n\nNo catch(Throwable).\n\nPreferire eccezioni Android mirate.\n\nOgni fallback deve lasciare Home utilizzabile.\n\n==================================================\n39. LOGGING\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi debug spam.\n\nMantieni logging solo per:\n\n- catalog fatal refresh failure\n- malformed persistence\n- launch failure rilevante\n\nNo log per recomposition.\n\n==================================================\n40. FREEZE / ANR AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nloops\nwhile(true)\nblocking waits\nThread.sleep\nfuture.get\nrunBlocking\nSharedPreferences commit ripetuto\nPackageManager work main-thread\nbitmap decode main-thread\n\nClassifica:\n\nCONFIRMED\nLIKELY\nPOSSIBLE\nNOT_FOUND\n\n==================================================\n41. MEMORY LEAK AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nControlla:\n\nActivity context retained\nLauncherApps callback cleanup\nreceivers\nexecutors\ndrawable caches\nwallpaper decode jobs\n\n==================================================\n42. PROCESS RESTART\n==================================================\n\nCold process restart:\n\nP1/P2/Dock devono tornare dallo store.\n\nNo dependency da state solo-memory per slot persistiti.\n\n==================================================\n43. CONFIGURATION CHANGE\n==================================================\n\nSe Activity viene ricreata:\n\nnessun duplicate callback.\n\nnessun double catalog owner.\n\nnessun reset slot.\n\n==================================================\n44. DEFENSIVE INVARIANTS\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi memo/assertion non-crashing dove utile:\n\nP1_COUNT = 8\nP2_COUNT = 8\nDOCK_COUNT = 5\n\nNo runtime `check()` che possa crashare per preference corrotta.\n\nPreferire normalizzazione safe.\n\n==================================================\n45. TESTABLE PURE LOGIC\n==================================================\n\nIsola in funzioni pure almeno:\n\nnormalizeSlotList\nresolveSavedSlots\nP2 migration transform\n\nSolo se ciò semplifica realmente il codice.\n\n==================================================\n46. TESTS\n==================================================\n\nSe il progetto ha già test infrastructure:\n\naggiungi test per:\n\n- slot counts 8/8/5\n- empty preserved\n- malformed identity safe\n- P2 migration idempotent\n- no auto-fill\n- snapshot normalization\n- removed app safe\n\nSe non esiste infrastructure:\nNON aggiungere nuove dipendenze solo per questo.\n\nDocumenta NO_TEST_HARNESS.\n\n==================================================\n47. CODE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi funzioni duplicate.\n\nRiduci file monolitici solo se separazione è ovvia.\n\nNON fare mega-refactor.\n\n==================================================\n48. COMMENTS / MEMOS\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi memo brevi nei punti critici:\n\n- Home snapshot must never be cleared on resume\n- P2 is 8 fully manual slots\n- explicit empty is authoritative\n- catalog refresh is event-driven\n- first tap must not depend on refresh\n- no gesture layer on Home\n\n==================================================\n49. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n50. CREATE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_MINIMAL_PRODUCTION_AUDIT.md\n\nSezioni:\n\n# Architecture\n# State Ownership\n# Home Snapshot\n# Lifecycle\n# Catalog\n# Persistence\n# P2 Migration\n# Launch Pipeline\n# Input\n# Compose Effects\n# Threading\n# Icon/Drawable Pipeline\n# Wallpaper/Fav\n# Error Handling\n# Freeze/ANR\n# Memory\n# Manifest\n# Resources\n# Dependencies\n# Tests\n# Remaining Risks\n# Build Verification\n\n==================================================\n51. CREATE CHECKPOINT AFTER SUCCESS\n==================================================\n\nSOLO se:\n\nBuild SUCCESS\ne nessun blocker confermato rimane.\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/MachinaHome-minimal-stable-<timestamp>\n\ne relativo:\n\n.tar.gz\n\nIncludi:\n\n- project\n- audit\n- reconstruction log\n- APK build verificato\n\nCalcola SHA-256 archive + APK.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nArchitecture ownership:\nCLEAR\n\nHome snapshot partial states:\n0\n\nCatalog clear on resume:\n0\n\nSlot reset on resume:\n0\n\nMigration repeat writes:\n0\n\nP1 count:\n8\n\nP2 count:\n8\n\nDock count:\n5\n\nP2 auto-fill:\n0\n\nFirst-touch blockers:\n0\n\nGlobal gesture layers:\n0\n\nMain-thread catalog scans:\n0\n\nMain-thread bitmap decodes:\n0\n\nUnclean listener/receiver paths:\n0\n\nConfirmed crash paths:\n0\n\nConfirmed freeze/ANR paths:\n0\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\nCheckpoint:\nCREATED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME MINIMAL PRODUCTION HARDENING COMPLETE\n\nArchitecture score: <0-10>\nState score: <0-10>\nReliability score: <0-10>\nPerformance score: <0-10>\nMaintainability score: <0-10>\n\nP1 slots: <numero>\nP2 slots: <numero>\nDock slots: <numero>\nP2 automatic-fill paths: <numero>\n\nHome snapshot partial-state paths: <numero>\nCatalog clears on resume: <numero>\nSlot resets on resume: <numero>\nIcon/cache clears on resume: <numero>\n\nDuplicate input owners: <numero>\nGlobal gesture layers: <numero>\nFirst-touch blockers found: <numero>\n\nMain-thread heavy paths: <numero>\nConfirmed crash paths fixed: <numero>\nConfirmed freeze/ANR paths: <numero>\nListener/receiver leaks: <numero>\n\nDead code removed: <numero>\nDead resources removed: <numero>\nUnused dependencies removed: <numero>\n\nTests: <PASSED/NO_TEST_HARNESS/FAILED>\nRemaining risks: <numero>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nCheckpoint: <path>\nArchive: <path>\nArchive SHA-256: <hash>\nAPK: <path>\nAPK SHA-256: <hash>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_MINIMAL_PRODUCTION_AUDIT.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:196:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787145475,"text":"FASE FINALE: MACHINA HOME — MINIMAL SIZE + HARDENING + FREEZE + BACKUPS\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCHECKPOINT ROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints\n\nOUTPUT ROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs\n\nDOCS:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nPortare Machina Home alla baseline finale minimale:\n\nVISIBLE RUNTIME ONLY:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5 manual/persisted\n\nPoi:\n\n1. ridurre significativamente APK e codice\n2. applicare hardening conservativo\n3. build verificata\n4. creare backup multipli\n5. creare checkpoint finale\n6. dichiarare il progetto FROZEN\n\nNESSUNA NUOVA FEATURE.\n\n==================================================\n1. SAFETY BACKUP BEFORE ANY CHANGE\n==================================================\n\nPRIMA DI MODIFICARE QUALSIASI FILE:\n\ncrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-pre-minification-<timestamp>\n\ne:\n\nMachinaHome-pre-minification-<timestamp>.tar.gz\n\nIncludi:\n\n- project corrente\n- docs correnti\n- ultimo APK disponibile\n- build/reconstruction logs rilevanti\n\nCalcola SHA-256 archive.\n\nNON modificare questo backup.\n\n==================================================\n2. BASELINE BUILD\n==================================================\n\nPrima del cleanup:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRegistra:\n\n- APK path\n- APK byte size\n- SHA-256\n- file count project\n- Kotlin source count\n- resource count\n\nQuesto è SIZE BEFORE.\n\nSe build FALLISCE:\nSTOP.\n\n==================================================\n3. HARD FEATURE BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nRuntime ammesso:\n\nHome\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\nAppCatalog minimo\nLauncherActions\nLauncherPreferences minimo\nrender app icons\nwallpaper necessario al visual corrente\n\nTutto il resto deve essere valutato per rimozione.\n\n==================================================\n4. REMOVE FEATURE CODE DEFINITIVELY\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi se ancora presente:\n\n- Search\n- Search history\n- Search index\n- App Drawer\n- Settings UI\n- Settings navigation\n- Clock\n- onboarding\n- changelog UI\n- Dynamic Media\n- MediaSessionReader\n- Notification Listener\n- recents\n- suggested apps\n- hidden-app UI/features non necessarie\n- horizontal gestures\n- vertical gestures se non più necessarie\n- animation system\n- haptic configuration\n- shadow configuration\n- Home-role UI\n- debug/developer UI\n\nTarget runtime:\nZERO call paths.\n\n==================================================\n5. REMOVE P2 SUGGESTED COMPLETELY\n==================================================\n\nFinal persistent layout:\n\nP1:\npanel1_0..7\n\nP2:\npanel2_0..7\n\nDock:\ndock_0..4\n\nSuggestedAppsResolver:\nREMOVE if no remaining call-site.\n\nRecentIdentityOrder:\nREMOVE if no remaining call-site.\n\nNo automatic replacement.\n\nExplicit empty:\npreserved.\n\n==================================================\n6. KEEP P2 MIGRATION ONLY IF REQUIRED\n==================================================\n\nMantieni soltanto il minimo codice necessario a migrare installazioni vecchie:\n\n4 manual + 4 suggested\n→\n8 manual\n\nMigration:\n\n- versioned\n- one-shot\n- idempotent\n- never overwrites later user choices\n\nDopo marker completato:\nnessun suggested runtime.\n\n==================================================\n7. REMOVE DEAD SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nEsegui reference/call-site audit.\n\nRimuovi file Kotlin con ZERO call-site confermato.\n\nCandidati naturali dopo la minimalizzazione:\n\ndrawer/\nsettings/\nmedia/\nsearch/\ninteraction/\nsuggestions/\nrecents/\nrole UI helpers\n\nNON eliminare file solo in base al nome.\n\nVerifica imports/references/Manifest prima.\n\n==================================================\n8. REMOVE DEAD RESOURCES\n==================================================\n\nInventaria:\n\nres/drawable\nres/drawable-nodpi\nres/mipmap*\nres/xml\nres/values\nres/font se presenti\nraw assets\n\nPer ogni resource:\n\nKEEP\noppure\nREMOVE_ZERO_CALLSITE\n\nRimuovi soltanto risorse realmente irraggiungibili.\n\nMantieni sicuramente ciò che serve a:\n\n- launcher icon\n- Fav visual\n- Home wallpaper behavior\n- app theme\n- required Android manifests/styles\n\n==================================================\n9. REMOVE OLD LAUNCHER ARTWORK\n==================================================\n\nMantieni SOLO l'icona launcher finale approvata:\n\nWHITE BACKGROUND\nBLACK HEXAGON\nSMALL WHITE X\n\nMantieni:\n\nadaptive\nforeground\nbackground\nmonochrome\nlegacy variant necessaria\n\nRimuovi artwork launcher storico soltanto se non più referenziato da:\n\nManifest\ntheme\nsplash\nadaptive XML\n\n==================================================\n10. SPLASH\n==================================================\n\nSe splash usa ancora un vecchio logo:\n\nsostituisci il riferimento con il nuovo logo minimale\noppure usa un semplice static splash resource.\n\nNO animated splash custom.\n\nRimuovi vecchio splash artwork se diventa dead.\n\n==================================================\n11. GRADLE DEPENDENCY AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nAnalizza tutte le dependencies.\n\nPer ciascuna:\n\n- production call sites\n- transitive necessity\n\nRimuovi librerie usate esclusivamente dalle feature eliminate.\n\nNON aggiornare versioni.\n\nNON cambiare toolchain.\n\nNON introdurre nuove dependencies.\n\n==================================================\n12. RELEASE-SIZE OPPORTUNITIES\n==================================================\n\nControlla configurazione release.\n\nSe esiste release build supportata:\n\nminifyEnabled = true\nshrinkResources = true\n\nSOLO se il progetto già supporta una release pipeline corretta.\n\nNon rompere debug workflow.\n\nNon inventare signing production.\n\n==================================================\n13. DEBUG APK EXPECTATION\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nNon promettere una dimensione arbitraria.\n\nTarget:\nridurre il più possibile in sicurezza.\n\nGoal desiderato:\n\"pochi MB\"\n\nMa SUCCESS non dipende da un numero inventato.\n\nReport obbligatorio:\n\nAPK before\nAPK after\nbytes removed\npercent reduction\nlargest remaining contributors\n\n==================================================\n14. APK CONTENT AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nDopo build:\n\nunzip -l APK\n\nClassifica dimensione:\n\nclasses*.dex\nresources.arsc\nres/\nMETA-INF/\nnative libs\nassets\n\nMostra top 20 entry per dimensione.\n\nIdentifica cosa mantiene grande l'APK.\n\n==================================================\n15. NO LARGE BUNDLED DUPLICATES\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\n- wallpaper duplicati\n- screenshots\n- reference PNG/JPEG\n- old launcher icons\n- preview images\n- changelog screenshots\n- unused bundled backups\n- generated contact sheets\n\nNessun file documentale/reference deve finire nell'APK.\n\n==================================================\n16. IMAGE SIZE REVIEW\n==================================================\n\nPer immagini runtime indispensabili:\n\nNON degradare visualmente Fav.\n\nMa verifica:\n\n- duplicate copies\n- accidental oversized artwork\n- debug-only images\n\nNon ricomprimere aggressivamente l'asset Fav se produce regressione visiva.\n\n==================================================\n17. MINIMAL MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nManifest finale deve contenere solo componenti necessari.\n\nKEEP:\n\nlauncher HOME/DEFAULT Activity\n\nREMOVE se feature eliminate:\n\nNotificationListenerService\nobsolete queries\nunused activity/service/receiver/provider\n\nPackage visibility:\nmantieni solo se realmente necessaria al core corrente.\n\n==================================================\n18. MINIMAL APP CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nAppCatalog deve fare soltanto ciò che serve a:\n\n- risolvere P1\n- risolvere P2\n- risolvere Dock\n- launch identity\n- app icons\n\nNo:\n\ndrawer-specific models\nsearch indexes\nsuggestion ranking\nrecent ranking\n\n==================================================\n19. HOME SNAPSHOT\n==================================================\n\nFormalizza un unico snapshot:\n\nHomeSnapshot(\n  p1 = 8,\n  p2 = 8,\n  dock = 5\n)\n\nSnapshot completo o precedente valido.\n\nMai partial/empty during refresh.\n\n==================================================\n20. LIFECYCLE HARDENING\n==================================================\n\nOnResume NON deve:\n\n- clear catalog\n- clear slots\n- clear icons\n- reload defaults\n- rerun migrations\n- reconstruct empty state\n\nHome → app → Home:\n\ndeve essere immediatamente pronta.\n\n==================================================\n21. EVENT-DRIVEN REFRESH\n==================================================\n\nRefresh catalog soltanto per eventi reali:\n\npackage add\npackage remove\npackage change\nprofile state change se ancora supportato\n\nNo refresh completo ad ogni resume.\n\n==================================================\n22. BACKGROUND WORK\n==================================================\n\nPackageManager / LauncherApps enumeration:\n\noff main thread.\n\nSorting:\noff main thread se significativo.\n\nPublish:\nmain thread.\n\nNo raw uncontrolled thread storm.\n\n==================================================\n23. REFRESH GENERATION\n==================================================\n\nImpedisci stale delivery:\n\ngeneration counter\noppure cancellation equivalente semplice.\n\nOld refresh result:\nnon può sostituire new refresh result.\n\n==================================================\n24. INPUT HARDENING\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\nglobal pointerInput = 0\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\none clickable each.\n\nNo invisible overlays.\nNo gesture detector.\nNo double-click owner.\nNo input lock.\n\nFirst tap:\nlaunch.\n\n==================================================\n25. LAUNCHER ACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nUn solo launch path.\n\nAppCell:\n→ LauncherActions.launch\n\nGestisci safe:\n\nActivityNotFoundException\nSecurityException\nplatform IllegalStateException dove appropriato\n\nNo crash Home.\n\n==================================================\n26. PERSISTENCE HARDENING\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock storage:\n\n- exact counts\n- explicit empty\n- malformed entry safe\n- profile identity safe se ancora usata\n- no writes during composition\n\n==================================================\n27. NORMALIZE CORRUPT DATA SAFELY\n==================================================\n\nQuando si legge:\n\nP1 normalize to 8\nP2 normalize to 8\nDock normalize to 5\n\nMai:\n\nlist[index] senza bounds guarantee.\n\nMalformed slot:\nunresolved/empty safe.\n\nNON crash.\n\n==================================================\n28. DO NOT AUTO-REPAIR USER DATA DESTRUCTIVELY\n==================================================\n\nCorrupted/unavailable app:\n\nnon sostituire automaticamente.\n\nMantieni raw identity quando possibile.\n\nNon inventare altra app.\n\n==================================================\n29. COMPOSE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nInventaria:\n\nLaunchedEffect\nDisposableEffect\nproduceState\nremember\nrememberSaveable\nSideEffect\nsnapshotFlow\n\nRiduci al minimo.\n\nOgni effect deve avere:\n\n- stable key\n- clear owner\n- cleanup\n\nNo state write loops.\n\n==================================================\n30. REMOVE ALL ANIMATION DEPENDENCIES\n==================================================\n\nRuntime occurrences target:\n\nanimate* = 0\nAnimatedVisibility = 0\nAnimatedContent = 0\nupdateTransition = 0\nspring = 0\ntween = 0 per Home runtime\ngraphicsLayer motion = 0\n\n==================================================\n31. NO GESTURE SYSTEM\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\npointerInput runtime Home:\n0\n\ndetectDragGestures:\n0\n\nhorizontal drag:\n0\n\nvertical drag:\n0\n\nswipe:\n0\n\n==================================================\n32. FAV HARDENING\n==================================================\n\nFav:\n\npresentation-only.\n\nCount:\n\nP1 resolved non-null\n+\nP2 resolved non-null\n\nNo mutation during composition.\n\n==================================================\n33. DATE\n==================================================\n\nSe Fav mostra data:\n\nmantieni SOLO un receiver minimale per cambio minuto/data/timezone.\n\nSe è sufficiente aggiornare solo data:\nnon mantenere Clock subsystem.\n\nReceiver cleanup:\nmandatory.\n\n==================================================\n34. WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il visual corrente approvato.\n\nHome URI existing:\npreserved.\n\nFav URI existing:\npreserved.\n\nDefault Fav:\nbundled approved asset.\n\nNo Settings/picker required.\n\n==================================================\n35. ICON PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nSemplifica al minimo necessario.\n\nSe icon-pack support rimane solo per leggere una scelta storica e comporta\nmolto codice/size/instabilità:\n\nvaluta rimozione completa.\n\nIn tal caso:\n\nSystem/Original only.\n\nMA NON cancellare preference storica;\nsemplicemente non usarla.\n\nSe invece il resolver è piccolo/stabile:\npuò restare.\n\nDocumenta la decisione con size/call-site evidence.\n\n==================================================\n36. NO BROAD CATCH\n==================================================\n\nElimina:\n\ncatch(Throwable)\n\nPreferire exception mirate.\n\nFallback deve mantenere Home viva.\n\n==================================================\n37. ANR CHECK\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nThread.sleep\nrunBlocking\nFuture.get\nblocking IO main thread\nPackageManager enumeration main\nbitmap decode main\nbusy loops\ninfinite loops\n\nTarget confirmed ANR paths:\n0\n\n==================================================\n38. MEMORY CHECK\n==================================================\n\nControlla:\n\nActivity context retained\ncallback cleanup\nreceiver cleanup\ndrawable cache\nwallpaper decode objects\n\nTarget confirmed leaks:\n0\n\n==================================================\n39. CODE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nPreferisci struttura finale piccola.\n\nTarget indicativo:\n\nMainActivity.kt\n\nactions/\n  LauncherActions.kt\n\ncatalog/\n  AppCatalog.kt\n\nmodel/\n  LaunchableApp.kt\n  HomeSnapshot.kt\n\nstorage/\n  LauncherPreferences.kt\n\nui/common/\n  AppVisuals.kt\n\nui/home/\n  HomeScreen.kt\n  FavPanel.kt\n  HomePanels.kt\n\nui/design/\n  MachinaDesign.kt\n\nNon forzare esattamente questi file se una fusione/rimozione è più semplice.\n\n==================================================\n40. NO MEGA-ABSTRACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nNon creare:\n\nrepository framework\nuse-case framework\ndependency injection framework\nnavigation framework\n\nIl progetto è piccolo.\n\nCodice diretto > architettura artificiale.\n\n==================================================\n41. MEMOS\n==================================================\n\nAggiungi commenti brevi SOLO sui contratti critici:\n\nP2 IS 8 MANUAL SLOTS.\nNEVER AUTO-FILL EMPTY SLOTS.\n\nHOME SNAPSHOT MUST NOT BE CLEARED ON RESUME.\n\nHOME HAS NO GLOBAL GESTURE LAYER.\n\nCATALOG REFRESH IS EVENT-DRIVEN.\n\n==================================================\n42. TESTS\n==================================================\n\nSe test infrastructure esiste già:\n\ntest:\n\n8/8/5 normalization\nP2 migration idempotency\nexplicit empty\nmalformed identity\nuninstalled app\nsnapshot atomic replacement\n\nSe non esiste:\nNO new testing framework/dependency.\n\n==================================================\n43. BUILD AFTER CLEANUP\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nDeve essere SUCCESS.\n\nRegistra:\n\nAPK AFTER\nAPK SHA-256\nAPK bytes\n\n==================================================\n44. APK VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\nunzip -t <APK>\n\nPoi:\n\napksigner verify --verbose <APK>\n\nEntrambi devono PASS.\n\n==================================================\n45. SIZE REPORT\n==================================================\n\nCalcola:\n\nbefore bytes\nafter bytes\ndelta bytes\nreduction %\n\nClassifica top contributors finali.\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_SIZE_AUDIT.md\n\n==================================================\n46. FULL HARDENING AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_FROZEN_CORE_AUDIT.md\n\nSezioni:\n\nArchitecture\nRuntime Features\nSource Inventory\nResource Inventory\nAPK Size\nState Ownership\nHome Snapshot\nLifecycle\nCatalog\nPersistence\nInput\nLaunch\nCompose Effects\nThreading\nError Handling\nANR\nMemory\nManifest\nRemaining Risks\nFreeze Contract\n\n==================================================\n47. FREEZE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nDopo build/audit SUCCESS:\n\nconsidera FROZEN:\n\n- Home geometry\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- persistence 8/8/5\n- input model\n- lifecycle\n- launcher icon\n- wallpaper behavior\n\nNessuna modifica successiva senza:\n\n1. checkpoint nuovo\n2. feature scope esplicito\n3. regression build\n\n==================================================\n48. FINAL CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-minimal-frozen-<timestamp>\n\nContenuto:\n\nproject/\ndocs/\nAPK/\nCHECKPOINT_INFO.txt\nSHA256SUMS.txt\n\n==================================================\n49. SECOND ARCHIVE BACKUP\n==================================================\n\nCrea anche:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-minimal-frozen-<timestamp>.tar.gz\n\n==================================================\n50. CHECKPOINT_INFO\n==================================================\n\nInserisci:\n\nName\nTimestamp\nRuntime features:\nHome/Fav/P1/P2/Dock\n\nP1 manual:\n8\n\nP2 manual:\n8\n\nDock:\n5\n\nSearch:\nNO\n\nDrawer:\nNO\n\nSettings:\nNO\n\nClock:\nNO\n\nAnimations:\nNO\n\nGestures:\nNO\n\nSuggested:\nNO\n\nAPK size:\n<bytes>\n\nAPK SHA-256:\n<hash>\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n51. HASH EVERYTHING\n==================================================\n\nSHA-256:\n\nAPK\ntar.gz\nimportant audit docs\n\nSalva:\n\nSHA256SUMS.txt\n\n==================================================\n52. ARCHIVE VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\ntar -tzf <archive> >/dev/null\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n53. BACKUP RETENTION\n==================================================\n\nNON cancellare automaticamente checkpoint vecchi.\n\nMantieni almeno:\n\nA.\npre-minification backup\n\nB.\nminimal-frozen checkpoint\n\nC.\nminimal-frozen tar.gz\n\nNON ripulire la directory checkpoints.\n\n==================================================\n54. FINAL FREEZE MARKER\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/FROZEN_BASELINE.md\n\nContenuto conciso:\n\nMACHINA HOME MINIMAL FROZEN BASELINE\n\nRuntime:\nHome / Fav / P1 / P2 / Dock\n\nP1: 8 manual\nP2: 8 manual\nDock: 5\n\nNo Search\nNo Drawer\nNo Settings\nNo Clock\nNo Media\nNo Suggestions\nNo Recents\nNo Animations\nNo Gestures\n\nSee:\nMACHINA_HOME_FROZEN_CORE_AUDIT.md\n\nNON inserire timestamp runtime logic.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nRuntime visible blocks:\n5\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nSearch:\n0\n\nDrawer:\n0\n\nSettings:\n0\n\nClock:\n0\n\nDynamic Media:\n0\n\nSuggested:\n0\n\nRecents:\n0\n\nAnimations:\n0\n\nGesture handlers:\n0\n\nHome snapshot clears on resume:\n0\n\nCatalog full reload on unchanged resume:\n0\n\nFirst-touch blockers:\n0\n\nConfirmed crash paths:\n0\n\nConfirmed ANR paths:\n0\n\nConfirmed leaks:\n0\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\nAPK ZIP verification:\nPASS\n\nAPK signature verification:\nPASS\n\nSize reduced:\nYES\n\nFrozen checkpoint:\nCREATED\n\nPre-clean backup:\nCREATED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE FINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME MINIMAL FROZEN BASELINE COMPLETE\n\n=== SIZE ===\nAPK before: <bytes / MiB>\nAPK after: <bytes / MiB>\nReduction: <bytes / percent>\nDEX total: <size>\nResources total: <size>\nNative libs total: <size>\nLargest remaining APK contributor: <value>\n\n=== RUNTIME ===\nVisible blocks: Home / Fav / P1 / P2 / Dock\nP1 manual slots: <numero>\nP2 manual slots: <numero>\nDock slots: <numero>\n\nSearch paths: <numero>\nDrawer paths: <numero>\nSettings paths: <numero>\nClock paths: <numero>\nMedia paths: <numero>\nSuggested paths: <numero>\nRecents paths: <numero>\nAnimation paths: <numero>\nGesture paths: <numero>\n\n=== HARDENING ===\nHome snapshot clear paths: <numero>\nCatalog unchanged-resume reloads: <numero>\nFirst-touch blockers: <numero>\nMain-thread heavy paths: <numero>\nConfirmed crash paths: <numero>\nConfirmed ANR paths: <numero>\nConfirmed memory leaks: <numero>\nRemaining risks: <numero>\n\n=== CLEANUP ===\nKotlin files before/after: <n>/<n>\nResources removed: <numero>\nDependencies removed: <numero>\nDead code removed: <numero>\n\n=== BUILD ===\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nAPK ZIP validation: <PASS/FAIL>\nAPK signature: <PASS/FAIL>\nAPK SHA-256: <hash>\n\n=== BACKUPS ===\nPre-minification backup: <path>\nPre-minification archive: <path>\n\nFrozen checkpoint: <path>\nFrozen archive: <path>\nFrozen archive SHA-256: <hash>\n\nFreeze marker:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/FROZEN_BASELINE.md\n\nSize audit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_SIZE_AUDIT.md\n\nHardening audit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_FROZEN_CORE_AUDIT.md\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:197:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787146448,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — COMPLEXITY REDUCTION CHECK-UP\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRidurre la complessità del codice mantenendo ESATTAMENTE il runtime minimale:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nNON aggiungere feature.\nNON cambiare UI.\nNON cambiare geometry.\nNON cambiare persistence semantics.\n\n==================================================\n1. PRINCIPIO\n==================================================\n\nPreferire:\n\ncodice diretto\npochi state owner\npochi effects\npochi helper\npochi file con responsabilità chiare\n\nEvitare:\n\nabstraction layers inutili\nwrapper su wrapper\nstate duplicati\nresolver duplicati\ncallbacks a catena\nmicro-classi con un solo call-site\n\n==================================================\n2. INVENTORY\n==================================================\n\nConta:\n\n- Kotlin files\n- classes\n- objects\n- data classes\n- interfaces\n- extension functions\n- composables\n- effects\n- state holder\n- executors\n- callbacks/listeners\n\nCrea baseline complexity.\n\n==================================================\n3. REMOVE DEAD ABSTRACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nCerca componenti con:\n\n- un solo call-site\n- nessuna sostituzione reale\n- nessun test benefit\n- nessun lifecycle ownership reale\n\nSe un wrapper non aggiunge valore:\ninline oppure rimuovi.\n\n==================================================\n4. HOME STATE\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\nun solo HomeSnapshot.\n\nNo duplicati tipo:\n\nhomeApps\nresolvedApps\nvisibleApps\nrenderApps\npanelApps\n\nse rappresentano gli stessi dati in fasi inutili.\n\n==================================================\n5. SNAPSHOT MODEL\n==================================================\n\nPreferire:\n\nHomeSnapshot(\n    p1,\n    p2,\n    dock\n)\n\nOgni lista con size normalizzata.\n\nUI legge solo snapshot.\n\n==================================================\n6. REMOVE DERIVED STATE DUPLICATES\n==================================================\n\nSe esiste uno state che può essere calcolato direttamente da snapshot:\n\nnon persisterlo in mutableState.\n\nEsempi:\n\nFav count\nresolved count\nnonEmpty count\n\nCalcolare come derived value.\n\n==================================================\n7. MAINACTIVITY\n==================================================\n\nMainActivity deve fare solo:\n\n- lifecycle\n- catalog owner\n- slot snapshot owner\n- Home composition\n\nNon deve contenere:\n\n- feature routing morto\n- Settings state\n- Drawer state\n- Search state\n- media state\n- animation state\n\n==================================================\n8. CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nAppCatalog deve essere piccolo.\n\nResponsabilità:\n\n- enumerate launchable apps\n- listen package/profile changes\n- publish stable catalog\n\nNON:\n\n- suggestions\n- recents\n- Search\n- Settings data\n- UI formatting\n\n==================================================\n9. STORAGE\n==================================================\n\nLauncherPreferences deve contenere solo ciò che serve al core.\n\nMantieni:\n\nP1 8\nP2 8\nDock 5\nwallpaper URI se ancora usati\neventuale icon preference realmente usata\n\nRimuovi API morte.\n\n==================================================\n10. MIGRATION\n==================================================\n\nTutte le migration vecchie non più necessarie al device state attuale vanno:\n\nKEEP solo se servono davvero a installazioni legacy ancora supportate.\n\nAltrimenti documenta e rimuovi.\n\nNon tenere 5 layer di compatibilità storica senza necessità.\n\n==================================================\n11. P2\n==================================================\n\nContratto unico:\n\nP2 = 8 manual.\n\nNon devono esistere termini runtime:\n\nsuggested\nrecommended\nrecent fallback\nauto-fill\n\nNemmeno come naming residuo.\n\n==================================================\n12. APP MODEL\n==================================================\n\nLaunchableApp deve contenere solo campi realmente usati.\n\nCerca campi legacy:\n\nprofileLabel\nbadgedIcon\nsearch tokens\nsuggestion score\nmetadata non consumati\n\nRimuovi se zero call-site.\n\n==================================================\n13. ICON PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nPreferire un solo resolver.\n\nSe icon pack non è più necessario:\nrimuoverlo.\n\nSe resta:\nun solo call path.\n\nNo:\n\nresolver Home\nresolver Dock\nresolver Search\nfallback wrapper duplicati\n\n==================================================\n14. COMPOSE\n==================================================\n\nRiduci effects.\n\nTarget ideale:\n\npochi DisposableEffect/LaunchedEffect realmente necessari.\n\nNo effect per valori derivabili.\n\nNo preference read in render.\n\n==================================================\n15. REMEMBER\n==================================================\n\nAudit ogni:\n\nremember\nrememberSaveable\nderivedStateOf\n\nRimuovi remember inutile per calcoli economici.\n\nNon usare remember come pseudo-storage.\n\n==================================================\n16. CALLBACK DEPTH\n==================================================\n\nRiduci callback nesting.\n\nEvita:\n\nHomeScreen\n→ onPanelAction\n→ onCellAction\n→ onLaunchRequest\n→ handler\n→ launcher\n\nPreferire:\n\ncell\n→ launch callback\n\nchiaro.\n\n==================================================\n17. UI FILES\n==================================================\n\nTarget semplice:\n\nHomeScreen.kt\nFavPanel.kt\nHomePanels.kt\nAppVisuals.kt\n\nSe due file sono minuscoli e fortemente accoppiati:\nvaluta merge.\n\nSe un file è enorme:\nsepara solo per responsabilità reale.\n\n==================================================\n18. DESIGN TOKENS\n==================================================\n\nMachinaDesign.kt deve contenere solo token usati.\n\nRimuovi:\n\nold settings tokens\nanimation tokens\nshadow tuning\ngesture tokens\nsearch tokens\ndrawer tokens\nclock tokens\n\nse non più usati.\n\n==================================================\n19. RESOURCES\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi solo resources zero-callsite.\n\nControlla soprattutto:\n\nold search icons\nsettings icons\ndrawer assets\nclock assets\nmedia assets\nold launcher images\n\n==================================================\n20. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nManifest minimale.\n\nIdealmente:\n\nMainActivity launcher\n\npiù nient'altro salvo componenti realmente necessari.\n\n==================================================\n21. GRADLE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dependency zero-callsite.\n\nNon aggiornare versioni.\n\n==================================================\n22. ERROR HANDLING\n==================================================\n\nNon creare helper generici per ogni try/catch.\n\nGestisci eccezioni vicino al boundary Android:\n\ncatalog\nlaunch\nwallpaper\n\n==================================================\n23. LOGGING\n==================================================\n\nUn solo tag per area se necessario.\n\nNo debug verbosity.\n\n==================================================\n24. THREADING\n==================================================\n\nPreferire un solo executor catalogo.\n\nNo raw thread per task ripetibili.\n\nNo executor duplicati.\n\n==================================================\n25. LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nUn solo path di startup.\n\nUn solo path di refresh.\n\nUn solo path di cleanup.\n\nElimina lifecycle branching storico non più necessario.\n\n==================================================\n26. FIRST FRAME\n==================================================\n\nNon fare lavoro pesante durante composition.\n\nMa evita anche pipeline async inutilmente frammentate.\n\n==================================================\n27. CODE METRICS\n==================================================\n\nPrima/dopo misura:\n\nKotlin LOC\nKotlin files\nclasses/objects\nstate holders\neffects\ncallbacks/listeners\nruntime feature paths\n\n==================================================\n28. NO COSMETIC REFORMAT\n==================================================\n\nNon produrre un diff enorme per:\n\nformatting\nrename non necessari\ncomment rewrite\n\nRidurre il diff ai cambi realmente utili.\n\n==================================================\n29. MEMOS\n==================================================\n\nMantieni solo memo essenziali:\n\nP2 = 8 manual.\nNo auto-fill.\n\nHome state survives resume.\n\nNo global gestures.\n\n==================================================\n30. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n31. CREATE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_COMPLEXITY_AUDIT.md\n\nCon:\n\nBefore\nAfter\nRemoved abstractions\nState ownership\nEffect count\nCallback count\nSource structure\nRemaining complexity\nBuild verification\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nRuntime feature count:\nunchanged\n\nVisible UI:\nunchanged\n\nP1:\n8\n\nP2:\n8\n\nDock:\n5\n\nCode LOC:\nreduced\n\nDead abstractions:\n0 confirmed\n\nDuplicate state owners:\n0\n\nGlobal gesture owners:\n0\n\nSearch/Drawer/Settings/Clock paths:\n0\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME COMPLEXITY REDUCTION COMPLETE\n\nKotlin LOC before: <numero>\nKotlin LOC after: <numero>\nReduction: <numero / percent>\n\nKotlin files before: <numero>\nKotlin files after: <numero>\n\nClasses/objects before: <numero>\nClasses/objects after: <numero>\n\nMutable state owners before: <numero>\nMutable state owners after: <numero>\n\nCompose effects before: <numero>\nCompose effects after: <numero>\n\nCallbacks/listeners before: <numero>\nCallbacks/listeners after: <numero>\n\nDead abstractions removed: <numero>\nDead helpers removed: <numero>\nDead models removed: <numero>\nDead resources removed: <numero>\n\nP1 slots: <numero>\nP2 slots: <numero>\nDock slots: <numero>\n\nRuntime visual regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nPersistence regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nLifecycle regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nFiles removed: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_COMPLEXITY_AUDIT.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:198:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787146791,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — APK SIZE + FINAL CORE AUDIT\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nBASELINE STATUS:\n\nKotlin LOC: 2077\nKotlin files: 10\nMutable state owners: 5\nCompose effects: 2\nCallbacks/listeners: 14\n\nP1: 8 manual\nP2: 8 manual\nDock: 5\n\nPrevious build:\nSUCCESS\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nNON modificare subito il codice.\n\nPrima misurare con precisione:\n\n1. dimensione APK\n2. contenuto APK\n3. peso DEX\n4. peso resources\n5. peso immagini\n6. eventuali feature morte ancora compilate\n7. dipendenze realmente incluse\n8. possibilità di riduzione SICURA\n\n==================================================\n1. BUILD CURRENT CLEAN BASELINE\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nIndividua l'APK prodotto da QUESTO build.\n\nRegistra:\n\npath\nbytes\nMiB\nSHA-256\n\n==================================================\n2. APK ZIP VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\nunzip -t \"$APK\"\n\nTarget:\nPASS\n\n==================================================\n3. SIGNATURE VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nTrova build-tools corrente e verifica:\n\napksigner verify --verbose --print-certs \"$APK\"\n\nTarget:\nPASS\n\n==================================================\n4. APK CONTENT INVENTORY\n==================================================\n\nEsegui inventario completo dell'APK.\n\nClassifica dimensioni per:\n\nclasses*.dex\nresources.arsc\nres/\nassets/\nlib/\nMETA-INF/\nAndroidManifest.xml\nother\n\nCalcola:\n\nraw bytes\npercentuale APK\n\n==================================================\n5. DEX INVENTORY\n==================================================\n\nElenca:\n\nclasses.dex\nclasses2.dex\nclasses3.dex\n...\n\ncon size individuale.\n\nCalcola DEX total.\n\n==================================================\n6. TOP APK ENTRIES\n==================================================\n\nMostra le 30 entry più grandi dell'APK.\n\nServe a capire immediatamente cosa pesa.\n\n==================================================\n7. IMAGE INVENTORY\n==================================================\n\nTrova tutte le immagini incluse:\n\npng\njpg\njpeg\nwebp\n\nPer ciascuna:\n\nresource/path\nsize\n\nSegnala:\n\nduplicate artwork\noversized artwork\nhistorical assets\nunused previews\nscreenshots\nreference images\n\nNON modificare ancora.\n\n==================================================\n8. NATIVE LIBRARIES\n==================================================\n\nVerifica se esiste:\n\nlib/\n\nSe sì:\n\nelenca ABI\n.so files\nsize\n\nDetermina quale dependency li introduce.\n\n==================================================\n9. RESOURCE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nConfronta resources incluse nell'APK con source call-sites.\n\nClassifica:\n\nKEEP\nLIKELY_DEAD\nCONFIRMED_DEAD\n\nNon eliminare LIKELY_DEAD.\n\n==================================================\n10. FEATURE STRING AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca nel source e nell'APK tracce delle feature rimosse:\n\nSearch\nSettings\nDrawer\nClock\nDynamic Media\nSuggested\nRecents\nChangelog\nOnboarding\n\nDistingui:\n\nSOURCE RUNTIME PATH\nDEAD SOURCE ONLY\nRESOURCE STRING ONLY\nDEPENDENCY CODE\n\nTarget desiderato:\nnessun runtime path.\n\n==================================================\n11. MANIFEST AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nDump manifest finale.\n\nElenca:\n\nactivities\nservices\nreceivers\nproviders\npermissions\nqueries\nintent filters\n\nTarget:\n\nsolo componenti necessari al core minimale.\n\n==================================================\n12. DEPENDENCY AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nAnalizza Gradle dependencies.\n\nPer ogni dependency production:\n\nnome\nperché è necessaria\ncall-site principale\nremovable YES/NO\n\nSegnala dipendenze rimaste da:\n\nSettings\nDrawer\nMedia\nSearch\nanimations\n\n==================================================\n13. COMPOSE DEPENDENCY REALITY\n==================================================\n\nNON tentare di rimuovere Compose solo per ridurre APK.\n\nDocumenta quanto del peso deriva dal runtime/framework necessario\nalla UI attuale.\n\n==================================================\n14. CODE SIZE VS APK SIZE\n==================================================\n\nSpiega quanto incidono realmente i 2077 LOC.\n\nNon assumere che ridurre altre 100 LOC riduca significativamente l'APK.\n\n==================================================\n15. SAFE REDUCTION CANDIDATES\n==================================================\n\nProduci una lista ordinata:\n\nA — SAFE / HIGH VALUE\nB — SAFE / LOW VALUE\nC — RISKY\nD — DO NOT REMOVE\n\nPer ogni candidato:\n\nestimated size saving\nrisk\nfiles/dependency affected\n\n==================================================\n16. RELEASE SHRINK CHECK\n==================================================\n\nVerifica configurazione:\n\nminifyEnabled\nshrinkResources\nProGuard/R8 rules\n\nNON modificarla ancora.\n\nDocumenta soltanto:\n\ndebug status\nrelease status\nwhether release shrinking is currently viable\n\n==================================================\n17. DO NOT OPTIMIZE BLINDLY\n==================================================\n\nIn questa fase:\n\nNO source deletion\nNO dependency deletion\nNO resource deletion\nNO Gradle changes\nNO R8 changes\n\nREAD-ONLY audit salvo documentazione generata.\n\n==================================================\n18. CREATE SIZE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_APK_SIZE_AUDIT.md\n\nContiene:\n\n# APK\n# DEX\n# Resources\n# Images\n# Native Libraries\n# Manifest\n# Dependencies\n# Removed Feature Residue\n# Safe Reduction Candidates\n# R8 / Resource Shrinking\n# Recommended Next Step\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME APK SIZE AUDIT COMPLETE\n\nAPK: <path>\nAPK size bytes: <numero>\nAPK size MiB: <numero>\nAPK SHA-256: <hash>\nZIP validation: <PASS/FAIL>\nSignature validation: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nDEX files: <numero>\nDEX total: <bytes / MiB>\nResources total: <bytes / MiB>\nImages total: <bytes / MiB>\nNative libs total: <bytes / MiB>\nLargest APK entry: <path + size>\n\nActivities: <numero>\nServices: <numero>\nReceivers: <numero>\nProviders: <numero>\nPermissions: <numero>\n\nProduction dependencies: <numero>\nConfirmed removable dependencies: <numero>\nConfirmed dead resources: <numero>\nRemoved-feature runtime paths: <numero>\n\nDebug minify: <ON/OFF>\nDebug shrinkResources: <ON/OFF>\nRelease minify: <ON/OFF/NOT_CONFIGURED>\nRelease shrinkResources: <ON/OFF/NOT_CONFIGURED>\n\nSafe high-value reductions: <numero>\nEstimated safe reduction: <bytes / MiB>\n\nProject source modified: NO\nGradle modified: NO\nRuntime modified: NO\n\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_APK_SIZE_AUDIT.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:199:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787147147,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — APK UNEXPLAINED SIZE ROOT-CAUSE AUDIT\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nAPK:\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/19-08-2026_03-39-PM/app-debug.apk\n\nKNOWN APK SIZE:\n33090314 bytes\n31.557 MiB\n\nKNOWN COMPONENTS:\n\nDEX:\n5150036 bytes\n\nResources:\n1466577 bytes\n\nImages:\n1376801 bytes\n\nNative libs:\n37392 bytes\n\nPROBLEMA\n\nLa somma delle categorie note non spiega circa 24 MiB dell'APK.\n\nNON modificare codice.\nNON modificare Gradle.\nNON rebuildare finché non necessario.\nNON rimuovere dependencies.\n\n==================================================\n1. VERIFY FILE SIZE\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\nstat -c '%s' \"$APK\"\ndu -h \"$APK\"\nsha256sum \"$APK\"\n\nConferma che il file analizzato sia esattamente:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/19-08-2026_03-39-PM/app-debug.apk\n\n==================================================\n2. COMPLETE ZIP INVENTORY\n==================================================\n\nUsa:\n\nunzip -lv \"$APK\"\n\nPer OGNI entry raccogli:\n\n- path\n- uncompressed size\n- compressed size\n- compression method\n\nCalcola:\n\nTOTAL ENTRY UNCOMPRESSED\nTOTAL ENTRY COMPRESSED\n\n==================================================\n3. CLASSIFY EVERY BYTE\n==================================================\n\nClassifica tutte le entry in:\n\nDEX\nRESOURCES_ARSC\nRES\nASSETS\nLIB\nMETA-INF\nMANIFEST\nKOTLIN/METADATA\nOTHER\n\nLa somma delle dimensioni compresse deve essere confrontata con\nla dimensione fisica APK.\n\n==================================================\n4. APK PHYSICAL OVERHEAD\n==================================================\n\nCalcola:\n\napkPhysicalSize\n\nminus\n\nsumCompressedZipEntries\n\nLa differenza è:\n\nZIP/APK PHYSICAL OVERHEAD\n\nDocumenta esattamente quanti byte.\n\n==================================================\n5. APK SIGNING BLOCK\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL.\n\nVerifica presenza e dimensione dell'APK Signing Block v2.\n\nIndividua:\n\n- offset central directory\n- end of central directory\n- signing block start/end\n- signing block byte size\n\nSe il signing block occupa molti MiB:\nquesta è probabilmente la causa.\n\nNON alterare la firma.\n\n==================================================\n6. ZIP ALIGNMENT / PADDING\n==================================================\n\nControlla:\n\nzipalign -c -v 4 \"$APK\"\n\ne identifica eventuale padding significativo.\n\nQuantifica:\n\nalignment/padding bytes\n\nNon limitarti a PASS/FAIL.\n\n==================================================\n7. CENTRAL DIRECTORY\n==================================================\n\nCalcola:\n\nnumber of ZIP entries\ncentral directory size\nEOCD size\n\nUn central directory normale deve essere piccolo.\n\nSe è enorme:\nidentifica perché.\n\n==================================================\n8. SEARCH EXTRA DATA\n==================================================\n\nControlla byte/file non rappresentati normalmente da unzip.\n\nVerifica:\n\n- preamble prima del primo local header\n- data dopo EOCD\n- giant extra fields\n- signing block\n- alignment gaps\n\nClassifica ogni regione fisica dell'APK.\n\n==================================================\n9. TOP 50 COMPRESSED ENTRIES\n==================================================\n\nMostra top 50 per:\n\nA. uncompressed size\nB. compressed size\n\nNon solo top 30.\n\n==================================================\n10. DEX COMPRESSION\n==================================================\n\nVerifica se classes.dex è:\n\nSTORED\noppure\nDEFLATED\n\nRiporta:\n\nuncompressed\ncompressed\ndifference\n\n==================================================\n11. RESOURCE COMPRESSION\n==================================================\n\nFai lo stesso per:\n\nresources.arsc\n\ne grandi resource entry.\n\n==================================================\n12. REMOVABLE DEPENDENCY\n==================================================\n\nL'audit precedente segnala:\n\nConfirmed removable dependencies: 1\n\nIdentifica ESATTAMENTE:\n\ndependency\nGradle declaration\ncurrent APK contribution stimata/reale\nDEX classes/resources introdotte\n\nNON rimuoverla.\n\nVoglio sapere se vale:\n\n<100 KiB\n100–500 KiB\n500 KiB–1 MiB\n>1 MiB\n\n==================================================\n13. DEPENDENCY SIZE BREAKDOWN\n==================================================\n\nSe possibile tramite Gradle/R8 mapping o dependency analysis,\nattribuisci le classi DEX principali a:\n\nAndroidX Compose\nKotlin\nMaterial\napp code\nremaining dependency groups\n\nNon serve precisione byte-perfect se tooling non lo permette.\n\n==================================================\n14. VERIFY MINIFY CLAIM\n==================================================\n\nIl precedente audit riporta:\n\nDebug minify: ON\nDebug shrinkResources: ON\n\nVerifica direttamente build.gradle/build.gradle.kts.\n\nRiporta le righe/configurazioni reali.\n\nConferma che l'APK 03-39-PM provenga effettivamente da quella buildType.\n\n==================================================\n15. CHECK DEBUG SYMBOL / METADATA CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nCerca nell'APK:\n\ndebug metadata\nbaseline profiles\ncompose metadata\nkotlin metadata\nsource debug extensions\n\nQuantifica solo ciò che è realmente packaged.\n\n==================================================\n16. NO SPECULATION\n==================================================\n\nDeve emergere un'equazione completa:\n\nAPK physical size\n=\ncompressed ZIP entries\n+\nsigning block\n+\nalignment/padding\n+\ncentral directory/headers\n+\nother identified bytes\n\nErrore massimo accettabile:\npochi KiB.\n\n==================================================\n17. CREATE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_APK_PHYSICAL_SIZE_AUDIT.md\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME APK PHYSICAL SIZE AUDIT COMPLETE\n\nAPK physical size: <bytes / MiB>\n\nZIP entries: <numero>\nZIP entries compressed total: <bytes / MiB>\nZIP entries uncompressed total: <bytes / MiB>\n\nAPK signing block: <bytes / MiB>\nZIP alignment/padding: <bytes / MiB>\nCentral directory + headers: <bytes / MiB>\nOther physical bytes: <bytes / MiB>\n\nUnexplained bytes before audit: <bytes>\nUnexplained bytes after audit: <bytes>\n\nclasses.dex uncompressed: <bytes>\nclasses.dex compressed: <bytes>\nclasses.dex method: <STORED/DEFLATED>\n\nresources.arsc uncompressed: <bytes>\nresources.arsc compressed: <bytes>\nresources.arsc method: <value>\n\nLargest compressed entry: <path / bytes>\n\nConfirmed removable dependency: <name>\nEstimated packaged contribution: <bytes / MiB>\n\nDebug minify verified: <ON/OFF>\nDebug shrinkResources verified: <ON/OFF>\n\nPrimary reason APK is 31.557 MiB:\n<precise cause>\n\nSafe next reduction:\n<value>\n\nProject source modified: NO\nGradle modified: NO\nAPK modified: NO\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO\n\nAudit:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_HOME_APK_PHYSICAL_SIZE_AUDIT.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:200:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787147626,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — APK PACKAGING / ZIP PADDING FIX\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCURRENT APK:\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/19-08-2026_03-39-PM/app-debug.apk\n\nKNOWN AUDIT:\n\nAPK physical:\n33090314 bytes\n\nCompressed ZIP entries:\n6685568 bytes\n\nInter-entry alignment/filler:\n26385086 bytes\n\nSigning block:\n4096 bytes\n\nUnexplained:\n0\n\nROOT CAUSE:\n\nAPK size inflation is caused by ~25.16 MiB of redundant\ninter-entry ZIP alignment/filler padding.\n\nPRIORITÀ:\nPACKAGING ONLY\n\n==================================================\n1. HARD SAFETY RULE\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- Kotlin\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- persistence\n- catalog\n- lifecycle\n- Manifest semantics\n- resources\n- launcher icon\n- wallpapers\n\nQuesta fase riguarda SOLO il packaging APK.\n\n==================================================\n2. BACKUP CURRENT APK\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-pre-packaging-fix-<timestamp>/\n\nCopia:\n\n- current APK\n- APK size audit\n- APK physical size audit\n\nCalcola SHA-256.\n\n==================================================\n3. IDENTIFY PADDING SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nTrova esattamente chi genera:\n\n409 orphan padding headers\n26385086 bytes filler\n\nAudit:\n\nGradle Android plugin packaging\nzipalign invocation\napksigner invocation\nprojectctl packaging steps\npost-processing scripts\ncustom APK copy/repack\nalignment options\npage alignment\nnative library alignment\n\n==================================================\n4. AUDIT PROJECTCTL\n==================================================\n\nIspeziona:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl\n\ne tutti gli script chiamati dalla build.\n\nCerca:\n\nzipalign\napksigner\nalign\npage-size\npadding\nzip\nunzip\nrepack\napktool\ncp\ndd\n\nVerifica se l'APK viene riallineato più volte.\n\n==================================================\n5. AUDIT GRADLE OUTPUT DIRECTLY\n==================================================\n\nConfronta il file immediatamente prodotto da Gradle:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk\n\ncon:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/.../app-debug.apk\n\nPer ENTRAMBI misura:\n\n- physical size\n- compressed entry total\n- padding\n- SHA-256\n\nCRITICAL:\n\nstabilisci se il padding esiste già nell'APK Gradle\noppure viene introdotto da projectctl/post-processing.\n\n==================================================\n6. DO NOT ASSUME ZIPALIGN IS THE FIX\n==================================================\n\nPrima identifica la causa.\n\nSe APK Gradle è piccolo:\nbug = projectctl/post-processing.\n\nSe APK Gradle è già ~31 MiB:\nbug = Android packaging/alignment configuration.\n\n==================================================\n7. ORPHAN PADDING HEADERS\n==================================================\n\nAnalizza i 409 orphan padding headers.\n\nDetermina:\n\n- signature/magic\n- location\n- size distribution\n- quale tool li produce\n\nDocumenta il pattern.\n\n==================================================\n8. BUILD TOOLS\n==================================================\n\nIdentifica versioni effettive:\n\nAndroid Gradle Plugin\nGradle\nbuild-tools\nzipalign\napksigner\n\nNON aggiornarle.\n\n==================================================\n9. PACKAGING CONFIG AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca nel Gradle:\n\npackaging\npackagingOptions\njniLibs\nuseLegacyPackaging\ndex\nresources\ndoNotCompress\njniDebuggable\n\ne qualsiasi configurazione alignment.\n\nDocumenta solo valori realmente presenti.\n\n==================================================\n10. CONTROL EXPERIMENT A\n==================================================\n\nCrea una COPIA del current APK.\n\nNON modificare l'originale.\n\nRimuovi/repack soltanto il padding ridondante mantenendo:\n\n- tutte le 90 entry\n- stessi contenuti entry\n- stesso compression method dove ragionevole\n- Manifest invariato\n- resources invariati\n- DEX invariato\n\nOutput temporaneo:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/reports/\npackaging-experiment-<timestamp>/unsigned-repacked.apk\n\n==================================================\n11. REPACK VALIDATION BEFORE SIGNING\n==================================================\n\nConfronta original vs repacked:\n\nZIP entry count\nentry names\nCRC\nuncompressed size\n\nTarget:\n\n90 / 90 identical logical entries\n\nDEX SHA-256 extracted:\nIDENTICAL\n\nresources.arsc SHA-256:\nIDENTICAL\n\nManifest logical content:\nIDENTICAL\n\n==================================================\n12. ALIGN ONCE\n==================================================\n\nSe necessario:\n\nusa zipalign UNA SOLA VOLTA.\n\nNon fare alignment multipli.\n\nOutput:\n\naligned.apk\n\nVerifica:\n\nzipalign -c -v 4 aligned.apk\n\nPASS.\n\n==================================================\n13. SIGN ONCE\n==================================================\n\nFirma la copia con la stessa DEBUG signing configuration\nusata dal normale progetto.\n\nOutput:\n\npackaging-test-debug.apk\n\nNON modificare keystore/signing config del progetto.\n\n==================================================\n14. FINAL TEST APK SIZE\n==================================================\n\nMisura:\n\nphysical size\ncompressed entry total\nalignment/padding\nsigning block\n\nTarget:\n\npadding drasticamente inferiore.\n\nExpected class:\nsingle-digit MiB APK.\n\nNON hardcodare 6 MiB come pass/fail.\n\n==================================================\n15. APK VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\nunzip -t\n\napksigner verify --verbose --print-certs\n\nzipalign -c -v 4\n\nTutti PASS.\n\n==================================================\n16. APK SEMANTIC COMPARISON\n==================================================\n\nConfronta original vs fixed:\n\npackage name\nversionCode\nversionName\nminSdk\ntargetSdk\nlaunchable activity\n\nDevono essere identici.\n\n==================================================\n17. DEX IDENTITY\n==================================================\n\nEstrai classes.dex da entrambi.\n\nSHA-256:\n\nMUST MATCH.\n\nQuesta è una patch packaging,\nnon una modifica del codice.\n\n==================================================\n18. RESOURCE IDENTITY\n==================================================\n\nConfronta tutte le entry non-signature.\n\nPer ogni logical APK entry:\n\nCRC/content equivalence.\n\nSegnala qualunque differenza.\n\n==================================================\n19. FIND PERMANENT FIX\n==================================================\n\nDopo aver dimostrato che il repack piccolo funziona,\ncorreggi LA CAUSA nella pipeline.\n\nPreferenza:\n\nfix projectctl\noppure\nfix packaging config\n\nNON aggiungere un fragile repack post-build\nse il problema può essere eliminato alla sorgente.\n\n==================================================\n20. ONE PACKAGING PASS\n==================================================\n\nFinal pipeline desiderata:\n\nGradle package\n→ align once if required\n→ sign once\n→ copy output\n\nNON:\n\npackage\n→ align\n→ sign\n→ repack\n→ realign\n→ resign\n\n==================================================\n21. REBUILD FROM CLEAN\n==================================================\n\nDopo il fix permanente:\n\nesegui clean build appropriata tramite:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNON usare l'APK sperimentale come output finale.\n\n==================================================\n22. FINAL APK AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSul nuovo output ufficiale misura nuovamente:\n\nAPK physical\ncompressed entries\npadding\nsigning block\nDEX\nresources\nimages\n\n==================================================\n23. REMOVE TOOLING PREVIEW?\n==================================================\n\nNON rimuovere ancora:\n\nandroidx.compose.ui:ui-tooling-preview\n\nVale <100 KiB.\n\nPrima chiudi il packaging bug.\n\nPotrà essere valutato separatamente dopo il freeze.\n\n==================================================\n24. CREATE REPORT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_HOME_APK_PACKAGING_FIX.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- actual padding producer\n- why 409 orphan headers existed\n- pipeline before\n- pipeline after\n- logical APK equivalence\n- size before/after\n- validation\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nRoot padding producer:\nIDENTIFIED\n\nKotlin modified:\nNO\n\nResources modified:\nNO\n\nManifest semantics modified:\nNO\n\nDEX content changed:\nNO\n\nLogical APK entries lost:\n0\n\nRedundant padding:\nREMOVED\n\nZIP:\nPASS\n\nzipalign:\nPASS\n\nsignature:\nPASS\n\nOfficial project build:\nSUCCESS\n\nAPK size:\nDRAMATICALLY REDUCED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME APK PACKAGING FIX COMPLETE\n\nPadding producer: <precise tool/path/config>\nOrphan padding header producer: <value>\n\nGradle direct APK before:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nProjectctl output APK before:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nPadding before:\n26385086 bytes / 25.163 MiB\n\nFixed official APK:\n<path>\n\nFixed APK size:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nCompressed ZIP entries:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nPadding after:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nSize reduction:\n<bytes / percent>\n\nLogical ZIP entries before/after:\n<90/90>\n\nclasses.dex SHA-256 identical:\n<YES/NO>\n\nresources.arsc identical:\n<YES/NO>\n\nPackage/version identical:\n<YES/NO>\n\nZIP validation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nzipalign validation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSignature validation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nKotlin files modified:\n0\n\nResource files modified:\n0\n\nManifest semantic changes:\n0\n\nPipeline files modified:\n<numero>\n\nBuild:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used:\nNO\n\nAPK installed:\nNO\n\nReport:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_HOME_APK_PACKAGING_FIX.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:201:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787148210,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — ANDROID 17 APK PACKAGING REBUILD\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRicostruire la pipeline APK in modo moderno, semplice e conforme ad Android 17.\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- Kotlin\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- persistence\n- resources\n- manifest semantics\n- visual UI\n\nIl problema è esclusivamente nel packaging APK.\n\n==================================================\n1. CURRENT ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nAPK corrente:\n\n31.557 MiB\n\nZIP logical content:\n~6.376 MiB compressed\n\nRedundant filler/alignment:\n~25.163 MiB\n\nOrphan padding headers:\n409\n\nQuesta dimensione non è normale e deve essere eliminata alla sorgente.\n\n==================================================\n2. TARGET PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nPipeline finale desiderata:\n\nGradle/AGP package\n→ zipalign ONCE if required\n→ apksigner ONCE\n→ verify\n→ copy artifact\n\nNient'altro.\n\nNO:\n\nrepack multipli\nrealign multipli\nresign multipli\nzip/unzip cycles\nmanual dd padding\ncustom filler\npost-sign modifications\n\n==================================================\n3. IDENTIFY ACTUAL APK PRODUCER\n==================================================\n\nConfronta:\n\nA.\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk\n\nB.\nultimo APK copiato in:\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/<timestamp>/app-debug.apk\n\nMisura entrambi:\n\nstat\nsha256\nunzip -lv\npadding bytes\nsigning block\nentry count\n\nDetermina se il padding nasce:\n\n- dentro AGP/Gradle\noppure\n- dentro projectctl/post-processing\n\n==================================================\n4. AUDIT PROJECTCTL\n==================================================\n\nIspeziona:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl\n\ne tutti gli script chiamati.\n\nCerca:\n\nzipalign\napksigner\nzip\nunzip\njar\ncp\ndd\ntruncate\nalign\npage\npadding\nrepack\nsign\n\nElenca l'ordine reale delle operazioni.\n\n==================================================\n5. AUDIT ANDROID GRADLE CONFIG\n==================================================\n\nLeggi:\n\napp/build.gradle\napp/build.gradle.kts\nsettings.gradle*\ngradle.properties\n\nCerca:\n\npackaging\npackagingOptions\njniLibs\nuseLegacyPackaging\ndoNotCompress\nminifyEnabled\nshrinkResources\nsigningConfig\ndebuggable\njniDebuggable\n\nNON modificare ancora.\n\n==================================================\n6. ANDROID 17 / MODERN ALIGNMENT POLICY\n==================================================\n\nMantieni una policy semplice:\n\n- APK ZIP entry alignment standard per file uncompressed\n- native ELF/page alignment lasciato agli strumenti Android moderni\n- nessun padding manuale enorme\n\nNON applicare 16 KiB alignment a tutte le entry APK.\n\nNON applicare padding fisso per ogni file.\n\n==================================================\n7. ZIPALIGN ONLY ONCE\n==================================================\n\nSe il build Gradle produce APK unsigned/non-final:\n\nusa una sola passata:\n\nzipalign -v -p 4\n\noppure il comando equivalente corretto per il build-tools installato.\n\nNon riallineare un APK già allineato/signato.\n\n==================================================\n8. SIGN AFTER ALIGN\n==================================================\n\nFirma DOPO l'allineamento:\n\napksigner sign ...\n\nMai modificare l'APK dopo la firma.\n\n==================================================\n9. NO MANUAL ZIP REPACK IN FINAL PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nÈ consentito fare un repack solo come test diagnostico.\n\nLa pipeline definitiva NON deve basarsi su:\n\nunzip\nzip\nmanual padding cleanup\n\nse AGP/projectctl può essere corretto alla sorgente.\n\n==================================================\n10. ORPHAN HEADER ROOT CAUSE\n==================================================\n\nIdentifica precisamente i 409 header/filler.\n\nDevi riportare:\n\nproducer\nmagic/signature\nper-entry pattern\nreason generated\n\nSe sono prodotti da una custom alignment routine:\nrimuovi quella routine.\n\n==================================================\n11. FIX MINIMUM POSSIBLE FILES\n==================================================\n\nPreferenza assoluta:\n\nmodificare solo:\n\nprojectctl\noppure\nGradle packaging config\n\nNON toccare source app.\n\nTarget:\n\nKotlin files modified = 0\nResource files modified = 0\n\n==================================================\n12. CLEAN BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDopo il fix:\n\nesegui una build pulita appropriata.\n\nPoi:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nIl nuovo APK ufficiale deve essere prodotto dalla pipeline corretta.\n\n==================================================\n13. VERIFY PHYSICAL SIZE\n==================================================\n\nSul nuovo APK:\n\nstat\nunzip -lv\n\nCalcola:\n\nphysical size\ncompressed ZIP content\npadding\nsigning block\ncentral directory\n\nTarget:\n\npadding ridotto da ~25 MiB a valore normale/minimo.\n\n==================================================\n14. VERIFY LOGICAL IDENTITY\n==================================================\n\nConfronta vecchio e nuovo APK:\n\npackage name\nversionCode\nversionName\nminSdk\ntargetSdk\nlaunchable activity\n\nDevono essere identici.\n\n==================================================\n15. VERIFY DEX\n==================================================\n\nEstrai classes.dex dal vecchio e dal nuovo APK.\n\nSHA-256:\n\ndeve essere identico,\nse non è stata fatta una rebuild che cambia solo metadata non-semanticamente.\n\nSe differisce per build nondeterminism:\nconfronta almeno class/method counts e source hash per assicurarti che il codice\napp non sia cambiato.\n\n==================================================\n16. VERIFY RESOURCES\n==================================================\n\nresources.arsc e resource inventory devono restare semanticamente equivalenti.\n\nNessuna risorsa Home deve sparire.\n\n==================================================\n17. ZIPALIGN VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nUsa il build-tools corrente:\n\nzipalign -c -v 4 <APK>\n\nPASS richiesto.\n\nSe il tooling moderno usa page alignment per native libs,\ndocumentalo ma non applicarlo indiscriminatamente a tutte le entry.\n\n==================================================\n18. SIGNATURE VERIFY\n==================================================\n\napksigner verify --verbose --print-certs <APK>\n\nPASS richiesto.\n\n==================================================\n19. ANDROID 17 COMPATIBILITY CHECK\n==================================================\n\nVerifica soltanto aspetti packaging rilevanti:\n\n- target/compile SDK correnti\n- modern APK signing\n- alignment corretto\n- native libs compatibility/page-size where applicable\n- no obsolete post-processing\n\nNON aggiungere nuove API o behavior change code.\n\n==================================================\n20. SIZE TARGET\n==================================================\n\nNon hardcodare una dimensione.\n\nAspettativa realistica:\n\nlogical content ~6.4 MiB\n+\nnormal APK overhead\n\nQuindi l'APK finale dovrebbe essere vicino al single-digit MiB,\nnon ~31 MiB.\n\n==================================================\n21. FINAL REPORT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_HOME_ANDROID17_PACKAGING.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\n- old pipeline\n- exact padding bug\n- new pipeline\n- Android 17 alignment rationale\n- size before/after\n- verification commands\n- build-tools versions\n- remaining risks\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nPadding producer:\nIDENTIFIED\n\nOrphan filler producer:\nIDENTIFIED\n\nManual redundant padding:\nREMOVED\n\nMultiple align passes:\n0\n\nMultiple sign passes:\n0\n\nKotlin modified:\n0\n\nResources modified:\n0\n\nAPK logical content:\nPRESERVED\n\nzipalign:\nPASS\n\napksigner:\nPASS\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\nAPK size:\nDRAMATICALLY REDUCED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME ANDROID 17 PACKAGING REBUILD COMPLETE\n\nPadding producer: <value>\nOrphan header producer: <value>\n\nOld pipeline:\n<short sequence>\n\nNew pipeline:\n<short sequence>\n\nBuild-tools version: <value>\nAGP version: <value>\nGradle version: <value>\n\nAPK before:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nAPK after:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nCompressed logical content:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nPadding before:\n26385086 bytes / 25.163 MiB\n\nPadding after:\n<bytes / MiB>\n\nSize reduction:\n<bytes / percent>\n\nZIP entries before/after:\n<90/90>\n\nPackage/version preserved:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDEX equivalent:\n<YES/NO>\n\nResources equivalent:\n<YES/NO>\n\nzipalign validation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSignature validation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nAndroid 17 packaging compatibility:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nKotlin files modified:\n0\n\nResource files modified:\n0\n\nPipeline files modified:\n<numero>\n\nBuild:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used:\nNO\n\nAPK installed:\nNO\n\nReport:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_HOME_ANDROID17_PACKAGING.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:202:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787148749,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — PURE STATIC CORE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRidurre Machina Home al runtime più semplice possibile.\n\nVISIBLE UI:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5 manual\n\nRIMUOVERE:\n\n- swipe\n- gesture custom\n- animazioni\n- meteo\n- data\n- clock\n- wallpaper gestiti da Machina\n- wallpaper Fav\n- Search\n- Drawer\n- Settings\n- Dynamic Media\n- Suggestions\n- Recents\n- onboarding\n- dim\n- haptic custom\n- qualsiasi comportamento UI non necessario\n\n==================================================\n1. ZERO GESTURES\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi completamente:\n\npointerInput\ndetectDragGestures\ndetectVerticalDragGestures\ndetectHorizontalDragGestures\nawaitPointerEventScope custom\ndraggable\nnested swipe logic\nswipe thresholds\nswipe direction state\n\nTarget runtime:\n\ngesture handlers = 0\n\nLEFT:\nnessuna azione\n\nRIGHT:\nnessuna azione\n\nUP:\nnessuna azione\n\nDOWN:\nnessuna azione\n\n==================================================\n2. ZERO ANIMATIONS\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dal runtime:\n\nanimateDpAsState\nanimateFloatAsState\nanimateColorAsState\nanimateContentSize\nAnimatedVisibility\nAnimatedContent\nupdateTransition\nspring\ntween\nfade\nslide\nscale\ngraphicsLayer animation\npress animations\n\nTarget:\n\nanimation paths = 0\n\nTutti i cambiamenti di stato residui:\nimmediati.\n\n==================================================\n3. REMOVE CLOCK / DATE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nMachina Clock\nshow_clock\nClock tokens\nClock composable\nclock receiver\nclock formatting\n\nFav NON deve più mostrare:\n\n- data\n- giorno\n- mese\n- ora\n\n==================================================\n4. REMOVE WEATHER\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dal Fav:\n\nweather icon\ntemperature placeholder\nweather glyph\nweather layout\nweather tokens\n\nRimuovi resource weather se zero-callsite.\n\nTarget:\n\nweather runtime paths = 0\n\n==================================================\n5. FAV FINAL CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nFav contiene soltanto:\n\nFav. apps\nApps N\n\nN =\n\nresolved P1\n+\nresolved P2\n\nDock esclusa.\n\nNessuna altra informazione.\n\n==================================================\n6. FAV FINAL VISUAL\n==================================================\n\nFav resta una surface statica coerente con Home.\n\nNO:\n\nwallpaper Fav\nimage\noverlay fotografico\nweather\ndate\nmedia\nclick action\nanimation\n\nUsa soltanto:\n\nbackground surface\nborder se già parte del visual approvato\ntesto Fav. apps\nApps N\n\n==================================================\n7. SYSTEM WALLPAPER ONLY\n==================================================\n\nMachina NON gestisce più wallpaper.\n\nWallpaper Home viene scelto esclusivamente dalle:\n\nImpostazioni Android / sistema.\n\nLa root Machina deve essere:\n\nTRANSPARENT\n\nin modo che sia visibile il wallpaper di sistema.\n\n==================================================\n8. REMOVE HOME WALLPAPER FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nhomeWallpaperUri\nHome wallpaper picker\npersisted URI permission\nimage decoder Home\ncustom Home wallpaper rendering\nwallpaper reset\nwallpaper revision\nwallpaper preference API\n\nMachina non deve più selezionare immagini.\n\n==================================================\n9. REMOVE FAV WALLPAPER FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nfavoritesWallpaperUri\nFav wallpaper picker\nFav URI persistence\nFav image decoder\nFav wallpaper reset\nbundled Fav wallpaper runtime path\nblack image overlay\n\nSe:\n\npixel10_fav_wallpaper.jpg\n\nnon ha più alcun call-site:\nrimuovilo dalle resources.\n\n==================================================\n10. SYSTEM WALLPAPER WINDOW\n==================================================\n\nMantieni correttamente:\n\nandroid:windowShowWallpaper=true\n\ne window/root trasparente dove necessario.\n\nNON impostare un wallpaper da codice.\n\nNON usare WallpaperManager per cambiare wallpaper.\n\n==================================================\n11. NO WALLPAPER OBSERVERS\n==================================================\n\nSe non servono più:\n\nrimuovi:\n\nWallpaperColors listener\nwallpaper luminance decoder\nwallpaper generation jobs\ncustom wallpaper callbacks\n\nSe status bar automatica dipende da questo codice,\nsemplifica la status bar a un comportamento statico sicuro\nsenza reintrodurre Settings.\n\n==================================================\n12. P1\n==================================================\n\nP1:\n\n8 slot manuali.\n\nNessuna logica automatica.\n\n==================================================\n13. P2\n==================================================\n\nP2:\n\n8 slot manuali.\n\nTUTTE le otto posizioni persistite.\n\nNO:\n\nsuggested\nrecent\nrandom\nauto-fill\nreplacement\nrecommendations\n\n==================================================\n14. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock:\n\n5 slot persistiti.\n\nNo automatic refill.\n\n==================================================\n15. INPUT MODEL\n==================================================\n\nL'unico input Home ammesso:\n\ntap su app P1\ntap su app P2\ntap su app Dock\n\nTap:\n\n→ launch app\n\nFav:\nNON cliccabile.\n\nRoot:\nNON cliccabile.\n\n==================================================\n16. CLICK OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nOgni app cell:\n\nUN SOLO clickable.\n\nNessun:\n\nparent clickable\noverlay clickable\npointerInput\ndouble owner\n\nTarget:\n\nfirst tap = launch.\n\n==================================================\n17. REMOVE HAPTIC CUSTOM\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi haptic custom se ancora presente.\n\nNO haptic controller.\nNO haptic settings.\nNO haptic gesture feedback.\n\nPreferenza per baseline:\nzero haptic custom.\n\n==================================================\n18. REMOVE UNUSED FEATURE BACKENDS\n==================================================\n\nSe ancora presenti e zero-callsite, rimuovi:\n\nSearch\nDrawer\nSettings\nClock\nWeather\nMedia\nSuggestions\nRecents\nHome Role UI\nOnboarding\nChangelog UI\ngesture helpers\nanimation helpers\n\n==================================================\n19. MINIMAL PERSISTENCE\n==================================================\n\nMantieni solamente ciò che serve al core.\n\nNecessario:\n\nP1 8\nP2 8\nDock 5\n\nEventuale identity profile-safe.\n\nRimuovi preference API morte relative a:\n\nwallpaper\nclock\nweather\nmedia\nsearch\ndrawer\nsettings visual\ngesture\nmotion\n\nNON cancellare automaticamente dati storici dal device:\nsemplicemente non leggerli più.\n\n==================================================\n20. MINIMAL CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nAppCatalog serve solo a:\n\n- risolvere slot\n- ottenere label/icon\n- launch identity\n- reagire a install/remove/update\n\nNiente ranking.\nNiente suggestions.\nNiente recents.\nNiente Search.\n\n==================================================\n21. LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nHome → app → Home:\n\nP1/P2/Dock devono essere immediatamente disponibili.\n\nNON:\n\nclear catalog\nclear snapshot\nclear slots\nrerun migration\nreload defaults\n\n==================================================\n22. HOME SNAPSHOT\n==================================================\n\nUsa un unico snapshot stabile:\n\nHomeSnapshot(\n    p1 = exactly 8,\n    p2 = exactly 8,\n    dock = exactly 5\n)\n\nMai intermediate empty snapshot.\n\n==================================================\n23. MANIFEST CLEANUP\n==================================================\n\nMantieni:\n\nMainActivity HOME/DEFAULT launcher.\n\nRimuovi se non più usati:\n\nservices\nreceivers\nproviders\npermission\nqueries\n\nECCEZIONE:\n\nmantieni solo componenti Android realmente richiesti\ndal core minimale.\n\n==================================================\n24. RESOURCE CLEANUP\n==================================================\n\nAudit zero-callsite e rimuovi:\n\nweather icon\nFav wallpaper\nSettings assets\nSearch assets\nDrawer assets\nmedia assets\nanimation-only resources\nold preview resources\n\nMantieni:\n\nlauncher icon finale\ntheme\ncolor/resources effettivamente usati\nHome resources necessari\n\n==================================================\n25. FINAL LAUNCHER ICON\n==================================================\n\nMantieni l'icona approvata:\n\nbackground bianco\nesagono nero\npiccola X bianca\n\nNo modifiche.\n\n==================================================\n26. CODE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nObiettivo finale semplice:\n\nMainActivity.kt\n\ncatalog/\n  AppCatalog.kt\n\nactions/\n  LauncherActions.kt\n\nmodel/\n  LaunchableApp.kt\n  HomeSnapshot.kt\n\nstorage/\n  LauncherPreferences.kt\n\nui/home/\n  HomeScreen.kt\n  HomePanels.kt\n  FavPanel.kt\n\nui/common/\n  AppVisuals.kt\n\nui/design/\n  MachinaDesign.kt\n\nNon creare nuovi framework.\n\n==================================================\n27. DEAD CODE\n==================================================\n\nDopo la rimozione:\n\nrimuovi:\n\nunused imports\nunused helpers\nunused models\nunused tokens\nunused callbacks\nunused state\nunused resources\n\nNO cosmetic mega-refactor.\n\n==================================================\n28. SIZE\n==================================================\n\nQuesta semplificazione deve anche ridurre:\n\nKotlin LOC\nDEX\nresources\nAPK logical content\n\nNON inseguire dimensione a costo di stabilità.\n\n==================================================\n29. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n30. APK AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSul nuovo APK misura:\n\nphysical size\nlogical ZIP content\nDEX\nresources\nimages\npadding\n\nVerifica che il packaging padding anomalo non venga\nconfuso con il peso reale del runtime.\n\n==================================================\n31. VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\nunzip -t <APK>\n\napksigner verify --verbose --print-certs <APK>\n\nEntrambi PASS.\n\n==================================================\n32. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nSe Build + validation = SUCCESS:\n\ncrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-static-core-<timestamp>\n\ne:\n\nMachinaHome-static-core-<timestamp>.tar.gz\n\nNON cancellare backup precedenti.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nHome:\nYES\n\nFav:\nYES\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nFav content:\nTITLE + COUNT ONLY\n\nWeather:\n0\n\nDate:\n0\n\nClock:\n0\n\nCustom wallpaper:\n0\n\nFav wallpaper:\n0\n\nWallpaper picker:\n0\n\nWallpaper source:\nANDROID SYSTEM ONLY\n\nSearch:\n0\n\nDrawer:\n0\n\nSettings:\n0\n\nMedia:\n0\n\nSuggestions:\n0\n\nRecents:\n0\n\nAnimations:\n0\n\nGesture handlers:\n0\n\nCustom haptic:\n0\n\nGlobal pointerInput:\n0\n\nFirst tap:\n1\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME PURE STATIC CORE COMPLETE\n\nVisible runtime:\nHome / Fav / P1 / P2 / Dock\n\nP1 manual slots: <numero>\nP2 manual slots: <numero>\nDock slots: <numero>\n\nFav content: <TITLE_COUNT_ONLY/FAILED>\n\nWeather runtime paths: <numero>\nDate runtime paths: <numero>\nClock runtime paths: <numero>\n\nHome custom-wallpaper paths: <numero>\nFav wallpaper paths: <numero>\nWallpaper picker paths: <numero>\nSystem wallpaper only: <YES/NO>\n\nSearch paths: <numero>\nDrawer paths: <numero>\nSettings paths: <numero>\nMedia paths: <numero>\nSuggested paths: <numero>\nRecents paths: <numero>\n\nAnimation paths: <numero>\nGesture handlers: <numero>\nGlobal pointerInput: <numero>\nCustom haptic paths: <numero>\n\nKotlin LOC before: <numero>\nKotlin LOC after: <numero>\nResources removed: <numero>\nFiles removed: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch blockers: <numero>\nHome snapshot clear paths: <numero>\n\nAPK logical content: <MiB>\nAPK physical size: <MiB>\nAPK padding: <MiB>\n\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nZIP validation: <PASS/FAIL>\nSignature validation: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nCheckpoint: <path>\nArchive: <path>\nArchive SHA-256: <hash>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:203:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787149178,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — FINAL HAPTIC CLOCK_TICK\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nAggiungere un feedback tattile leggero e adattivo all'hardware\nsu ogni tap app accettato.\n\nUsare:\n\nView.performHapticFeedback(\n    HapticFeedbackConstants.CLOCK_TICK\n)\n\n==================================================\n1. SINGLE HELPER\n==================================================\n\nCrea un solo helper minimale:\n\nMachinaHaptic.perform(view)\n\nImplementazione:\n\nview.performHapticFeedback(\n    HapticFeedbackConstants.CLOCK_TICK\n)\n\nNessuna preference.\nNessuna Settings.\nNessun controller complesso.\n\n==================================================\n2. CALL SITES\n==================================================\n\nUsa lo stesso helper per:\n\nP1 tap\nP2 tap\nDock tap\n\nPreferenza:\n\nun unico call-site condiviso nella AppCell,\nse P1/P2/Dock usano lo stesso componente.\n\n==================================================\n3. ORDER\n==================================================\n\nTap accettato:\n\n1. perform CLOCK_TICK\n2. launch app\n\nNessun delay.\n\n==================================================\n4. EMPTY SLOT\n==================================================\n\nSlot vuoto:\n\nNO haptic\nNO launch\n\n==================================================\n5. NO OTHER HAPTICS\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi eventuali haptic residui da:\n\ngesture\nmovement\nFav\nlifecycle\nresume\nrender\ncatalog refresh\n\nTarget:\n\nhaptic solo su app tap reale.\n\n==================================================\n6. NO VIBRATE API\n==================================================\n\nNON usare:\n\nVibrator\nVibratorManager\nVibrationEffect\ncreateOneShot\nwaveform\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\nandroid.permission.VIBRATE\n\n==================================================\n7. INPUT SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nIl feedback non deve:\n\n- consumare pointer\n- introdurre pointerInput\n- bloccare primo tap\n- aggiungere debounce\n- aggiungere coroutine\n- aggiungere animation\n\n==================================================\n8. FIRST TAP\n==================================================\n\nP1:\n1 tap → 1 CLOCK_TICK → 1 launch\n\nP2:\n1 tap → 1 CLOCK_TICK → 1 launch\n\nDock:\n1 tap → 1 CLOCK_TICK → 1 launch\n\n==================================================\n9. STATIC AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nperformHapticFeedback\nLocalHapticFeedback\nVibrator\nVibrationEffect\n\nTarget finale:\n\nMachinaHaptic implementations:\n1\n\nCLOCK_TICK:\n1 shared implementation\n\nVibrator paths:\n0\n\nVibrationEffect paths:\n0\n\n==================================================\n10. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nHaptic type:\nCLOCK_TICK\n\nHardware-adaptive:\nYES\n\nShared helper:\n1\n\nP1:\nYES\n\nP2:\nYES\n\nDock:\nYES\n\nEmpty slot haptic:\nNO\n\nPointer MOVE haptic:\n0\n\nVIBRATE permission:\nNO\n\nFirst tap regression:\nNONE\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME CLOCK_TICK HAPTIC COMPLETE\n\nHaptic implementation: <CLOCK_TICK/FAILED>\nShared helper implementations: <numero>\nShared app-cell call-sites: <numero>\n\nP1 feedback: <YES/NO>\nP2 feedback: <YES/NO>\nDock feedback: <YES/NO>\nEmpty-slot feedback: <YES/NO>\n\nVibrator paths: <numero>\nVibrationEffect paths: <numero>\nPointer MOVE haptic paths: <numero>\nLifecycle haptic paths: <numero>\nVIBRATE permission: <YES/NO>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:204:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787149333,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — DEEP SIZE / R8 OPTIMIZATION\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nTARGET RUNTIME:\nHome / Fav / P1 / P2 / Dock\n\nP1 = 8 manual\nP2 = 8 manual\nDock = 5\n\nNESSUNA FEATURE NUOVA.\n\n==================================================\n1. R8 FULL MODE\n==================================================\n\nVerifica che R8 Full Mode sia realmente attivo.\n\nNon devono esistere property che lo disabilitano.\n\nAudit:\n\ngradle.properties\nbuild.gradle*\nproguard-rules.pro\n\n==================================================\n2. MINIFY + SHRINK\n==================================================\n\nRelease:\n\nminifyEnabled = true\nshrinkResources = true\n\nUsa:\n\nproguard-android-optimize.txt\n\nnon una configurazione non-optimized.\n\n==================================================\n3. R8 CONFIGURATION ANALYZER\n==================================================\n\nSe tooling disponibile:\n\nanalizza optimization score\nobfuscation score\nshrinking score\n\nIdentifica le regole che impediscono a R8 di:\n\n- remove\n- inline\n- merge\n- rename\n\n==================================================\n4. KEEP RULE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca tutte:\n\n-keep\n-keepclassmembers\n-keepnames\n-dontwarn\n-dontoptimize\n-dontobfuscate\n-dontshrink\n\nPer ciascuna:\n\nREQUIRED\nTOO_BROAD\nDEAD\n\nTarget:\nkeep rules minime.\n\n==================================================\n5. REMOVE BROAD KEEP RULES\n==================================================\n\nVietato mantenere pattern tipo:\n\n-keep class it.gaetano.machinahome.** { *; }\n\nse non realmente necessari.\n\nPreferire keep specifiche solo ai componenti raggiunti\nda Android/reflection.\n\n==================================================\n6. CHECK REFLECTION\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nClass.forName\nreflection\nkotlin.reflect\nServiceLoader\nresource-name lookup\ngetIdentifier\n\nRiduci reflection se non necessaria.\n\nR8 può ottimizzare meglio codice con riferimenti statici.\n\n==================================================\n7. REMOVE KOTLIN REFLECT\n==================================================\n\nVerifica che:\n\nkotlin-reflect\n\nNON sia tra le dependency runtime.\n\nSe zero call-site:\nREMOVE.\n\n==================================================\n8. RESOURCE SHRINKING OPTIMIZED\n==================================================\n\nVerifica AGP version.\n\nSe applicabile alla versione AGP installata,\nusa optimized resource shrinking support corrente.\n\nNon attivare flag legacy incompatibili.\n\n==================================================\n9. RESOURCE CONFIGURATIONS\n==================================================\n\nControlla resource alternative realmente necessarie.\n\nSe Machina usa solo una lingua bundled e non richiede\nresource alternative proprie multiple:\n\nvaluta resConfigs/resourceConfigurations appropriate.\n\nNON rimuovere resource Android/framework.\n\n==================================================\n10. VECTOR OVER BITMAP\n==================================================\n\nPer artwork geometrico semplice:\n\npreferire vector XML.\n\nIn particolare:\n\nlauncher foreground hexagon/X\nsimple shapes\n\nNON convertire il wallpaper:\nil wallpaper ora è quello di sistema.\n\n==================================================\n11. REMOVE IMAGE ASSETS\n==================================================\n\nDopo la rimozione Fav wallpaper/weather/etc:\n\nImages runtime target:\n\nidealmente solo launcher-related bitmap/vector assets.\n\nRimuovi ogni image zero-callsite.\n\n==================================================\n12. COMPOSE DEPENDENCY AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerifica le 5 production dependencies.\n\nIdentifica quali parti Compose sono realmente usate.\n\nNON sostituire Compose solo per dimensione in questa fase.\n\nMa rimuovi:\n\nui-tooling-preview\n\ndal runtime/release se realmente inutile.\n\nSe serve soltanto IDE preview:\nusa dependency scope appropriato.\n\n==================================================\n13. MATERIAL AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerifica se Machina usa realmente componenti Material/Material3 pesanti.\n\nSe Material viene usato soltanto per:\n\nSurface\nText\n\nNON fare subito una riscrittura.\n\nPrima misura il contributo DEX reale.\n\nClassifica:\n\nKEEP\nOPTIONAL_REWRITE\n\n==================================================\n14. STATIC FINAL MODELS\n==================================================\n\nEvita modelli intermedi duplicati.\n\nIdealmente:\n\nLaunchableApp\nHomeSnapshot\n\ne pochissimo altro.\n\n==================================================\n15. SEALED/INTERFACE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi interface/sealed hierarchy con una sola implementazione\nse non danno valore reale.\n\nQuesto aiuta sia leggibilità sia R8.\n\n==================================================\n16. INLINE SMALL WRAPPERS\n==================================================\n\nInline manualmente solo wrapper che:\n\n- hanno un solo call-site\n- non hanno ownership\n- non migliorano testabilità\n\nLascia poi R8 fare il resto.\n\n==================================================\n17. CONST VALUES\n==================================================\n\nValori realmente compile-time:\n\nusa const val dove appropriato.\n\nQuesto permette dead-code elimination più efficace.\n\nNON trasformare user state in compile-time flags.\n\n==================================================\n18. REMOVE RUNTIME FEATURE FLAGS\n==================================================\n\nSe una feature è stata definitivamente eliminata:\n\nnon lasciare:\n\nif (FEATURE_ENABLED) ...\n\nRimuovi direttamente il branch.\n\nR8 non deve portarsi dietro architettura morta.\n\n==================================================\n19. COMPOSE EFFECT COUNT\n==================================================\n\nCurrent:\n2 effects.\n\nAudit entrambi.\n\nSe uno serve solo a feature rimossa:\nREMOVE.\n\nNon inseguire count 0 se lifecycle/catalog richiedono effect reale.\n\n==================================================\n20. CALLBACK COUNT\n==================================================\n\nCurrent:\n14 callbacks/listeners.\n\nClassifica:\n\nANDROID_REQUIRED\nAPP_REQUIRED\nREDUNDANT\n\nRiduci soltanto REDUNDANT.\n\n==================================================\n21. GENERATED CODE\n==================================================\n\nAnalizza DEX per package/class count.\n\nTrova eventuale generated code introdotto da dependency/plugin.\n\nSe grande e inutile:\nidentifica dependency producer.\n\n==================================================\n22. DEX PACKAGE BREAKDOWN\n==================================================\n\nProduci size estimate per:\n\nit.gaetano.machinahome\nandroidx.compose\nandroidx.lifecycle/activity\nkotlin\nmaterial\nother\n\nQuesto decide dove vale la pena intervenire.\n\n==================================================\n23. RESOURCE TABLE\n==================================================\n\nMisura:\n\nresources.arsc\nresource entry counts\nqualifier variants\n\nEvita di ottimizzare source Kotlin se il peso è altrove.\n\n==================================================\n24. STARTUP PROFILE\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere Baseline/Startup Profile per ridurre APK.\n\nServono principalmente alle performance startup/runtime,\nnon sono lo strumento principale di size reduction.\n\nValutali solo dopo il freeze se vuoi velocizzare startup."}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:205:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787150089,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — PROMOTE VALIDATED R8 RELEASE CONFIG\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nVALIDATED REFERENCE ARTIFACT:\n\napp-release-unsigned.apk\nsize:\n1458780 bytes\n\nDEX:\n1261836 bytes\n\nOBJECTIVE:\n\nRendere permanente ESATTAMENTE la configurazione release R8\ngià validata nell'esperimento temporaneo.\n\nNON modificare Kotlin.\nNON modificare UI.\nNON rimuovere altre feature.\nNON cambiare persistence.\nNON cambiare Manifest semantics.\n\n==================================================\n1. RESTORE THE VALIDATED RELEASE CONFIG\n==================================================\n\nRipristina come configurazione permanente la stessa configurazione usata\nnell'esperimento release che ha prodotto:\n\nAPK:\n1458780 bytes\n\nclasses.dex:\n1261836 bytes\n\n==================================================\n2. RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nRelease:\n\nminifyEnabled = true\nshrinkResources = true\n\nUsa optimized R8 config.\n\nR8 Full Mode:\nON\n\n==================================================\n3. DEBUG\n==================================================\n\nMantieni Debug utile per sviluppo.\n\nNON serve inseguire la dimensione release nel debug.\n\nDebug può restare separato.\n\n==================================================\n4. KEEP RULES\n==================================================\n\nMantieni SOLO le keep rules realmente necessarie.\n\nBroad app keep rules:\n0\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\n-keep class it.gaetano.machinahome.** { *; }\n\n==================================================\n5. UI TOOLING PREVIEW\n==================================================\n\nVerifica androidx.compose.ui:ui-tooling-preview.\n\nSe serve solo a Preview IDE:\n\nspostala nello scope appropriato oppure rimuovila dal runtime release,\nma SOLO se build e preview development restano corrette.\n\nExpected saving:\npiccolo.\n\nNON è blocker.\n\n==================================================\n6. RELEASE BUILD\n==================================================\n\nGenera nuovamente release unsigned/minified.\n\nTarget:\n\nAPK logical size circa quello dell'esperimento validato.\n\nNon richiedere byte-identical output se build metadata cambia.\n\n==================================================\n7. R8 OUTPUTS\n==================================================\n\nPreserva privatamente:\n\nmapping.txt\n\nSe disponibili:\n\nusage.txt\nseeds/configuration diagnostics\n\nNON inserirli nell'APK.\n\n==================================================\n8. PRIVACY\n==================================================\n\nRelease:\n\ndebuggable = false\nminified = true\nobfuscated = true\n\nMapping:\nPRIVATE\n\nSigning private keys:\nNON copiare nel repository/checkpoint.\n\n==================================================\n9. VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nunzip -t\n\nR8 completed without critical missing-class warnings\n\nAPK content\n\nManifest/package/version\n\n==================================================\n10. SIZE VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nReport:\n\nAPK physical\nDEX\nresources\nnative libs\nimages\npadding\n\nCompare against validated reference:\n\n1458780 bytes\n1261836 bytes DEX\n\n==================================================\n11. NO MANUAL CODE COMPRESSION\n==================================================\n\nNON fare ulteriori:\n\nfile merges\ninline manuali\nclass collapsing\nreflection tricks\nencrypted DEX\ncustom obfuscator\n\nLascia che R8 faccia optimization/inlining/merging.\n\n==================================================\n12. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nSe SUCCESS:\n\ncrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-r8-frozen-<timestamp>\n\nInclude:\n\nproject\nrelease unsigned APK\ndebug APK\nmapping.txt\naudit docs\nSHA256SUMS.txt\n\nNON includere keystore/private keys.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME VALIDATED R8 RELEASE COMPLETE\n\nRelease minify: <ON/OFF>\nRelease shrinkResources: <ON/OFF>\nR8 Full Mode: <ON/OFF>\nObfuscation: <ON/OFF>\nRelease debuggable: <YES/NO>\n\nRelease APK: <path>\nRelease APK size: <bytes / MiB>\nRelease DEX: <bytes / MiB>\nResources: <bytes / MiB>\nNative libs: <bytes / MiB>\nImages: <bytes / MiB>\nPadding: <bytes / MiB>\n\nValidated-reference APK size:\n1458780 bytes\n\nValidated-reference DEX:\n1261836 bytes\n\nSize delta vs reference:\n<bytes>\n\nBroad keep rules:\n<numero>\n\nMapping generated:\n<YES/NO>\nMapping packaged:\n<YES/NO>\n\nKotlin modified:\nNO\nRuntime modified:\nNO\n\nBuild:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nCheckpoint:\n<path>\n\nADB used:\nNO\nAPK installed:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:206:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787150786,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — SOFT ELASTIC VERTICAL SWIPE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nReintrodurre SOLO lo swipe verticale Home con una\nanimazione morbida/elastica.\n\nNO flash.\n\nNO gesture orizzontali.\n\nNO cambi di alpha.\n\nNO animazioni multiple.\n\n==================================================\n1. FINAL GESTURE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nSWIPE UP:\nespande Upper/Home state previsto\n\nSWIPE DOWN:\nse serve, torna allo stato precedente\n\nSWIPE LEFT:\nNO-OP\n\nSWIPE RIGHT:\nNO-OP\n\nUn solo gesture owner.\n\n==================================================\n2. NO HORIZONTAL REACTION\n==================================================\n\nMovimento prevalentemente orizzontale:\n\nIGNORE COMPLETAMENTE.\n\nNon modificare:\n\n- state\n- offset\n- alpha\n- scale\n- visibility\n- snapshot\n- layout\n- route\n\nTarget:\n\nhorizontal visual changes = 0\n\n==================================================\n3. DIRECTION CONFIRMATION FIRST\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL.\n\nDurante DOWN/MOVE iniziale:\n\nNON modificare UI.\n\nPrima determina:\n\nabs(dy) > abs(dx)\n+\ntouch slop superato\n\nSolo dopo:\nla gesture diventa vertical.\n\nQuesto elimina il flash laterale.\n\n==================================================\n4. SOFT ELASTIC MOTION\n==================================================\n\nPer la transizione verticale usa UNA sola animazione spring.\n\nTarget feeling:\n\n- morbida\n- lenta quanto basta\n- nessun bounce evidente\n- piccolo assestamento finale\n- niente effetto gommoso aggressivo\n\nUsa spring con damping alto.\n\nIndicativamente:\n\ndampingRatio ≈ 0.82–0.90\nstiffness ≈ 260–340\n\nPunto iniziale consigliato:\n\ndampingRatio = 0.86\nstiffness = 300\n\nNON usare tween per questa transizione.\n\n==================================================\n5. ONE PROPERTY ONLY\n==================================================\n\nAnima UNA sola proprietà geometrica.\n\nPreferenza:\n\nUpper height\noppure\nUpper top\n\nNON contemporaneamente:\n\nheight\ntranslationY\nscale\nalpha\n\nUna proprietà = comportamento prevedibile.\n\n==================================================\n6. BOTTOM ANCHOR\n==================================================\n\nMantieni:\n\nUpper bottom:\nFIXED\n\nDock:\nFIXED\n\nDurante espansione:\n\nsolo il top dell'Upper sale/scende.\n\nFav/P1/P2 seguono il layout interno.\n\n==================================================\n7. NO DRAG-FOLLOW\n==================================================\n\nNON far seguire il container direttamente al dito.\n\nSchema:\n\ngesture recognized\n→ state toggle\n→ spring animation\n\nNON:\n\ndrag progress\n→ translate UI frame-by-frame\n\nQuesto mantiene il codice semplice e impedisce flash/cancel artifacts.\n\n==================================================\n8. SINGLE TOGGLE\n==================================================\n\nUno swipe completato:\n\nONE toggle.\n\nNessun doppio cambio nello stesso pointer stream.\n\n==================================================\n9. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nQuando lo swipe viene realmente accettato:\n\nun solo:\n\nCLOCK_TICK\n\nall'inizio del cambio state.\n\nNON durante MOVE.\n\nNON durante animazione.\n\n==================================================\n10. APP TAPS\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock devono restare indipendenti.\n\nTap sotto touch slop:\n\nnon è swipe.\n\nDeve raggiungere immediatamente AppCell.\n\nFirst tap:\n1.\n\n==================================================\n11. NO INPUT LOCK DURING SPRING\n==================================================\n\nNON bloccare tutta la Home durante l'animazione.\n\nEvita:\n\ninputEnabled = !animationRunning\ninteractionLocked\ngestureLocked\n\nLe app devono restare cliccabili dove sensato.\n\n==================================================\n12. INTERRUPT POLICY\n==================================================\n\nSe arriva un nuovo swipe verticale mentre la spring è ancora in corso:\n\nnon creare una seconda animation pipeline.\n\nAggiorna semplicemente il target dello stesso state/animation.\n\nCompose deve convergere al nuovo target.\n\n==================================================\n13. NO ANIMATEDVISIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nNon usare per questa feature:\n\nAnimatedVisibility\nAnimatedContent\nCrossfade\nfadeIn/fadeOut\nscaleIn/scaleOut\n\n==================================================\n14. NO GRAPHICSLAYER SIDE EFFECTS\n==================================================\n\nEvita:\n\ngraphicsLayer.translationX\ngraphicsLayer.translationY\ngraphicsLayer.alpha\ngraphicsLayer.scaleX/Y\n\nse non strettamente necessario.\n\nPreferire layout animation pura.\n\n==================================================\n15. HORIZONTAL FLASH TEST\n==================================================\n\n20 swipe LEFT:\n\nvisual changes = 0\nstate changes = 0\n\n20 swipe RIGHT:\n\nvisual changes = 0\nstate changes = 0\n\n==================================================\n16. VERTICAL MOTION TEST\n==================================================\n\n20 swipe UP/DOWN validi:\n\n- one state change per gesture\n- no flash\n- no snap\n- no visible bounce\n- soft elastic landing\n- Dock fixed\n\n==================================================\n17. TAP TEST\n==================================================\n\nDopo swipe:\n\nP1 first tap works\nP2 first tap works\nDock first tap works\n\nNo 2nd/3rd tap required.\n\n==================================================\n18. CODE SIMPLICITY\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\n1 pointerInput\n1 vertical gesture detector\n1 boolean/state\n1 spring animation\n1 haptic call\n\nNient'altro.\n\n==================================================\n19. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nVertical gesture owners:\n1\n\nHorizontal gesture owners:\n0\n\nHorizontal visual reactions:\n0\n\nAnimated properties:\n1\n\nSpring:\nYES\n\nBounce:\nSUBTLE/NONE\n\nFlash:\n0\n\nHaptic:\nCLOCK_TICK once per accepted swipe\n\nFirst-touch regression:\nNONE\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME SOFT ELASTIC SWIPE COMPLETE\n\nVertical gesture owners: <numero>\nHorizontal gesture owners: <numero>\nHorizontal visual writes: <numero>\n\nAnimated property: <value>\nSpring damping ratio: <value>\nSpring stiffness: <value>\n\nDrag-follow paths: <numero>\nAlpha animation paths: <numero>\nScale animation paths: <numero>\n\nLeft/right flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nVertical bounce: <SUBTLE/NONE/EXCESSIVE>\n\nAccepted swipe haptic: <CLOCK_TICK/FAILED>\nPointer MOVE haptic paths: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:207:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787151150,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — MATERIAL DEFAULT MOTION\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nUsare come motion DEFAULT dello swipe verticale\ni preset ufficiali Compose/Material.\n\nDEFAULT:\n\nspring(\n    dampingRatio = Spring.DampingRatioNoBouncy,\n    stiffness = Spring.StiffnessMedium\n)\n\n==================================================\n1. DEFAULT MOTION\n==================================================\n\nMaterial/Compose spring:\nDEFAULT e unica configurazione.\n\nDamping:\nSpring.DampingRatioNoBouncy\n\nStiffness:\nSpring.StiffnessMedium\n\nCustom numeric spring constants:\n0\n\n==================================================\n2. VERTICAL ONLY\n==================================================\n\nGesture custom:\n\nUP / DOWN:\nvertical drag\n\nLEFT / RIGHT:\nnessuna reazione Machina\n\nUsare primitive Compose verticali e touch-slop platform.\n\n==================================================\n3. DRAG\n==================================================\n\nDurante il drag verticale:\n\nUpper segue il gesto.\n\nUna sola proprietà geometrica controllata.\n\nDock:\nIMMOBILE.\n\nFav/P1/P2:\nnessuna animazione indipendente.\n\n==================================================\n4. RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nAl rilascio:\n\nusa posizione + velocity per scegliere:\n\nEXPANDED\noppure\nCOLLAPSED\n\nPoi usa esclusivamente:\n\nSpring.DampingRatioNoBouncy\n+\nSpring.StiffnessMedium\n\nper raggiungere il target.\n\n==================================================\n5. NO EXTRA EFFECTS\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi dalla gesture:\n\nfade\nalpha animation\nscale\ncrossfade\nAnimatedVisibility\nAnimatedContent\ntranslationX\nbounce custom\novershoot custom\ncustom easing\ncustom tween\n\n==================================================\n6. NO HORIZONTAL FLASH\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT/RIGHT:\n\nstate writes = 0\nvisual writes = 0\nanimation starts = 0\n\nNessuna mini-apparizione.\n\n==================================================\n7. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nQuando cambia realmente stato:\n\nCollapsed → Expanded\nExpanded → Collapsed\n\nesegui UNA volta:\n\nHapticFeedbackConstants.CLOCK_TICK\n\nNO feedback durante MOVE.\n\n==================================================\n8. INPUT\n==================================================\n\nTap normale:\n\nnon deve essere interpretato come drag.\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\nFIRST TAP → CLOCK_TICK → LAUNCH\n\n==================================================\n9. SINGLE MOTION SYSTEM\n==================================================\n\nAlla fine deve esistere:\n\n1 vertical gesture owner\n1 motion state\n1 animated property\n1 Material/Compose spring configuration\n\nRimuovi completamente il vecchio sistema swipe/animation.\n\n==================================================\n10. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS\n==================================================\n\nDefault motion:\nMATERIAL_COMPOSE\n\nDamping:\nNO_BOUNCY\n\nStiffness:\nMEDIUM\n\nCustom spring floats:\n0\n\nHorizontal reaction:\n0\n\nHorizontal flash:\n0\n\nDock movement:\n0\n\nIndependent Fav/P1/P2 animations:\n0\n\nAccepted-transition haptic:\nCLOCK_TICK\n\nFirst-touch regression:\nNONE\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME MATERIAL DEFAULT MOTION COMPLETE\n\nMotion preset: <MATERIAL_COMPOSE/FAILED>\nDamping: <NO_BOUNCY/OTHER>\nStiffness: <MEDIUM/OTHER>\nCustom numeric spring constants: <numero>\n\nVertical gesture owners: <numero>\nAnimated properties: <numero>\nHorizontal gesture actions: <numero>\nHorizontal visual writes: <numero>\nHorizontal flash paths: <numero>\n\nDock movement: <numero>\nIndependent child animations: <numero>\n\nCLOCK_TICK transition feedback: <YES/NO>\nMOVE haptic paths: <numero>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:208:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787151410,"text":"FASE A — MACHINA HOME TEST SIGNED RELEASE + CORE FREEZE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nProdurre una release R8 firmata SOLO PER TEST\ne congelare il core attuale.\n\nNON modificare runtime/UI.\n\n==================================================\n1. RELEASE OPTIMIZATION\n==================================================\n\nRelease:\n\nminifyEnabled = true\nshrinkResources = true\n\nUsare:\n\nproguard-android-optimize.txt\n\nR8 optimization:\nON\n\nR8 obfuscation:\nON\n\nBroad keep rules:\n0\n\n==================================================\n2. TEST SIGNING ONLY\n==================================================\n\nQuesta NON è una firma production.\n\nUsa una signing configuration di TEST locale.\n\nPreferenza:\n\n- debug keystore Android esistente\noppure\n- test keystore dedicato già disponibile\n\nNON:\n\n- generare/committare password nel repository\n- copiare private key nei docs\n- inserire keystore nel checkpoint\n- modificare la futura signing production\n\n==================================================\n3. RELEASE VARIANT\n==================================================\n\nProdurre una variant esplicitamente test-only se necessario:\n\nreleaseTest\noppure\nrelease firmata con test signing config\n\nMa deve avere:\n\nminify ON\nshrinkResources ON\ndebuggable false\n\n==================================================\n4. VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nunzip -t APK\nzipalign -c -v 4 APK\napksigner verify --verbose --print-certs APK\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n5. R8\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nmapping.txt generated\nmapping NOT inside APK\ncritical missing class warnings = 0\n\n==================================================\n6. SIZE\n==================================================\n\nConfronta con reference R8 validata:\n\nreference unsigned:\n1458780 bytes\n\nRegistra:\n\nsigned test APK bytes\nDEX bytes\nresources\npadding\n\nUna piccola crescita dovuta alla firma è normale.\n\n==================================================\n7. CORE FREEZE\n==================================================\n\nDopo SUCCESS crea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/CORE_FROZEN.md\n\nContratto:\n\nCORE UI:\nHome\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nCORE runtime non deve essere modificato da nuove feature\nsenza una patch esplicitamente classificata CORE_CHANGE.\n\n==================================================\n8. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-core-frozen-<timestamp>\n\nInclude:\n\nproject\ntest-signed release APK\ndebug APK\nmapping.txt\naudit docs\nSHA256SUMS.txt\n\nNON includere:\n\nkeystore\njks\npassword\nprivate signing key\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME CORE FROZEN TEST RELEASE COMPLETE\n\nRelease minify: <ON/OFF>\nRelease shrink resources: <ON/OFF>\nR8 optimization: <ON/OFF>\nR8 obfuscation: <ON/OFF>\nDebuggable: <YES/NO>\n\nTest signed APK: <path>\nAPK size: <bytes / MiB>\nDEX: <bytes / MiB>\nPadding: <bytes / MiB>\n\nZIP: <PASS/FAIL>\nzipalign: <PASS/FAIL>\nsignature: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nMapping generated: <YES/NO>\nMapping packaged: <YES/NO>\n\nCore freeze marker: <path>\nCheckpoint: <path>\nArchive SHA-256: <hash>\n\nRuntime modified: NO\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:209:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787151624,"text":"FASE B — MACHINA FEATURE EXTENSION ARCHITECTURE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nPreparare UNA sola architettura per tutte le future feature\nsenza modificare il core Home.\n\nNON implementare ancora nuove feature.\n\n==================================================\n1. CORE BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\nHomeScreen\nFavPanel\nHomePanels\nHomeSnapshot\nAppCatalog\nLauncherPreferences\nLauncherActions\nAppVisuals\nMachinaDesign\n\nFuture features NON devono scrivere direttamente:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\nHomeSnapshot\ncatalog internal state\n\n==================================================\n2. CENTRAL ACTION MODEL\n==================================================\n\nCreare:\n\ncore/MachinaAction.kt\n\nModello minimo.\n\nEsempio concettuale:\n\nsealed interface MachinaAction {\n    data class LaunchApp(\n        val app: LaunchableApp\n    ) : MachinaAction\n}\n\nNON aggiungere azioni speculative.\n\nSolo LaunchApp per ora.\n\n==================================================\n3. CENTRAL HANDLER\n==================================================\n\nCreare:\n\ncore/MachinaActionHandler.kt\n\nUn solo entry point:\n\nhandle(action)\n\nLaunchApp:\n→ CLOCK_TICK\n→ LauncherActions.launch(app)\n\n==================================================\n4. HOME INTEGRATION\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock non chiamano più direttamente sottosistemi diversi.\n\nTutti producono:\n\nMachinaAction.LaunchApp(app)\n\ne passano al medesimo handler.\n\n==================================================\n5. FUTURE FEATURE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nOgni futura feature vive in:\n\nfeatures/<name>/\n\nEsempio:\n\nfeatures/torch/\nfeatures/search/\nfeatures/shortcuts/\n\nOgni feature può contenere al massimo ciò che serve:\n\n<Name>Feature.kt\n<Name>State.kt\n<Name>Actions.kt\n\nNon creare file vuoti o boilerplate.\n\n==================================================\n6. FEATURE ENTRY\n==================================================\n\nUna futura funzione deve entrare nel sistema tramite:\n\nMachinaAction\n\noppure tramite una sola interface capability\nse realmente asincrona/stateful.\n\nMai tramite modifiche sparse alla Home.\n\n==================================================\n7. PATCH ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nContratto futuro:\n\nPATCH FEATURE:\npuò modificare\n\nfeatures/<feature>/*\nMachinaAction.kt\nMachinaActionHandler.kt\n\ne SOLO se necessario un singolo hook UI.\n\nSe una patch modifica:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nLauncherPreferences slot semantics\nAppCatalog ownership\nHome lifecycle\n\ndeve essere classificata:\n\nCORE_CHANGE\n\ne richiede checkpoint prima.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO FEATURE REGISTRY COMPLEX\n==================================================\n\nNON creare:\n\nplugin framework\nreflection registry\nServiceLoader\nDI framework\ndynamic DEX\nruntime plugin loading\n\nLa struttura deve rimanere statica e R8-friendly.\n\n==================================================\n9. R8 FRIENDLY\n==================================================\n\nTutte le feature devono essere referenziate staticamente.\n\nCosì, se una feature viene rimossa:\n\nR8 può eliminarla completamente.\n\nNo reflection.\n\n==================================================\n10. FEATURE FLAGS\n==================================================\n\nNON mantenere decine di:\n\nFEATURE_X_ENABLED\n\nSe una feature non serve:\nrimuovere il source/call-site.\n\n==================================================\n11. ERROR ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nUna feature futura non deve poter:\n\nclear HomeSnapshot\nclear catalog\nreset P1/P2/Dock\nbloccare input globale\n\nFailure:\nritorna localmente/no-op.\n\n==================================================\n12. ASYNC FEATURE RULE\n==================================================\n\nSe una futura feature necessita coroutine/callback:\n\nownership dentro features/<name>/\n\ncleanup locale\n\nnessun listener globale in MainActivity\nsalvo necessità Android dimostrata.\n\n==================================================\n13. FILE AUDITABILITY\n==================================================\n\nOgni feature deve poter essere revisionata guardando:\n\nfeatures/<name>/\n\n+\nla singola action aggiunta.\n\nObiettivo:\npatch facili da diffare/revertire.\n\n==================================================\n14. DOC\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_FEATURE_EXTENSION_CONTRACT.md\n\nContiene:\n\nCore Boundary\nAction Flow\nFeature Folder Contract\nAllowed Patch Surface\nCORE_CHANGE Definition\nR8 Rules\nLifecycle Rules\nError Isolation\nRemoval Procedure\n\n==================================================\n15. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui build.\n\nIl solo refactor action centralizzata NON deve cambiare\ncomportamento o visuale.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA FEATURE EXTENSION ARCHITECTURE READY\n\nCore files: <numero>\nCentral action models: <numero>\nCentral action handlers: <numero>\n\nP1 launch through handler: <YES/NO>\nP2 launch through handler: <YES/NO>\nDock launch through handler: <YES/NO>\n\nDirect feature writes to HomeSnapshot: <numero>\nReflection/plugin loaders: <numero>\nGlobal feature registries: <numero>\n\nRuntime visual regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nCore behavior regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nContract:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_FEATURE_EXTENSION_CONTRACT.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:210:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787151920,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — CREATE TEST-SIGNED RELEASE APK\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nTrovare la release R8 unsigned già prodotta e creare\nun APK RELEASE firmato esclusivamente per testing.\n\nNON modificare:\n- Kotlin\n- resources\n- Manifest\n- Gradle dependencies\n- runtime\n- R8 configuration\n\n==================================================\n1. FIND RELEASE APK\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nfind /opt/Android/Machina \\\n  -type f \\\n  \\( -name 'app-release*.apk' -o -name '*release*unsigned*.apk' \\) \\\n  -printf '%TY-%Tm-%Td %TH:%TM:%TS %s %p\\n' \\\n  | sort -r\n\nIndividua la release R8 più recente.\n\nPreferire:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk\n\nse presente e corrispondente alla build validata.\n\n==================================================\n2. VERIFY UNSIGNED APK\n==================================================\n\nRegistra:\n\npath\nsize\nSHA-256\n\nExpected size class:\ncirca 1.46 MB dalla precedente verifica.\n\nEsegui:\n\nunzip -t \"$UNSIGNED_APK\"\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n3. FIND ANDROID DEBUG KEYSTORE\n==================================================\n\nPer TESTING soltanto, cerca il debug keystore standard esistente:\n\n$HOME/.android/debug.keystore\n\nSe NON esiste:\n\nNON inventare password/keystore production.\n\nPuoi generare esclusivamente un TEST keystore locale,\nchiaramente denominato:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/private/test-signing/machina-test.jks\n\nNON dentro project.\nNON dentro checkpoint.\nNON dentro git.\n\n==================================================\n4. FIND BUILD TOOLS\n==================================================\n\nTrova l'ultima versione installata coerente della Android build-tools\ne individua:\n\nzipalign\napksigner\n\nDocumenta i path esatti.\n\n==================================================\n5. ALIGN COPY\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare l'unsigned originale.\n\nCrea directory:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/test-signed-<timestamp>/\n\nEsegui una sola passata di alignment sulla copia:\n\nzipalign -f -p 4 \\\n  \"$UNSIGNED_APK\" \\\n  \"$OUT/app-release-aligned.apk\"\n\n==================================================\n6. VERIFY ALIGNMENT\n==================================================\n\nzipalign -c -v 4 \\\n  \"$OUT/app-release-aligned.apk\"\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n7. SIGN FOR TESTING\n==================================================\n\nFirma aligned APK con TEST key.\n\nOutput finale:\n\n$OUT/MachinaHome-release-test-signed.apk\n\nUsa apksigner.\n\nNON usare jarsigner.\n\nNON modificare APK dopo la firma.\n\n==================================================\n8. VERIFY SIGNATURE\n==================================================\n\napksigner verify \\\n  --verbose \\\n  --print-certs \\\n  \"$OUT/MachinaHome-release-test-signed.apk\"\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n9. FINAL ZIP VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nunzip -t \\\n  \"$OUT/MachinaHome-release-test-signed.apk\"\n\nPASS required.\n\n==================================================\n10. FINAL SIZE\n==================================================\n\nRegistra:\n\nsigned APK path\nbytes\nMiB\nSHA-256\n\nLa firma non deve riportare l'APK a ~31 MB.\n\nSe torna enorme:\nSTOP e segnala packaging regression.\n\n==================================================\n11. COPY FRIENDLY NAME\n==================================================\n\nCrea anche una copia finale:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/MachinaHome-test-release.apk\n\nQuesta deve essere IDENTICA al signed APK.\n\nVerifica SHA-256 identico.\n\n==================================================\n12. DO NOT BACKUP PRIVATE KEY\n==================================================\n\nNON copiare nel checkpoint:\n\ndebug.keystore\nmachina-test.jks\npassword\nprivate key\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT TERMINALE\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME TEST-SIGNED RELEASE READY\n\nUnsigned source: <path>\nUnsigned size: <bytes / MiB>\nUnsigned SHA-256: <hash>\n\nSigning type: TEST ONLY\nKeystore location: <path>\nKeystore inside project: NO\nKeystore backed up: NO\n\nzipalign: <PASS/FAIL>\nSignature: <PASS/FAIL>\nZIP: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nSigned APK:\n<path>\n\nFriendly APK:\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/MachinaHome-test-release.apk\n\nSigned size: <bytes / MiB>\nSigned SHA-256: <hash>\n\nFriendly copy SHA-256 identical: <YES/NO>\n\nKotlin modified: NO\nResources modified: NO\nRuntime modified: NO\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:211:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787152323,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — CORE SOFT WOBBLE GESTURES\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nQuesta è una CORE_CHANGE.\n\nPrima crea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\nMachinaHome-before-wobble-core-<timestamp>\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- P1/P2/Dock persistence\n- AppCatalog\n- LauncherActions\n- icon rendering\n- Fav content\n- colors\n- geometry idle\n- R8/release config\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nAggiungere un comportamento gesture/wobble leggero e coerente al core:\n\nSWIPE LEFT\nSWIPE RIGHT\nSWIPE UP\n\ncon:\n\n- movimento corto\n- resistenza\n- piccolo overshoot\n- ritorno elastico morbido\n- nessun flash\n- nessun fade\n- nessuna scale\n- nessuna route temporanea\n\n==================================================\n1. MOTION PRINCIPLE\n==================================================\n\nNon usare:\n\ngesture → boolean → animation improvvisa\n\nUsare:\n\ngesture\n→ directional displacement\n→ resistant movement\n→ release\n→ soft wobble settle\n\n==================================================\n2. ONE MOTION ENGINE\n==================================================\n\nCreare UN SOLO sistema motion per Home.\n\nNon implementare:\n\nhorizontal motion engine\n+\nvertical motion engine\n\nseparati.\n\nUsa un unico controller con:\n\nAxis.HORIZONTAL\nAxis.VERTICAL\n\ne una sola logica di resistance + settle.\n\n==================================================\n3. AXIS LOCK\n==================================================\n\nAspetta touchSlop.\n\nPoi:\n\nif abs(dx) > abs(dy) * 1.15\n→ HORIZONTAL\n\nif abs(dy) > abs(dx) * 1.15\n→ VERTICAL\n\nAltrimenti:\nnon muovere UI.\n\nUna volta scelto l'asse:\nlock fino a UP/CANCEL.\n\n==================================================\n4. HORIZONTAL SWIPE\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT/RIGHT:\n\nNON naviga.\n\nNON cambia schermata.\n\nProduce soltanto un piccolo wobble della Home.\n\nTarget visual:\n\nmax travel normale:\n10–14dp\n\nNon trascinare tutto per 100dp.\n\nIl movimento deve sembrare una superficie pesante che cede leggermente.\n\n==================================================\n5. HORIZONTAL RESISTANCE\n==================================================\n\nDurante drag orizzontale:\n\neffectiveX = resistant(rawX)\n\nTarget iniziale:\n\ncirca 20–25% del movimento del dito.\n\nEsempio:\n\n100dp finger movement\n→ circa 20–25dp max raw response\n\npoi clamp visivo a ~12dp.\n\n==================================================\n6. HORIZONTAL RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nAl rilascio:\n\ntarget finale sempre:\n0dp\n\nMa con piccolo overshoot opposto.\n\nEsempio:\n\nswipe right:\n+12dp\n→ -2dp circa\n→ 0dp\n\nswipe left:\n-12dp\n→ +2dp circa\n→ 0dp\n\nQuesto produce il wobble.\n\n==================================================\n7. VERTICAL SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nSwipe UP:\n\nmantiene il comportamento core previsto,\nma usa LO STESSO linguaggio motion.\n\nDurante drag:\n\nUpper segue leggermente il dito.\n\nNon 1:1.\n\nUsa resistance.\n\n==================================================\n8. VERTICAL WOBBLE\n==================================================\n\nQuando raggiunge il target Expanded:\n\nconsenti un overshoot visuale minimo:\n\ncirca 3–5dp\n\npoi ritorno al target.\n\nEsempio:\n\nexpandedTop\n→ expandedTop - 4dp\n→ expandedTop\n\nCollapsing:\nstesso comportamento speculare.\n\n==================================================\n9. MATERIAL-LIKE SOFT SPRING\n==================================================\n\nNon usare una spring troppo rigida.\n\nUsa una spring leggermente elastica.\n\nBaseline consigliata:\n\nspring(\n    dampingRatio = Spring.DampingRatioLowBouncy,\n    stiffness = Spring.StiffnessMedium\n)\n\nSe risulta troppo elastica:\nusa DampingRatioNoBouncy.\n\nNON hardcodare custom float finché i preset Compose\nnon sono stati provati sul Pixel.\n\n==================================================\n10. WOBBLE LIMIT\n==================================================\n\nIl wobble deve essere VISIBILE ma leggero.\n\nTarget:\n\nhorizontal overshoot:\n2–3dp\n\nvertical overshoot:\n3–5dp\n\nNiente effetto gomma.\n\n==================================================\n11. NO ALPHA\n==================================================\n\nDurante gesture:\n\nalpha changes = 0\n\nNessun flash.\n\n==================================================\n12. NO SCALE\n==================================================\n\nscaleX/Y changes = 0\n\n==================================================\n13. NO CHILD ANIMATIONS\n==================================================\n\nP1:\nnessuna animazione propria\n\nP2:\nnessuna animazione propria\n\nDock:\nnessuna animazione propria\n\nFav:\nnessuna animazione propria\n\nTutto segue il container/root motion.\n\n==================================================\n14. DOCK BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nPer swipe orizzontale:\n\nDock può muoversi insieme al gruppo Home\nsolo se il root wobble è globale.\n\nPer swipe UP:\n\nDock resta fermo.\n\nQuindi:\n\nHORIZONTAL wobble:\nwhole Home group\n\nVERTICAL expansion:\nUpper only\n\n==================================================\n15. NO STATE CORRUPTION\n==================================================\n\nGesture visual state NON deve modificare:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nP1/P2/Dock\ncatalog\npersistence\nicon cache\n\nMotion state:\nsolo visual/transient.\n\n==================================================\n16. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nCLOCK_TICK:\n\nLEFT completed:\n1 tick\n\nRIGHT completed:\n1 tick\n\nUP state accepted:\n1 tick\n\nNO tick durante MOVE.\n\nNO repeated tick durante wobble.\n\n==================================================\n17. FIRST TAP\n==================================================\n\nTap normale:\n\ndeve rimanere tap.\n\nSotto touchSlop:\ngesture non parte.\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nfirst tap launch.\n\n==================================================\n18. CANCEL\n==================================================\n\nACTION_CANCEL:\n\nritorna dolcemente a:\n\nhorizontal offset = 0\nvertical nearest stable target\n\nMai snap/flash.\n\n==================================================\n19. INTERRUPTION\n==================================================\n\nSe tocco durante settle:\n\ninterrompi animazione corrente.\n\nRiparti dal valore visuale attuale.\n\nNon saltare prima a 0/target.\n\n==================================================\n20. SINGLE STATE\n==================================================\n\nTarget ideale:\n\nhorizontalOffset\nverticalUpperOffset/height\nactiveAxis\n\ne un solo motion controller.\n\nNon creare 10 boolean.\n\n==================================================\n21. REMOVE OLD MOTION\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nold toggle spring\nold swipe animation\nduplicate Animatable\nold horizontal flash workaround\ntemporary alpha/visibility logic\n\nDeve restare un solo sistema motion.\n\n==================================================\n22. STATIC TARGETS\n==================================================\n\nIdle:\n\nhorizontalOffset = 0\n\nCollapsed:\nexact current geometry\n\nExpanded:\nexact current geometry\n\nMotion non deve cambiare le posizioni finali.\n\n==================================================\n23. TEST LEFT\n==================================================\n\n20 swipe left:\n\n- no crash\n- no state changes\n- max displacement controlled\n- small opposite overshoot\n- return to zero\n- one CLOCK_TICK\n\n==================================================\n24. TEST RIGHT\n==================================================\n\nStesso comportamento speculare.\n\n==================================================\n25. TEST UP\n==================================================\n\n20 swipe up:\n\n- Upper moves with resistance\n- completes target\n- 3–5dp soft overshoot\n- settles\n- Dock fixed\n- one CLOCK_TICK\n- no flash\n\n==================================================\n26. TEST TAP\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\nfirst tap:\n100% direct launch\n\nNo accidental wobble.\n\n==================================================\n27. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nMotion engines:\n1\n\nAxis lock:\nYES\n\nHorizontal navigation:\n0\n\nHorizontal state mutation:\n0\n\nHorizontal wobble:\nYES\n\nHorizontal overshoot:\n2–3dp\n\nVertical wobble:\nYES\n\nVertical overshoot:\n3–5dp\n\nAlpha animations:\n0\n\nScale animations:\n0\n\nFlash:\n0\n\nCLOCK_TICK:\nonce per accepted gesture\n\nFirst-touch regression:\nNONE\n\nBuild:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME SOFT WOBBLE CORE COMPLETE\n\nMotion engines: <numero>\nAxis lock: <YES/NO>\n\nHorizontal max displacement: <dp>\nHorizontal overshoot: <dp>\nVertical overshoot: <dp>\n\nSpring damping preset: <LOW_BOUNCY/NO_BOUNCY/OTHER>\nSpring stiffness preset: <MEDIUM/OTHER>\n\nHorizontal navigation actions: <numero>\nHorizontal persistent state writes: <numero>\n\nAlpha animation paths: <numero>\nScale animation paths: <numero>\n\nLeft flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nRight flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nUp flash: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nDock vertical movement: <numero>\n\nCLOCK_TICK left: <YES/NO>\nCLOCK_TICK right: <YES/NO>\nCLOCK_TICK up: <YES/NO>\nMOVE haptic paths: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nOld motion paths remaining: <numero>\n\nFiles modified: <numero>\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nCheckpoint before core change:\n<path>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:212:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787152832,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — MICRO SOFT WOBBLE\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRendere le gesture molto morbide senza spostare visibilmente tutta la Home.\n\nTARGET FEEL:\n\n- leggero\n- morbido\n- quasi “gommoso”\n- movimento minimo\n- nessun flash\n- nessuna traslazione ampia\n- nessuna scale evidente\n\n==================================================\n1. HORIZONTAL GESTURE\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT/RIGHT:\n\nNON spostare l'intera Home.\n\nApplicare soltanto un micro-offset al container Upper:\n\nmax displacement:\n3dp\n\nDirezione:\n\nLEFT → max -3dp\nRIGHT → max +3dp\n\nDock:\nfermo.\n\n==================================================\n2. RESISTANCE\n==================================================\n\nIl dito può muoversi molto,\nma il container reagisce pochissimo.\n\nUsare forte resistenza.\n\nTarget concettuale:\n\neffectiveDelta = rawDelta * 0.08f\n\npoi clamp:\n\n-3dp .. +3dp\n\n==================================================\n3. SOFT WOBBLE RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nAl rilascio:\n\nritorno verso 0 con spring morbida.\n\nPiccolo overshoot opposto:\n\nmax 0.5–1dp\n\npoi:\n0dp\n\nDeve essere appena percepibile.\n\n==================================================\n4. SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nSwipe UP mantiene l'espansione Upper.\n\nDurante il drag:\n\nnon far seguire tutto il dito.\n\nAggiungere solo una piccola “compressione” iniziale\nprima di completare il movimento reale.\n\nMicro pre-response:\n\n2–3dp\n\npoi, quando gesture accettata:\ncompleta Expanded con spring.\n\n==================================================\n5. MATERIAL SPRING\n==================================================\n\nUsare preset Compose:\n\nSpring.DampingRatioNoBouncy\nSpring.StiffnessMedium\n\nPer il micro-wobble orizzontale,\nse serve appena più elasticità:\n\nSpring.DampingRatioLowBouncy\nSpring.StiffnessMedium\n\nNON usare custom float inizialmente.\n\n==================================================\n6. NO ROOT TRANSLATION\n==================================================\n\nNon applicare offset alla root completa.\n\nNO:\n\nHome root translation\nDock translation\nwallpaper translation\n\nSolo Upper/container interessato.\n\n==================================================\n7. NO SCALE\n==================================================\n\nNon usare scaleX/scaleY.\n\nLa sensazione morbida deve derivare dal micro-movimento,\nnon dalla deformazione dimensionale.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO ALPHA\n==================================================\n\nAlpha:\nsempre 1f.\n\nNo fade.\n\n==================================================\n9. CHILDREN\n==================================================\n\nFav/P1/P2:\n\nseguono naturalmente Upper.\n\nNessuna animazione indipendente.\n\nDock:\nsempre immobile.\n\n==================================================\n10. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nCLOCK_TICK solo a gesture accettata.\n\nLEFT:\n1\n\nRIGHT:\n1\n\nUP:\n1\n\nMai durante MOVE.\n\n==================================================\n11. FIRST TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nTouch sotto touchSlop:\n\nnessun wobble.\n\nTap app:\nfirst tap launch.\n\n==================================================\n12. TARGET VALUES\n==================================================\n\nHorizontal movement:\nMAX 3dp\n\nHorizontal opposite overshoot:\nMAX 1dp\n\nVertical pre-response:\nMAX 3dp\n\nRoot movement:\n0\n\nDock movement:\n0\n\nAlpha changes:\n0\n\nScale changes:\n0\n\n==================================================\n13. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME MICRO SOFT WOBBLE COMPLETE\n\nHorizontal max movement: <dp>\nHorizontal overshoot: <dp>\nVertical pre-response: <dp>\n\nRoot movement: <dp>\nDock movement: <dp>\n\nAlpha animation paths: <numero>\nScale animation paths: <numero>\n\nSpring damping: <preset>\nSpring stiffness: <preset>\n\nLeft flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nRight flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nUp flash: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nCLOCK_TICK gesture feedback: <YES/NO>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:213:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787153337,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — EDGE COMPRESSION WOBBLE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nCambiare il wobble attuale.\n\nNON spostare tutta la Home.\n\nCreare invece una micro-compressione morbida SOLO sul lato\nverso cui avviene lo swipe.\n\nTARGET FEEL:\n\n- molto leggero\n- morbido\n- locale\n- quasi impercettibile\n- niente flash\n- niente slide\n- niente scale globale\n- niente alpha\n\n==================================================\n1. CORE CONCEPT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe RIGHT:\ncomprime leggermente SOLO il bordo destro.\n\nSwipe LEFT:\ncomprime leggermente SOLO il bordo sinistro.\n\nSwipe UP:\ncomprime leggermente SOLO il bordo superiore.\n\nIl lato opposto resta ancorato.\n\n==================================================\n2. NO ROOT TRANSLATION\n==================================================\n\nRoot translation X:\n0\n\nRoot translation Y:\n0\n\nDock translation:\n0\n\nWallpaper movement:\n0\n\n==================================================\n3. HORIZONTAL RIGHT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe RIGHT:\n\nleft edge:\nFIXED\n\nright edge:\nentra verso sinistra di massimo 3dp\n\nQuindi:\n\nwidth visuale temporanea:\nwidth - max 3dp\n\nAnchor:\nLEFT\n\n==================================================\n4. HORIZONTAL LEFT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT:\n\nright edge:\nFIXED\n\nleft edge:\nentra verso destra di massimo 3dp\n\nAnchor:\nRIGHT\n\n==================================================\n5. SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nSwipe UP:\n\nbottom edge:\nFIXED\n\ntop edge:\nentra verso il basso di massimo 2–3dp\n\nPoi:\nritorno morbido / completamento stato Upper previsto.\n\n==================================================\n6. STRENGTH\n==================================================\n\nCompressione massima iniziale:\n\nhorizontal:\n3dp\n\nvertical:\n2.5dp\n\nNon superare 4dp.\n\n==================================================\n7. RESISTANCE\n==================================================\n\nIl movimento del dito deve essere fortemente attenuato.\n\nTarget:\n\nraw gesture\n→ circa 5–8% di risposta visuale\n\npoi clamp alla compressione massima.\n\n==================================================\n8. SHAPE BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nNON scalare tutto il container con scaleX/scaleY.\n\nModificare solo bounds/padding/clip geometry\ndel lato interessato.\n\nIl lato opposto deve restare visivamente stabile.\n\n==================================================\n9. CHILD CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nFav/P1/P2 NON devono avere animazioni indipendenti.\n\nDevono seguire naturalmente il nuovo bound del container.\n\nNon applicare scale alle icone.\n\n==================================================\n10. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock:\nCOMPLETAMENTE FERMO.\n\nNessun wobble Dock.\n\n==================================================\n11. RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nAl rilascio:\n\nil bordo compresso ritorna alla posizione originale\ncon una spring morbida.\n\nUsare preset Compose:\n\nSpring.DampingRatioNoBouncy\nSpring.StiffnessMedium\n\nSe troppo secco:\nprovare LowBouncy + Medium.\n\n==================================================\n12. MICRO OVERSHOOT\n==================================================\n\nConsentire al massimo:\n\n0.5dp\n\ndi overshoot oltre la posizione normale.\n\nPreferenza:\nquasi zero.\n\n==================================================\n13. NO FLASH\n==================================================\n\nNessun:\n\nalpha\nvisibility toggle\ncrossfade\nroute\ntemporary screen\nbackground redraw intenzionale\n\n==================================================\n14. AXIS LOCK\n==================================================\n\nAspetta touchSlop.\n\nPoi:\n\nhorizontal dominant\n→ LEFT/RIGHT compression\n\nvertical dominant\n→ UP behavior\n\nNessuna reazione prima del direction lock.\n\n==================================================\n15. TAP SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nTouch sotto touchSlop:\n\nnessun wobble.\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nfirst tap launch.\n\n==================================================\n16. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nCLOCK_TICK una sola volta al completamento/accettazione\ndella gesture.\n\nNO haptic durante MOVE.\n\n==================================================\n17. FINAL TARGET VALUES\n==================================================\n\nRIGHT compression:\nmax 3dp on right edge only\n\nLEFT compression:\nmax 3dp on left edge only\n\nUP compression:\nmax 2.5dp on top edge only\n\nOpposite edge movement:\n0dp\n\nRoot translation:\n0dp\n\nDock movement:\n0dp\n\nAlpha changes:\n0\n\nGlobal scale:\n0\n\n==================================================\n18. REMOVE OLD WOBBLE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovi:\n\nroot translation wobble\nwhole-container horizontal offset\nold 10–14dp movement\nglobal scale\nduplicate spring paths\n\nDeve esistere UN SOLO edge-compression system.\n\n==================================================\n19. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME EDGE COMPRESSION WOBBLE COMPLETE\n\nRight-edge compression: <dp>\nLeft-edge compression: <dp>\nTop-edge compression: <dp>\n\nOpposite-edge movement: <dp>\nRoot translation X/Y: <dp>\nDock movement: <dp>\n\nGlobal scale paths: <numero>\nAlpha animation paths: <numero>\n\nSpring damping: <preset>\nSpring stiffness: <preset>\n\nLeft flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nRight flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nUp flash: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nCLOCK_TICK accepted gesture: <YES/NO>\nMOVE haptic paths: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nOld wobble paths remaining: <numero>\n\nBuild: <SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:214:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787153967,"text":"FASE: MACHINA HOME — FROZEN CORE + PATCHABLE FEATURES ARCHITECTURE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nConsolidare Machina in:\n\n1. UN SOLO CORE minimale\n2. core congelato e hardenizzato\n3. meno file dove possibile\n4. tutte le feature non-core isolate in features/\n5. patch future facilmente verificabili e reversibili\n\nNON cambiare comportamento runtime del core.\n\n==================================================\n1. CORE DEFINITION\n==================================================\n\nIl CORE comprende soltanto:\n\n- Home snapshot\n- P1 8 manual\n- P2 8 manual\n- Dock 5\n- app catalog necessario\n- app launch\n- persistence necessaria\n- rendering Home\n- rendering icone\n- design tokens core\n\n==================================================\n2. CORE MUST NOT CONTAIN\n==================================================\n\nNON tenere nel core:\n\n- motion/wobble\n- Settings\n- Search\n- Drawer\n- Clock\n- Weather\n- Media\n- Changelog\n- Home role UI\n- optional shortcuts\n- feature-specific listeners\n- feature-specific state\n\n==================================================\n3. TARGET CORE FILES\n==================================================\n\nRidurre il core idealmente a:\n\ncore/\n  MachinaCore.kt\n  MachinaAction.kt\n\ncatalog/\n  AppCatalog.kt\n\nstorage/\n  LauncherPreferences.kt\n\nactions/\n  LauncherActions.kt\n\nui/home/\n  HomeScreen.kt\n  HomePanels.kt\n\nui/common/\n  AppVisuals.kt\n\nui/design/\n  MachinaDesign.kt\n\nNon forzare esattamente questo numero se peggiora leggibilità.\n\nTarget:\npochi file, responsabilità chiare.\n\n==================================================\n4. MERGE SAFE SMALL FILES\n==================================================\n\nValuta merge SOLO se naturale.\n\nEsempi:\n\nHomeSnapshot + core contracts\n→ MachinaCore.kt\n\nFavPanel molto piccolo\n→ HomePanels.kt\n\nSmall action wrapper\n→ MachinaAction.kt\n\nNON creare file monolitici enormi.\n\n==================================================\n5. CORE STATE OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nIl core deve avere ownership chiara:\n\nHomeSnapshot:\nsingle owner\n\nCatalog:\nsingle owner\n\nPersistence:\nLauncherPreferences\n\nLaunch:\nLauncherActions\n\nUI:\nread-only snapshot + actions\n\n==================================================\n6. FROZEN CORE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/CORE_FROZEN.md\n\nRegole:\n\nCORE CHANGE richiede:\n- checkpoint precedente\n- motivo esplicito\n- regression audit\n- build debug\n- build release R8\n\nUna normale FEATURE PATCH non deve modificare core files.\n\n==================================================\n7. FEATURE ROOT\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\nfeatures/\n\nOgni funzione non-core vive qui.\n\nFormato:\n\nfeatures/<feature-name>/\n\n==================================================\n8. FEATURE EXAMPLE\n==================================================\n\nPer motion:\n\nfeatures/motion/\n  HomeMotionFeature.kt\n\nPer Settings futura:\n\nfeatures/settings/\n  MachinaSettingsFeature.kt\n\nPer Search futura:\n\nfeatures/search/\n  MachinaSearchFeature.kt\n\nNon creare file vuoti adesso.\n\n==================================================\n9. ONE FEATURE ENTRY CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nOgni feature deve esporre un solo entry point concettuale.\n\nEsempio:\n\ninterface MachinaFeature {\n    ...\n}\n\nMA:\n\nNON creare plugin framework complesso.\n\nSe basta una funzione/object:\nusa quello.\n\n==================================================\n10. CENTRAL ACTION FLOW\n==================================================\n\nTutte le azioni passano da:\n\nMachinaAction\n→ MachinaActionHandler\n\nCore actions iniziali:\n\nLaunchApp\n\nFuture feature actions:\naggiunte solo quando la feature esiste.\n\n==================================================\n11. NO DIRECT CORE MUTATION\n==================================================\n\nFeature NON possono scrivere direttamente:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nP1\nP2\nDock\ncatalog internals\nslot persistence internals\n\n==================================================\n12. FEATURE STATE\n==================================================\n\nSe una feature ha stato:\n\nlo stato vive nella sua directory.\n\nEsempio:\n\nfeatures/motion/HomeMotionFeature.kt\nowns motion state.\n\nRimuovere feature:\nrimuove anche il relativo state.\n\n==================================================\n13. FEATURE LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nListener/callback/effect specifici:\n\nownership locale alla feature.\n\nCleanup locale.\n\nNON aggiungere listener globali in MainActivity senza necessità Android reale.\n\n==================================================\n14. PATCH SURFACE\n==================================================\n\nDefinire:\n\nFEATURE PATCH può modificare:\n\nfeatures/<name>/*\nMachinaAction.kt\nMachinaActionHandler.kt\nmassimo 1 hook UI/core dichiarato\n\nSe modifica più core files:\nclassificare CORE_CHANGE.\n\n==================================================\n15. PATCH MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nOgni feature patch deve produrre un piccolo file:\n\nPATCH_<feature>_<date>.md\n\nContiene:\n\n- files added\n- files modified\n- core files touched\n- state introduced\n- listeners/effects introduced\n- persistence introduced\n- rollback instructions\n\n==================================================\n16. ROLLBACK CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nOgni feature deve poter essere rimossa eliminando:\n\nfeatures/<name>/\n\n+\neventuale singola action/hook.\n\nCore deve tornare funzionante.\n\n==================================================\n17. R8 FRIENDLY\n==================================================\n\nFeature linkage:\n\nstatic.\n\nNO:\n\nreflection\nServiceLoader\ndynamic DEX\nruntime plugin discovery\nclass-name lookup\n\nCosì R8 può eliminare feature non referenziate.\n\n==================================================\n18. NO FEATURE REGISTRY FRAMEWORK\n==================================================\n\nNON creare:\n\nDI framework\nplugin manager\nfeature manager enorme\nregistry dinamico\nevent bus generale\n\nMachina è piccola.\n\nPreferire codice diretto.\n\n==================================================\n19. ERROR ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nFailure di feature:\n\nNO crash core\nNO snapshot clear\nNO catalog clear\nNO slot reset\n\nFeature failure:\nlocal no-op/fallback.\n\n==================================================\n20. HARDEN CORE\n==================================================\n\nVerifica nel core:\n\n- no empty snapshot on resume\n- no full catalog reload unchanged resume\n- no duplicate clickable\n- no global input lock\n- malformed persistence safe\n- uninstalled app safe\n- launch failure safe\n- no listener leak\n- no main-thread heavy scan\n- no catch(Throwable)\n\n==================================================\n21. CORE INPUT\n==================================================\n\nIl core deve funzionare anche senza features/.\n\nInput base:\n\nP1 tap\nP2 tap\nDock tap\n\nTutto il resto:\nfeature.\n\n==================================================\n22. MOTION BECOMES FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nSposta tutto il motion futuro sotto:\n\nfeatures/motion/\n\nIl core non deve contenere spring/wobble logic.\n\nHome espone soltanto un hook visual/input minimo.\n\nSe motion feature rimossa:\nHome rimane statica e funzionante.\n\n==================================================\n23. SETTINGS BECOMES FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nFuture Settings:\n\nfeatures/settings/\n\nNon deve modificare direttamente core state.\n\n==================================================\n24. SEARCH BECOMES FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nFuture Search:\n\nfeatures/search/\n\nNo Search state dentro Home core.\n\n==================================================\n25. REDUCE FILE COUNT\n==================================================\n\nMisura prima/dopo:\n\nKotlin files\nKotlin LOC\nclasses/objects\n\nRidurre file soltanto se:\n\n- ownership resta chiara\n- file non diventa monolitico\n- diffabilità migliora\n\n==================================================\n26. DOCUMENT CORE API\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_CORE_CONTRACT.md\n\nDocumenta:\n\nCore data\nCore actions\nCore state ownership\nAllowed feature hooks\nForbidden feature access\nCore change procedure\nFeature rollback procedure\n\n==================================================\n27. FEATURE PATCH TEMPLATE\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_FEATURE_PATCH_TEMPLATE.md\n\nTemplate breve:\n\nFeature:\nPurpose:\nFiles added:\nFiles modified:\nCore files touched:\nState:\nEffects:\nListeners:\nPersistence:\nR8 impact:\nRollback:\nBuild:\nRegression:\n\n==================================================\n28. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nPrima del refactor:\n\nMachinaHome-before-core-consolidation-<timestamp>\n\nDopo SUCCESS:\n\nMachinaHome-core-frozen-v1-<timestamp>\n\nNon cancellare backup precedenti.\n\n==================================================\n29. R8 RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nDopo refactor:\n\ndebug build:\nSUCCESS\n\nrelease R8:\nSUCCESS\n\nVerifica che consolidation non aumenti APK in modo significativo.\n\n==================================================\n30. FREEZE\n==================================================\n\nQuando PASS:\n\ncore status:\nFROZEN_V1\n\nFuture work default:\nFEATURE_PATCH\n\nCORE_CHANGE solo esplicito.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA FROZEN CORE ARCHITECTURE COMPLETE\n\nCore status: <FROZEN_V1/FAILED>\n\nCore Kotlin files before: <numero>\nCore Kotlin files after: <numero>\n\nKotlin LOC before: <numero>\nKotlin LOC after: <numero>\n\nCore state owners: <numero>\nDuplicate state owners: <numero>\n\nFeature directories: <numero>\nDirect feature writes to HomeSnapshot: <numero>\nDirect feature writes to slot persistence: <numero>\n\nCentral action models: <numero>\nCentral action handlers: <numero>\n\nReflection/plugin loaders: <numero>\nDynamic feature registries: <numero>\n\nCore runtime without features/: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nCore hardening regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nLifecycle regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nPre-refactor checkpoint: <path>\nFrozen core checkpoint: <path>\n\nCore contract:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_CORE_CONTRACT.md\n\nPatch template:\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/MACHINA_FEATURE_PATCH_TEMPLATE.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:215:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787154960,"text":"MASTER PLAN — MACHINA PATCHED UI LAYER\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCORE STATUS:\nFROZEN\n\nCORE MAY NOT BE MODIFIED EXCEPT FOR ONE DECLARED UI HOOK PER PATCH.\n\n==================================================\nPATCH 001 — MATERIAL STRETCH + UI DETAILS\n==================================================\n\nFEATURE ROOT:\n\nfeatures/motion/\n\nFILE:\n\nfeatures/motion/MaterialStretchMotion.kt\n\nGOAL:\n\nUsare l'effetto Android/Material stretch overscroll come\nUNICO linguaggio motion dell'app.\n\nQuesto sostituisce:\n\n- wobble custom\n- spring custom\n- alpha motion\n- scale motion\n- slide motion\n- edge compression custom\n- route transition custom\n\n==================================================\n1. MATERIAL STRETCH\n==================================================\n\nVerificare la Compose Foundation installata.\n\nPreferire API ufficiale disponibile:\n\nrememberOverscrollEffect()\nModifier.overscroll(...)\n\noppure equivalente corrente.\n\nSe serve pilotarlo manualmente:\n\nOverscrollEffect.applyToScroll(...)\nOverscrollEffect.applyToFling(...)\n\nNON creare un motion engine parallelo.\n\n==================================================\n2. ONE MOTION LANGUAGE\n==================================================\n\nUsare lo stesso Material stretch behavior per:\n\n- Home edge interaction\n- Settings scroll boundaries\n- Changelog scroll boundaries\n- future scrollable feature boundaries\n\nNo feature-specific animation style.\n\n==================================================\n3. HOME BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nLEFT / RIGHT:\n\nnessuna navigazione.\n\nSolo piccolo Material stretch sul lato coinvolto.\n\nUP:\n\nmantiene l'azione Home prevista.\n\nQuando raggiunge il limite:\nusa Material stretch.\n\n==================================================\n4. NO CUSTOM MOTION\n==================================================\n\nTarget runtime:\n\ncustom spring constants = 0\ncustom damping floats = 0\ncustom stiffness floats = 0\ncustom wobble = 0\ncustom edge compression = 0\nalpha animation = 0\nscale animation = 0\ncrossfade = 0\n\n==================================================\n5. UI DETAILS RESTORE\n==================================================\n\nRipristinare i dettagli UI approvati che devono restare\nfuori dal core logic:\n\n- bordi leggeri\n- dim wallpaper\n- shadow leggera\n- colori/surface coerenti\n- radius approvati\n\nMA:\n\nquesti valori NON vanno hardcoded dentro HomeScreen.\n\nDevono provenire dalla PATCH 003 visual tokens.\n\n==================================================\n6. PATCH ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nCore touched:\nmassimo un hook UI.\n\nRemoving this feature:\nHome remains functional/static.\n\n==================================================\nPATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/PATCH_001_MATERIAL_STRETCH_UI.md\n\n\n==================================================\nPATCH 002 — MATERIAL 3 SETTINGS + DYNAMIC COLOR\n==================================================\n\nFEATURE ROOT:\n\nfeatures/settings/\n\nFILES TARGET:\n\nMachinaSettingsFeature.kt\nMachinaSettingsScreen.kt\nIconShapeScreen.kt\nChangelogScreen.kt\nDefaultHomeScreen.kt\n\nRidurre file se naturale.\n\n==================================================\n1. SETTINGS SCOPE\n==================================================\n\nSolo:\n\n- Forma icone\n- Changelog\n- Imposta come Home\n\nNient'altro.\n\n==================================================\n2. REAL MATERIAL 3\n==================================================\n\nUsare:\n\nMaterialTheme\n\nColorScheme\nTypography\nShapes\n\nComponenti Material 3 standard.\n\nPreferire:\n\nScaffold\nTopAppBar\nListItem\nSurface/Card\nRadioButton\nIcon\nText\n\nNo custom imitation Pixel.\n\n==================================================\n3. DYNAMIC COLOR\n==================================================\n\nImplementare dynamic color tramite API ufficiali Material 3:\n\ndynamicDarkColorScheme(context)\n\ndynamicLightColorScheme(context)\n\nquando supportato dal sistema.\n\nFallback:\n\nMachina static color scheme.\n\n==================================================\n4. DYNAMIC COLOR CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nDynamic Color:\n\nON by default where supported.\n\nNo manual palette picker.\n\nNo custom wallpaper extraction.\n\nNo WallpaperManager color logic.\n\nLascia che Material/Android produca la palette dinamica.\n\n==================================================\n5. DARK/LIGHT\n==================================================\n\nSeguire:\n\nisSystemInDarkTheme()\n\nSe dynamic color disponibile:\n\ndark:\ndynamicDarkColorScheme\n\nlight:\ndynamicLightColorScheme\n\nAltrimenti:\nMachinaDarkScheme / MachinaLightScheme\n\n==================================================\n6. SMALL EXPLICIT ICONS\n==================================================\n\nRoot Settings:\n\ntre righe.\n\nOgni riga:\n\nsmall Material icon:\n18–20dp\n\ntitle\nsmall subtitle\nchevron/action where appropriate\n\nIcon Shape:\nMaterial icon appropriata\n\nChangelog:\nhistory/info icon\n\nDefault Home:\nhome icon\n\nNo emoji.\nNo oversized icon containers.\n\n==================================================\n7. ROOT UI\n==================================================\n\nMaterial 3 screen.\n\nHeader:\n\nMachina\nImpostazioni\n\nTre sole entries:\n\nForma delle icone\nChangelog\nImposta come Home\n\nNo nested dashboard cards enormi.\n\nPreferire ListItem/section structure pulita.\n\n==================================================\n8. ICON SHAPE\n==================================================\n\nOpzioni:\n\nOriginale\nRounded\nSquircle\n\nPersistenza minimale.\n\nQuesta è l'unica Settings che modifica visual runtime.\n\nNon deve:\n\nreload catalog\nclear snapshot\nreset P1/P2/Dock\n\n==================================================\n9. CHANGELOG\n==================================================\n\nRead-only.\n\nMostra:\n\nversionName\nversionCode\n\nSections brevi:\n\nCore\nMotion\nUI\nOptimization\n\nUsare solo feature realmente presenti.\n\n==================================================\n10. DEFAULT HOME\n==================================================\n\nUsare RoleManager quando disponibile.\n\nNessun prompt automatico.\n\nAzione solo manuale da Settings.\n\n==================================================\n11. SETTINGS MOTION\n==================================================\n\nNessuna custom animation.\n\nScrollable Settings:\nusa lo stesso Material stretch overscroll della PATCH 001.\n\nNo altra spring.\n\n==================================================\n12. CORE ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nSettings non scrive:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nP1\nP2\nDock\ncatalog state\nmotion state\n\n==================================================\n13. PATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/PATCH_002_MATERIAL3_SETTINGS.md\n\n\n==================================================\nPATCH 003 — VISUAL TOKENS RESTORE\n==================================================\n\nFEATURE ROOT:\n\nfeatures/visual/\n\nFILE TARGET:\n\nfeatures/visual/MachinaVisualFeature.kt\n\noppure integrare in MachinaDesign.kt SOLO se classificato come\nUI HOOK, non core state change.\n\nGOAL:\n\nCentralizzare i dettagli visuali che sono spariti durante\nle semplificazioni.\n\n==================================================\n1. RESTORE\n==================================================\n\nRipristinare:\n\n- border\n- dim wallpaper\n- soft shadow\n- Machina surface colors\n- container colors\n- text colors\n- accent colors\n- radius\n\n==================================================\n2. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH\n==================================================\n\nNessun valore visuale duplicato nei composable.\n\nCreare token tipo:\n\nMachinaVisualTokens.Border\nMachinaVisualTokens.Shadow\nMachinaVisualTokens.WallpaperDim\nMachinaVisualTokens.Container\nMachinaVisualTokens.TextPrimary\nMachinaVisualTokens.TextSecondary\n\n==================================================\n3. DYNAMIC COLOR INTERACTION\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nHome core visual può mantenere identità Machina.\n\nSettings Material 3 può usare Dynamic Color.\n\nNON necessariamente applicare Dynamic Color alla Home\nse altera troppo il design approvato.\n\nDefault recommendation:\n\nHome:\nMachina visual tokens stabili\n\nSettings:\nMaterial 3 Dynamic Color\n\n==================================================\n4. BORDER\n==================================================\n\nRipristinare bordo leggero.\n\nNo bright stroke.\n\nNo thick outline.\n\nUna sola token definition.\n\n==================================================\n5. SHADOW\n==================================================\n\nShadow:\n\nmolto leggera\nuniforme\nsenza direzione evidente\n\nNo glow.\nNo black halo pesante.\n\nUna sola implementazione.\n\n==================================================\n6. DIM WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nMachina non sceglie wallpaper.\n\nWallpaper:\nAndroid system wallpaper only.\n\nApplicare solo un overlay dim visuale sopra il wallpaper.\n\nNo WallpaperManager setter.\nNo custom bitmap decode.\n\nDim deve essere:\n\nstatic token\nnon animato\n\n==================================================\n7. COLORS\n==================================================\n\nCentralizzare tutti i colori runtime.\n\nRimuovere hardcoded Color(...) sparsi dove possibile.\n\nClassificare:\n\nCORE HOME COLORS\nMATERIAL SETTINGS COLORS\nACCENT\n\n==================================================\n8. MATERIAL SETTINGS COLORS\n==================================================\n\nSettings:\n\npreferire ColorScheme Material dinamico.\n\nNon sovrascrivere dynamic color con Machina hardcoded colors\ntranne branding minimale.\n\n==================================================\n9. HOME COLORS\n==================================================\n\nHome mantiene palette approvata.\n\nDynamic color non deve automaticamente cambiare:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\nFav\n\na meno di scelta futura esplicita.\n\n==================================================\n10. PATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/PATCH_003_VISUAL_TOKENS.md\n\n\n==================================================\nMASTER MOTION RULE\n==================================================\n\nTUTTA L'APP usa:\n\nANDROID/MATERIAL STRETCH OVERSCROLL\n\ncome unica motion language per edge/scroll interaction.\n\nNessun:\n\ncustom wobble\ncustom spring\ncustom fade\ncustom slide\ncustom scale\ncustom bounce\n\nse non richiesto da componente Material standard.\n\n==================================================\nMASTER PATCH RULE\n==================================================\n\nOgni patch deve dichiarare:\n\nFiles added\nFiles modified\nCore files touched\nState introduced\nPersistence introduced\nEffects/listeners introduced\nR8 impact\nRollback steps\n\n==================================================\nBUILD GATES\n==================================================\n\nDopo PATCH 001:\n\ndebug build\nR8 release build\n\nDopo PATCH 002:\n\ndebug build\nR8 release build\n\nDopo PATCH 003:\n\ndebug build\nR8 release build\n\nSe una patch introduce regression:\n\nSTOP.\n\nNon procedere alla successiva.\n\n==================================================\nFINAL REGRESSION\n==================================================\n\nP1:\n8\n\nP2:\n8\n\nDock:\n5\n\nFirst tap:\nworks\n\nHome snapshot:\nunchanged\n\nCatalog:\nunchanged\n\nNo crash\n\nNo flash\n\nNo multi-touch requirement\n\nMaterial stretch:\nconsistent\n\nSettings:\n3 entries only\n\nDynamic Color:\nMaterial 3 API\n\nSystem wallpaper only:\nYES\n\nDim overlay:\nYES\n\nBorder:\nYES\n\nSoft shadow:\nYES\n\n==================================================\nFINAL OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCHED UI LAYER COMPLETE\n\n=== PATCH 001 ===\nMaterial stretch API: <value>\nCustom motion engines: <numero>\nCore files touched: <numero>\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\n=== PATCH 002 ===\nSettings root entries: <numero>\nMaterial 3: <YES/NO>\nDynamic Color: <YES/NO>\ndynamicDarkColorScheme: <USED/NOT_USED>\ndynamicLightColorScheme: <USED/NOT_USED>\nExtra Settings entries: <numero>\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\n=== PATCH 003 ===\nBorder restored: <YES/NO>\nWallpaper dim restored: <YES/NO>\nSoft shadow restored: <YES/NO>\nCentral visual tokens: <YES/NO>\nHardcoded duplicate visual values: <numero>\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\n=== CORE ===\nCore status: <FROZEN/CHANGED>\nP1: <numero>\nP2: <numero>\nDock: <numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFlash regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nLifecycle regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nPatch docs:\nPATCH_001_MATERIAL_STRETCH_UI.md\nPATCH_002_MATERIAL3_SETTINGS.md\nPATCH_003_VISUAL_TOKENS.md\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:217:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787157217,"text":"PATCH 001C — MATERIAL STRETCH DIRECTLY DRIVEN BY SWIPES\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREPLACES:\nPATCH 001B\n\nLOCKED:\nCORE\nPATCH 002\nPATCH 003\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nCollegare direttamente gli SWIPE della Home\nal Material/Android OverscrollEffect.\n\nNON usare il Material Stretch come effetto passivo.\n\nSWIPE LEFT\nSWIPE RIGHT\nSWIPE UP\n\ndevono essere la sorgente reale del delta che alimenta\nl'effetto Material.\n\n==================================================\n1. SINGLE GESTURE PIPELINE\n==================================================\n\nUsare un solo gesture owner Home.\n\nPipeline:\n\npointer gesture\n→ touchSlop\n→ axis lock\n→ swipe delta\n→ OverscrollEffect.applyToScroll(...)\n→ release velocity\n→ OverscrollEffect.applyToFling(...)\n\nNessun secondo motion engine.\n\n==================================================\n2. SWIPE LEFT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT:\n\n- nessuna navigation\n- nessuna route\n- nessun Home state change\n\nIl delta X negativo alimenta direttamente\nil Material OverscrollEffect.\n\nRisultato:\nstretch sul lato LEFT.\n\n==================================================\n3. SWIPE RIGHT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe RIGHT:\n\nstessa pipeline speculare.\n\nDelta X positivo\n→ Material stretch RIGHT.\n\n==================================================\n4. SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nSwipe UP:\n\nusa la stessa gesture pipeline.\n\nSe l'Upper ha ancora uno stato expanded/collapsed:\n\nprima consuma il delta necessario al movimento reale Upper.\n\nIl delta residuo/non consumato\n→ OverscrollEffect.\n\nQuindi:\n\nfinger delta\n→ Upper consumes valid vertical movement\n→ remaining delta\n→ Material stretch\n\n==================================================\n5. RELEASE\n==================================================\n\nAl rilascio:\n\nvelocity del gesto\n→ OverscrollEffect.applyToFling(...)\n\nNessuna spring custom successiva.\n\nIl ritorno deve essere quello Material/Foundation.\n\n==================================================\n6. NO CUSTOM WOBBLE\n==================================================\n\nCustom wobble:\n0\n\nCustom spring:\n0\n\nCustom overshoot:\n0\n\nCustom scale:\n0\n\nCustom translation:\n0\n\nMaterial effect owns the deformation.\n\n==================================================\n7. AXIS LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPrima del touchSlop:\nnessun effetto.\n\nDopo:\n\nhorizontal dominant:\nLEFT/RIGHT stretch pipeline\n\nvertical dominant:\nUP pipeline\n\nUn asse per gesture.\n\n==================================================\n8. FIRST TOUCH SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nTap sotto touchSlop:\n\nNON passa all'OverscrollEffect.\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nfirst tap launch.\n\n==================================================\n9. HORIZONTAL SWIPES\n==================================================\n\nLEFT/RIGHT devono produrre:\n\nMaterial stretch:\nYES\n\nPersistent state changes:\n0\n\nNavigation:\n0\n\nFlash:\n0\n\n==================================================\n10. VERTICAL SWIPE\n==================================================\n\nUP:\n\n- comportamento Upper preservato\n- Material stretch solo sul delta residuo/al limite\n- Dock fixed\n\n==================================================\n11. ONE OVERSCROLL EFFECT\n==================================================\n\nUna sola istanza:\n\nrememberOverscrollEffect()\n\nNon creare effect separati per:\n\nleft\nright\nup\n\n==================================================\n12. FEATURE LOCATION\n==================================================\n\nTutta la logica:\n\nfeatures/motion/MaterialStretchMotion.kt\n\nHomeScreen:\nsolo singolo hook.\n\n==================================================\n13. PATCH 002 / 003 LOCK\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\nfeatures/settings/*\nfeatures/visual/*\n\n==================================================\n14. STATIC CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nGesture owner:\n1\n\nOverscrollEffect:\n1\n\nCustom animation engine:\n0\n\nCustom spring constants:\n0\n\nPersistent motion state:\n0 preferred\n\n==================================================\n15. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 Release:\nSUCCESS\n\nNO adb\nNO install\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 001C SWIPE-DRIVEN MATERIAL STRETCH COMPLETE\n\nGesture owner count: <numero>\nOverscrollEffect count: <numero>\n\nSwipe LEFT drives overscroll: <YES/NO>\nSwipe RIGHT drives overscroll: <YES/NO>\nSwipe UP drives overscroll: <YES/NO>\n\napplyToScroll used: <YES/NO>\napplyToFling used: <YES/NO>\n\nUpper consumes vertical delta first: <YES/NO>\nResidual delta to overscroll: <YES/NO>\n\nCustom wobble paths: <numero>\nCustom spring paths: <numero>\nCustom scale/translation paths: <numero>\n\nHorizontal persistent writes: <numero>\nHorizontal navigation actions: <numero>\n\nLeft flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nRight flash: <NONE/FOUND>\nUp flash: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nPATCH 002 modified: <NO/YES>\nPATCH 003 modified: <NO/YES>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:218:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787159060,"text":"PATCH 001D — HORIZONTAL MATERIAL STRETCH FIX\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREPLACES:\nPATCH 001C horizontal implementation only\n\nLOCKED:\nCORE\nPATCH 002\nPATCH 003\nVERTICAL MATERIAL STRETCH IF ALREADY WORKING\n\nPROBLEMA\n\nMaterial Stretch funziona verticalmente,\nma NON su swipe LEFT/RIGHT.\n\nROOT CAUSE TO VERIFY:\n\nhorizontal swipe currently has no proper Foundation\nhorizontal scroll source feeding OverscrollEffect.\n\n==================================================\n1. KEEP VERTICAL UNCHANGED\n==================================================\n\nSe UP stretch funziona:\n\nNON modificarlo.\n\nVertical regression target:\nNONE.\n\n==================================================\n2. HORIZONTAL SCROLL SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nImplementare una vera pipeline Foundation orizzontale.\n\nPreferire:\n\nModifier.scrollable(\n    state = ...,\n    orientation = Orientation.Horizontal,\n    overscrollEffect = sharedOverscrollEffect\n)\n\noppure:\n\nModifier.scrollableArea(...)\n\nse disponibile e appropriato nella Compose Foundation installata.\n\nNON usare raw pointerInput se l'API Foundation può fare il lavoro.\n\n==================================================\n3. HORIZONTAL STATE\n==================================================\n\nLo ScrollableState orizzontale NON deve produrre\nnavigazione o posizione persistente.\n\nOgni delta normale viene considerato non consumabile\ndalla Home statica.\n\nConcetto:\n\nscrollable state receives dx\n→ Home consumes 0 movement\n→ delta remains for OverscrollEffect\n→ Material stretch\n\nQuindi:\n\ncontent persistent offset = 0\n\nsempre.\n\n==================================================\n4. LEFT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe LEFT:\n\nOrientation.Horizontal scroll source\n→ unconsumed negative delta\n→ shared Material OverscrollEffect\n→ left-side stretch\n→ Material settle\n\nNo route.\nNo Home state.\n\n==================================================\n5. RIGHT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe RIGHT:\n\nstesso comportamento speculare.\n\n→ right-side stretch\n→ Material settle\n\n==================================================\n6. NO MANUAL MOVEMENT\n==================================================\n\nNON implementare:\n\ntranslationX\nscaleX\nwidth manipulation\npadding compression\ncustom offset\ncustom spring\n\nTarget:\nMaterial Foundation owns visual deformation.\n\n==================================================\n7. ONE EFFECT\n==================================================\n\nRiutilizzare UNA OverscrollEffect instance per il\ncontainer Home interessato.\n\nNon creare:\n\nhorizontalEffect\nleftEffect\nrightEffect\n\nse non imposto dall'API.\n\n==================================================\n8. AXIS INTERACTION\n==================================================\n\nHorizontal scrollable non deve rubare swipe UP.\n\nAssicurare axis arbitration tramite primitive Foundation.\n\nVertical drag:\ncontinua al suo handler.\n\nHorizontal drag:\nva allo scrollable orizzontale.\n\nTap:\nva ad AppCell.\n\n==================================================\n9. TOUCH SLOP\n==================================================\n\nUsare touchSlop/platform gesture detection della Foundation.\n\nNiente threshold dx/dy custom se evitabile.\n\n==================================================\n10. FIRST TAP\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\n\ntap senza drag\n→ first tap works\n\nHorizontal scrollable non deve consumare un semplice tap.\n\n==================================================\n11. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nNo haptic sul Material Stretch.\n\nCLOCK_TICK resta sulle app/actions approvate.\n\n==================================================\n12. FLING\n==================================================\n\nLasciare che scrollable/Foundation invii fling\nall'OverscrollEffect.\n\nSe serve API esplicita:\n\napplyToFling(...)\n\nma NON aggiungere una spring manuale.\n\n==================================================\n13. SETTINGS CONSISTENCY\n==================================================\n\nIl visual effect deve rimanere della stessa famiglia\nMaterial/Foundation usata dalle Settings.\n\nNo custom \"Pixel-like\" emulation.\n\n==================================================\n14. PATCH LOCATION\n==================================================\n\nModificare preferibilmente solo:\n\nfeatures/motion/MaterialStretchMotion.kt\n\nHome hook:\nsolo se strettamente richiesto.\n\nPATCH 002:\nNO changes.\n\nPATCH 003:\nNO changes.\n\n==================================================\n15. STATIC VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nHorizontal scroll source:\n1\n\nHorizontal persistent offset:\n0\n\nHorizontal navigation:\n0\n\nCustom translation:\n0\n\nCustom scale:\n0\n\nCustom spring:\n0\n\nRaw horizontal pointerInput:\n0 preferred\n\n==================================================\n16. DEVICE TARGET\n==================================================\n\nLEFT swipe:\nvisible Material stretch\n\nRIGHT swipe:\nvisible Material stretch\n\nUP swipe:\nexisting Material stretch unchanged\n\nTap:\nunchanged\n\nNo flash.\n\n==================================================\n17. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 001D HORIZONTAL MATERIAL STRETCH COMPLETE\n\nCompose Foundation version: <value>\n\nHorizontal primitive:\n<SCROLLABLE/SCROLLABLE_AREA/OTHER>\n\nHorizontal orientation:\n<HORIZONTAL/FAILED>\n\nHorizontal ScrollableState instances:\n<numero>\n\nHorizontal normal content consumption:\n<0/other>\n\nLeft delta reaches OverscrollEffect:\n<YES/NO>\n\nRight delta reaches OverscrollEffect:\n<YES/NO>\n\nLeft Material stretch:\n<YES/NO>\n\nRight Material stretch:\n<YES/NO>\n\nVertical implementation modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nVertical stretch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nRaw horizontal pointerInput:\n<numero>\n\nCustom horizontal translation:\n<numero>\n\nCustom horizontal scale:\n<numero>\n\nCustom spring:\n<numero>\n\nHorizontal navigation actions:\n<numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nFlash regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nPATCH 002 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:219:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787160241,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — SYSTEM GESTURE CORE RESET + PATCH PRESERVATION\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nCorreggere definitivamente la distinzione tra:\n\nA. SYSTEM NAVIGATION MOTION\nB. MACHINA APP MOTION\n\nSYSTEM:\n\n- edge swipe LEFT/RIGHT = Android Back\n- swipe UP from navigation area = Android Home/system navigation\n\nMACHINA:\n\n- Material Stretch = unica animazione interna\n\nNON simulare gesture di sistema dentro Machina.\n\n==================================================\n1. LOCK EXISTING GOOD PATCHES\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001:\nMaterial Stretch\nKEEP\n\nPATCH 002:\nMaterial 3 Settings\nKEEP\n\nPATCH 003:\nVisual Tokens\nKEEP\n\nNON riscriverle salvo bug confermato.\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE CUSTOM SYSTEM-GESTURE EMULATION\n==================================================\n\nCerca ed elimina dal runtime Machina qualsiasi codice che\ntenti di simulare:\n\n- swipe-left back\n- swipe-right back\n- swipe-up-to-home\n- back fade\n- home fade\n- root slide\n- root scale\n- back wobble\n- predictive-back imitation\n- home-return animation\n\nQuesti gesture appartengono al sistema.\n\n==================================================\n3. SYSTEM BACK\n==================================================\n\nMachina deve usare correttamente le API Back Android.\n\nNON:\n\n- intercettare edge swipe con pointerInput\n- applicare Material Stretch all'edge Back\n- sostituire Predictive Back con una gesture Machina\n\nQuando Android gestisce Back:\nlasciare animation ownership al sistema.\n\n==================================================\n4. ROOT HOME BACK\n==================================================\n\nQuando Machina è già sulla HOME ROOT:\n\nBack non deve:\n\n- ricreare Home\n- fare fade custom\n- svuotare snapshot\n- ricaricare catalogo\n- avviare animazione Machina\n\nNessun side effect applicativo inutile.\n\n==================================================\n5. SETTINGS BACK\n==================================================\n\nSettings detail\n→ Settings root\n\nSettings root\n→ Home\n\nUsare Back Android/Compose correttamente.\n\nNON creare:\n\ncustom horizontal swipe\ncustom fade\ncustom slide\n\n==================================================\n6. SYSTEM HOME GESTURE\n==================================================\n\nLo swipe dal basso usato dal sistema per tornare alla Home:\n\nNON deve essere implementato da Machina.\n\nMachina deve semplicemente essere una HOME Activity valida.\n\nRimuovere qualsiasi handler applicativo che tenta di riconoscere\nla gesture di sistema dalla navigation area.\n\n==================================================\n7. NO CUSTOM RETURN-HOME TRANSITION\n==================================================\n\nQuando Android porta Machina in foreground come Home:\n\nNON avviare:\n\nfade\nscale\nspring\nwobble\nAnimatedVisibility\nAnimatedContent\ncrossfade\n\nHome deve essere già pronta.\n\nSystem owns transition.\n\n==================================================\n8. LIFECYCLE\n==================================================\n\nSystem Home gesture\n→ Machina RESUMED\n\ndeve trovare:\n\nP1 ready\nP2 ready\nDock ready\nFav ready\n\nNON:\n\nempty snapshot\nloading state\ntemporary alpha\ntransition state\n\n==================================================\n9. CORE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nIl supporto alle gesture di sistema può stare nel core SOLO come:\n\nSYSTEM_NAVIGATION_CONTRACT\n\nRegole:\n\n- don't intercept\n- don't emulate\n- don't animate\n- don't reset state\n- remain lifecycle-ready\n\nNessun motion engine di sistema nel core.\n\n==================================================\n10. PATCH 001 APP MOTION\n==================================================\n\nMaterial Stretch resta l'unico motion applicativo.\n\nUsarlo SOLO per contenuti/interazioni Machina appropriate.\n\nNON applicarlo alla:\n\n- system Back edge\n- system Home gesture\n- navigation gesture area\n\n==================================================\n11. MATERIAL STRETCH CLEANUP\n==================================================\n\nDato che PATCH 001 funziona bene:\n\nfare solo audit/cleanup.\n\nTarget:\n\n- 1 Material Overscroll implementation\n- no duplicate effect\n- no old custom springs\n- no wobble legacy\n- no custom fades\n- no alpha animations\n\nNon modificarne il feeling se già approvato.\n\n==================================================\n12. APP ICON — FINAL DESIGN\n==================================================\n\nAggiornare definitivamente l'icona Machina.\n\nDesign:\n\nCANVAS:\nwhite\n\nHEXAGON:\nblack filled\ncentered\nsmaller than current\n\nX:\nsmall white X\ncentered inside black hexagon\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\naumentare chiaramente il margine bianco attorno all'esagono.\n\nNO:\n\nshadow\ngradient\ngloss\nstroke\n3D\ntexture\n\n==================================================\n13. ADAPTIVE ICON\n==================================================\n\nAggiornare:\n\nadaptive foreground\nadaptive background\nmonochrome\nlegacy icon\n\nMantenere l'esagono abbastanza piccolo da risultare corretto\ncon le mask Android.\n\n==================================================\n14. FIRST RUN FEATURE\n==================================================\n\nAggiungere come PATCH 004 isolata:\n\nfeatures/firstRun/\n\nFlow:\n\nFIRST INSTALL\n→ WHITE FULLSCREEN\n→ MACHINA LOGO\n→ ONE SOFT BOUNCE\n→ CHANGELOG\n→ SET AS DEFAULT HOME\n→ HOME\n\n==================================================\n15. FIRST RUN LOGO\n==================================================\n\nFullscreen:\n\npure white.\n\nLogo centered.\n\nBlack hexagon:\nsmall.\n\nWhite margin:\nlarge/clearly visible.\n\nWhite X:\ncentered.\n\n==================================================\n16. FIRST RUN BOUNCE\n==================================================\n\nSolo il logo del first-run può usare un bounce dedicato.\n\nUn singolo bounce morbido:\n\nsmall\n→ slight overshoot\n→ settled\n\nNO loop.\nNO shake.\nNO fade flashing.\n\nQuesto è separato da PATCH 001.\n\n==================================================\n17. FIRST RUN → CHANGELOG\n==================================================\n\nDopo il bounce:\n\npassare al Changelog Material 3.\n\nNO screenshot.\nNO image preview.\n\nRiutilizzare il Changelog della PATCH 002.\n\n==================================================\n18. CHANGELOG\n==================================================\n\nBreve e reale.\n\nMostrare:\n\nversionName\nversionCode\n\nSezioni:\n\nCORE\nMOTION\nUI\nOPTIMIZATION\n\nSolo feature realmente presenti.\n\n==================================================\n19. SET DEFAULT HOME\n==================================================\n\nSotto il Changelog:\n\nImposta Machina come Home\n\nsubtitle breve.\n\nPrimary button:\n\nImposta come Home\n\nSecondary:\n\nNon ora\n\nRiutilizzare l'action/RoleManager della PATCH 002.\n\nNON duplicare implementazione.\n\n==================================================\n20. FIRST RUN PERSISTENCE\n==================================================\n\nUna sola preference:\n\nfirst_run_completed\n\nDefault:\nfalse\n\nDopo:\n\nHome accepted\noppure\nNon ora\n\n→ true.\n\nSecond launch:\ndirect Home.\n\n==================================================\n21. MATERIAL 3 SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 resta:\n\nForma icone\nChangelog\nImposta come Home\n\nDynamic Color:\nKEEP.\n\nMaterial 3:\nKEEP.\n\nNo nuove Settings.\n\n==================================================\n22. VISUAL PATCH\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 003 resta:\n\nMachina colors\nlight border\nsoft shadow\nstatic wallpaper dim\n\nSystem wallpaper only.\n\nNON modificarla durante questo intervento.\n\n==================================================\n23. FINAL MOTION OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nSYSTEM:\n\nBack gesture\nHome gesture\nsystem transitions\n\nowner:\nANDROID\n\nAPP:\n\nMaterial Stretch\n\nowner:\nPATCH 001\n\nFIRST RUN:\n\nsingle logo bounce\n\nowner:\nPATCH 004\n\nNessun quarto motion system.\n\n==================================================\n24. STATIC SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nCerca ed elimina legacy:\n\ncustomBackSwipe\nswipeLeft\nswipeRight\nswipeHome\nhomeFade\nbackFade\nrootFade\nreturnHomeAnimation\npredictiveBackEmulation\ngestureLocked\nisAnimatingHome\n\nsolo se confermato come vecchio codice Machina.\n\n==================================================\n25. DEVICE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nSwipe Back da bordo:\n\nAndroid behavior\nNO Machina overlay/fade\n\nSwipe system Home:\n\nAndroid behavior\nMachina already ready\n\nMaterial Stretch:\n\nsolo dentro Machina\nrimane quello approvato\n\n==================================================\n26. FIRST TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nSystem gesture return\n→ immediately tap P1/P2/Dock\n\nfirst tap:\nWORKS.\n\n==================================================\n27. PATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\nCrea:\n\ndocs/PATCH_004_FIRST_RUN_EXPERIENCE.md\n\ne aggiorna:\n\ndocs/MACHINA_CORE_CONTRACT.md\n\ncon:\n\nSYSTEM NAVIGATION IS PLATFORM OWNED\n\n==================================================\n28. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 Release:\nSUCCESS\n\nNO adb\nNO install\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SYSTEM GESTURE + FIRST RUN RESET COMPLETE\n\n=== SYSTEM NAVIGATION ===\n\nCustom system-back gesture handlers: <numero>\nCustom system-home gesture handlers: <numero>\nCustom back/home fades: <numero>\nPredictive Back emulation paths: <numero>\n\nBack animation owner:\n<ANDROID/FAILED>\n\nHome gesture animation owner:\n<ANDROID/FAILED>\n\nMachina state writes during system gesture:\n<numero>\n\n=== MATERIAL MOTION ===\n\nPATCH 001 preserved:\n<YES/NO>\n\nMaterial Stretch implementations:\n<numero>\n\nLegacy custom wobble/spring paths:\n<numero>\n\nMaterial Stretch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\n=== ICON ===\n\nWhite background:\n<YES/NO>\n\nBlack hexagon:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHexagon reduced:\n<YES/NO>\n\nWhite X:\n<YES/NO>\n\nAdaptive icon:\n<YES/NO>\n\nMonochrome:\n<YES/NO>\n\n=== FIRST RUN ===\n\nFeature isolated:\n<YES/NO>\n\nWhite fullscreen:\n<YES/NO>\n\nLogo bounce:\n<ONE/FAILED>\n\nScreenshots:\n<numero>\n\nChangelog reused:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSet-as-Home reused:\n<YES/NO>\n\nNot Now:\n<YES/NO>\n\nFirst-run keys:\n<numero>\n\nSecond launch onboarding:\n<NO/YES>\n\n=== REGRESSION ===\n\nP1:\n8\n\nP2:\n8\n\nDock:\n5\n\nFirst-touch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nFlash regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nLifecycle regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nPATCH 002 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used:\nNO\n\nAPK installed:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:220:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787160769,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — REMOVE CURRENT SETTINGS / CLEAN BASELINE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRimuovere completamente l'attuale PATCH 002 Settings\nper preparare una base pulita.\n\nNON creare ancora nuove Settings.\n\nMANTENERE:\n\n- core\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- PATCH 001 Material Stretch\n- PATCH 003 Visual Tokens\n- CLOCK_TICK\n- launcher icon corrente\n- R8 / hardening / packaging\n\n==================================================\n1. REMOVE PATCH 002\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere:\n\nfeatures/settings/\n\ne tutta la UI Settings corrente.\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE SETTINGS HOST HOOK\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere da MainActivity soltanto:\n\n- feature host hook Settings\n- entry/open Settings introdotta da PATCH 002\n\nNON modificare altri startup/core path.\n\n==================================================\n3. ICON SHAPE ADAPTER\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 aveva aggiunto:\n\nsetIconShape\n\nAudit.\n\nSe non esistono altri call-site:\nREMOVE.\n\nSe iconShape è ancora usato dal core/runtime:\nmantieni la preference READ path esistente,\nma rimuovi soltanto l'adapter Settings inutilizzato.\n\n==================================================\n4. MATERIAL ICONS DEPENDENCY\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 aveva aggiunto:\n\nmaterial-icons-core\n\nSe dopo la rimozione Settings ha zero call-site:\nREMOVE dependency.\n\nSe serve altrove:\nKEEP e documentare.\n\n==================================================\n5. ROLEMANAGER\n==================================================\n\nNon rimuovere automaticamente il backend Home Role\nse servirà alla futura PATCH 004 / Settings completa.\n\nSeparare:\n\nSETTINGS UI = REMOVE\n\nSYSTEM CAPABILITY = KEEP if already clean/shared.\n\nSe l'implementazione RoleManager vive dentro PATCH 002:\nestrarre soltanto il minimo backend riusabile in:\n\nfeatures/system/HomeRoleAction.kt\n\noppure altro singolo file semplice.\n\nNO UI.\n\n==================================================\n6. CHANGELOG\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere la UI Changelog della PATCH 002.\n\nSe esiste un modello dati Changelog pulito e riusabile:\npuò restare come semplice data source.\n\nAltrimenti:\nREMOVE e sarà ricostruito dopo.\n\n==================================================\n7. DYNAMIC COLOR\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere Dynamic Color insieme alle Settings attuali\nse nessun'altra UI lo usa.\n\nNON applicarlo alla Home.\n\nLa futura Settings completa lo reintrodurrà correttamente.\n\n==================================================\n8. MATERIAL 3 DEPENDENCIES\n==================================================\n\nNON rimuovere Material 3 se altre parti dell'app\nlo usano realmente.\n\nRimuovere solo dependency zero-callsite.\n\n==================================================\n9. PATCH 001 LOCK\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\nfeatures/motion/MaterialStretchMotion.kt\n\nsalvo compilazione strettamente necessaria per dipendenze rimosse.\n\nMotion behavior:\nUNCHANGED.\n\n==================================================\n10. PATCH 003 LOCK\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\nfeatures/visual/MachinaVisualFeature.kt\n\nBorder:\nKEEP\n\nWallpaper dim:\nKEEP\n\nSoft shadow:\nKEEP\n\nMachina colors:\nKEEP\n\n==================================================\n11. CORE LOCK\n==================================================\n\nNON cambiare:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nAppCatalog\nLauncherPreferences slot semantics\nLauncherActions\nP1/P2/Dock\nlifecycle\ninput ownership\n\n==================================================\n12. BASE VISIBLE RUNTIME\n==================================================\n\nDopo cleanup:\n\nHome\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nNessuna Settings screen.\n\nNessuna Settings route.\n\n==================================================\n13. FUTURE SETTINGS CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nCreare SOLO documento:\n\ndocs/MACHINA_SETTINGS_V2_CONTRACT.md\n\nNON implementare UI.\n\nIl documento deve dire:\n\nFuture Settings = independent feature\n\nfeatures/settingsV2/\n\nPuò leggere core state tramite API dichiarate.\n\nNon può scrivere direttamente:\nHomeSnapshot\ncatalog\nP1/P2/Dock internals\n\nOgni setting deve passare attraverso:\nsmall explicit adapter/action.\n\n==================================================\n14. FUTURE SETTINGS GOAL\n==================================================\n\nAnnotare nel contract che la futura Settings completa\npotrà includere, dopo approvazione:\n\n- Home\n- P1/P2/Dock configuration\n- Icon Shape\n- Icon Pack\n- Appearance\n- Dynamic Color\n- Interaction\n- Default Home\n- Changelog\n- About\n\nMA NESSUNA DI QUESTE VA IMPLEMENTATA ORA.\n\n==================================================\n15. CLEAN DEAD CODE\n==================================================\n\nDopo removal:\n\nrimuovere solo zero-callsite confermati:\n\nSettings composables\nSettings strings\nSettings icons\nSettings routes\nSettings state\nSettings-only helpers\nunused imports\n\n==================================================\n16. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n17. REGRESSION\n==================================================\n\nVerificare:\n\nP1 = 8\nP2 = 8\nDock = 5\n\nMaterial Stretch:\nunchanged\n\nVisual Tokens:\nunchanged\n\nFirst tap:\nunchanged\n\nHome return:\nunchanged\n\n==================================================\n18. PATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreare:\n\ndocs/PATCH_002_REMOVED_SETTINGS_BASELINE.md\n\nDocumentare:\n\nremoved files\nremoved hooks\ndependencies removed\nbackend capability preserved\ncore files touched\nrollback reference\n\n==================================================\nSUCCESS CRITERIA\n==================================================\n\nSettings screens:\n0\n\nSettings routes:\n0\n\nSettings feature directory:\n0\n\nSettings direct core adapters:\n0 unused\n\nMaterial Stretch regression:\nNONE\n\nVisual regression:\nNONE\n\nCore state regression:\nNONE\n\nDebug build:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SETTINGS REMOVED — CLEAN BASE READY\n\nSettings screens remaining: <numero>\nSettings routes remaining: <numero>\nSettings feature files remaining: <numero>\n\nMainActivity Settings hooks removed: <numero>\nUnused Settings adapters removed: <numero>\nSettings-only dependencies removed: <numero>\n\nHomeRole backend preserved: <YES/NO/N-A>\nChangelog data preserved: <YES/NO/N-A>\nDynamic Color runtime remaining: <numero>\n\nPATCH 001 modified: <NO/YES>\nPATCH 003 modified: <NO/YES>\n\nP1: <numero>\nP2: <numero>\nDock: <numero>\n\nMaterial Stretch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nVisual regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nLifecycle regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nCore files modified: <numero>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nFuture Settings contract:\ndocs/MACHINA_SETTINGS_V2_CONTRACT.md\n\nRemoval doc:\ndocs/PATCH_002_REMOVED_SETTINGS_BASELINE.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:221:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787161685,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — SYSTEM GESTURE FLASH ROOT-CAUSE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPROBLEMA DEVICE\n\nSwipe dal bordo LEFT/RIGHT:\n\nper un istante appare il wallpaper / background sottostante.\n\nNON patchare il motion Material.\nNON modificare PATCH 001.\nNON modificare PATCH 003.\nNON aggiungere animazioni.\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nDeterminare se il flash viene da:\n\nA. Android Predictive Back / back-to-home preview\nB. window transparency / windowShowWallpaper\nC. MainActivity finish/back behavior\nD. Machina compositing bug\n\n==================================================\n1. AUDIT MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nRiporta:\n\ntargetSdk\nMainActivity theme\nwindowShowWallpaper\nwindowIsTranslucent\nwindowBackground\nenableOnBackInvokedCallback\n\nsia application che activity level.\n\n==================================================\n2. AUDIT THEME\n==================================================\n\nCerca nel theme:\n\nandroid:windowShowWallpaper\nandroid:windowIsTranslucent\nandroid:windowBackground\nandroid:windowDisablePreview\nwindowNoTitle\nwindowActionModeOverlay\nwindowDrawsSystemBarBackgrounds\n\nDocumenta valori effettivi.\n\n==================================================\n3. AUDIT BACK\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\nBackHandler\nPredictiveBackHandler\nNavigationEventHandler\nOnBackPressedDispatcher\nOnBackInvokedDispatcher\nonBackPressed\nfinish()\nfinishAffinity()\nmoveTaskToBack()\nfinishAndRemoveTask()\n\nPer ciascuno:\nFILE\nCALL SITE\nROOT HOME BEHAVIOR\n\n==================================================\n4. ROOT HOME CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nQuando Machina è sulla Home root:\n\nsystem Back non deve provocare un custom:\n\nfinish\nfade\nroute change\nstate clear\n\nDocumentare cosa avviene realmente.\n\n==================================================\n5. PREDICTIVE BACK\n==================================================\n\nVerificare se il flash coincide con la preview\nPredictive Back Android.\n\nNON disabilitarlo ancora.\n\nPrima identifica con certezza.\n\n==================================================\n6. WINDOW COMPOSITING\n==================================================\n\nVerificare se MainActivity usa una finestra trasparente\nper mostrare il wallpaper Android.\n\nSe sì:\n\ndeterminare se durante predictive-back il sistema\nespone direttamente il wallpaper perché:\n\nroot surface\nwindow background\ntask background\n\nsono trasparenti.\n\n==================================================\n7. IMPORTANT\n==================================================\n\nMachina deve continuare a mostrare il wallpaper di sistema.\n\nNON risolvere il flash rendendo tutta la Home opaca\nsenza valutare l'effetto sul design.\n\n==================================================\n8. TEMPORARY DIAGNOSTIC TEST\n==================================================\n\nSolo come esperimento locale e reversibile:\n\nTest A:\nPredictive Back corrente.\n\nTest B:\ndisabilitare temporaneamente SOLO MainActivity predictive-back participation,\nse la platform/config consente il test.\n\nConfrontare:\n\nLEFT flash\nRIGHT flash\n\nPoi RIPRISTINARE la configurazione originale.\n\nNON lasciare il test come fix.\n\n==================================================\n9. SECOND DIAGNOSTIC TEST\n==================================================\n\nSe necessario, testare temporaneamente un windowBackground opaco\nsenza cambiare Home UI.\n\nSe il flash sparisce:\n\nroot cause = transparent window/task compositing.\n\nRipristinare dopo il test.\n\n==================================================\n10. NO RUNTIME FIX YET\n==================================================\n\nAlla fine dell'audit:\n\nNON applicare fix permanente.\n\nVoglio prima una diagnosi precisa.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SYSTEM GESTURE FLASH AUDIT COMPLETE\n\ntargetSdk: <value>\n\nwindowShowWallpaper: <value>\nwindowIsTranslucent: <value>\nwindowBackground: <value>\n\nPredictive Back enabled: <YES/NO>\n\nBack handlers: <numero>\nRoot Home Back action: <value>\n\nMachina custom fade paths: <numero>\nMachina custom system-gesture animation paths: <numero>\n\nFlash reproduced with Predictive Back enabled:\n<YES/NO>\n\nFlash reproduced with temporary Predictive Back opt-out:\n<YES/NO/N-A>\n\nFlash reproduced with temporary opaque window background:\n<YES/NO/N-A>\n\nPrimary root cause:\n<PREDICTIVE_BACK / TRANSPARENT_WINDOW / ROOT_BACK_HANDLER / MACHINA_UI / UNKNOWN>\n\nPATCH 001 modified: NO\nPATCH 003 modified: NO\nRuntime fix applied: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:222:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787161839,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — SYSTEM BACK FLASH FIX\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nDIAGNOSIS:\n\ntargetSdk = 37\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = transparent\nwindowIsTranslucent = false\n\nCustom Back handlers = 0\nCustom Back animations = 0\nCustom fade paths = 0\n\nProbable cause:\n\nPredictive Back system preview +\ntransparent wallpaper-showing launcher window.\n\nGOAL:\n\nEliminare il flash del wallpaper su swipe LEFT/RIGHT\nSENZA rendere opaca la Home\ne SENZA modificare Material Stretch.\n\n==================================================\n1. HARD LOCK\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch\nPATCH 003 Visual Tokens\nHomeScreen\nHomeSnapshot\nP1\nP2\nDock\nFav\nAppCatalog\nLauncherPreferences\nLauncherActions\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\ncustom Back animation\nfade\nspring\nwobble\npointerInput\nBackHandler\n\n==================================================\n2. KEEP SYSTEM WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nMANTENERE:\n\nandroid:windowShowWallpaper=\"true\"\n\nMANTENERE:\n\ntransparent window/background necessario\na visualizzare il wallpaper Android.\n\nNON rendere la finestra opaca come workaround.\n\n==================================================\n3. ACTIVITY-LEVEL PREDICTIVE ANIMATION OPT-OUT\n==================================================\n\nSOLO sulla MainActivity launcher aggiungere:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nNON applicarlo a livello <application>.\n\nTarget:\n\n<activity\n    android:name=\".MainActivity\"\n    android:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n    ... />\n\n==================================================\n4. WHY\n==================================================\n\nMainActivity è la root Home launcher.\n\nNon ha una pagina precedente Machina da mostrare tramite\nPredictive Back.\n\nQuindi non serve una preview Back applicativa sulla root Home.\n\nAndroid continua a possedere la navigazione di sistema;\nstiamo disabilitando soltanto la predictive animation\nper questa Activity.\n\n==================================================\n5. NO LEGACY BACK IMPLEMENTATION\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\nonBackPressed()\nBackHandler\nOnBackPressedCallback\nOnBackInvokedCallback\nfinish()\nmoveTaskToBack()\nfinishAffinity()\n\nRoot Home continua ad avere:\n\napp-side Back action = NONE.\n\n==================================================\n6. SYSTEM HOME GESTURE\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare la gesture dal basso verso Home.\n\nQuella rimane completamente Android-owned.\n\n==================================================\n7. MATERIAL STRETCH\n==================================================\n\nMaterial Stretch è un'altra cosa.\n\nDeve rimanere invariato.\n\nNon collegarlo:\n\n- edge Back system gesture\n- system Home gesture\n\n==================================================\n8. MANIFEST-ONLY TARGET\n==================================================\n\nPatch ideale:\n\nAndroidManifest.xml only.\n\nKotlin modified:\n0\n\nCompose modified:\n0\n\nVisual tokens modified:\n0\n\n==================================================\n9. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nEsegui:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nPoi R8 release verification build.\n\n==================================================\n10. STATIC VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nConfermare:\n\nMainActivity enableOnBackInvokedCallback = false\n\nApplication-level value:\nUNSET\n\nwindowShowWallpaper:\ntrue\n\nwindowBackground:\ntransparent\n\nCustom Back handlers:\n0\n\nCustom Back animations:\n0\n\n==================================================\n11. DEVICE TEST REQUIRED\n==================================================\n\nQuesta parte NON può essere dichiarata verificata staticamente.\n\nSul Pixel testare:\n\n20 swipe LEFT dal bordo\n20 swipe RIGHT dal bordo\n\nTarget:\n\nwallpaper flash = 0\n\nPoi:\n\nlaunch app\n→ system Home gesture\n→ Machina\n\nTarget:\n\nHome transition normale Android\nP1/P2/Dock già pronti\nfirst tap funziona.\n\n==================================================\n12. IF FLASH REMAINS\n==================================================\n\nSe il flash rimane sul device:\n\nSTOP.\n\nNON aggiungere altre patch.\n\nIl passo successivo sarà un test controllato del\nwindow/task background, NON una modifica motion.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SYSTEM BACK FLASH FIX READY\n\nMainActivity predictive animations:\n<DISABLED/FAILED>\n\nApplication predictive setting:\n<UNSET/OTHER>\n\nwindowShowWallpaper:\n<TRUE/FAILED>\n\nwindowBackground:\n<TRANSPARENT/OTHER>\n\nCustom Back handlers:\n<numero>\n\nCustom Back animations:\n<numero>\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nKotlin files modified:\n<numero>\n\nManifest files modified:\n<numero>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDEVICE VALIDATION REQUIRED:\nYES"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:223:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787162210,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — TRANSPARENT WINDOW FLASH ISOLATION\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPROBLEMA\n\nSwipe system LEFT/RIGHT mostra ancora per un istante\nil wallpaper/background anche dopo:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nQuindi predictive-back opt-out NON è sufficiente.\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nVerificare con certezza se il flash nasce dalla finestra trasparente\nusata per mostrare il wallpaper di sistema.\n\nNON modificare:\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch\nPATCH 003 Visual Tokens\nHomeScreen\nHomeSnapshot\nP1/P2/Dock\ncatalog\npersistence\nmotion\n\n==================================================\n1. RESTORE PREDICTIVE SETTING\n==================================================\n\nSe il precedente test ha lasciato:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nrimuoverlo.\n\nTornare al comportamento Android standard.\n\nQuesto flag non ha risolto il bug.\n\n==================================================\n2. CURRENT WINDOW CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nConfermare baseline:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowIsTranslucent = false\nwindowBackground = transparent\n\nRoot Home:\ntransparent\n\nPATCH 003:\nstatic dim overlay\n\n==================================================\n3. TEST A — TEMPORARY OPAQUE WINDOW\n==================================================\n\nSOLO PER DIAGNOSI.\n\nCreare una variante temporanea in cui:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = false\n\nwindowBackground =\nun colore opaco molto evidente,\nper esempio il colore base Machina.\n\nNON cambiare Home layout.\n\nNON cambiare PATCH 003 permanentemente.\n\nBuild test.\n\n==================================================\n4. DEVICE TEST A\n==================================================\n\nSul Pixel:\n\n20 swipe LEFT edge\n20 swipe RIGHT edge\n\nOsservare:\n\nflash wallpaper/background presente?\nYES/NO\n\n==================================================\n5. INTERPRETATION\n==================================================\n\nSe flash SPARISCE con window opaca:\n\nROOT CAUSE =\nWINDOW/WALLPAPER COMPOSITING\n\nSe flash RESTA:\n\nROOT CAUSE non è la trasparenza semplice.\n\nSTOP e analizzare task/system transition.\n\n==================================================\n6. TEST B — TRANSPARENT WINDOW WITHOUT DIM\n==================================================\n\nSOLO se serve a distinguere PATCH 003.\n\nRipristinare:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = transparent\n\nTemporaneamente disabilitare SOLO il dim overlay\ndi PATCH 003.\n\nTest LEFT/RIGHT.\n\nSe flash cambia:\nPATCH 003 compositing contribuisce.\n\nSe identico:\nPATCH 003 non è responsabile.\n\nPoi RIPRISTINARE PATCH 003.\n\n==================================================\n7. TEST C — WINDOW BACKGROUND MATCH\n==================================================\n\nSe Test A dimostra compositing issue:\n\nprovare una terza variante diagnostica:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\n\nwindowBackground =\nsame base/dim color used visually by Machina\n\nRoot Home può restare trasparente sopra.\n\nScopo:\nevitare che durante la transition Android trovi\nun background completamente trasparente.\n\nNON dichiarare ancora fix permanente.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO CUSTOM ANIMATION\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\nfade\nspring\nwobble\nBackHandler\npointerInput\ncustom predictive back\nsystem gesture interception\n\n==================================================\n9. MATERIAL STRETCH LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001:\nNO modifications.\n\nQuesta non è una questione Material Stretch.\n\n==================================================\n10. OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA WINDOW FLASH ISOLATION COMPLETE\n\nBaseline:\nwindowShowWallpaper: <value>\nwindowBackground: <value>\n\nPredictive opt-out restored:\n<YES/NO>\n\nTEST A — OPAQUE WINDOW\nLeft flash: <YES/NO>\nRight flash: <YES/NO>\n\nTEST B — TRANSPARENT / DIM DISABLED\nExecuted: <YES/NO>\nLeft flash: <YES/NO/N-A>\nRight flash: <YES/NO/N-A>\n\nTEST C — WALLPAPER + OPAQUE WINDOW BACKGROUND\nExecuted: <YES/NO>\nLeft flash: <YES/NO/N-A>\nRight flash: <YES/NO/N-A>\n\nPrimary root cause:\n<WINDOW_COMPOSITING / PATCH003_DIM / SYSTEM_TRANSITION / UNKNOWN>\n\nPermanent runtime fix applied:\nNO\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH 003 permanently modified:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:224:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787162390,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — DEVICE TEST A / OPAQUE WINDOW\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nCreare UNA SOLA build diagnostica temporanea per capire\nse il flash LEFT/RIGHT deriva dal compositing della finestra trasparente.\n\nNON applicare fix permanente.\n\n==================================================\n1. BASELINE\n==================================================\n\nCurrent:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = @android:color/transparent\nwindowIsTranslucent = false\n\nPATCH 001:\nLOCKED\n\nPATCH 003:\nLOCKED\n\nCore:\nLOCKED\n\n==================================================\n2. DIAGNOSTIC VARIANT\n==================================================\n\nCreare temporaneamente una variante TEST A con:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = false\n\nwindowBackground = colore opaco Machina coerente,\nes. il background base corrente.\n\nRoot/window non deve mostrare wallpaper Android.\n\n==================================================\n3. DO NOT TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\nHomeScreen\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\nMaterial Stretch\nvisual tokens\ndim logic\nshadow\nborder\ncatalog\npersistence\nlifecycle\nBack handlers\n\n==================================================\n4. NO NEW MOTION\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\nBackHandler\nPredictiveBackHandler\nfade\nspring\npointerInput\nwobble\ncustom swipe\n\n==================================================\n5. BUILD TEST APK\n==================================================\n\nProdurre APK diagnostico chiaramente nominato:\n\nMachinaHome-window-test-A.apk\n\nNON sostituire l'APK baseline ufficiale.\n\n==================================================\n6. DEVICE INSTRUCTIONS\n==================================================\n\nSul Pixel:\n\ninstallare TEST A\n\npoi eseguire:\n\n20 swipe dal bordo LEFT\n20 swipe dal bordo RIGHT\n\nOsservare soltanto:\n\nil flash appare ancora?\n\n==================================================\n7. USER RESULT\n==================================================\n\nClassificazione:\n\nA1:\nLEFT NO\nRIGHT NO\n\n=> strong confirmation:\nWINDOW_COMPOSITING\n\nA2:\nLEFT YES\nRIGHT YES\n\n=> transparent wallpaper window NON è la causa primaria\n\nA3:\nsolo uno dei due lati\n\n=> investigare gesture/system navigation asymmetry\n\n==================================================\n8. NO PERMANENT CHANGE\n==================================================\n\nDopo la build:\n\nNON modificare baseline.\n\nNON incorporare TEST A nel core.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA WINDOW TEST A APK READY\n\nTest APK:\n<path>\n\nwindowShowWallpaper:\nFALSE\n\nwindowBackground:\n<value>\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\nNO\n\nCore modified:\nNO\n\nPermanent fix applied:\nNO\n\nBuild:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:225:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787162669,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — REVERT WINDOW TEST A / RESTORE BASELINE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPROBLEMA DEVICE\n\nLa variante TEST A con finestra opaca ha introdotto:\n\n- background nero\n- gesture di sistema/comportamento swipe alterati\n\nQuindi TEST A è INVALIDO come fix.\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nRipristinare ESATTAMENTE la baseline precedente al TEST A.\n\n==================================================\n1. RESTORE WINDOW CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nRipristinare:\n\nandroid:windowShowWallpaper=\"true\"\n\nwindowBackground:\n@android:color/transparent\n\nwindowIsTranslucent:\ndefault false / configurazione precedente\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE TEST-A OVERRIDES\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere qualunque:\n\n- theme test\n- opaque background override\n- test manifest overlay\n- diagnostic build variant override\n- temporary window color\n- test-only window flags\n\n==================================================\n3. KEEP PREDICTIVE BACK BASELINE\n==================================================\n\nNon reintrodurre:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nLa precedente diagnosi ha mostrato che non risolveva il flash.\n\nLasciare configurazione Android standard.\n\n==================================================\n4. DO NOT TOUCH GESTURES\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\n- system Back handling\n- system Home gesture\n- PATCH 001 Material Stretch\n- gesture ownership\n- touch handlers\n\n==================================================\n5. PATCH LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001:\nUNCHANGED\n\nPATCH 003:\nUNCHANGED\n\nCore:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n6. VISUAL RESTORE\n==================================================\n\nDopo revert devono tornare:\n\n- wallpaper Android visibile\n- dim PATCH 003\n- border\n- shadow\n- colori Machina\n\nNessuno sfondo nero aggiuntivo.\n\n==================================================\n7. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n8. VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nConfermare staticamente:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = transparent\nopaque test overrides = 0\nPredictive opt-out = unset\ncustom Back handlers = 0\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA WINDOW TEST A REVERT COMPLETE\n\nwindowShowWallpaper: <TRUE/FAILED>\nwindowBackground: <TRANSPARENT/FAILED>\nwindowIsTranslucent: <value>\n\nOpaque test overrides remaining: <numero>\nPredictive Back opt-out remaining: <numero>\n\nPATCH 001 modified: <NO/YES>\nPATCH 003 modified: <NO/YES>\nCore modified: <NO/YES>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:226:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787163465,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — TRUE HOME LAUNCHER INTEGRATION AUDIT\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPROBLEMA DEVICE\n\nIl Material motion interno dell'app funziona correttamente.\n\nNON modificarlo.\n\nIl problema residuo riguarda SOLO le gesture di sistema:\n\n- swipe LEFT/RIGHT di Back\n- swipe UP dal basso / ritorno Home\n\nDurante alcune gesture appare una variazione di opacity /\nflash del wallpaper.\n\nIPOTESI:\n\nMachina potrebbe essere dichiarata come HOME launcher,\nma task/window/activity behavior potrebbe essere ancora\nquello di una normale app.\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nVerificare che Machina sia integrata correttamente come\nlauncher/Home Activity per Android 17 / targetSdk 37.\n\nREAD-ONLY AUDIT.\n\nNON applicare fix.\n\n==================================================\n1. MANIFEST HOME INTENT\n==================================================\n\nVerifica MainActivity.\n\nDeve avere intent-filter appropriato per launcher Home:\n\nandroid.intent.action.MAIN\n\nandroid.intent.category.HOME\n\nandroid.intent.category.DEFAULT\n\nRiporta esattamente le categorie presenti.\n\nSeparare eventuale:\n\nandroid.intent.category.LAUNCHER\n\ne spiegare se viene usata.\n\n==================================================\n2. EXPORTED\n==================================================\n\nVerifica:\n\nandroid:exported\n\nPer una Activity con intent filter HOME deve essere coerente\ncon il fatto che il sistema debba poterla avviare.\n\nRiporta valore reale.\n\n==================================================\n3. ACTIVITY TASK ATTRIBUTES\n==================================================\n\nAudit MainActivity:\n\nlaunchMode\ntaskAffinity\nexcludeFromRecents\nfinishOnTaskLaunch\nclearTaskOnLaunch\nalwaysRetainTaskState\nnoHistory\nstateNotNeeded\ndocumentLaunchMode\nrelinquishTaskIdentity\n\nRiporta tutti i valori espliciti/default rilevanti.\n\n==================================================\n4. HOME TASK BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nVerifica se MainActivity sta creando un normale task app\ninvece di comportarsi come launcher root.\n\nCerca:\n\nstartActivity flags\nFLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK\nFLAG_ACTIVITY_CLEAR_TASK\nFLAG_ACTIVITY_CLEAR_TOP\nFLAG_ACTIVITY_REORDER_TO_FRONT\nmoveTaskToBack\nfinish\nfinishAffinity\nfinishAndRemoveTask\n\nTarget ideale:\nnessuna manipolazione task custom inutile.\n\n==================================================\n5. HOME ROLE\n==================================================\n\nVerifica backend per:\n\nRoleManager.ROLE_HOME\n\ne fallback Home Settings.\n\nConfermare che quando Machina viene scelta come Home default\nil sistema la riconosca come HOME role holder.\n\nNON modificare il ruolo.\n\n==================================================\n6. WINDOW HOME CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nAudit theme/window:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper\nwindowBackground\nwindowIsTranslucent\nwindowDisablePreview\nwindowNoDisplay\nbackgroundDimEnabled\nwindowIsFloating\n\nRiporta valori.\n\n==================================================\n7. ROOT COMPOSE BACKGROUND\n==================================================\n\nVerifica la gerarchia visuale reale:\n\nWindow\n→ ComposeView\n→ root Home\n→ PATCH 003 dim overlay\n→ P1/P2/Dock/Fav\n\nIdentifica quali layer sono:\n\nOPAQUE\nTRANSPARENT\nALPHA < 1\n\nDurante idle.\n\n==================================================\n8. OPACITY AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCerca in TUTTO il runtime Home:\n\nalpha\ngraphicsLayer.alpha\nColor.copy(alpha\ndrawRect alpha\nbackground alpha\nAnimatedVisibility\nCrossfade\ntransitionAlpha\ncontentAlpha\n\nClassifica:\n\nSTATIC VISUAL\nMOTION\nSYSTEM BAR\nUNEXPECTED\n\n==================================================\n9. PATCH 003 DIM\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 003 applica dim statico wallpaper.\n\nVerifica implementazione esatta.\n\nIl dim deve essere:\n\nstatic draw overlay\n\nNON:\n\nwindow dim\ndialog dim\nactivity dim\nanimated alpha\n\nRiporta come viene realizzato.\n\n==================================================\n10. SYSTEM BAR SCRIMS\n==================================================\n\nAudit:\n\nenableEdgeToEdge\nstatusBarColor\nnavigationBarColor\nisAppearanceLightStatusBars\nisAppearanceLightNavigationBars\ncontrast enforcement\nnavigation bar scrim\n\nVerifica se durante system gesture Android potrebbe\nmostrare un diverso scrim/background rispetto alla Home.\n\n==================================================\n11. SPLASH / STARTING WINDOW\n==================================================\n\nAudit:\n\nTheme.Machina.Starting\nwindowSplashScreenBackground\nwindowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon\npostSplashScreenTheme\n\nVerifica se un Starting Window / Splash Theme\npotrebbe essere temporaneamente esposto durante\ntask/home transitions.\n\nQuesto è importante.\n\n==================================================\n12. WINDOW BACKGROUND VS SYSTEM WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nVerifica la relazione tra:\n\nwindowBackground = transparent\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\n\ne root Compose.\n\nDocumenta se esiste un frame in cui:\n\nCompose root non ha ancora disegnato\nma wallpaper è già visibile.\n\n==================================================\n13. HOME RESUME READINESS\n==================================================\n\nAl ritorno tramite system Home gesture:\n\nMainActivity onStart/onResume\nNON deve:\n\nreset alpha\nricreare visual state\nmostrare loading state\nritardare root composition\n\nCerca state tipo:\n\nisReady\nisLoaded\nshowContent\ncontentVisible\nstartupComplete\nfirstFrameReady\n\n==================================================\n14. STARTUP / RESUME ALPHA\n==================================================\n\nCerca qualsiasi codice:\n\nalpha = 0\n→ alpha = 1\n\nall'avvio/resume.\n\nTarget:\n0 per Home normale.\n\n==================================================\n15. SYSTEM TRANSITION OVERRIDES\n==================================================\n\nCerca:\n\noverridePendingTransition\noverrideActivityTransition\nActivityOptions\nwindowAnimations\nactivityOpenEnterAnimation\nactivityCloseExitAnimation\nactivityOpenExitAnimation\nactivityCloseEnterAnimation\n\nTarget:\nnessuna transition custom sulla Home root.\n\n==================================================\n16. MATERIAL PATCH LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001:\nLOCKED.\n\nNon modificare il Material Stretch approvato.\n\n==================================================\n17. VISUAL PATCH LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 003:\nLOCKED per ora.\n\nNon modificare border/dim/shadow/colori.\n\n==================================================\n18. HOME-LAUNCHER CHECKLIST\n==================================================\n\nClassifica:\n\nHOME intent:\nPASS/FAIL\n\nDEFAULT category:\nPASS/FAIL\n\nHOME role eligibility:\nPASS/FAIL\n\nTask model:\nPASS/WARNING/FAIL\n\nWindow model:\nPASS/WARNING/FAIL\n\nStarting window:\nPASS/WARNING/FAIL\n\nRoot opacity:\nPASS/WARNING/FAIL\n\nResume readiness:\nPASS/WARNING/FAIL\n\nSystem transition overrides:\nPASS/FAIL\n\n==================================================\n19. ROOT CAUSE CANDIDATES\n==================================================\n\nOrdina con confidence:\n\n1.\n<cause>\n\n2.\n<cause>\n\n3.\n<cause>\n\nPossibili esempi:\n\nSTARTING_WINDOW_EXPOSED\nROOT_TRANSPARENT_FRAME\nSYSTEM_NAV_SCRIM\nTASK_CONFIGURATION\nHOME_ROLE_CONFIGURATION\nPATCH003_DIM\nOTHER\n\nNON scegliere senza evidenza.\n\n==================================================\n20. NO FIX\n==================================================\n\nProject modified:\nNO\n\nManifest modified:\nNO\n\nTheme modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\nNO\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA TRUE HOME LAUNCHER AUDIT COMPLETE\n\nHOME intent: <PASS/FAIL>\nDEFAULT category: <PASS/FAIL>\nLAUNCHER category: <value>\nexported: <value>\n\nHome role eligible: <YES/NO>\nCurrent Home role backend: <value>\n\nlaunchMode: <value>\ntaskAffinity: <value>\nexcludeFromRecents: <value>\nfinish/clear task paths: <numero>\n\nwindowShowWallpaper: <value>\nwindowBackground: <value>\nwindowIsTranslucent: <value>\nwindowDisablePreview: <value>\n\nStarting theme: <value>\npostSplashScreenTheme: <value>\nStarting-window risk: <PASS/WARNING/FAIL>\n\nRoot transparent layers: <numero>\nRuntime alpha-changing paths: <numero>\nResume alpha paths: <numero>\n\nPATCH003 dim implementation:\n<STATIC_DRAW/WINDOW_DIM/OTHER>\n\nCustom activity transitions: <numero>\n\nHome task model:\n<PASS/WARNING/FAIL>\n\nHome window model:\n<PASS/WARNING/FAIL>\n\nResume readiness:\n<PASS/WARNING/FAIL>\n\nLikely cause #1:\n<value + confidence>\n\nLikely cause #2:\n<value + confidence>\n\nLikely cause #3:\n<value + confidence>\n\nProject modified: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:227:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787163641,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — HOME SURFACE CONTINUITY HARDENING\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nDIAGNOSIS:\n\nHOME intent: PASS\nHOME role: eligible\nTask model: PASS\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = transparent\nwindowIsTranslucent = false\n\nRoot transparent layers = 2\nPATCH003 dim = STATIC_DRAW 14%\n\nCustom Back handlers = 0\nCustom activity transitions = 0\nResume alpha paths = 0\n\nLIKELY ISSUE:\n\nSYSTEM TRANSITION +\ntransparent launcher surface continuity\n\nGOAL:\n\nRendere la superficie Home visivamente continua durante\nsystem Back/Home gestures SENZA:\n\n- rimuovere system wallpaper\n- rendere la Home opaca\n- modificare Material Stretch\n- creare custom system gesture animations\n\n==================================================\n1. LOCK\n==================================================\n\nLOCK:\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch\nPATCH 003 Visual Tokens\nHomeSnapshot\nAppCatalog\nLauncherPreferences\nLauncherActions\nP1/P2/Dock\nmotion behavior\n\n==================================================\n2. EDGE-TO-EDGE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\ntargetSdk 37:\n\nassumere edge-to-edge platform behavior.\n\nVerificare che MainActivity configuri edge-to-edge\nuna sola volta e in modo coerente.\n\nPreferire API AndroidX corrente appropriata:\n\nenableEdgeToEdge()\n\nse già disponibile nel progetto.\n\nNON introdurre immersive mode.\n\n==================================================\n3. SYSTEM BARS\n==================================================\n\nGesture navigation:\n\nstatus/navigation bars devono rimanere trasparenti.\n\nNON cercare di correggere il flash con:\n\nnavigationBarColor opaque\nstatusBarColor opaque\ncontrast scrim custom\n\n==================================================\n4. ROOT SURFACE CONTINUITY\n==================================================\n\nLa Compose root deve coprire SEMPRE l'intero window bounds.\n\nUsare:\n\nfillMaxSize()\n\ncon composizione:\n\nSYSTEM WALLPAPER\n→ static Machina dim\n→ Home content\n\nNessun frame in cui la root visuale viene condizionata da:\n\nisReady\nisResumed\nisLoaded\nanimation state\n\n==================================================\n5. DIM OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nPATCH003 dim deve essere applicato al root visual layer\nche copre l'intero display.\n\nNon applicarlo soltanto ai pannelli.\n\nTarget:\n\nsystem wallpaper visible everywhere\n+\nsame 14% dim everywhere\n\nincluso dietro:\n\nstatus bar\ngesture nav region\ndisplay cutout\n\n==================================================\n6. WINDOW INSETS\n==================================================\n\nRoot background/dim:\ndraw edge-to-edge.\n\nInteractive content:\ncontinua a rispettare gli insets approvati.\n\nNON applicare systemBarsPadding() al layer wallpaper/dim.\n\nApplicare insets solo ai contenuti che devono evitare system UI.\n\n==================================================\n7. STARTING WINDOW CONTINUITY\n==================================================\n\nCurrent:\n\nTheme.Machina.Starting\nopaque #08080A\n\nQuesto NON corrisponde alla Home:\nsystem wallpaper + static dim.\n\nAudit se Theme.Machina.Starting viene realmente usato\ndurante ritorni/recreation.\n\nPer cold start, renderlo coerente quanto possibile\ncon il first frame senza introdurre fake wallpaper.\n\nPreferenza:\n\nnon mostrare un opaque #08080A frame se può essere evitato\ncon il corretto Android splash/window configuration.\n\n==================================================\n8. SPLASH API\n==================================================\n\nSe il progetto usa SplashScreen API:\n\nverificare:\n\nwindowSplashScreenBackground\nwindowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon\npostSplashScreenTheme\n\nConfigurarla correttamente e separatamente dal theme Home.\n\nNon lasciare un Starting Theme incompleto.\n\n==================================================\n9. POST SPLASH THEME\n==================================================\n\nSe manca postSplashScreenTheme ed è richiesto dalla\nSplashScreen implementation corrente:\n\ndefinire esplicitamente Theme.Machina come post-splash theme.\n\nNON creare animation custom.\n\n==================================================\n10. NO STARTING WINDOW ON NORMAL RESUME\n==================================================\n\nVerificare che MainActivity non venga ricreata inutilmente\nquando si torna Home.\n\nHome gesture normale:\nresume existing activity preferred.\n\nNessuna forced recreation.\n\n==================================================\n11. ACTIVITY CONFIG\n==================================================\n\nNON cambiare launchMode/taskAffinity alla cieca.\n\nCurrent task model = PASS.\n\nPreservarlo.\n\n==================================================\n12. ROOT TRANSPARENCY\n==================================================\n\nLa trasparenza necessaria al wallpaper resta.\n\nMa deve esserci una sola composizione prevedibile:\n\ntransparent window\n+\nwallpaper\n+\nfull-screen dim layer\n\nNon usare più transparent nested background layers\nse non necessari.\n\n==================================================\n13. REMOVE REDUNDANT TRANSPARENT LAYERS\n==================================================\n\nRoot transparent layers current:\n2\n\nAudit entrambi.\n\nSe uno è ridondante e non ha altra funzione:\nrimuoverlo.\n\nTarget:\nminimum necessary transparent layers.\n\nNON rendere opaco il root.\n\n==================================================\n14. SYSTEM GESTURE EXCLUSION\n==================================================\n\nNON usare gesture exclusion rects per bloccare Back.\n\nLEFT/RIGHT edge:\nAndroid owned.\n\nBottom Home:\nAndroid owned.\n\n==================================================\n15. NO PREDICTIVE BACK OPT-OUT\n==================================================\n\nNON reintrodurre:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nNon ha risolto il problema device.\n\n==================================================\n16. NO CUSTOM BACK\n==================================================\n\nBackHandler:\n0 on Home root\n\nPredictiveBackHandler:\n0 on Home root\n\nCustom fade:\n0\n\nCustom spring:\n0\n\n==================================================\n17. PATCH001 MATERIAL MOTION\n==================================================\n\nPATCH001 rimane esattamente il motion interno approvato.\n\nNon collegarlo alle gesture di sistema.\n\n==================================================\n18. FIRST-FRAME CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nQuando MainActivity diventa visibile:\n\nframe 1 deve già contenere:\n\n- wallpaper system\n- PATCH003 dim\n- Home root surface\n\nP1/P2/Dock possono risolvere contenuti normalmente,\nma il background visivo non deve cambiare opacity.\n\n==================================================\n19. STATIC ALPHA AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCurrent alpha paths:\n2 static.\n\nVerificare che nessuno dei due venga:\n\n- ricalcolato da system bar state\n- cambiato durante WindowInsets\n- cambiato durante lifecycle\n- applicato due volte in alcuni frame\n\n==================================================\n20. DEVICE-TARGETED LOGGING\n==================================================\n\nÈ consentito aggiungere TEMPORANEAMENTE logging\nnon visuale per:\n\nonCreate\nonStart\nonResume\nonWindowFocusChanged\nonStop\n\nObiettivo:\n\ndurante LEFT/RIGHT flash verificare se Activity lifecycle cambia.\n\nSe non cambia:\nflash è quasi certamente system/window compositing.\n\nRimuovere log dopo diagnosi.\n\n==================================================\n21. DO NOT CHANGE VISUAL FEEL\n==================================================\n\nIdle Home deve risultare pixel-identica prima/dopo:\n\nsame wallpaper\nsame dim\nsame border\nsame shadow\nsame colors\n\n==================================================\n22. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\nNO adb\nNO install\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME SURFACE CONTINUITY HARDENING COMPLETE\n\nEdge-to-edge API:\n<value>\n\nRoot fills entire window:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDim covers full display:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDim behind status bar:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDim behind navigation gesture area:\n<YES/NO>\n\nRoot transparent layers before:\n2\n\nRoot transparent layers after:\n<numero>\n\nStarting theme:\n<value>\n\nSplashScreen API:\n<YES/NO>\n\npostSplashScreenTheme:\n<value>\n\nOpaque starting-frame risk:\n<PRESENT/REMOVED/UNCHANGED>\n\nHome forced recreation paths:\n<numero>\n\nLifecycle-dependent alpha paths:\n<numero>\n\nSystem gesture handlers:\n<numero>\n\nPredictive Back opt-out:\n<ABSENT/FAILED>\n\nPATCH001 modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH003 semantic behavior:\n<UNCHANGED/CHANGED>\n\nIdle visual regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:228:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787163886,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — STARTING WINDOW / SPLASH CONTINUITY FIX\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCURRENT VERIFIED STATE:\n\nedge-to-edge = configured once\nHome root fills window = YES\nPATCH003 dim full-display = YES\nlifecycle alpha paths = 0\nforced recreation = 0\nsystem gesture handlers = 0\n\nREMAINING WARNING:\n\nTheme.Machina.Starting\nopaque background = #08080A\n\nSplashScreen API:\nnot explicitly integrated\n\npostSplashScreenTheme:\nmissing\n\nOBJECTIVE:\n\nRendere il cold/warm starting surface coerente con la Home\nsenza modificare runtime Home o Material Stretch.\n\n==================================================\n1. LOCK\n==================================================\n\nDO NOT MODIFY:\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch\nPATCH 003 Visual Tokens\nHomeScreen runtime geometry\nHomeSnapshot\nP1/P2/Dock\ncatalog\npersistence\nsystem gesture handling\n\n==================================================\n2. MODERN SPLASH CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nMigrare Theme.Machina.Starting a una configurazione\nAndroid SplashScreen corretta per Android 12+ / targetSdk 37.\n\nPreferire AndroidX core-splashscreen se già disponibile\no se l'aggiunta è minima e coerente col progetto.\n\nStarting theme deve derivare da:\n\nTheme.SplashScreen\n\no variante appropriata.\n\n==================================================\n3. POST SPLASH THEME\n==================================================\n\nImpostare esplicitamente:\n\npostSplashScreenTheme = Theme.Machina\n\nQuesto è REQUIRED per una transizione deterministica\ndal starting surface alla Home Activity.\n\n==================================================\n4. SPLASH BACKGROUND\n==================================================\n\nNon usare il vecchio #08080A arbitrario.\n\nIl first system splash deve essere coerente con la futura\nidentità Machina:\n\nwhite background\n+\nMachina icon\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nquesto riguarda la system splash,\nNON ancora PATCH 004 onboarding.\n\n==================================================\n5. SPLASH ICON\n==================================================\n\nUsare il logo finale:\n\nwhite canvas/background\nsmall black filled hexagon\nsmall white X centered\n\nHexagon:\nsmaller than current artwork.\n\nLarge white safe margin around it.\n\nNo:\nshadow\ngradient\ngloss\nstroke\n\n==================================================\n6. NO CUSTOM SPLASH ANIMATION YET\n==================================================\n\nNon implementare ancora:\n\nbounce onboarding\ncustom splash Activity\nfade chain\nlogo scale animation\n\nLa PATCH 004 farà eventualmente il bounce DOPO\nla system splash.\n\nQui vogliamo solo una starting window moderna e coerente.\n\n==================================================\n7. INSTALL SPLASH SCREEN\n==================================================\n\nSe si usa AndroidX SplashScreen:\n\nMainActivity.onCreate:\n\ninstallSplashScreen()\n\nprima di super.onCreate(...)\n\nsecondo API ufficiale.\n\nNessuna keep-on-screen condition se non necessaria.\n\n==================================================\n8. NO ARTIFICIAL DELAY\n==================================================\n\nNon trattenere lo splash.\n\nNo timers.\nNo sleep.\nNo minimum duration.\n\n==================================================\n9. THEME TRANSITION\n==================================================\n\nSystem Splash:\n\nTheme.Machina.Starting\n\n→ postSplashScreenTheme\n\nTheme.Machina\n\n→ Compose Home\n\nUna sola sequenza.\n\n==================================================\n10. NO DOUBLE SPLASH\n==================================================\n\nNon creare una seconda SplashActivity.\n\nTarget:\n\nsystem splash only.\n\nPATCH 004 first-run sarà una normale feature screen\ndopo l'avvio, non una seconda Android splash activity.\n\n==================================================\n11. WINDOW CONTRACT AFTER SPLASH\n==================================================\n\nTheme.Machina mantiene:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper = true\nwindowBackground = transparent\nwindowIsTranslucent = false\n\nSystem wallpaper behavior:\nUNCHANGED.\n\n==================================================\n12. FIRST FRAME\n==================================================\n\nDopo splash dismissal:\n\nHome root deve essere già full-screen con:\n\nsystem wallpaper\nPATCH003 dim\nHome content\n\nNo black intermediate frame.\n\n==================================================\n13. SYSTEM GESTURES\n==================================================\n\nNon modificare:\n\nPredictive Back\nsystem Home gesture\nsystem bar gesture handling\n\nQuesto fix riguarda startup continuity soltanto.\n\n==================================================\n14. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n15. STATIC VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nStarting theme parent:\nTheme.SplashScreen-compatible\n\npostSplashScreenTheme:\nTheme.Machina\n\nOpaque legacy #08080A starting background:\nREMOVED\n\nCustom SplashActivity:\n0\n\nArtificial splash delays:\n0\n\nPATCH001 modified:\nNO\n\nPATCH003 modified:\nNO\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SPLASH CONTINUITY COMPLETE\n\nSplash implementation:\n<ANDROIDX_SPLASHSCREEN/PLATFORM/FAILED>\n\nStarting theme parent:\n<value>\n\npostSplashScreenTheme:\n<value>\n\nSystem splash background:\n<value>\n\nSystem splash icon:\n<value>\n\nLegacy #08080A starting frame:\n<REMOVED/PRESENT>\n\nCustom splash activities:\n<numero>\n\nArtificial splash delays:\n<numero>\n\nTheme.Machina windowShowWallpaper:\n<TRUE/FAILED>\n\nTheme.Machina windowBackground:\n<TRANSPARENT/FAILED>\n\nPATCH001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nPATCH003 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
