/root/.codex/history.jsonl:230:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787164589,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — CORE ROOT HOME BACK = NO_OP\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCLASSIFICATION:\nCORE HARDENING\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nQuando Machina mostra la HOME ROOT:\n\nSYSTEM BACK\n→ CONSUMED\n→ NO_OP\n\nNon deve esistere una destinazione precedente Machina.\nNon deve partire una transizione Back applicativa.\nNon deve modificarsi la Home.\n\nLe future schermate secondarie continueranno invece\nad avere normale Back navigation.\n\n==================================================\n1. CORE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nAggiungere al contratto core:\n\nHOME_ROOT_BACK = NO_OP\n\nQuesto significa:\n\n- nessuna navigation\n- nessun finish()\n- nessun moveTaskToBack()\n- nessun route change\n- nessun HomeSnapshot change\n- nessun alpha/fade\n- nessuna animation custom\n\n==================================================\n2. USE SUPPORTED ANDROIDX API\n==================================================\n\nNella Home root usare il Back handling AndroidX/Compose\nsupportato dalla versione installata.\n\nPreferenza:\n\nandroidx.activity.compose.BackHandler\n\nConcetto:\n\nBackHandler(\n    enabled = isHomeRoot\n) {\n    // intentional NO_OP\n}\n\nNON usare:\n\nPredictiveBackHandler\n\nperché non vogliamo animare il progresso Back della Home root.\n\n==================================================\n3. IMPORTANT — ONLY HOME ROOT\n==================================================\n\nIl NO_OP deve essere attivo SOLO quando:\n\ncurrent destination = HOME ROOT\n\nNon globalmente sull'intera Activity.\n\nFuture:\n\nSettings detail\n→ Back naviga indietro\n\nChangelog\n→ Back naviga indietro\n\nFirst Run\n→ proprio flow controllato\n\nHome root\n→ Back NO_OP\n\n==================================================\n4. DO NOT DISABLE PREDICTIVE BACK GLOBALLY\n==================================================\n\nNON usare:\n\nandroid:enableOnBackInvokedCallback=\"false\"\n\nIl precedente test non ha risolto il problema\ne disabiliterebbe comportamento moderno a livello Activity.\n\nLascia Predictive Back Android abilitato.\n\n==================================================\n5. NO MANIFEST BACK HACK\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare Manifest per questa funzione.\n\nNON modificare:\n\nwindowShowWallpaper\nwindowBackground\nwindowIsTranslucent\ntaskAffinity\nlaunchMode\n\n==================================================\n6. NO SYSTEM-GESTURE EMULATION\n==================================================\n\nNON aggiungere:\n\npointerInput edge detector\nswipeLeft\nswipeRight\ncustom predictive gesture\ngesture exclusion rect\ncustom edge animation\n\nBackHandler è l'unico owner applicativo del Back sulla root.\n\n==================================================\n7. MATERIAL STRETCH LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch:\n\nUNCHANGED.\n\nNon deve essere usato per il system Back gesture.\n\nMaterial Stretch = app motion.\n\nBack = Android navigation event.\n\n==================================================\n8. VISUAL LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 003:\n\nUNCHANGED.\n\nMantieni:\n\nsystem wallpaper\ndim\nborder\nshadow\nMachina colors\n\n==================================================\n9. NO VISUAL RESPONSE TO BACK\n==================================================\n\nDurante Back sulla Home root Machina non deve modificare:\n\nalpha\nscale\noffset\nvisibility\ncontainer bounds\nwallpaper dim\nshadow\nborder\n\nTarget applicativo:\n\nvisual state delta = 0\n\n==================================================\n10. HOME STATE\n==================================================\n\nBack Home root non deve toccare:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\nFav\nHomeSnapshot\ncatalog\nicon cache\npersistence\n\n==================================================\n11. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nBack NO_OP:\n\nNO CLOCK_TICK.\n\nNon è un'azione Machina confermata.\n\n==================================================\n12. CURRENT ROOT IMPLEMENTATION\n==================================================\n\nAudit dove viene composto HomeScreen.\n\nIntegra il BackHandler nel punto più alto che conosce\ncon certezza che la destinazione corrente sia Home root.\n\nNON duplicarlo dentro:\n\nFav\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\n==================================================\n13. SINGLE OWNER\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\nHome root BackHandlers = 1\n\nNested Home BackHandlers = 0\n\nLegacy Back handlers = 0\n\n==================================================\n14. FUTURE FEATURE CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nAggiornare:\n\ndocs/MACHINA_CORE_CONTRACT.md\n\ncon:\n\nSYSTEM BACK OWNERSHIP\n\nHOME ROOT:\nBackHandler → intentional NO_OP\n\nFEATURE/SUBPAGE:\nfeature owns normal Back navigation while visible\n\nQuando feature viene chiusa:\nownership torna alla Home root.\n\n==================================================\n15. FIRST RUN FUTURE\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 004 First Run non deve dipendere dal NO_OP Home.\n\nDurante First Run:\n\nHome-root BackHandler = disabled\n\nFirstRun feature decide il proprio comportamento Back.\n\n==================================================\n16. SETTINGS FUTURE\n==================================================\n\nFuture Settings V2:\n\nquando Settings visibile:\n\nHome-root BackHandler = disabled\n\nSettings Back:\ndetail → Settings\nSettings → Home\n\n==================================================\n17. STATIC AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nCercare:\n\nBackHandler\nPredictiveBackHandler\nOnBackPressedCallback\nOnBackInvokedCallback\nfinish()\nfinishAffinity()\nmoveTaskToBack()\n\nFinal ownership deve essere documentato.\n\n==================================================\n18. DEVICE EXPECTATION\n==================================================\n\nTest Pixel:\n\nHOME ROOT\n→ edge Back LEFT\n→ Home remains Home\n\nHOME ROOT\n→ edge Back RIGHT\n→ Home remains Home\n\nExpected:\n\nno Machina navigation\nno state change\nno Home reload\n\nVerificare soprattutto se sparisce il fastidioso\nwallpaper-opacity flash.\n\n==================================================\n19. IMPORTANT RESULT CLASSIFICATION\n==================================================\n\nSe il NO_OP elimina il flash:\n\nROOT BACK TRANSITION CONFIRMED.\n\nSe il flash rimane:\n\nBack event è consumato correttamente ma il visual artifact\nproviene ancora da system/window composition.\n\nNON aggiungere altri workaround automaticamente.\n\n==================================================\n20. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA CORE ROOT BACK NO_OP COMPLETE\n\nHome root Back owner:\n<BACK_HANDLER/FAILED>\n\nHome root Back action:\n<NO_OP/OTHER>\n\nHome root BackHandlers:\n<numero>\n\nNested BackHandlers:\n<numero>\n\nPredictiveBackHandler on Home:\n<numero>\n\nCustom edge gesture handlers:\n<numero>\n\nManifest predictive opt-out:\n<ABSENT/PRESENT>\n\nBack-triggered navigation:\n<numero>\n\nBack-triggered finish paths:\n<numero>\n\nBack-triggered HomeSnapshot writes:\n<numero>\n\nBack-triggered visual state writes:\n<numero>\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nPATCH 003 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nCore contract updated:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDEVICE FLASH VALIDATION REQUIRED:\nYES"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:231:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787165622,"text":"PATCH 001E — HOME ROOT MATERIAL RESPONSE / NO BACK VISUAL\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCURRENT GOOD STATE:\n\nHome root BackHandler:\nNO_OP\n\nFlash:\nFIXED\n\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch:\nWORKING\n\nGOAL:\n\nSulla HOME ROOT:\n\n- nessuna navigazione Back\n- nessuna animazione Back applicativa\n- mantenere Material Stretch come feedback interno\n- non modificare Settings/subpage Back behavior\n\n==================================================\n1. KEEP ROOT BACK NO_OP\n==================================================\n\nBackHandler sulla Home root:\nKEEP.\n\nNon rimuoverlo.\n\nHome Back:\nNO_OP.\n\n==================================================\n2. NO PREDICTIVE BACK HANDLER\n==================================================\n\nHome root:\n\nPredictiveBackHandler = 0\n\nOnBackAnimationCallback = 0\n\nCustom predictive progress = 0\n\nNon partecipare a una custom back animation.\n\n==================================================\n3. PATCH001 MATERIAL RESPONSE\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001 resta l'unico visual feedback interno.\n\nUsare Material/Foundation stretch soltanto come\nfeedback della superficie Home.\n\nNo navigation semantics.\n\n==================================================\n4. DO NOT EMULATE BACK\n==================================================\n\nNon creare:\n\nback arrow\nchevron\nback icon\nback progress indicator\ndestination preview\n\nMachina Home non ha una destination precedente.\n\n==================================================\n5. SYSTEM EDGE OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nNon usare gesture exclusion rects globali.\n\nNon bloccare la gesture Back di Android in tutta l'app.\n\nRoot Home:\nBack is simply consumed/no-op.\n\nSubpages:\nAndroid Back remains normal.\n\n==================================================\n6. SETTINGS / FUTURE FEATURES\n==================================================\n\nQuando una feature/subpage è aperta:\n\nHome root BackHandler disabled.\n\nFeature can use normal Back/Predictive Back.\n\nQuando torni Home:\nroot NO_OP owner restored.\n\n==================================================\n7. MATERIAL STRETCH ONLY\n==================================================\n\nVisual motion Home:\n\nMaterial Stretch only.\n\nNo:\ncustom fade\ncustom spring\nroot slide\nback icon\npredictive preview\nalpha transition\n\n==================================================\n8. TEST CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nHOME ROOT:\n\nLEFT edge:\nno navigation\nno flash\nHome remains unchanged\n\nRIGHT edge:\nsame\n\nMaterial internal stretch:\npreserved\n\nSETTINGS/SUBPAGE:\n\nBack:\nworks normally\n\n==================================================\n9. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8:\nSUCCESS"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:232:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787166246,"text":"PATCH 004 — MACHINA FIRST RUN + FINAL ICON\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCORE:\nFROZEN\n\nLOCKED:\nPATCH 001 Material Stretch\nPATCH 003 Visual Tokens\nLauncher root gesture exclusion / Back NO_OP\nSystem wallpaper integration\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nAggiungere soltanto:\n\n1. icona Machina definitiva\n2. first-run fullscreen\n3. singolo bounce del logo\n4. Changelog iniziale\n5. Imposta come Home\n6. Non ora\n\nNON reintrodurre ancora Settings.\n\n==================================================\n1. FEATURE ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nCreare:\n\nfeatures/firstRun/\n\nPreferire massimo:\n\nMachinaFirstRunFeature.kt\nFirstRunScreen.kt\n\nNiente framework/navigation dedicato.\n\n==================================================\n2. FINAL APP ICON\n==================================================\n\nDesign definitivo:\n\nBACKGROUND:\nPURE WHITE\n\nHEXAGON:\nBLACK\nFILLED\nCENTERED\n\nX:\nSMALL\nWHITE\nCENTERED\n\nIMPORTANTE:\n\nl'esagono deve essere più piccolo rispetto alla versione attuale.\n\nDeve essere evidente il margine bianco intorno.\n\nTarget:\n\nwhite background\n→ generous white safe area\n→ small black hexagon\n→ small centered white X\n\nNO:\n\ngradient\nshadow\ngloss\nstroke\ntexture\n3D\n\n==================================================\n3. ADAPTIVE ICON\n==================================================\n\nAggiornare correttamente:\n\nadaptive background\nadaptive foreground\nmonochrome\nlegacy launcher icon\n\nL'esagono deve stare comodamente dentro la safe zone\ndelle mask Android.\n\n==================================================\n4. SYSTEM SPLASH\n==================================================\n\nMantenere il sistema già corretto:\n\nTheme.SplashScreen\nwhite background\nic_machina_logo\npostSplashScreenTheme = Theme.Machina\n\nNON modificarne il comportamento.\n\n==================================================\n5. FIRST RUN ENTRY\n==================================================\n\nDopo il system splash:\n\nif first_run_completed == false\n→ FirstRunFeature\n\nelse\n→ Home\n\nUn solo startup decision point.\n\n==================================================\n6. FIRST RUN FULLSCREEN\n==================================================\n\nPrima schermata:\n\nfullscreen\npure white\nedge-to-edge\n\nsolo logo Machina al centro.\n\nNessun testo.\nNessun bottone.\nNessun progress indicator.\n\n==================================================\n7. LOGO SIZE\n==================================================\n\nLogo first-run:\n\ncirca 76–88dp canvas visuale.\n\nEsagono nero:\ncirca 56–64dp.\n\nX:\npiccola e proporzionata.\n\nIl bianco attorno deve essere chiaramente visibile.\n\n==================================================\n8. SINGLE BOUNCE\n==================================================\n\nIl logo esegue UNA sola animazione.\n\nTarget:\n\nsmall\n→ slightly overshoots\n→ settles\n\nUsare preset Compose ufficiale.\n\nPreferenza:\n\nspring(\n    dampingRatio = Spring.DampingRatioMediumBouncy,\n    stiffness = Spring.StiffnessMediumLow\n)\n\noppure il preset equivalente realmente disponibile\nnella Compose installata.\n\nNO custom float se non necessario.\n\n==================================================\n9. BOUNCE CHARACTER\n==================================================\n\nDeve essere:\n\nmorbido\nbreve\nelegante\nnon giocattoloso\n\nNO:\n\nloop\nshake\nrotation\nflash\nfade chain\nmulti-bounce aggressivo\n\n==================================================\n10. TRANSITION AFTER BOUNCE\n==================================================\n\nFinito il bounce:\n\npassare al Changelog.\n\nNon introdurre delay artificiale.\n\n==================================================\n11. CHANGELOG SCREEN\n==================================================\n\nMaterial 3 semplice.\n\nHeader:\n\nMachina\n\nNovità\n\nMostrare:\n\nversionName\nversionCode\n\nNO screenshot.\nNO preview.\nNO immagini.\n\n==================================================\n12. CHANGELOG CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nMassimo 4 sezioni.\n\nCORE\n- Home stabile\n- P1 8 app\n- P2 8 app\n- Dock 5 app\n\nINTERAZIONE\n- Material Stretch\n- launcher root gesture behavior\n- CLOCK_TICK\n\nASPETTO\n- colori Machina\n- bordo\n- dim wallpaper\n- shadow leggera\n\nOTTIMIZZAZIONE\n- core congelato\n- R8\n- resource shrinking\n\nMostrare SOLO feature realmente presenti.\n\n==================================================\n13. MATERIAL STRETCH\n==================================================\n\nSe Changelog è scrollabile:\n\nriusare PATCH 001 Material Stretch.\n\nNON creare una seconda animation/overscroll implementation.\n\n==================================================\n14. SET AS HOME SECTION\n==================================================\n\nSotto il Changelog:\n\nspazio ben definito.\n\nTitolo:\n\nImposta Machina come Home\n\nSubtitle:\n\nUsa Machina come schermata Home predefinita.\n\nPrimary Material 3 button:\n\nImposta come Home\n\nSecondary:\n\nNon ora\n\n==================================================\n15. HOME ROLE BACKEND\n==================================================\n\nUsare un solo backend:\n\nHomeRoleAction\n\ncon:\n\nRoleManager.ROLE_HOME\n\nquando disponibile.\n\nNON duplicare RoleManager dentro FirstRunScreen.\n\n==================================================\n16. ROLE RESULT\n==================================================\n\nSe utente accetta:\n\nfirst_run_completed = true\n→ Home\n\nSe sceglie Non ora:\n\nfirst_run_completed = true\n→ Home\n\nSe apre il dialog Android e lo annulla:\n\nritorna alla schermata Changelog.\n\nNON creare loop.\n\n==================================================\n17. PERSISTENCE\n==================================================\n\nUna sola key:\n\nfirst_run_completed\n\nDefault:\nfalse\n\nDopo completamento:\ntrue\n\nNessun altro onboarding state persistito.\n\n==================================================\n18. SECOND START\n==================================================\n\nSecondo avvio:\n\nNO first-run\nNO logo bounce\nNO Changelog automatico\nNO Home prompt\n\n→ Home direttamente.\n\n==================================================\n19. BACK DURING FIRST RUN\n==================================================\n\nHome-root BackHandler:\nDISABLED durante FirstRun.\n\nFirst Run non deve ereditare il NO_OP della Home root.\n\nBack behavior:\nsemplice e deterministico.\n\nNon creare predictive-back custom animation.\n\n==================================================\n20. LAUNCHER ROOT CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nNON modificare:\n\ngesture exclusion della Home\nBack NO_OP Home\nMaterial Stretch Home\nsystem Home gesture\nsystem wallpaper\n\n==================================================\n21. PATCH003 VISUAL\n==================================================\n\nNon modificare:\n\nborder\ndim\nshadow\nHome colors\n\nFirst white intro è volutamente separato.\n\n==================================================\n22. NO SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nSettings screens:\n0\n\nSettings routes:\n0\n\nDynamic Color Settings:\nNON ancora reintrodotto.\n\nLa Settings completa sarà PATCH successiva.\n\n==================================================\n23. R8\n==================================================\n\nFeature statically referenced.\n\nNo reflection.\nNo broad keep rules.\n\n==================================================\n24. ROLLBACK\n==================================================\n\nLa feature deve essere removibile con:\n\ndelete features/firstRun/\n\n+\nremove single startup hook.\n\nCore resta funzionante.\n\n==================================================\n25. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 004 FIRST RUN COMPLETE\n\n=== ICON ===\n\nWhite background: <YES/NO>\nSmall black hexagon: <YES/NO>\nWhite X: <YES/NO>\nAdaptive icon: <YES/NO>\nMonochrome icon: <YES/NO>\n\n=== FIRST RUN ===\n\nFeature files: <numero>\nStartup hooks: <numero>\n\nWhite fullscreen: <YES/NO>\nLogo bounce: <ONE/FAILED>\nBounce loops: <numero>\n\nScreenshots: <numero>\nImages in changelog: <numero>\n\nChangelog: <YES/NO>\nMaterial Stretch reused: <YES/NO>\n\nSet as Home: <YES/NO>\nRoleManager owners: <numero>\nNot Now: <YES/NO>\nAutomatic prompt loops: <numero>\n\nFirst-run persistence keys: <numero>\nSecond-launch onboarding: <NO/YES>\n\n=== CORE ===\n\nCore files modified: <numero>\nHome gesture exclusion modified: <NO/YES>\nHome Back NO_OP modified: <NO/YES>\nPATCH001 modified: <NO/YES>\nPATCH003 modified: <NO/YES>\n\nP1/P2/Dock regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFirst-touch regression: <NONE/FOUND>\nFlash regression: <NONE/FOUND>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nPatch doc:\ndocs/PATCH_004_FIRST_RUN_EXPERIENCE.md"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:235:{"session_id":"01a0116c-fa49-7f00-b48a-3282b9c83a05","ts":1787167242,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — SIMPLE LAUNCHER CORE RESET\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBIETTIVO\n\nSemplificare il core launcher.\n\nCORE VISIBILE:\n\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- App Drawer\n\nNAVIGAZIONE CORE:\n\nSWIPE UP:\nHome → App Drawer\n\nSWIPE DOWN:\nApp Drawer → Home\n\nLEFT:\nNO_NAVIGATION\n\nRIGHT:\nNO_NAVIGATION\n\nBack sulla Home:\nNO_OP\n\n==================================================\n1. REMOVE WRONG LEFT/RIGHT NAVIGATION\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere qualsiasi comportamento Machina associato a:\n\nswipeLeft\nswipeRight\nhorizontal navigation\nprevious screen\nnext screen\nback-by-swipe\nhome-by-horizontal-swipe\n\nLEFT/RIGHT non devono:\n\n- cambiare route\n- cambiare Home state\n- aprire Drawer\n- chiudere Drawer\n- navigare Back\n- fare finish\n- modificare snapshot\n\n==================================================\n2. CORE STATES\n==================================================\n\nUsare soltanto due stati principali:\n\nHOME\nAPP_DRAWER\n\nNiente state machine complessa.\n\nEsempio concettuale:\n\nenum class LauncherSurface {\n    HOME,\n    APP_DRAWER\n}\n\n==================================================\n3. SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nDa HOME:\n\nswipe UP valido\n→ APP_DRAWER\n\nUna sola azione.\n\n==================================================\n4. SWIPE DOWN\n==================================================\n\nDa APP_DRAWER:\n\nswipe DOWN valido\n→ HOME\n\nUna sola azione.\n\nDa HOME:\n\nswipe DOWN\n→ NO_OP\n\n==================================================\n5. BACK CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nHOME:\nBack = NO_OP\n\nAPP_DRAWER:\nBack = HOME\n\nQuesto è l'unico Back utile nel core.\n\nNON uscire dal launcher.\n\n==================================================\n6. APP DRAWER\n==================================================\n\nApp Drawer deve essere semplice:\n\n- lista/grid app\n- app launch\n- stesso icon resolver della Home\n- nessun Search per ora\n- nessuna Settings\n- nessuna suggestion\n- nessuna history\n- nessuna recents logic\n\n==================================================\n7. DRAWER STATE\n==================================================\n\nDrawer non deve possedere:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nP1/P2/Dock\ncatalog lifecycle\nicon cache separata\n\nLegge lo stesso catalogo stabile del core.\n\n==================================================\n8. SINGLE VERTICAL GESTURE OWNER\n==================================================\n\nUn solo gesture owner verticale.\n\nDeve riconoscere:\n\nHOME + UP\nDRAWER + DOWN\n\nNient'altro.\n\n==================================================\n9. HORIZONTAL GESTURES\n==================================================\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\n\nnessun owner Machina.\n\nNessuna route.\n\nNessuna state mutation.\n\nNon trattarli come Back applicativo.\n\n==================================================\n10. MATERIAL MOTION\n==================================================\n\nMantieni il Material Stretch approvato.\n\nUsarlo come feedback visuale interno.\n\nNON creare:\n\ncustom fade\ncustom slide\ncustom back animation\ncustom wobble engine\n\n==================================================\n11. DRAWER TRANSITION\n==================================================\n\nPreferire una sola transizione Material semplice.\n\nTarget:\n\nUP:\nDrawer emerge verticalmente\n\nDOWN:\nDrawer torna via verso il basso\n\nNiente alpha chain.\n\nNiente scale.\n\n==================================================\n12. DO NOT ANIMATE HOME ROOT HORIZONTALLY\n==================================================\n\nHome root:\n\ntranslationX = 0\nroute horizontal = 0\nback-horizontal = 0\n\n==================================================\n13. FIRST TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nfirst tap → launch\n\nDrawer app:\nfirst tap → launch\n\nGesture detector non deve rubare i tap.\n\n==================================================\n14. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nCLOCK_TICK:\n\n- app tap accepted\n- Drawer open accepted\n- Drawer close accepted\n\nUna volta.\n\nNO haptic durante MOVE.\n\n==================================================\n15. CORE FILES\n==================================================\n\nRidurre il core a pochi owner chiari.\n\nTarget indicativo:\n\nMachinaCore.kt\nHomeScreen.kt\nAppDrawer.kt\nAppCatalog.kt\nLauncherPreferences.kt\nLauncherActions.kt\nAppVisuals.kt\nMachinaDesign.kt\n\nNon creare framework.\n\n==================================================\n16. CORE STATE OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nHomeSnapshot:\none owner\n\nLauncherSurface:\none owner\n\nCatalog:\none owner\n\nPersistence:\none owner\n\n==================================================\n17. REMOVE DEAD NAVIGATION CODE\n==================================================\n\nRimuovere:\n\nhorizontal navigation helpers\nold back swipe\nold predictive imitation\nold left/right state\nold route transitions\nunused Back handlers\n\n==================================================\n18. SYSTEM NAVIGATION\n==================================================\n\nSystem Home gesture:\nANDROID OWNED\n\nSystem Overview:\nANDROID OWNED\n\nMachina non li simula.\n\n==================================================\n19. SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nSettings:\nNOT IN CORE\n\nVerrà aggiunta dopo come feature separata.\n\n==================================================\n20. FIRST RUN\n==================================================\n\nFirst Run:\nNOT IN CORE\n\nVerrà aggiunta dopo come feature separata.\n\n==================================================\n21. REGRESSION\n==================================================\n\nP1:\n8 manual\n\nP2:\n8 manual\n\nDock:\n5\n\nHomeSnapshot:\nunchanged\n\nMaterial Stretch:\npreserved\n\nWallpaper/dim/border/shadow:\npreserved\n\n==================================================\n22. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8 release:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA SIMPLE LAUNCHER CORE COMPLETE\n\nCore surfaces:\n<HOME/APP_DRAWER>\n\nHome root Back:\n<NO_OP/OTHER>\n\nDrawer Back:\n<HOME/OTHER>\n\nSwipe UP:\n<HOME_TO_DRAWER/FAILED>\n\nSwipe DOWN:\n<DRAWER_TO_HOME/FAILED>\n\nLeft navigation actions:\n<numero>\n\nRight navigation actions:\n<numero>\n\nHorizontal state writes:\n<numero>\n\nVertical gesture owners:\n<numero>\n\nHorizontal gesture owners:\n<numero>\n\nMaterial Stretch preserved:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1:\n<numero>\n\nP2:\n<numero>\n\nDock:\n<numero>\n\nFirst-touch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nFiles modified:\n<numero>\n\nFiles removed:\n<numero>\n\nDebug build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8 release:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
