No custom alpha/fade/translation/scale path unless explicitly required by the patch.\n- Prefer Android/Compose/Material platform primitives over emulation.\n- Layout geometry must not be mutated by visual-only motion unless the feature explicitly requires real geometry changes.\n\n## 7. Haptic\n\n- Prefer View.performHapticFeedback(...).\n- Do not use raw Vibrator/VibrationEffect unless explicitly required.\n- No haptic during continuous MOVE unless feature semantics explicitly require it.\n- One accepted command or gesture must not trigger duplicate haptics.\n- Do not add android.permission.VIBRATE unless genuinely necessary.\n\n## 8. Data / cache\n\n- Reuse existing AppCatalog and core data sources.\n- No PackageManager scan per keystroke or gesture.\n- Cache must be bounded.\n- Android owns process caching.\n- Patches must not add Service, WakeLock, polling, alarms, or process-priority tricks to remain resident.\n\n## 9. Error handling\n\n- catch(Throwable) is forbidden unless explicitly justified.\n- Local failures must not crash the Home.\n- Missing/uninstalled apps must fail safely.\n- Malformed optional patch data must degrade safely.\n- Silent failure paths should be minimized and documented.\n\n## 10. Security / hardening\n\n- No unnecessary reflection.\n- No dynamic code loading.\n- No embedded credentials or secrets.\n- No broad R8 keep rules without justification.\n- No private keys or signing secrets in source, snapshots, docs, outputs, or checkpoints.\n- Release minify/shrink/obfuscation must remain enabled where configured.\n\n## 11. Performance\n\nDuring gesture/input/render hot paths:\n\n- disk IO = 0\n- network = 0\n- PackageManager heavy work = 0\n- bitmap decode = 0\n- avoid heavy per-frame allocation\n\nIdle Home should not poll or perform continuous work.\n\n## 12. Patch rollback\n\nEvery patch document must state:\n\n- files added\n- files modified\n- core hook\n- state introduced\n- persistence introduced\n- lifecycle ownership\n- rollback procedure\n\nRemoving patch files plus the declared hook must restore the previous validated baseline.\n\n## 13. Validation gate\n\nA patch may be marked VALIDATED only when all applicable gates pass:\n\n- DEVICE TEST: PASS\n- STATIC AUDIT: PASS\n- CORE ISOLATION: PASS\n- INPUT SAFETY: PASS\n- STATE OWNERSHIP: PASS\n- LIFECYCLE: PASS\n- MOTION OWNERSHIP: PASS\n- HAPTIC OWNERSHIP: PASS\n- CODE SECURITY: PASS\n- DEBUG BUILD: SUCCESS\n- R8 RELEASE BUILD: SUCCESS\n- SNAPSHOT/HASH VALIDATION: PASS\n- ROLLBACK: PASS\n- CHECKPOINT: CREATED\n\nIf any required gate fails:\n\nPATCH STATUS = NOT VALIDATED\n\nDo not build additional feature patches on top until the failure is understood or explicitly waived.\n\n## 14. Validation must not change approved behavior\n\nThe validation phase is not a feature-development phase.\n\nIf runtime behavior must change to pass validation:\n\nSTOP.\n\nReport the issue and require a separate corrective patch.\n\n## 15. Core process-cache policy\n\n- Android owns process caching and residency.\n- Machina does not attempt to keep its process alive.\n- Valid in-memory state may be reused naturally while the process survives.\n- Correctness must not depend on process survival.\nEOF"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:282:{"session_id":"01a01d19-caa0-7921-a3ec-211c73fb2cc5","ts":1787213605,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — PATCH 001 V2 FINAL VALIDATION\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nPATCH:\nPATCH 001 V2 — SENSITIVE HOME INTERACTION\n\nDEVICE TEST:\nPASS\n\nCORE V2:\nSTABLE CANDIDATE / FROZEN FOR THIS VALIDATION\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nNON cambiare:\n- motion\n- gesture sensitivity\n- LEFT/RIGHT Material Stretch\n- edge exclusion\n- haptic\n- UI\n- geometry\n- P1/P2/Dock\n- Core V2 behavior\n\nQuesta fase è VALIDATION ONLY.\n\n==================================================\n1. APPLY CODE SECURITY POLICY\n==================================================\n\nApplicare:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nMACHINA_PATCH_CODE_SECURITY_POLICY.md\n\nSe il documento non esiste:\nSTOP\n\nNon inventare una policy sostitutiva.\n\n==================================================\n2. PATCH BOUNDARY AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerificare:\n\nCore logic writes from patch = 0\nHomeSnapshot writes = 0\nLauncherPreferences writes = 0\nAppCatalog internal writes = 0\n\nNew persistence = 0\nNew lifecycle owners = 0\n\n==================================================\n3. INPUT AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerificare:\n\ngesture owners = 1 preferred\naxis classifier owners = 1 preferred\nduplicate pointer owners = 0\nfirst-touch blockers = 0\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nMaterial Stretch\n\nSystem Back arrow:\nexcluded on Home root\n\nNo unintended navigation.\n\n==================================================\n4. MOTION AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerificare che non siano rimasti path legacy attivi:\n\ncustom wobble\nduplicate spring\nduplicate overscroll\ntranslation hacks\nalpha/fade motion\nold Fav/container motion\n\nNon rimuovere nulla se non è CONFIRMED DEAD.\n\nSe serve una modifica runtime per superare l'audit:\nSTOP.\n\nQuesta validazione non deve cambiare il feeling già approvato.\n\n==================================================\n5. HAPTIC AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerificare uso di:\n\nperformHapticFeedback(...)\n\nNo raw Vibrator path unless explicitly required.\n\nNo duplicate haptic for one accepted command.\n\nNo continuous MOVE haptic.\n\nNo unnecessary VIBRATE permission.\n\n==================================================\n6. LIFECYCLE / PERFORMANCE\n==================================================\n\nPatch must add:\n\nonResume refresh paths = 0\nkeep-alive paths = 0\nWakeLock paths = 0\npolling paths = 0\n\nGesture path must perform:\n\ndisk IO = 0\nPackageManager work = 0\nnetwork = 0\nbitmap decode = 0\n\n==================================================\n7. SECURITY\n==================================================\n\nVerify:\n\nreflection unnecessary = 0\ndynamic code loading = 0\nembedded credentials = 0\nbroad R8 keep rules added by patch = 0\n\n==================================================\n8. ROLLBACK\n==================================================\n\nDocument exact rollback:\n\npatch files\n+\nsingle integration hook\n\nRemoving those must restore Core V2.\n\nRollback:\nPASS/FAIL\n\n==================================================\n9. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 release = SUCCESS\nsnapshot validation = PASS\nSHA-256 validation = PASS\n\nNO adb.\nNO install.\n\n==================================================\n10. FINAL STATUS\n==================================================\n\nOnly if ALL gates PASS:\n\nPATCH 001 V2 status:\nVALIDATED\n\nThen freeze patch behavior.\n\nCreate/update:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/\nPATCH_001_V2_SENSITIVE_HOME_INTERACTION.md\n\nAdd:\n\nSTATUS: VALIDATED\nDEVICE: PASS\nCODE_SECURITY: PASS\nDEBUG: PASS\nR8: PASS\nROLLBACK: PASS\n\n==================================================\n11. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nOnly after validation PASS:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl checkpoint patch-001-sensitive-validated\n\n==================================================\n12. DO NOT CONTINUE\n==================================================\n\nAfter checkpoint:\n\nSTOP.\n\nDo not implement Search.\nDo not implement another patch.\nDo not refactor Core.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 001 V2 VALIDATION COMPLETE\n\nDevice validation: PASS\n\nCore logic modified by validation: <NO/YES>\nPatch runtime modified by validation: <NO/YES>\n\nCore writes: <n>\nHomeSnapshot writes: <n>\nPersistence writes: <n>\n\nGesture owners: <n>\nDuplicate input owners: <n>\nFirst-touch blockers: <n>\n\nMotion owners: <n>\nLegacy active motion paths: <n>\nDuplicate motion paths: <n>\n\nHaptic owners: <n>\nMOVE haptic paths: <n>\nDuplicate haptic paths: <n>\n\nLifecycle owners added: <n>\nKeep-alive paths: <n>\nMain-thread heavy gesture paths: <n>\n\nCode-security: <PASS/FAIL>\nRollback: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug build: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nR8 release: <SUCCESS/FAILED>\nSnapshot validation: <PASS/FAIL>\nSHA-256 validation: <PASS/FAIL>\n\nPATCH STATUS:\n<VALIDATED/FAILED>\n\nCheckpoint:\n<path/N-A>\n\nADB used: NO\nAPK installed: NO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:283:{"session_id":"01a01e42-5a29-7d01-b591-9fd51529f476","ts":1787214065,"text":"PATCH 002 V2 — FAV REVEAL SEARCH\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nBASE:\nCore V2\n+ PATCH 001 V2 SENSITIVE HOME INTERACTION [VALIDATED/FROZEN]\n\nCORE:\nFROZEN\n\nPATCH 001:\nFROZEN\n\nMANDATORY:\nApply MACHINA_PATCH_CODE_SECURITY_POLICY.md\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nAggiungere una seconda patch indipendente:\n\nSWIPE UP\n→ Fav si espande leggermente\n→ P1 NON si muove\n→ compare uno spazio Search tra Fav e P1\n→ Search bar diventa visibile e già pronta per l'input\n\nSWIPE DOWN\n→ Search si chiude\n→ Fav torna allo stato base\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nPATCH 001 unchanged.\n\n==================================================\n1. PATCH ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\npatches/fav_search/\n    FavSearchPatch.kt\n\nPrefer 1 file initially.\n\nPATCH 001 files modified:\n0\n\nCore logic modified:\n0\n\n==================================================\n2. GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nP1:\nFIXED\n\nP2:\nFIXED\n\nDock:\nFIXED\n\nFav:\nmay move/expand only as required to create Search space.\n\nCritical:\n\nP1 y-position delta = 0dp\nP2 y-position delta = 0dp\nDock y-position delta = 0dp\n\n==================================================\n3. EXPANSION TARGET\n==================================================\n\nIncrease the current Fav/Search area a little more than baseline.\n\nDo NOT use 60% display immediately.\n\nFirst target:\nsmall/moderate expansion sufficient for:\n\n- Search field\n- one compact result/history area later\n\nUse measured available space.\n\nNo overlap with P1.\n\n==================================================\n4. SEARCH VISIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nCOLLAPSED:\n\nSearch:\nNOT VISIBLE\n\nNo empty search line.\nNo cursor.\nNo keyboard.\n\nEXPANDED:\n\nSearch:\nVISIBLE\n\n==================================================\n5. SEARCH DESIGN\n==================================================\n\nSearch bar must be extremely minimal.\n\nVisual composition:\n\n[ magnifier ]  query text / cursor\n──────────────────────────────────\n\nONLY:\n\n- magnifier icon left\n- text input\n- one horizontal underline\n\nNO:\n\npill\nrounded search box\ncard\nbackground container\nfull border\nshadow\nfilled field\n\n==================================================\n6. MAGNIFIER\n==================================================\n\nMaterial search icon.\n\nSize:\napproximately 18–20dp.\n\nPosition:\nleft side.\n\nVertically aligned with input text.\n\n==================================================\n7. UNDERLINE\n==================================================\n\nSingle line only.\n\nRuns from after/under magnifier area toward right edge.\n\nApprox:\n1dp.\n\nUse current Machina/Material surface contrast.\n\nNo animation independent from Search reveal.\n\n==================================================\n8. INPUT READY\n==================================================\n\nWhen EXPANDED state is accepted:\n\nSearch field receives focus automatically.\n\nCursor:\nalready positioned in text input.\n\nKeyboard:\nopens automatically.\n\nUse current Compose APIs:\n\nFocusRequester\nSoftwareKeyboardController\n\nor appropriate equivalents.\n\n==================================================\n9. IMPORTANT IME TIMING\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT open keyboard during partial drag.\n\nPipeline:\n\nswipe UP\n→ expansion accepted\n→ settle completes / state becomes EXPANDED\n→ request focus\n→ show keyboard\n\nThis avoids layout jumps.\n\n==================================================\n10. IME GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nKeyboard must NOT move:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nFav/Search layout remains in approved expanded bounds.\n\nAudit WindowInsets/IME behavior.\n\n==================================================\n11. VERTICAL GESTURE\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 owns only:\n\nUP:\nreveal Fav/Search\n\nDOWN:\nhide Search / collapse\n\nDo NOT modify PATCH 001 LEFT/RIGHT gesture behavior.\n\n==================================================\n12. PATCH 001 LOCK\n==================================================\n\nLEFT Material Stretch:\nUNCHANGED\n\nRIGHT Material Stretch:\nUNCHANGED\n\nBack-arrow exclusion:\nUNCHANGED\n\nPATCH 001 haptic:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n13. VERTICAL MOTION\n==================================================\n\nUP/DOWN:\nNO Material Stretch.\n\nUse a bounded real-layout transition.\n\nOne progress owner.\n\n0f:\ncollapsed\n\n1f:\nexpanded\n\nNo second/duplicate motion engine.\n\n==================================================\n14. FAV / P1 RELATION\n==================================================\n\nExpanded:\n\nFav must remain visually separated from P1.\n\nThere must be a real Search gap between:\n\nFav.bottom\nand\nP1.top\n\nP1 itself stays fixed.\n\n==================================================\n15. SEARCH SLOT\n==================================================\n\nSearchSlot is real layout space.\n\nExpanded SearchSlot must contain Search field.\n\nCollapsed SearchSlot:\n0 or minimum height.\n\nNo negative height.\nNo overlap.\n\n==================================================\n16. SEARCH LOGIC — PHASE 1\n==================================================\n\nFor this patch implement only the input shell.\n\nRequired now:\n\n- field\n- focus\n- keyboard\n- query state\n\nDo NOT yet implement:\n\n- app results\n- web search\n- system settings results\n- history\n\nThese can be added after geometry/input is perfect.\n\n==================================================\n17. QUERY STATE\n==================================================\n\nPatch-local:\n\nquery: String\n\nNo persistence yet.\n\nNo HomeSnapshot writes.\n\n==================================================\n18. BACK\n==================================================\n\nWhen Search is expanded/focused:\n\nBack:\n1. clear focus\n2. hide keyboard\n3. collapse Search/Fav\n\nHome collapsed:\nexisting Home Back behavior remains.\n\n==================================================\n19. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nVertical expansion uses one hardware-adaptive haptic.\n\nUse:\n\nView.performHapticFeedback(\n    HapticFeedbackConstants.GESTURE_THRESHOLD_ACTIVATE\n)\n\nwhen UP/DOWN transition becomes committed.\n\nIf unavailable:\nCONFIRM once.\n\nNo haptic during MOVE.\n\nNo duplicate final CONFIRM.\n\n==================================================\n20. FIRST TOUCH SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nfirst tap still works.\n\nSearch field:\nfirst tap works.\n\nNo root input overlay consumes simple tap.\n\n==================================================\n21. PERFORMANCE\n==================================================\n\nDuring expansion:\n\ndisk IO = 0\nnetwork = 0\nPackageManager work = 0\nbitmap decode = 0\n\n==================================================\n22. CORE SECURITY\n==================================================\n\nHomeSnapshot writes:\n0\n\nLauncherPreferences writes:\n0\n\nAppCatalog writes:\n0\n\nNew lifecycle owners:\n0\n\nPersistence:\n0\n\nPATCH 001 modifications:\n0\n\n==================================================\n23. DEVICE TEST\n==================================================\n\nCOLLAPSED:\nSearch invisible.\n\nSWIPE UP:\nFav/Search area expands.\nP1 stays exactly still.\nSearch appears.\nCursor becomes active.\nKeyboard appears after accepted expansion.\n\nSWIPE DOWN:\nkeyboard hides.\nSearch disappears.\nFav returns baseline.\nP1 remains still.\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nexact same PATCH 001 behavior as before.\n\n==================================================\n24. BUILD\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n25. STATUS\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT validate immediately.\n\nAfter build:\n\nSTATUS:\nDEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 002 V2 FAV REVEAL SEARCH COMPLETE\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nCore logic modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nFav expansion owner:\n<n>\n\nSearch state owners:\n<n>\n\nCollapsed Search visibility:\n<HIDDEN/OTHER>\n\nExpanded Search visibility:\n<VISIBLE/OTHER>\n\nMagnifier:\n<YES/NO>\n\nUnderline only:\n<YES/NO>\n\nAuto focus:\n<YES/NO>\n\nCursor ready:\n<YES/NO>\n\nKeyboard auto-open:\n<YES/NO>\n\nKeyboard during partial drag:\n<NO/YES>\n\nP1 movement:\n<dp>\n\nP2 movement:\n<dp>\n\nDock movement:\n<dp>\n\nSearch overlap P1:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nLEFT/RIGHT regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nFirst-touch regression:\n<NONE/FOUND>\n\nCode-security:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nPATCH STATUS:\n<DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:284:{"session_id":"01a01e42-5a29-7d01-b591-9fd51529f476","ts":1787215461,"text":"FASE: PATCH 002 RUNTIME INTEGRATION CHECK\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREAD ONLY.\n\nVerificare:\n\n1. FavSearchPatch.kt esiste.\n2. FavSearchPatch ha un call-site runtime reale.\n3. Il call-site viene composto nella Home.\n4. PATCH 002 non è solo codice dead/non referenced.\n5. SearchSlot viene realmente composto.\n6. Search field viene realmente composto quando expanded.\n7. FocusRequester viene realmente eseguito.\n8. L'APK 2026-08-20_10-25-25 contiene PATCH 002.\n9. Nessun build successivo ha ripristinato una baseline precedente.\n\nOUTPUT:\n\nPATCH 002 RUNTIME CHECK\n\nPatch file present: <YES/NO>\nRuntime call-site: <path/symbol/NONE>\nPatch reachable from Home: <YES/NO>\nSearchSlot composed: <YES/NO>\nSearch field composed: <YES/NO>\nPatch dead/unreferenced: <YES/NO>\n\nBuild containing PATCH 002:\n<path>\n\nLikely cause:\n<OLD_APK / HOOK_MISSING / PATCH_NOT_REACHABLE / OTHER>\n\nProject modified:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:285:{"session_id":"01a01e42-5a29-7d01-b591-9fd51529f476","ts":1787215539,"text":"FASE: PATCH 002 REVEAL STATE / IME PATH AUDIT\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREAD ONLY.\n\nVerificare il runtime path esatto:\n\nswipe UP\n→ gesture recognized\n→ progress/state update\n→ expanded accepted\n→ Search visibility true\n→ FocusRequester.requestFocus()\n→ keyboardController.show()\n\nNON modificare codice.\n\n==================================================\n1. STATE\n==================================================\n\nRiporta:\n\n- tipo dello state che controlla expanded/collapsed\n- owner\n- valore iniziale\n- condizione esatta per diventare EXPANDED\n- condizione esatta per tornare COLLAPSED\n\n==================================================\n2. SWIPE UP THRESHOLD\n==================================================\n\nRiporta:\n\n- touchSlop\n- drag threshold\n- progress threshold\n- velocity threshold\n- release decision\n\nVerificare se uno swipe normale sul Pixel può effettivamente\nraggiungere EXPANDED.\n\n==================================================\n3. SEARCH VISIBILITY CONDITION\n==================================================\n\nRiporta la condizione esatta che compone:\n\nSearchSlot\nBasicTextField\n\nDistinguere:\n\nSearchSlot always composed?\nBasicTextField only when expanded?\n\n==================================================\n4. FOCUS PATH\n==================================================\n\nRiporta:\n\n- LaunchedEffect / SideEffect / callback usato\n- key\n- quando requestFocus() viene eseguito\n- quando keyboardController.show() viene eseguito\n\nVerificare se il focus path può essere saltato.\n\n==================================================\n5. IME\n==================================================\n\nVerificare:\n\n- BasicTextField enabled\n- focusable\n- not covered by another hit target\n- no clearFocus immediately after request\n- no BackHandler/state callback collapsing immediately\n\n==================================================\n6. LAYOUT\n==================================================\n\nRiporta SearchSlot bounds in:\n\nCOLLAPSED\nEXPANDED\n\nVerificare se BasicTextField è tecnicamente composto\nma:\n\n- altezza 0\n- clipped\n- outside parent bounds\n- behind another layer\n- alpha 0\n- invisible due to z-order\n\n==================================================\n7. STATIC ASSERTIONS\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\nexpanded state reachable: YES\nSearch field visible at expanded: YES\nSearch field bounds > 0: YES\nSearch field alpha > 0: YES\nSearch field above background layer: YES\nrequestFocus reachable: YES\nkeyboard show reachable: YES\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 REVEAL STATE AUDIT\n\nExpanded state owner: <value>\nInitial state: <value>\n\nUP threshold: <value>\nRelease threshold: <value>\nVelocity condition: <value>\n\nExpanded reachable by normal swipe:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearchSlot collapsed bounds:\n<value>\n\nSearchSlot expanded bounds:\n<value>\n\nBasicTextField composed condition:\n<value>\n\nBasicTextField expanded bounds:\n<value>\n\nClipping risk:\n<YES/NO>\n\nZ-order risk:\n<YES/NO>\n\nAlpha/visibility risk:\n<YES/NO>\n\nrequestFocus trigger:\n<value>\n\nrequestFocus reachable:\n<YES/NO>\n\nkeyboard show reachable:\n<YES/NO>\n\nImmediate collapse/reset path:\n<YES/NO>\n\nLikely root cause:\n<STATE_THRESHOLD / ZERO_BOUNDS / CLIPPING / FOCUS_PATH / IMMEDIATE_RESET / OTHER>\n\nProject modified:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:286:{"session_id":"01a01e67-609e-7143-851f-20a717288c4f","ts":1787216492,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — ROLLBACK PATCH 002 / RESTORE VALIDATED PATCH 001\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nVALIDATED BASELINE CHECKPOINT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\n2026-08-20_10-14-03-patch-001-sensitive-validated\n\nCURRENT PROBLEM:\n\nPATCH 002 Fav Reveal Search works visually,\nbut changed the previously approved UP/DOWN interaction.\n\nDEVICE DECISION:\n\nREJECT PATCH 002 CURRENT VERSION.\n\nOBJECTIVE:\n\nRemove PATCH 002 completely and restore EXACT behavior from\nvalidated PATCH 001 baseline.\n\n==================================================\n1. KEEP\n==================================================\n\nKEEP:\n\nCore V2\nPATCH 001 V2 Sensitive Home Interaction\n\nPATCH 001:\nVALIDATED / FROZEN\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE PATCH 002\n==================================================\n\nRemove:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\npatches/fav_search/FavSearchPatch.kt\n\nand ONLY the integration hook required by PATCH 002.\n\nRemove PATCH 002-only:\n\n- query state\n- SearchSlot reveal logic\n- FocusRequester\n- keyboard controller\n- BasicTextField\n- PATCH 002 Back handling\n- PATCH 002 vertical gesture owner\n- PATCH 002 haptic paths\n\n==================================================\n3. DO NOT TOUCH PATCH 001\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001 source:\nUNCHANGED\n\nLEFT behavior:\nUNCHANGED\n\nRIGHT behavior:\nUNCHANGED\n\nMaterial Stretch:\nUNCHANGED\n\ngesture exclusion:\nUNCHANGED\n\nhaptic:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n4. RESTORE OLD UP/DOWN BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nRestore exactly the behavior present at validated checkpoint.\n\nDo NOT redesign UP/DOWN.\n\nDo NOT add Search.\n\nDo NOT add new vertical gesture logic.\n\nUse checkpoint as source of truth.\n\n==================================================\n5. CORE SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nHomeSnapshot:\nUNCHANGED\n\nP1:\nUNCHANGED\n\nP2:\nUNCHANGED\n\nDock:\nUNCHANGED\n\nAppCatalog:\nUNCHANGED\n\nPersistence:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n6. PATCH 002 DOC\n==================================================\n\nDo not delete historical documentation.\n\nMark PATCH 002:\n\nSTATUS:\nREJECTED_DEVICE_TEST\n\nReason:\n\nchanged approved vertical motion / interaction.\n\n==================================================\n7. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n8. DEVICE BASELINE\n==================================================\n\nExpected after install:\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nsame validated PATCH 001 behavior\n\nUP/DOWN:\nsame behavior as before PATCH 002\n\nSearch:\nABSENT\n\nKeyboard:\nnot automatically opened\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nunchanged\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 002 ROLLBACK COMPLETE\n\nPATCH 002 runtime paths:\n<n>\n\nFavSearchPatch removed:\n<YES/NO>\n\nPATCH 002 integration hooks removed:\n<n>\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nCore modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nSearch paths:\n<n>\n\nKeyboard paths:\n<n>\n\nPATCH 002 vertical gesture owners:\n<n>\n\nValidated PATCH 001 behavior restored:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nPATCH 002 status:\nREJECTED_DEVICE_TEST"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:287:{"session_id":"01a01e67-609e-7143-851f-20a717288c4f","ts":1787216801,"text":"FASE: MACHINA — FREEZE PRE-SEARCH BASELINE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nVALIDATED CHECKPOINT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints/\n2026-08-20_10-14-03-patch-001-sensitive-validated\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nCongelare come baseline ufficiale:\n\nCore V2\n+\nPATCH 001 V2 Sensitive Home Interaction\n\nSENZA Search bar.\n\n==================================================\n1. BASELINE CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nKEEP:\n\n- Core V2\n- Home\n- Fav\n- P1 = 8\n- P2 = 8\n- Dock = 5\n- PATCH 001 validated interaction\n- LEFT/RIGHT Material behavior\n- launcher-root edge handling\n- approved haptic behavior\n\nSEARCH:\nABSENT\n\n==================================================\n2. REMOVE SEARCH PATCH RUNTIME\n==================================================\n\nEnsure runtime contains no PATCH 002 Search implementation.\n\nTarget:\n\nFavSearchPatch runtime paths = 0\nBasicTextField Search paths = 0\nSearch FocusRequester paths = 0\nSearch keyboard auto-open paths = 0\nSearch query state = 0\nSearch BackHandler paths = 0\n\nDo not remove historical docs.\n\n==================================================\n3. PATCH 001 HARD LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001:\n\nVALIDATED\nFROZEN\n\nDo not modify runtime behavior.\n\nDo not retune motion.\nDo not modify haptic.\nDo not modify gesture exclusion.\nDo not modify LEFT/RIGHT behavior.\n\n==================================================\n4. CORE LOCK\n==================================================\n\nCore logic:\nUNCHANGED\n\nHomeSnapshot:\nUNCHANGED\n\nAppCatalog:\nUNCHANGED\n\nLauncherPreferences:\nUNCHANGED\n\nLauncherActions:\nUNCHANGED\n\nP1/P2/Dock:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n5. SEARCH PATCH STATUS\n==================================================\n\nMark previous PATCH 002 documentation:\n\nSTATUS:\nREJECTED_DEVICE_TEST\n\nReason:\nSearch implementation changed approved interaction baseline.\n\nDo not count it as active patch.\n\n==================================================\n6. ACTIVE PATCH COUNT\n==================================================\n\nActive validated patches:\n\n1\n\nPATCH 001 V2:\nACTIVE / VALIDATED / FROZEN\n\nPATCH 002:\nINACTIVE / REJECTED\n\n==================================================\n7. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8:\nSUCCESS\n\nSnapshot validation:\nPASS\n\nSHA-256 validation:\nPASS\n\n==================================================\n8. CREATE BASELINE CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nOnly if build passes:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl checkpoint pre-search-baseline\n\n==================================================\n9. MARKER\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/PRE_SEARCH_BASELINE_FROZEN\n\nContents:\n\nMachina Pre-Search Baseline\nCore: V2\nActive Patch: PATCH 001 V2 Sensitive Home Interaction\nSearch: ABSENT\nStatus: VALIDATED / FROZEN\nDo not modify without explicit migration.\n\n==================================================\n10. FINAL AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nVerify:\n\nActive Search UI paths = 0\nActive Search state owners = 0\nActive Search keyboard paths = 0\n\nCore writes = 0\nPATCH 001 changes = 0\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PRE-SEARCH BASELINE FROZEN\n\nCore V2:\n<UNCHANGED/FAILED>\n\nPATCH 001:\n<VALIDATED_FROZEN/FAILED>\n\nActive patch count:\n<n>\n\nSearch runtime paths:\n<n>\n\nSearch state owners:\n<n>\n\nSearch keyboard paths:\n<n>\n\nPATCH 002 status:\n<REJECTED_DEVICE_TEST/OTHER>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nCheckpoint:\n<path>\n\nFreeze marker:\n<path>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:288:{"session_id":"01a01e67-609e-7143-851f-20a717288c4f","ts":1787217064,"text":"PATCH 002 V2 — SEARCH BAR UI ONLY\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nBASE:\nCore V2\n+ PATCH 001 V2 Sensitive Home Interaction [VALIDATED/FROZEN]\n\nCORE:\nFROZEN\n\nPATCH 001:\nVALIDATED / FROZEN\n\nMANDATORY:\nApply MACHINA_PATCH_CODE_SECURITY_POLICY.md\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nCreare una PATCH 002 completamente separata\nche contenga SOLO la Search bar e il suo stato UI.\n\nNON modificare PATCH 001.\n\nNON aggiungere gesture.\nNON aggiungere motion.\nNON modificare geometria Home.\nNON modificare P1/P2/Dock.\n\n==================================================\n1. PATCH LOCATION\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\npatches/search_bar/SearchBarPatch.kt\n\nPrefer:\n1 file.\n\n==================================================\n2. RESPONSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 owns only:\n\n- Search bar composable\n- query text state\n- FocusRequester\n- keyboard controller\n- cursor/focus behavior\n- Search visibility input supplied externally\n\nPATCH 002 does NOT own:\n\n- swipe UP\n- swipe DOWN\n- LEFT/RIGHT\n- Material Stretch\n- Home geometry\n- container expansion\n- P1/P2/Dock\n- App search results\n- history\n- web search\n- Settings search\n\n==================================================\n3. INTEGRATION CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nExpose one simple entry point.\n\nConcept:\n\n@Composable\nfun SearchBarPatch.Content(\n    visible: Boolean,\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,\n    onQueryChanged: (String) -> Unit = {}\n)\n\nor equivalent minimal API.\n\nThe caller decides WHEN Search is visible.\n\nPATCH 002 does not decide visibility through gestures.\n\n==================================================\n4. SEARCH DESIGN\n==================================================\n\nVisual:\n\nmagnifier on left\ncursor/input\nsingle underline\n\nConcept:\n\n[ 🔍  |type here...              ]\n─────────────────────────────────\n\nNO:\n\npill\ncard\nfilled background\nrounded search container\nfull outline\nshadow\n\n==================================================\n5. MAGNIFIER\n==================================================\n\nUse Material search icon.\n\nSize:\n18–20dp.\n\nPosition:\nleft.\n\nAligned with input baseline.\n\n==================================================\n6. UNDERLINE\n==================================================\n\nOne horizontal line only.\n\nThickness:\n~1dp.\n\nRuns across available Search width.\n\nUse current Machina/Material contrast token.\n\nNo border on top/left/right.\n\n==================================================\n7. TEXT INPUT\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nBasicTextField\n\nor the simplest appropriate Compose input primitive.\n\nSingle line.\n\nNo decorative container.\n\n==================================================\n8. QUERY STATE\n==================================================\n\nPatch-local:\n\nquery: String\n\nOwner:\n1\n\nPersistence:\n0\n\nNo HomeSnapshot writes.\n\n==================================================\n9. VISIBLE = FALSE\n==================================================\n\nWhen visible == false:\n\nSearch UI:\nNOT COMPOSED or fully inactive\n\nFocus:\ncleared\n\nKeyboard:\nhidden if PATCH 002 currently owns focus\n\nQuery:\nmay remain transient in-memory unless explicitly cleared.\n\nPreferred baseline:\nclear query when hidden.\n\n==================================================\n10. VISIBLE = TRUE\n==================================================\n\nWhen visible becomes true:\n\n1. compose Search bar\n2. request focus\n3. cursor ready\n4. show keyboard\n\nNo gesture required inside PATCH 002.\n\n==================================================\n11. FOCUS\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nFocusRequester\n\nSingle focus owner.\n\nrequestFocus only on:\n\nfalse -> true visibility transition\n\nDo not request focus continuously on recomposition.\n\n==================================================\n12. KEYBOARD\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nLocalSoftwareKeyboardController\n\nor current equivalent.\n\nShow keyboard only after Search becomes visible/focused.\n\nNo timer.\nNo artificial delay unless required by Compose focus lifecycle.\n\n==================================================\n13. BACK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 should NOT add a global BackHandler\nunless absolutely required.\n\nPreferred:\n\ncaller controls Search visibility.\n\nIf field loses focus:\nkeyboard may hide.\n\nBack/navigation ownership stays outside this patch.\n\n==================================================\n14. NO MOTION\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 adds:\n\ngesture owners = 0\nmotion owners = 0\noverscroll owners = 0\nspring paths = 0\ntween paths = 0\n\nNo animations.\n\n==================================================\n15. NO HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 adds:\n\nhaptic owners = 0\n\nTyping:\nno haptic.\n\nFocus:\nno haptic.\n\nVisibility:\nno haptic.\n\nCommand haptic remains owned by PATCH 001/future action layer.\n\n==================================================\n16. GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 receives available bounds via modifier.\n\nIt must not:\n\nchange parent height\nchange parent top/bottom\nmove Fav\nmove P1\nmove P2\nmove Dock\n\nIt only renders inside allocated SearchSlot.\n\n==================================================\n17. IME SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nKeyboard appearance must not directly mutate Home geometry.\n\nPATCH 002 must use normal Compose focus/IME behavior only.\n\nNo manual root translation.\n\nNo resize hacks inside patch.\n\n==================================================\n18. SEARCH ENGINE\n==================================================\n\nNOT INCLUDED.\n\nDo not implement:\n\nAppCatalog filtering\nresults\nhistory\nweb\nSettings\nranking\n\nThat will be PATCH 003.\n\n==================================================\n19. CORE ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nDirect writes:\n\nHomeSnapshot = 0\nLauncherPreferences = 0\nAppCatalog = 0\nP1/P2/Dock = 0\n\nNew lifecycle owners:\n0\n\n==================================================\n20. PATCH 001 LOCK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 001 files modified:\n0\n\nLEFT/RIGHT:\nunchanged\n\nMaterial Stretch:\nunchanged\n\ngesture exclusion:\nunchanged\n\nhaptic:\nunchanged\n\n==================================================\n21. ROLLBACK\n==================================================\n\nRemoving:\n\npatches/search_bar/SearchBarPatch.kt\n\n+\nsingle integration call\n\nrestores exact pre-Search baseline.\n\n==================================================\n22. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug:\nSUCCESS\n\nR8:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n23. PATCH DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\ndocs/PATCH_002_V2_SEARCH_BAR_UI.md\n\nDocument:\n\n- responsibilities\n- API\n- state owner\n- focus/IME\n- zero gesture ownership\n- zero motion ownership\n- rollback\n- code-security\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA PATCH 002 V2 SEARCH BAR UI COMPLETE\n\nPatch files: <n>\n\nPATCH 001 modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nCore modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nSearch query owners:\n<n>\n\nFocus owners:\n<n>\n\nKeyboard owners:\n<n>\n\nGesture owners added:\n<n>\n\nMotion owners added:\n<n>\n\nHaptic owners added:\n<n>\n\nMagnifier:\n<YES/NO>\n\nUnderline only:\n<YES/NO>\n\nAuto focus when visible:\n<YES/NO>\n\nCursor ready:\n<YES/NO>\n\nKeyboard auto-open:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHomeSnapshot writes:\n<n>\n\nPersistence writes:\n<n>\n\nP1 movement:\n<dp>\n\nP2 movement:\n<dp>\n\nDock movement:\n<dp>\n\nCode-security:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nPATCH STATUS:\n<DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED/FAILED>\n\nPatch doc:\ndocs/PATCH_002_V2_SEARCH_BAR_UI.md"}
