er.\n\nrequestFocus only on:\n\nfalse -> true visibility transition\n\nDo not request focus continuously on recomposition.\n\n==================================================\n12. KEYBOARD\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nLocalSoftwareKeyboardController\n\nor current equivalent.\n\nShow keyboard only after Search becomes visible/focused.\n\nNo timer.\nNo artificial delay unless required by Compose focus lifecycle.\n\n==================================================\n13. BACK\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 should NOT add a global BackHandler\nunless absolutely required.\n\nPreferred:\n\ncaller controls Search visibility.\n\nIf field loses focus:\nkeyboard may hide.\n\nBack/navigation ownership stays outside this patch.\n\n==================================================\n14. NO MOTION\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 adds:\n\ngesture owners = 0\nmotion owners = 0\noverscroll owners = 0\nspring paths = 0\ntween paths = 0\n\nNo animations.\n\n==================================================\n15. NO HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 adds:\n\nhaptic owners = 0\n\nTyping:\nno haptic.\n\nFocus:\nno haptic.\n\nVisibility:\nno haptic.\n\nCommand haptic remains owned by PATCH 001/future action layer.\n\n==================================================\n16. GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nPATCH 002 receives available bounds via modifier.\n\nIt must not:\n\nchange parent height\nchange parent top/bottom\nmove Fav\nmove P1\nmove P2\nmove Dock\n\nIt only renders inside allocated SearchSlot.\n\n==================================================\n17. IME SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nKeyboard appearance must not directly mutate Home geometry.\n\nPATCH 002 must use normal Compose focus/IME behavior only.\n\nNo manual root translation.\n\nNo resize hacks inside patch.\n\n========