/root/.codex/history.jsonl:339:{"session_id":"01a02097-ee2a-74f2-a2df-93e06602ed52","ts":1787256209,"text":"MACHINA HOME UI V3 — IMPLEMENT APPROVED REFERENCE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nREFERENCE:\n/mnt/data/824.png\n\nARCHITECTURE:\n\nCORE V3 = DATA / STATE / ACTIONS\nHOME UI V3 = PRESENTATION\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nUse the supplied reference image as the AUTHORITATIVE\nvisual target.\n\nDo NOT reproduce the current device skeleton.\nDo NOT restore PATCH009 architecture.\n\nImplement this appearance directly in Home UI V3.\n\n==================================================\n1. HARD ARCHITECTURE BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nCORE V3 owns:\n\n- AppCatalog\n- HomeSnapshot\n- P1/P2/Dock slot identities\n- persistence\n- LauncherActions\n- AppVisuals\n\nHOME UI V3 owns:\n\n- position\n- size\n- padding\n- gaps\n- colors\n- borders\n- corner radius\n- surfaces\n- empty states\n- visual hierarchy\n\nCore V3 must contain:\n\n0 dp values\n0 colors\n0 Compose layout\n0 corner-radius values\n0 Home geometry\n\n==================================================\n2. AUTHORITATIVE VISUAL STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nRender:\n\n        HOME CONTAINER\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │      Fav. apps      │\n    ├─────────────────────┤\n    │       Search        │\n    ├─────────────────────┤\n    │         P1          │\n    ├─────────────────────┤\n    │         P2          │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\n             GAP\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │        DOCK         │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\nDock is NOT a child of Home container.\n\n==================================================\n3. HOME POSITION\n==================================================\n\nHome module:\n\ncentered horizontally\n\nWidth target:\n~88–90% available screen width\n\nDo NOT:\n\nfillMaxWidth without outer margins\nfillMaxHeight\nuse fullscreen Surface\nstretch vertically using weight(1f)\n\nWallpaper must remain clearly visible around Home.\n\n==================================================\n4. HOME CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nOne outer Home container wrapping:\n\nFav\nSearch\nP1\nP2\n\nStyle baseline:\n\nbackground:\n#0F0F11 family\n\nborder:\n1dp subtle dark/light outline\n\ncorner radius:\n24dp\n\ninternal padding:\n16dp\n\ncontent-driven height.\n\n==================================================\n5. INTERNAL SPACING\n==================================================\n\nUse one spacing system.\n\nOuter padding:\n16dp\n\nFav -> Search:\n16dp\n\nSearch -> P1:\n16dp\n\nP1 -> P2:\n12–16dp\n\nNo stacked duplicate Spacer/padding values.\n\n==================================================\n6. FAV APPS\n==================================================\n\nFav header is its own rounded internal surface.\n\nContents:\n\nFav. apps\nApps <count>\n\nSettings icon:\nright aligned\n\nUse approved existing typography.\n\nFav background may contain the existing approved\nvisual/particle treatment.\n\nStyle:\n\ncorner radius:\n24dp\n\nsubtle border\n\nsame dark family as reference.\n\n==================================================\n7. FAV HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nMatch reference proportions.\n\nFav should be compact but visibly substantial.\n\nDo NOT make it as short as the current skeleton.\n\nDo NOT make it enormous.\n\nUse reference 824.png proportions as source of truth.\n\n==================================================\n8. SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nSearch is directly below Fav.\n\nCollapsed/normal visible shell follows current V3 Search state.\n\nApproved visual:\n\nmagnifier left\ntext/input\nsingle underline where applicable\n\nDo NOT turn Search into a generic oversized Material pill\nunless the existing approved implementation already requires it.\n\n==================================================\n9. SEARCH EXPANSION\n==================================================\n\nWhen Search is expanded:\n\nadditional Search space belongs BETWEEN:\n\nFav\nand\nSearchBar/P1\n\nUse:\n\nparticle network\nresults/history\nSearchBar\n\nRequired ordering:\n\nFav\n↓\nParticle + Results area\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n↓\nP2\n\n==================================================\n10. SEARCH GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nSearch expansion must NOT resize:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nP1 height delta:\n0dp\n\nP2 height delta:\n0dp\n\nDock height delta:\n0dp\n\nThe upper region expands/repositions as required.\n\n==================================================\n11. P1\n==================================================\n\nP1 is an independent rounded surface INSIDE Home container.\n\nSlots:\n8\n\nGrid:\n4 columns x 2 rows\n\nStyle:\n\ncorner radius:\n24dp\n\nsubtle border\n\ndark surface\n\ninternal padding:\n12dp\n\nDo NOT merge P1 visually with P2.\n\n==================================================\n12. P2\n==================================================\n\nSame contract as P1.\n\nSlots:\n8\n\nGrid:\n4 x 2\n\nCRITICAL:\n\nP1 height == P2 height\n\nP1 width == P2 width\n\nsame:\nbackground\nborder\nradius\npadding\nicon geometry\n\n==================================================\n13. EMPTY STATE\n==================================================\n\nIf P1/P2 contains no assigned apps:\n\nshow centered:\n\nsmall outline cube icon\n\n\"No apps in this section\"\n\n\"Add your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\"\n\nUse reference visual hierarchy.\n\nCube:\n~28–32dp\n\nPrimary:\nbodyMedium / medium emphasis\n\nSecondary:\nbodySmall / onSurfaceVariant\n\nNo giant empty-state illustration.\n\n==================================================\n14. POPULATED STATE\n==================================================\n\nWhen slot data exists:\n\nREMOVE empty-state content completely.\n\nRender actual Core V3 slot icons.\n\nDo not show:\n\nApps 0-style placeholder\nempty-state text\ncube\n\nbehind populated grid.\n\n==================================================\n15. DOCK — CRITICAL\n==================================================\n\nDock is completely OUTSIDE Home container.\n\nHierarchy must prove:\n\nHomeContainer(...)\nDock(...)\n\nNOT:\n\nHomeContainer {\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\n==================================================\n16. DOCK POSITION\n==================================================\n\nHome container bottom\n↓\n20dp approximately\n↓\nDock\n\nDock centered horizontally.\n\nWidth:\nsame visual family as Home container.\n\nDo not attach Dock to navigation bar.\n\n==================================================\n17. DOCK STYLE\n==================================================\n\nIndependent background.\n\nSlightly darker than Home container.\n\nStarting family:\n#0A0A0C\n\nCorner radius:\n24dp\n\nBorder:\nsubtle 1dp\n\nPadding:\n~12dp\n\nSlots:\n5\n\nOne row.\n\n==================================================\n18. DOCK DATA\n==================================================\n\nDock consumes Core V3 slot state.\n\nIf Core contains assignments:\nicons MUST appear.\n\nDo NOT render an empty black Dock merely because\nfirst-install initialization has not run.\n\nExisting persisted assignments take priority.\n\n==================================================\n19. APP ICONS\n==================================================\n\nAll:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nuse ONE AppVisualsV3 resolver.\n\nNo separate drawable loading.\n\nNo duplicate icon cache.\n\n==================================================\n20. TOUCH\n==================================================\n\nNormal icon tap:\nLauncherActionsV3\n\nLong press:\nSlotEditor V3\n\nSettings gear:\nSettings V3\n\nSearch:\nSearch V3\n\nNo presentation layer owns persistence.\n\n==================================================\n21. STATUS / NAVIGATION BARS\n==================================================\n\nWallpaper may draw edge-to-edge.\n\nHome content respects safe usable bounds.\n\nDo not position Home under status bar.\n\nDo not position Dock over gesture/navigation indicator.\n\n==================================================\n22. HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nThe reference is compact.\n\nDo NOT stretch Home vertically to consume available screen.\n\nUse measured/content-driven heights.\n\nWallpaper should remain visible:\n\nabove Home\nleft/right\nbetween Home and Dock\nbelow Dock\n\n==================================================\n23. COLORS\n==================================================\n\nReference hierarchy:\n\nwallpaper\n→ dark outer Home\n→ slightly differentiated internal panels\n→ darker external Dock\n\nAvoid:\n\nlight gray\nMaterial default cards\nopaque fullscreen background\n\n==================================================\n24. CORNERS\n==================================================\n\nUse one visual family.\n\nHome outer:\n24dp\n\nFav:\n24dp\n\nP1:\n24dp\n\nP2:\n24dp\n\nDock:\n24dp\n\nSearch:\nexisting approved shape\n\n==================================================\n25. BORDERS\n==================================================\n\nFav/P1/P2/Dock:\n\nsubtle ~1dp outline.\n\nNo thick border.\n\nNo bright white border.\n\n==================================================\n26. PARTICLES\n==================================================\n\nUse ONE existing V3 particle engine.\n\nFav visual:\nmay use configured visual effect if approved.\n\nSearch expanded:\nparticle network fills Search result area.\n\nSettings:\nsame engine, separate preset.\n\nDo not duplicate engine.\n\n==================================================\n27. DATA / UI SEPARATION\n==================================================\n\nHome UI V3 must receive state conceptually like:\n\nHomeUiState(\n    favCount,\n    p1Slots,\n    p2Slots,\n    dockSlots,\n    searchState\n)\n\nUI must not:\n\nread SharedPreferences\nquery PackageManager\nquery UsageStats\nwrite slots directly\n\n==================================================\n28. REMOVE CURRENT SKELETON PATH\n==================================================\n\nThe current device UI shown before this task is NOT the target.\n\nFind the active V3 skeleton Home implementation.\n\nReplace its presentation with this reference implementation.\n\nDo not leave two competing V3 Home composables active.\n\nActive Home UI owners:\n1\n\n==================================================\n29. OLD PATCH UI\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT call old PATCH009 UI.\n\nDo NOT call old PATCH002 layout.\n\nDo NOT use old Settings/Home visual owners.\n\nV3 may reuse extracted generic components only when\nthey have no patch ownership/state.\n\n==================================================\n30. STATIC ASSERTIONS\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nCore V3 Compose presentation imports:\n0\n\nHome UI persistence writes:\n0\n\nHome UI PackageManager calls:\n0\n\nHome UI UsageStats calls:\n0\n\nHome UI owners:\n1\n\nAppVisuals owners:\n1\n\nDock parent == HomeContainer:\nNO\n\nP1/P2 equal dimensions:\nYES\n\n==================================================\n31. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n32. DEVICE VALIDATION TARGET\n==================================================\n\nOn Pixel verify visually against 824.png:\n\nHOME:\n\n- centered\n- compact\n- correct width\n- wallpaper visible\n\nFAV:\n\n- correct proportions\n- Settings icon\n- count\n\nSEARCH:\n\n- correctly positioned\n- expanded Search works\n\nP1/P2:\n\n- same size\n- rounded\n- bordered\n- actual apps when assigned\n- empty state only when empty\n\nDOCK:\n\n- outside Home\n- independent dark surface\n- actual icons when assigned\n\nNo fullscreen container.\n\n==================================================\n33. DO NOT DELETE V2 YET\n==================================================\n\nAfter implementation:\n\ndo NOT delete archived V2/Core V2.\n\nFirst validate this Home UI V3 on Pixel.\n\nOnly after device PASS can legacy runtime files be removed.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME UI V3 REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE\n\nReference:\n824.png\n\nActive Home UI owners:\n<n>\n\nCore V3 presentation imports:\n<n>\n\nHome width:\n<value>\n\nHome height:\n<value>\n\nFav height:\n<value>\n\nSearch collapsed height:\n<value>\n\nSearch expanded height:\n<value>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDock size:\n<value>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome → Dock gap:\n<value>\n\nP1 slot count:\n<n>\n\nP2 slot count:\n<n>\n\nDock slot count:\n<n>\n\nExisting P1 data rendered:\n<YES/NO>\n\nExisting P2 data rendered:\n<YES/NO>\n\nExisting Dock data rendered:\n<YES/NO>\n\nEmpty state conditional:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome UI persistence writes:\n<n>\n\nHome UI PackageManager calls:\n<n>\n\nParticle engines:\n<n>\n\nOld PATCH009 UI runtime references:\n<n>\n\nCode-security:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nV3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:340:{"session_id":"01a02097-ee2a-74f2-a2df-93e06602ed52","ts":1787257132,"text":"MACHINA HOME UI V3 — DEVICE PARITY FIX\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nCURRENT DEVICE REFERENCE:\n/mnt/data/825.png\n\nTARGET REFERENCE:\n/mnt/data/824.png\n\nMODE:\nUI V3 REPLACEMENT / DEVICE PARITY\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n825.png = CURRENT WRONG DEVICE RESULT\n824.png = AUTHORITATIVE TARGET\n\nDo NOT reinterpret the target.\nDo NOT redesign it.\nDo NOT patch the current skeleton with arbitrary spacers.\n\nReplace the active Home UI V3 composition so that its geometry\nand hierarchy match 824.png.\n\nCORE V3:\nDO NOT MODIFY SEMANTICS\n\nLEGACY V2/PATCHES:\nDO NOT REACTIVATE\n\n==================================================\n1. FIRST AUDIT ACTIVE UI OWNER\n==================================================\n\nBefore modification identify exactly:\n\n- MainActivity V3 entry\n- active MachinaHomeV3 composable\n- active Home container composable\n- Fav composable\n- Search composable\n- P1/P2 composable\n- Dock composable\n\nConfirm whether any old skeleton/placeholder implementation\nis still the runtime owner.\n\nThere must be ONE Home UI owner after fix.\n\n==================================================\n2. CURRENT DEVICE DEFECTS\n==================================================\n\n825.png currently shows:\n\n- Home too wide/tall\n- excessive vertical spacing\n- Fav visual background missing\n- Search rendered as bare text + underline\n- Search target surface missing\n- P1 title missing\n- P2 title missing\n- P1/P2 too tall\n- empty states oversized vertically\n- Dock empty\n- target visual density not reproduced\n\nAll must be addressed.\n\n==================================================\n3. TARGET HIERARCHY\n==================================================\n\n824.png hierarchy:\n\nHOME OUTER CONTAINER\n\n    Fav surface\n\n    gap\n\n    Search surface\n\n    gap\n\n    P1 surface\n\n    small gap\n\n    P2 surface\n\nEND HOME OUTER CONTAINER\n\n20dp approx gap\n\nDOCK SURFACE\n\nDock is OUTSIDE Home outer container.\n\n==================================================\n4. HOME OUTER CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\ncompact centered module.\n\nWidth:\nderive from reference proportions.\n\nStarting target:\n~86–88% screen width\n\nDo NOT fill display width.\n\nCorner radius:\n~24dp\n\nBackground:\nvery dark, approximately current Home family\n\nBorder:\nsubtle ~1dp\n\nInternal padding:\n12–16dp\n\nHeight:\nWRAP CONTENT / measured from children.\n\nFORBIDDEN:\n\nfillMaxHeight()\nweight(1f) on Home container\nlarge minHeight\nscreen-height derived fixed Home height\n\n==================================================\n5. VERTICAL POSITION\n==================================================\n\nKeep Home approximately in the lower-middle region\nas shown in target.\n\nDo not force it to top.\n\nDo not use hardcoded absolute screen Y coordinates.\n\nUse available-height arrangement/constraints while respecting\nsystem insets.\n\nDock remains below Home.\n\n==================================================\n6. FAV TARGET\n==================================================\n\nMatch 824.png.\n\nFav is a distinct rounded surface.\n\nContains:\n\nFav. apps\nApps <count>\nSettings gear\n\nTitle left.\nCount directly below.\nGear right.\n\nRestore existing approved Fav visual background/animation\ninstead of plain black surface.\n\nFav target height:\ncompact, approximately reference proportion.\n\nDo NOT use current oversized blank header.\n\n==================================================\n7. FAV VISUAL BACKGROUND\n==================================================\n\nFind the existing V3-compatible visual component or extracted\ngeneric visual previously used for Fav.\n\nRestore it inside Fav surface.\n\nDo NOT reactivate old PATCH runtime owner.\n\nIf the visual component is generic and stateless:\nreuse it.\n\nNo bitmap/static wallpaper replacement if current approved\nimplementation is animated.\n\n==================================================\n8. SEARCH TARGET\n==================================================\n\nCURRENT 825.png bare:\n\nmagnifier + Search + underline\n\nis NOT target presentation.\n\nTarget 824.png shows a dedicated rounded Search surface.\n\nRender Search inside its own dark rounded surface.\n\nContents:\n\nmagnifier left\nSearch apps... / query\n\nCorner family:\nsame visual language as other surfaces.\n\nCompact height.\n\nDo not make it fullscreen width outside Home.\n\n==================================================\n9. SEARCH FUNCTIONAL CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nSearch V3 functionality remains separate.\n\nUI only consumes:\n\nquery\nexpanded state\ncallbacks\n\nDo not put filtering/history logic into Home UI.\n\n==================================================\n10. P1 TARGET\n==================================================\n\nP1 MUST display:\n\n\"P1\"\n\nat top-left INSIDE P1 surface.\n\nCurrent device version missing title is incorrect.\n\nP1 surface:\n\nrounded\nbordered\ndark\ncompact\n\nWhen empty:\n\nsmall cube centered\n\"No apps in this section\"\nsecondary line\n\n==================================================\n11. P2 TARGET\n==================================================\n\nSame as P1.\n\nMust display:\n\n\"P2\"\n\ntop-left.\n\nRequired:\n\nP1 width == P2 width\nP1 height == P2 height\nP1 padding == P2 padding\nP1 radius == P2 radius\n\n==================================================\n12. REDUCE P1/P2 HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nCurrent 825.png P1/P2 are too tall.\n\nReduce empty-state section height to target reference.\n\nDo not derive empty P1/P2 height from remaining screen space.\n\nUse one shared fixed/tuned section height appropriate\nfor both empty and populated 2x4 grids.\n\nNo weight(1f).\n\n==================================================\n13. EMPTY STATE SCALE\n==================================================\n\nCurrent empty state should be compacted to target.\n\nCube:\n~28–32dp\n\nPrimary:\nNo apps in this section\n\nSecondary:\nAdd your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\n\nDo not let text determine excessive panel height.\n\n==================================================\n14. POPULATED P1/P2\n==================================================\n\nWhen Core V3 contains apps:\n\n2 rows\n4 columns\n\n8 slots.\n\nThe same P1/P2 panel dimensions must support the grid.\n\nEmpty and populated states must NOT change outer section size.\n\n==================================================\n15. DOCK TARGET\n==================================================\n\nDock remains OUTSIDE Home.\n\nBut current empty black rectangle is NOT acceptable\nif Core V3 has/migrates assignments.\n\nDock target:\n\n5 slots\none row\ncompact\nrounded\nindependent dark surface\n\nUse AppVisualsV3.\n\n==================================================\n16. DOCK DATA PATH AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nAudit why 825.png Dock is empty.\n\nDetermine:\n\nA. Core V3 snapshot actually has 0 Dock assignments\nor\nB. assignments exist but UI is not rendering them\nor\nC. V2 persistence migration failed\nor\nD. FirstInstall V3 did not initialize\n\nREPORT exact cause.\n\nDo NOT hide the problem with placeholder icons.\n\n==================================================\n17. P1/P2 DATA PATH AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSame audit for P1/P2.\n\nReport:\n\nCore snapshot slot count\nresolved package count\nrendered icon count\n\nDo not modify UI to fake populated state.\n\n==================================================\n18. TARGET SPACING\n==================================================\n\nUse a small shared token set.\n\nStarting values:\n\nHome padding:\n12–16dp\n\nFav → Search:\n12–16dp\n\nSearch → P1:\n12–16dp\n\nP1 → P2:\n8–12dp\n\nHome → Dock:\n~16–20dp\n\nDo not stack multiple spacing modifiers.\n\n==================================================\n19. TARGET COLORS\n==================================================\n\nUse reference hierarchy:\n\nHome outer:\n#0F0F11 family\n\ninternal Fav/P1/P2/Search:\nslightly lighter surface family\n\nDock:\n#0A0A0C family\n\nUse theme tokens where available.\n\nNo bright Material default surface.\n\n==================================================\n20. TARGET CORNERS\n==================================================\n\nHome outer:\n~24dp\n\nFav:\n~24dp\n\nSearch:\nrounded target matching reference\n\nP1:\n~24dp\n\nP2:\n~24dp\n\nDock:\n~24dp\n\nOne coherent family.\n\n==================================================\n21. SEARCH EXPANDED STATE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT solve expanded Search in this visual parity fix\nby permanently reserving blank space.\n\nCollapsed target must first match 824.png.\n\nExpanded Search may insert its Results/Particle region between:\n\nFav\nand\nSearch surface\n\nwhile preserving P1/P2/Dock dimensions.\n\n==================================================\n22. PARTICLE ENGINE\n==================================================\n\nKeep one shared V3 particle engine.\n\nFav:\napproved visual preset\n\nSearch expanded:\nSearch preset\n\nSettings:\nSettings preset\n\nDo not duplicate engine.\n\n==================================================\n23. CORE/UI SEPARATION\n==================================================\n\nHome UI must NOT:\n\nread persistence\nquery PackageManager\nquery UsageStats\nresolve defaults\nrank apps\n\nCore/features provide state.\n\nUI renders state.\n\n==================================================\n24. LEGACY ISOLATION\n==================================================\n\nActive runtime calls to old:\n\nPATCH002 layout\nPATCH003 UI\nPATCH004 owner\nPATCH009 UI\n\nmust remain 0.\n\nGeneric extracted visual components are allowed only if\nthey no longer carry patch ownership/state.\n\n==================================================\n25. STATIC UI ASSERTIONS\n==================================================\n\nAfter fix:\n\nActive Home UI owners = 1\n\nHome fillMaxHeight = 0\nP1/P2 weight expansion = 0\n\nP1 title visible = YES\nP2 title visible = YES\n\nFav visual background = YES\nSearch rounded surface = YES\n\nDock parent HomeContainer = NO\n\nP1 height == P2 height = YES\n\n==================================================\n26. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n27. DO NOT CHECKPOINT YET\n==================================================\n\nThis requires Pixel visual validation.\n\nStatus:\n\nV3_DEVICE_VISUAL_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME UI V3 DEVICE PARITY FIX COMPLETE\n\nCurrent reference:\n825.png\n\nTarget reference:\n824.png\n\nActive Home owner before:\n<path>\n\nActive Home owner after:\n<path>\n\nOld skeleton owner removed:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome width:\n<value>\n\nHome height:\n<value>\n\nFav height:\n<value>\n\nFav visual background:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch presentation:\n<ROUNDED_SURFACE/OTHER>\n\nP1 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nP2 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDock data source:\n<value>\n\nDock assignments in Core:\n<n>/5\n\nDock icons rendered:\n<n>/5\n\nP1 assignments in Core:\n<n>/8\n\nP1 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 assignments in Core:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nEmpty Dock root cause:\n<value>\n\nEmpty P1/P2 root cause:\n<value>\n\nHome fillMaxHeight paths:\n<n>\n\nP1/P2 weight expansion paths:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH UI runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nCore/UI boundary:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nV3_DEVICE_VISUAL_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:341:{"session_id":"01a020dd-c245-7503-b8ff-57a6cbc97ccf","ts":1787257805,"text":"FASE: MACHINA V3 — CLEAN PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\nOLD SOURCE:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nNEW ROOT:\n/opt/Machina\n\nNEW PROJECT:\n/opt/Machina/project\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina is READ ONLY.\n\nA full backup already exists under:\n/opt/Machina/backups/\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nCreate a clean Machina V3 project structure.\n\nDo NOT copy the complete V2 project into V3.\n\nV2 is reference/source material only.\n\n==================================================\nTARGET\n==================================================\n\n/opt/Machina/\n  project/\n  backups/\n  checkpoints/\n  snapshots/\n  outputs/\n  docs/\n  archive/\n  projectctl\n\nInside project source:\n\nit/gaetano/machinahome/\n\n  core/\n    catalog/\n    model/\n    persistence/\n    actions/\n    visuals/\n    defaults/\n    initialization/\n\n  ui/\n    home/\n    search/\n    settings/\n    picker/\n    components/\n    theme/\n\n  features/\n    search/\n    sloteditor/\n    settings/\n    firstinstall/\n    particles/\n\n==================================================\nCORE RULE\n==================================================\n\nCore owns:\n\nAppCatalog\nHomeSnapshot\nP1/P2/Dock identities\npersistence\nLauncherActions\ndefault-app resolution\ninitialization\n\nCore owns NO:\n\nCompose geometry\ndp\ncolors\npadding\ncorners\nanimations\nHome positioning\n\n==================================================\nUI RULE\n==================================================\n\nUI owns all presentation.\n\nHome:\n\n[ HomeContainer\n    Fav\n    Search\n    P1\n    P2\n]\n\n[ Dock ]\n\nDock is external.\n\n==================================================\nMIGRATION RULE\n==================================================\n\nRecover from V2 only after auditing each component.\n\nCandidates:\n\nAppCatalog\nslot persistence format\nLauncherActions\nicon resolver\nSearch algorithm\nparticle engine\nlegacy Settings icons\nSettings visual\nSlot Editor behavior\nUsageStats ranking\n\nDo NOT copy:\n\nPATCH architecture\ndead experiments\nlegacy duplicate owners\nPATCH 001-009 packages\nold Home geometry\nold skeleton UI\n\n==================================================\nFIRST OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT implement features yet.\n\nCreate structure and report:\n\nMACHINA V3 CLEAN ROOT READY\n\nOld project modified: NO\n\nNew root:\n<path>\n\nNew project:\n<path>\n\nBackup found:\n<YES/NO>\n\nCore directories:\n<list>\n\nUI directories:\n<list>\n\nFeature directories:\n<list>\n\nV2 source copied:\n0 expected\n\nReady for selective migration:\n<YES/NO>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:342:{"session_id":"01a020dd-c245-7503-b8ff-57a6cbc97ccf","ts":1787257983,"text":"FASE: MACHINA V3 — CORE + UI PARALLEL IMPLEMENTATION\n\nOLD PROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nNEW ROOT:\n/opt/Machina\n\nNEW PROJECT:\n/opt/Machina/project\n\nOLD PROJECT MODE:\nREAD ONLY\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nBuild Machina V3 with CORE and UI developed IN PARALLEL.\n\nDo NOT build Core completely first and UI later.\n\nFor every functional slice:\n\n1. define Core contract\n2. implement minimal Core behavior\n3. implement corresponding UI\n4. connect them\n5. build\n6. verify ownership\n7. continue to next slice\n\nNo PATCH 00x architecture.\n\n==================================================\n0. BACKUP\n==================================================\n\nBefore creating/modifying V3:\n\nverify a full backup exists under:\n\n/opt/Machina/backups/\n\nIf no valid full backup of /opt/Android/Machina exists:\nSTOP.\n\nDo not modify old project.\n\n==================================================\n1. ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nDirection:\n\nUI\n↓\nFeatures/controllers\n↓\nCore\n\nCore must never import UI.\n\nUI must never directly access persistence,\nPackageManager, UsageStats, or role resolution.\n\n==================================================\n2. FIRST PARALLEL SLICE — HOME DATA + HOME SHELL\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\nCreate:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nSlotId\nSlotSection\nSlotRepository interface\n\nHard contract:\n\nP1 = 8\nP2 = 8\nDock = 5\n\nUI:\n\nCreate simultaneously:\n\nMachinaHome\nFavSection\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nInitial target:\n\n[ HomeContainer\n    Fav\n    P1\n    P2\n]\n\n[ Dock outside ]\n\nUI must already render actual HomeSnapshot state.\n\nDo not use fake duplicate slot state.\n\n==================================================\n3. SECOND PARALLEL SLICE — APP CATALOG + ICONS\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\nAppCatalog\nAppVisuals\n\nExpose launchable app metadata and resolved icon model.\n\nUI:\n\nP1/P2/Dock consume AppVisuals.\n\nOne icon resolver owner.\n\nNo PackageManager access from UI.\n\n==================================================\n4. THIRD PARALLEL SLICE — SLOT PERSISTENCE + EDITOR\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\nSlotRepository implementation.\n\nSupport:\n\nload slots\nassign slot\nclear slot\n\nPreserve existing V2 slot data if compatible.\n\nFEATURE:\n\nSlotEditor controller.\n\nUI:\n\nlong press P1/P2/Dock\n→ App Picker\n→ select/remove app\n\nNormal tap:\nLauncherActions\n\n==================================================\n5. FOURTH PARALLEL SLICE — SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nCORE/FEATURE:\n\nSearchEngine\n\nUses AppCatalog.\n\nOwns:\n\nquery processing\nranking\nresults\nhistory max 3 MEMORY_ONLY\n\nUI:\n\nSearchArea\n\nCollapsed:\nminimal/hidden\n\nExpanded:\n\nparticle/results area\nSearchBar at bottom\n\nP1/P2/Dock dimensions unchanged.\n\n==================================================\n6. SEARCH VISUAL CONTRACT\n==================================================\n\nExpanded order:\n\nFav\n\nParticle + Results area\n\nSearchBar\n\nP1\n\nP2\n\nDock outside Home\n\nSearch results:\nabove SearchBar.\n\n==================================================\n7. FIFTH PARALLEL SLICE — PARTICLES\n==================================================\n\nUI COMPONENT:\n\nAnimatedParticleNetwork\n\nOne engine.\n\nUsed by:\n\nSearch\nSettings\n\nNo touch.\n\nNo persistence.\n\nNo bitmap wallpaper.\n\n==================================================\n8. SIXTH PARALLEL SLICE — SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nFEATURE:\n\nSettingsStore / SettingsController\n\nOne preference owner.\n\nUI:\n\nSettings visual built simultaneously.\n\nKeep approved visual language:\n\nlegacy icons\nDynamic Color\ncompact panel\nparticle background\n\nNo PATCH/debug text in normal UI.\n\n==================================================\n9. SEVENTH PARALLEL SLICE — FIRST INSTALL\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\nDefaultAppsResolver\nFirstInstallInitializer\n\nDock:\n\n0 Phone\n1 Messages\n2 Browser\n3 Music\n4 Mail\n\nP1:\ntop 8 usage-ranked eligible apps\n\nP2:\nnext 8\n\nUI:\n\nminimal first-run flow if needed.\n\nDo not reorder after established layout.\n\n==================================================\n10. HOME UI AUTHORITATIVE TARGET\n==================================================\n\nUse approved reference geometry:\n\nHomeContainer\n├── Fav\n├── SearchArea\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\nDock outside.\n\nHome:\ncentered\ncompact\nnot fullscreen\n\nP1/P2:\nsame size\n\nDock:\nindependent dark surface\n\n==================================================\n11. CORE OWNERSHIP TARGET\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nAppCatalog owners = 1\nHomeSnapshot owners = 1\nSlotRepository owners = 1\nLauncherActions owners = 1\nAppVisuals owners = 1\nDefaultAppsResolver owners = 1\n\n==================================================\n12. FEATURE OWNERSHIP TARGET\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nSearchEngine owners = 1\nSearch history owners = 1\nParticle engines = 1\nSettings preference owners = 1\nSlot editor owners = 1\nFirst-install owners = 1\n\n==================================================\n13. UI OWNERSHIP TARGET\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nHome UI owners = 1\nSearch UI owners = 1\nSettings UI owners = 1\nApp Picker owners = 1\n\nNo competing old skeleton UI.\n\n==================================================\n14. NO LEGACY RUNTIME\n==================================================\n\nV3 must not call runtime code from:\n\npatches/001...\n...\npatches/009...\n\nOld project is reference only.\n\nGeneric algorithms may be reimplemented after audit,\nnot linked through old patch ownership.\n\n==================================================\n15. BUILD AFTER EACH SLICE\n==================================================\n\nAfter every slice:\n\n/opt/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired before continuing:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\n\nDo not accumulate multiple broken slices.\n\n==================================================\n16. FINAL BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n17. STATUS DOCUMENT\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Machina/docs/V3_STATUS.md\n\nTrack slices:\n\nHOME\nCATALOG\nSLOTS\nSEARCH\nPARTICLES\nSETTINGS\nFIRST_INSTALL\n\nAllowed:\n\nNOT_STARTED\nIMPLEMENTED\nDEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\nVALIDATED\n\n==================================================\n18. OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA V3 PARALLEL CORE/UI IMPLEMENTATION\n\nBackup verified:\n<YES/NO>\n\nOld project modified:\nNO\n\nHOME slice:\n<status>\n\nCATALOG slice:\n<status>\n\nSLOTS slice:\n<status>\n\nSEARCH slice:\n<status>\n\nPARTICLES slice:\n<status>\n\nSETTINGS slice:\n<status>\n\nFIRST_INSTALL slice:\n<status>\n\nAppCatalog owners:\n<n>\n\nHomeSnapshot owners:\n<n>\n\nSlotRepository owners:\n<n>\n\nAppVisuals owners:\n<n>\n\nSearchEngine owners:\n<n>\n\nParticle engines:\n<n>\n\nSettings preference owners:\n<n>\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nCore imports UI:\n<n>\n\nUI direct persistence accesses:\n<n>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nV3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:343:{"session_id":"01a020dd-c245-7503-b8ff-57a6cbc97ccf","ts":1787260645,"text":"FASE: MACHINA V3 — HOME UI AUTHORITATIVE REFERENCE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Machina/project\n\nVISUAL REFERENCE:\n824.png\n\nIMPORTANT:\n824.png IS THE AUTHORITATIVE HOME UI TARGET.\n\nDo not use:\n- previous V3 skeleton\n- old PATCH009 runtime UI\n- previous device screenshots\nas visual targets.\n\nCORE and UI remain separate.\n\n==================================================\n1. REQUIRED STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav. apps\n├── Search\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\n20dp approximately\n\nDOCK\n(outside Home container)\n\nThis hierarchy is mandatory.\n\n==================================================\n2. HOME CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nCentered horizontally.\n\nCompact.\nNOT fullscreen.\n\nTarget width:\napproximately 88–90% usable display width.\n\nHeight:\ncontent-driven.\n\nBackground:\nvery dark.\n\nCorner radius:\n~24dp.\n\nBorder:\nsubtle ~1dp.\n\nInternal padding:\napproximately 12–16dp.\n\nWallpaper remains visible around the entire module.\n\n==================================================\n3. FAV. APPS\n==================================================\n\nFirst section inside Home.\n\nIndependent rounded surface.\n\nContents:\n\nFav. apps\nApps <count>\n\nSettings gear at right.\n\nMatch 824.png proportions.\n\nKeep the approved animated/visual background in Fav.\n\nFav must NOT become a plain black empty rectangle.\n\nRounded corners:\n~24dp.\n\n==================================================\n4. SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nImmediately below Fav.\n\nMatch 824.png:\n\nrounded dark Search surface\nmagnifier left\nSearch apps... / query\n\nCompact height.\n\nSame internal width as P1/P2.\n\nDo NOT render only:\n\nmagnifier + text + underline\n\nas in the rejected device implementation.\n\n==================================================\n5. P1\n==================================================\n\nIndependent rounded surface.\n\nTitle:\n\nP1\n\ntop-left.\n\n8 slots:\n4 columns x 2 rows.\n\nWhen empty:\n\nsmall outline cube\n\nNo apps in this section\n\nAdd your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\n\n==================================================\n6. P2\n==================================================\n\nIdentical geometry to P1.\n\nTitle:\n\nP2\n\ntop-left.\n\n8 slots:\n4 columns x 2 rows.\n\nRequired:\n\nP1 width == P2 width\nP1 height == P2 height\nP1 radius == P2 radius\nP1 padding == P2 padding\n\n==================================================\n7. P1/P2 HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT stretch P1/P2 using available screen height.\n\nNo:\n\nweight(1f)\nfillMaxHeight()\nlarge minHeight\n\nUse compact fixed/measured dimensions capable of holding\nthe 2x4 app grid.\n\nEmpty state must use the SAME section dimensions.\n\n==================================================\n8. INTERNAL GAPS\n==================================================\n\nFollow 824.png.\n\nStarting tokens:\n\nFav -> Search:\n16dp\n\nSearch -> P1:\n12–16dp\n\nP1 -> P2:\n8–12dp\n\nOuter Home padding:\n12–16dp\n\nUse one spacing owner.\n\n==================================================\n9. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock is NOT inside Home container.\n\nRequired hierarchy in Compose:\n\nColumn {\n    HomeContainer(...)\n    Spacer(~20dp)\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\nNOT:\n\nHomeContainer {\n    ...\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\n==================================================\n10. DOCK STYLE\n==================================================\n\nIndependent rounded dark surface.\n\n5 slots.\n\n1 row x 5 columns.\n\nSlightly darker than Home internal surfaces.\n\nCorner radius:\n~24dp.\n\nBorder:\nsubtle.\n\nCompact height.\n\nUse actual Core slot data.\n\n==================================================\n11. DATA\n==================================================\n\nUI must render actual Core state.\n\nIf P1 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf P2 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf Dock has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nEmpty-state appears ONLY when corresponding section is\nactually empty.\n\nDo NOT use placeholder icons to fake populated state.\n\n==================================================\n12. CORE / UI BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nCORE owns:\n\nAppCatalog\nHomeSnapshot\nslot persistence\nLauncherActions\nAppVisuals\ndefault-app resolution\nfirst-install initialization\n\nUI owns:\n\ndimensions\nposition\nsurfaces\nborders\ncolors\nradii\nspacing\nempty-state presentation\n\nUI direct persistence:\n0\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n0\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n0\n\n==================================================\n13. SEARCH EXPANSION\n==================================================\n\nCollapsed Home must FIRST match 824.png.\n\nWhen Search expands later:\n\nFav\n↓\nparticle/results area\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n↓\nP2\n\nP1/P2 dimensions remain unchanged.\n\nDock remains external.\n\nDo NOT reserve expanded Search space while collapsed.\n\n==================================================\n14. PARTICLE VISUAL\n==================================================\n\nUse one shared particle engine.\n\nFav:\napproved visual preset.\n\nExpanded Search:\nnetwork particles + results.\n\nSettings:\nSettings preset.\n\nDo not duplicate the particle engine.\n\n==================================================\n15. COLOR HIERARCHY\n==================================================\n\nMatch reference:\n\nWallpaper\n\n→ Home outer dark container\n\n→ Fav/Search/P1/P2 dark internal surfaces\n\n→ Dock independent darker surface\n\nDo not use default Material cards that visibly change\nthe reference appearance.\n\n==================================================\n16. SYSTEM BARS\n==================================================\n\nWallpaper:\nedge-to-edge allowed.\n\nHome content:\nrespect safe bounds.\n\nNo overlap with status bar.\n\nDock:\nstay above navigation/gesture safe region.\n\n==================================================\n17. SINGLE HOME OWNER\n==================================================\n\nFind current active V3 Home skeleton.\n\nReplace it.\n\nAfter implementation:\n\nHome UI owners = 1\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners = 0\n\nOld PATCH009 UI runtime references = 0\n\n==================================================\n18. DO NOT IMPORT OLD PATCH ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nDo not restore PATCH 001–009 packages.\n\nIf old source contains a useful generic algorithm/component:\n\nextract/reimplement it under V3 ownership.\n\nNo PATCH runtime dependency.\n\n==================================================\n19. VISUAL ACCEPTANCE\n==================================================\n\nCompare implementation against 824.png.\n\nRequired:\n\nHome compact:\nYES\n\nHome centered:\nYES\n\nWallpaper visible:\nYES\n\nFav rounded surface:\nYES\n\nFav visual background:\nYES\n\nSearch rounded surface:\nYES\n\nP1 title visible:\nYES\n\nP2 title visible:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 equal:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 compact:\nYES\n\nDock outside:\nYES\n\nDock populated from Core:\nYES when assignments exist\n\nNo fullscreen Home:\nYES\n\n==================================================\n20. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n21. DEVICE GATE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT freeze UI yet.\n\nDo NOT delete V2 backup/reference.\n\nAfter build:\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME UI V3 AUTHORITATIVE REFERENCE COMPLETE\n\nReference:\n824.png\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nHome width:\n<value>\n\nHome height:\n<value>\n\nFav size:\n<value>\n\nFav visual background:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch size:\n<value>\n\nSearch presentation:\n<ROUNDED_SURFACE/OTHER>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nP2 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nDock size:\n<value>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome -> Dock gap:\n<value>\n\nP1 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP1 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nDock assignments:\n<n>/5\n\nDock icons rendered:\n<n>/5\n\nUI direct persistence:\n<n>\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n<n>\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n<n>\n\nCore/UI separation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
