=================\n\nUI must render actual Core state.\n\nIf P1 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf P2 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf Dock has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nEmpty-state appears ONLY when corresponding section is\nactually empty.\n\nDo NOT use placeholder icons to fake populated state.\n\n==================================================\n12. CORE / UI BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nCORE owns:\n\nAppCatalog\nHomeSnapshot\nslot persistence\nLauncherActions\nAppVisuals\ndefault-app resolution\nfirst-install initialization\n\nUI owns:\n\ndimensions\nposition\nsurfaces\nborders\ncolors\nradii\nspacing\nempty-state presentation\n\nUI direct persistence:\n0\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n0\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n0\n\n==================================================\n13. SEARCH EXPANSION\n==================================================\n\nCollapsed Home must FIRST match 824.png.\n\nWhen Search expands later:\n\nFav\n↓\nparticle/results area\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n↓\nP2\n\nP1/P2 dimensions remain unchanged.\n\nDock remains external.\n\nDo NOT reserve expanded Search space while collapsed.\n\n==================================================\n14. PARTICLE VISUAL\n==================================================\n\nUse one shared particle engine.\n\nFav:\napproved visual preset.\n\nExpanded Search:\nnetwork particles + results.\n\nSettings:\nSettings preset.\n\nDo not duplicate the particle engine.\n\n==================================================\n15. COLOR HIERARCHY\n==================================================\n\nMatch reference:\n\nWallpaper\n\n→ Home outer dark container\n\n→ Fav/Search/P1/P2 dark internal surfaces\n\n→ Dock independent darker surface\n\nDo not use default Material cards that visibly change\nthe reference appearance.\n\n==================================================\n16. SYSTEM BARS\n==================================================\n\nWallpaper:\nedge-to-edge allowed.\n\nHome content:\nrespect safe bounds.\n\nNo overlap with status bar.\n\nDock:\nstay above navigation/gesture safe region.\n\n==================================================\n17. SINGLE HOME OWNER\n==================================================\n\nFind current active V3 Home skeleton.\n\nReplace it.\n\nAfter implementation:\n\nHome UI owners = 1\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners = 0\n\nOld PATCH009 UI runtime references = 0\n\n==================================================\n18. DO NOT IMPORT OLD PATCH ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nDo not restore PATCH 001–009 packages.\n\nIf old source contains a useful generic algorithm/component:\n\nextract/reimplement it under V3 ownership.\n\nNo PATCH runtime dependency.\n\n==================================================\n19. VISUAL ACCEPTANCE\n==================================================\n\nCompare implementation against 824.png.\n\nRequired:\n\nHome compact:\nYES\n\nHome centered:\nYES\n\nWallpaper visible:\nYES\n\nFav rounded surface:\nYES\n\nFav visual background:\nYES\n\nSearch rounded surface:\nYES\n\nP1 title visible:\nYES\n\nP2 title visible:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 equal:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 compact:\nYES\n\nDock outside:\nYES\n\nDock populated from Core:\nYES when assignments exist\n\nNo fullscreen Home:\nYES\n\n==================================================\n20. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n21. DEVICE GATE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT freeze UI yet.\n\nDo NOT delete V2 backup/reference.\n\nAfter build:\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME UI V3 AUTHORITATIVE REFERENCE COMPLETE\n\nReference:\n824.png\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nHome width:\n<value>\n\nHome height:\n<value>\n\nFav size:\n<value>\n\nFav visual background:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch size:\n<value>\n\nSearch presentation:\n<ROUNDED_SURFACE/OTHER>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nP2 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nDock size:\n<value>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome -> Dock gap:\n<value>\n\nP1 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP1 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nDock assignments:\n<n>/5\n\nDock icons rendered:\n<n>/5\n\nUI direct persistence:\n<n>\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n<n>\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n<n>\n\nCore/UI separation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:345:{"session_id":"01a020dd-c245-7503-b8ff-57a6cbc97ccf","ts":1787260686,"text":"FASE: MACHINA V3 — HOME UI AUTHORITATIVE REFERENCE\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Machina/project\n\nVISUAL REFERENCE:\n824.png\n\nIMPORTANT:\n824.png IS THE AUTHORITATIVE HOME UI TARGET.\n\nDo not use:\n- previous V3 skeleton\n- old PATCH009 runtime UI\n- previous device screenshots\nas visual targets.\n\nCORE and UI remain separate.\n\n==================================================\n1. REQUIRED STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav. apps\n├── Search\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\n20dp approximately\n\nDOCK\n(outside Home container)\n\nThis hierarchy is mandatory.\n\n==================================================\n2. HOME CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nCentered horizontally.\n\nCompact.\nNOT fullscreen.\n\nTarget width:\napproximately 88–90% usable display width.\n\nHeight:\ncontent-driven.\n\nBackground:\nvery dark.\n\nCorner radius:\n~24dp.\n\nBorder:\nsubtle ~1dp.\n\nInternal padding:\napproximately 12–16dp.\n\nWallpaper remains visible around the entire module.\n\n==================================================\n3. FAV. APPS\n==================================================\n\nFirst section inside Home.\n\nIndependent rounded surface.\n\nContents:\n\nFav. apps\nApps <count>\n\nSettings gear at right.\n\nMatch 824.png proportions.\n\nKeep the approved animated/visual background in Fav.\n\nFav must NOT become a plain black empty rectangle.\n\nRounded corners:\n~24dp.\n\n==================================================\n4. SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nImmediately below Fav.\n\nMatch 824.png:\n\nrounded dark Search surface\nmagnifier left\nSearch apps... / query\n\nCompact height.\n\nSame internal width as P1/P2.\n\nDo NOT render only:\n\nmagnifier + text + underline\n\nas in the rejected device implementation.\n\n==================================================\n5. P1\n==================================================\n\nIndependent rounded surface.\n\nTitle:\n\nP1\n\ntop-left.\n\n8 slots:\n4 columns x 2 rows.\n\nWhen empty:\n\nsmall outline cube\n\nNo apps in this section\n\nAdd your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\n\n==================================================\n6. P2\n==================================================\n\nIdentical geometry to P1.\n\nTitle:\n\nP2\n\ntop-left.\n\n8 slots:\n4 columns x 2 rows.\n\nRequired:\n\nP1 width == P2 width\nP1 height == P2 height\nP1 radius == P2 radius\nP1 padding == P2 padding\n\n==================================================\n7. P1/P2 HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT stretch P1/P2 using available screen height.\n\nNo:\n\nweight(1f)\nfillMaxHeight()\nlarge minHeight\n\nUse compact fixed/measured dimensions capable of holding\nthe 2x4 app grid.\n\nEmpty state must use the SAME section dimensions.\n\n==================================================\n8. INTERNAL GAPS\n==================================================\n\nFollow 824.png.\n\nStarting tokens:\n\nFav -> Search:\n16dp\n\nSearch -> P1:\n12–16dp\n\nP1 -> P2:\n8–12dp\n\nOuter Home padding:\n12–16dp\n\nUse one spacing owner.\n\n==================================================\n9. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock is NOT inside Home container.\n\nRequired hierarchy in Compose:\n\nColumn {\n    HomeContainer(...)\n    Spacer(~20dp)\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\nNOT:\n\nHomeContainer {\n    ...\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\n==================================================\n10. DOCK STYLE\n==================================================\n\nIndependent rounded dark surface.\n\n5 slots.\n\n1 row x 5 columns.\n\nSlightly darker than Home internal surfaces.\n\nCorner radius:\n~24dp.\n\nBorder:\nsubtle.\n\nCompact height.\n\nUse actual Core slot data.\n\n==================================================\n11. DATA\n==================================================\n\nUI must render actual Core state.\n\nIf P1 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf P2 has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nIf Dock has apps:\nrender apps.\n\nEmpty-state appears ONLY when corresponding section is\nactually empty.\n\nDo NOT use placeholder icons to fake populated state.\n\n==================================================\n12. CORE / UI BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nCORE owns:\n\nAppCatalog\nHomeSnapshot\nslot persistence\nLauncherActions\nAppVisuals\ndefault-app resolution\nfirst-install initialization\n\nUI owns:\n\ndimensions\nposition\nsurfaces\nborders\ncolors\nradii\nspacing\nempty-state presentation\n\nUI direct persistence:\n0\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n0\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n0\n\n==================================================\n13. SEARCH EXPANSION\n==================================================\n\nCollapsed Home must FIRST match 824.png.\n\nWhen Search expands later:\n\nFav\n↓\nparticle/results area\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n↓\nP2\n\nP1/P2 dimensions remain unchanged.\n\nDock remains external.\n\nDo NOT reserve expanded Search space while collapsed.\n\n==================================================\n14. PARTICLE VISUAL\n==================================================\n\nUse one shared particle engine.\n\nFav:\napproved visual preset.\n\nExpanded Search:\nnetwork particles + results.\n\nSettings:\nSettings preset.\n\nDo not duplicate the particle engine.\n\n==================================================\n15. COLOR HIERARCHY\n==================================================\n\nMatch reference:\n\nWallpaper\n\n→ Home outer dark container\n\n→ Fav/Search/P1/P2 dark internal surfaces\n\n→ Dock independent darker surface\n\nDo not use default Material cards that visibly change\nthe reference appearance.\n\n==================================================\n16. SYSTEM BARS\n==================================================\n\nWallpaper:\nedge-to-edge allowed.\n\nHome content:\nrespect safe bounds.\n\nNo overlap with status bar.\n\nDock:\nstay above navigation/gesture safe region.\n\n==================================================\n17. SINGLE HOME OWNER\n==================================================\n\nFind current active V3 Home skeleton.\n\nReplace it.\n\nAfter implementation:\n\nHome UI owners = 1\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners = 0\n\nOld PATCH009 UI runtime references = 0\n\n==================================================\n18. DO NOT IMPORT OLD PATCH ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nDo not restore PATCH 001–009 packages.\n\nIf old source contains a useful generic algorithm/component:\n\nextract/reimplement it under V3 ownership.\n\nNo PATCH runtime dependency.\n\n==================================================\n19. VISUAL ACCEPTANCE\n==================================================\n\nCompare implementation against 824.png.\n\nRequired:\n\nHome compact:\nYES\n\nHome centered:\nYES\n\nWallpaper visible:\nYES\n\nFav rounded surface:\nYES\n\nFav visual background:\nYES\n\nSearch rounded surface:\nYES\n\nP1 title visible:\nYES\n\nP2 title visible:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 equal:\nYES\n\nP1/P2 compact:\nYES\n\nDock outside:\nYES\n\nDock populated from Core:\nYES when assignments exist\n\nNo fullscreen Home:\nYES\n\n==================================================\n20. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n21. DEVICE GATE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT freeze UI yet.\n\nDo NOT delete V2 backup/reference.\n\nAfter build:\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA HOME UI V3 AUTHORITATIVE REFERENCE COMPLETE\n\nReference:\n824.png\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nOld skeleton runtime owners:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nHome width:\n<value>\n\nHome height:\n<value>\n\nFav size:\n<value>\n\nFav visual background:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch size:\n<value>\n\nSearch presentation:\n<ROUNDED_SURFACE/OTHER>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nP2 title:\n<VISIBLE/MISSING>\n\nDock size:\n<value>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome -> Dock gap:\n<value>\n\nP1 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP1 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 assignments:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 icons rendered:\n<n>/8\n\nDock assignments:\n<n>/5\n\nDock icons rendered:\n<n>/5\n\nUI direct persistence:\n<n>\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n<n>\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n<n>\n\nCore/UI separation:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
