/root/.codex/history.jsonl:347:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787285512,"text":"FASE 00 — MACHINA V3 PRE-CHECK\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nMODE:\nREAD ONLY\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nVerificare che la nuova struttura Machina V3 sia pronta\nprima di iniziare Core + UI in parallelo.\n\nNON modificare file.\nNON creare codice.\nNON fare build.\nNON fare checkpoint.\n\n==================================================\n1. VERIFY PATHS\n==================================================\n\nVerify:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n/opt/Android/Machina/backups\n/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs\n/opt/Android/Machina/snapshots\n/opt/Android/Machina/archive\n\n==================================================\n2. PROJECT CONTENT\n==================================================\n\nFrom:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nreport:\n\npwd\nls -la\ngit status if Git exists\nGradle files\nAndroid app module\npackage/applicationId\ncurrent source tree\n\n==================================================\n3. DETECT OLD ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nSearch current active project for:\n\ncore/v2\ncore/v3\nui/v3\npatches\n001_\n002_\n003_\n004_\n005_\n006_\n007_\n008_\n009_\n\nReport active legacy paths.\n\nDo not remove anything.\n\n==================================================\n4. DETECT CURRENT ENTRY POINT\n==================================================\n\nFind:\n\nMainActivity\nApplication class if present\nsetContent entry\ncurrent Home composable\n\nReport exact paths/symbols.\n\n==================================================\n5. PROJECTCTL\n==================================================\n\nVerify whether this exists:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl\n\nIf present report:\n\nROOT\nPROJECT\nOUTPUTS\nSNAPSHOTS\nCHECKPOINTS\n\nCheck for stale references to:\n\n/opt/Machina\n/opt/Android/Machina old layouts\n\nDo not edit.\n\n==================================================\n6. TARGET V3 STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nConfirm whether project is ready to create:\n\ncore/\nui/\nfeatures/\n\nwith Core + UI developed in parallel.\n\nDo not create them yet.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA V3 PRE-CHECK COMPLETE\n\nProject exists: <YES/NO>\nGit: <YES/NO>\nAndroid module: <value>\nApplicationId: <value>\n\nCurrent entry point:\n<path/symbol>\n\nCurrent Home owner:\n<path/symbol>\n\nCore V2 paths:\n<list>\n\nCore V3 paths:\n<list>\n\nUI V3 paths:\n<list>\n\nLegacy patch paths:\n<list>\n\nprojectctl present:\n<YES/NO>\n\nStale /opt/Machina references:\n<n>\n\nStale old-root references:\n<n>\n\nReady for Core+UI V3 parallel build:\n<YES/NO>\n\nProject modified:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:348:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787285924,"text":"FASE 01 — MACHINA V3 STRUCTURE BOOTSTRAP\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nMODE:\nSTRUCTURE ONLY\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nCreare la struttura base Machina V3 per sviluppo parallelo di:\n\n- Core\n- UI\n- Features\n\nNON implementare ancora logica applicativa.\nNON migrare vecchie patch.\nNON modificare il comportamento runtime.\nNON fare refactor del codice esistente oltre ai nuovi package vuoti/minimali necessari.\n\n==================================================\n1. TARGET SOURCE ROOT\n==================================================\n\nUnder the current application package create:\n\ncore/\nui/\nfeatures/\n\nPreferred structure:\n\ncore/\n  catalog/\n  model/\n  persistence/\n  actions/\n  visuals/\n  defaults/\n  initialization/\n\nui/\n  home/\n  search/\n  settings/\n  picker/\n  components/\n  theme/\n\nfeatures/\n  search/\n  particles/\n  sloteditor/\n  settings/\n  firstinstall/\n\n==================================================\n2. CORE CONTRACT DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/CORE_V3.md\n\nDocument only architecture contract:\n\nCore owns:\n- AppCatalog\n- HomeSnapshot\n- slot persistence\n- LauncherActions\n- AppVisuals\n- default-app resolution\n- first-install initialization\n\nCore does NOT own:\n- dp\n- colors\n- padding\n- corners\n- layout\n- animations\n- Home geometry\n- Settings visuals\n\n==================================================\n3. UI CONTRACT DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/UI_V3.md\n\nUI owns:\n- Home composition\n- Fav\n- Search area\n- P1/P2 surfaces\n- external Dock surface\n- dimensions\n- spacing\n- colors\n- borders\n- corners\n- animations/presentation\n\nUI does NOT:\n- write persistence directly\n- scan PackageManager\n- query UsageStats\n- resolve default apps directly\n\n==================================================\n4. FEATURES CONTRACT DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/FEATURES_V3.md\n\nFeatures bridge UI and Core.\n\nExpected modules:\n\nsearch\nparticles\nsloteditor\nsettings\nfirstinstall\n\nNo feature may become a second Core owner.\n\n==================================================\n5. HOME UI TARGET DOC\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/HOME_UI_V3_TARGET.md\n\nAuthoritative hierarchy:\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav\n├── SearchArea\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\nGAP\n\nDOCK\n(outside Home container)\n\nHard rules:\n\nP1 = 8\nP2 = 8\nDock = 5\n\nP1/P2 same size.\n\nDock external.\n\nHome compact and centered.\n\n==================================================\n6. STATUS FILE\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/V3_STATUS.md\n\nInitial:\n\nHOME: NOT_STARTED\nCATALOG: NOT_STARTED\nSLOTS: NOT_STARTED\nSEARCH: NOT_STARTED\nPARTICLES: NOT_STARTED\nSETTINGS: NOT_STARTED\nFIRST_INSTALL: NOT_STARTED\n\n==================================================\n7. NO LEGACY MOVE YET\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT move/delete current legacy sources.\n\nDo NOT archive patches yet.\n\nThis phase only prepares V3 namespaces/docs.\n\n==================================================\n8. BUILD SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nNew source files must not break current build.\n\nIf Kotlin package marker files are unnecessary:\ndo not create dummy runtime classes.\n\nPrefer directories + docs only where possible.\n\n==================================================\n9. PROJECTCTL\n==================================================\n\nDo not modify projectctl unless path verification found a real defect.\n\n==================================================\n10. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nAfter structure creation run:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA V3 STRUCTURE BOOTSTRAP COMPLETE\n\nCore directories:\n<list>\n\nUI directories:\n<list>\n\nFeature directories:\n<list>\n\nCORE_V3.md:\n<YES/NO>\n\nUI_V3.md:\n<YES/NO>\n\nFEATURES_V3.md:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHOME_UI_V3_TARGET.md:\n<YES/NO>\n\nV3_STATUS.md:\n<YES/NO>\n\nLegacy source moved:\n<NO/YES>\n\nRuntime behavior changed:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nProject modified:\nYES"}
