/root/.codex/history.jsonl:352:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787287527,"text":"FASE 01B — MACHINA PROJECTCTL RECOVERY\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nMODE:\nREAD ONLY FIRST\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nLocate an existing Machina projectctl from backups/archive/old roots\nand determine whether it can be safely adapted to the new canonical root.\n\nDo NOT modify application source.\n\nRequired canonical paths:\n\nROOT=/opt/Android/Machina\nPROJECT=/opt/Android/Machina/project\nOUTPUTS=/opt/Android/Machina/outputs\nSNAPSHOTS=/opt/Android/Machina/snapshots\nCHECKPOINTS=/opt/Android/Machina/checkpoints\nDOCS=/opt/Android/Machina/docs\n\nAudit candidates for stale references to:\n\n/opt/Machina\n/opt/Android/Machina old layouts\nold project roots\n\nIf one candidate is structurally compatible:\n\ncopy/adapt it to:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl\n\nMake executable:\n\nchmod 0755 /opt/Android/Machina/projectctl\n\nDo NOT change build semantics unless required for the new paths.\n\nThen run:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\nOUTPUT:\n\nMACHINA PROJECTCTL RECOVERY COMPLETE\n\nCandidate used:\n<path>\n\nInstalled projectctl:\n<path>\n\nStale path references before:\n<n>\n\nStale path references after:\n<n>\n\nApplication source modified:\nNO\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:353:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787287588,"text":"FASE 01C — MACHINA GRADLE WRAPPER RECOVERY\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRipristinare SOLO il Gradle Wrapper necessario per buildare\nil nuovo progetto Machina V3.\n\nNON modificare codice applicativo.\nNON copiare vecchie patch.\nNON copiare vecchia UI/Core.\n\n==================================================\n1. LOCATE CANDIDATE\n==================================================\n\nCercare nei backup/archive di Machina e negli altri progetti Android:\n\ngradlew\ngradlew.bat\ngradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar\ngradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties\n\nPreferire il wrapper dell'ultima Machina funzionante.\n\n==================================================\n2. AUDIT VERSION\n==================================================\n\nLeggere:\n\ngradle-wrapper.properties\n\nRiportare:\n\ndistributionUrl\nGradle version\n\nConfrontare con:\n\nsettings.gradle / settings.gradle.kts\nbuild.gradle / build.gradle.kts\ngradle/libs.versions.toml\n\ndel nuovo progetto.\n\nNon cambiare versione se il wrapper trovato è compatibile.\n\n==================================================\n3. RESTORE\n==================================================\n\nCopiare nel nuovo project root:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/gradlew\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/gradlew.bat\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties\n\nchmod 0755:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/gradlew\n\n==================================================\n4. NO LEGACY IMPORT\n==================================================\n\nNon copiare:\n\napp/src\nold patches\nold build outputs\n.gradle\nbuild/\n.idea/\nlocal.properties\nsigning keys\n\n==================================================\n5. VERIFY\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\ncd /opt/Android/Machina/project\n./gradlew --version\n\nThen:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA GRADLE WRAPPER RECOVERY COMPLETE\n\nWrapper source:\n<path>\n\nGradle version:\n<value>\n\nWrapper compatible:\n<YES/NO>\n\ngradlew installed:\n<YES/NO>\n\ngradle-wrapper.jar installed:\n<YES/NO>\n\nApplication source modified:\nNO\n\n./gradlew --version:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nprojectctl build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:354:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787287658,"text":"FASE 01D — MACHINA BUILD TOOLCHAIN RECOVERY\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nMODE:\nINFRASTRUCTURE ONLY\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRipristinare un ambiente di build OFFLINE funzionante per Machina V3.\n\nDO NOT modify:\n- application source\n- Core V3\n- UI V3\n- features\n- Gradle project semantics\n\nCURRENT FAILURES:\n\n1. /root/.gradle is unusable/read-only\n2. network download is blocked\n3. Android SDK missing at:\n   /opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\n==================================================\n1. FIND EXISTING GRADLE CACHE\n==================================================\n\nSearch under:\n\n/opt\n/root\nprevious Machina backups\nAndroid project backups\n\nfor existing directories containing:\n\ncaches/modules-2\nwrapper/dists\ncaches/transforms-*\ncaches/*/generated-gradle-jars\n\nPrefer cache from the last working Machina build.\n\nReport candidate paths.\n\n==================================================\n2. CREATE WRITABLE GRADLE HOME\n==================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home\n\nPopulate it from the best existing compatible Gradle cache.\n\nPreserve:\n\nwrapper/dists\ncaches/modules-2\ncaches/transforms-*\nnotifications if present\n\nDo NOT copy lock files/process state blindly if stale.\n\nSet:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home\n\n==================================================\n3. OFFLINE REQUIREMENT\n==================================================\n\nBuild must not require network.\n\nVerify wrapper distribution required by:\n\ngradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties\n\nalready exists in:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME/wrapper/dists\n\nIf missing:\nreport MISSING_OFFLINE_DISTRIBUTION and STOP.\n\nDo not attempt network download.\n\n==================================================\n4. FIND ANDROID SDK\n==================================================\n\nSearch for existing Android SDK under:\n\n/opt\n/root\n/usr/local\nprevious Machina backups\nother Android projects\n\nLook for:\n\nplatform-tools/\nbuild-tools/\nplatforms/\ncmdline-tools/ or tools/\nlicenses/\n\nReport candidates.\n\n==================================================\n5. CANONICAL SDK PATH\n==================================================\n\nCanonical target:\n\n/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nIf a complete existing SDK is found:\n\neither move/copy safely\nor create a stable symlink\n\nPrefer no duplicate multi-GB SDK copy if a trustworthy existing\ncanonical source already exists.\n\n==================================================\n6. REQUIRED SDK COMPONENTS\n==================================================\n\nRead current Machina project Gradle config and determine:\n\ncompileSdk\ntargetSdk\nbuildTools if explicitly pinned\n\nVerify corresponding installed components exist.\n\nExample checks:\n\nplatforms/android-<compileSdk>\nbuild-tools/<required-version>\nplatform-tools\n\nDo NOT install from network.\n\nIf required component missing:\nreport exact missing component and STOP.\n\n==================================================\n7. LOCAL PROPERTIES\n==================================================\n\nCreate/update only if appropriate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/local.properties\n\nwith:\n\nsdk.dir=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nDo not place secrets in local.properties.\n\n==================================================\n8. PROJECTCTL ENVIRONMENT\n==================================================\n\nEnsure projectctl exports/uses:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home\nANDROID_SDK_ROOT=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\nANDROID_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nDo not hardcode /root/.gradle.\n\n==================================================\n9. OFFLINE GRADLE TEST\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\ncd /opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home \\\n./gradlew --offline --version\n\nRequired:\nSUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n10. OFFLINE BUILD\n==================================================\n\nThen run:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home \\\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nprojectctl should use offline-compatible environment.\n\nNo network access.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA BUILD TOOLCHAIN RECOVERY COMPLETE\n\nGradle cache source:\n<path>\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME:\n<path>\n\nRequired Gradle distribution present:\n<YES/NO>\n\nAndroid SDK source:\n<path>\n\nCanonical SDK:\n<path>\n\ncompileSdk:\n<value>\n\nRequired platform present:\n<YES/NO>\n\nRequired build-tools present:\n<YES/NO>\n\nlocal.properties:\n<CREATED/UPDATED/UNCHANGED>\n\nNetwork required:\n<NO/YES>\n\n./gradlew --offline --version:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nprojectctl build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nApplication source modified:\nNO"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:355:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787287794,"text":"FASE 01E — MACHINA V3 ANDROID/GRADLE PROJECT SKELETON\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOLD SOURCES:\nsearch under:\n/opt/Android/Machina/backups\n/opt/Android/Machina/archive\n/opt/Android/backups\n\nMODE:\nBUILD INFRASTRUCTURE + MINIMAL ANDROID APP SHELL\n\nCURRENT STATUS:\n\nGradle wrapper offline:\nPASS\n\nAndroid SDK offline:\nPASS\n\nprojectctl environment:\nPASS\n\nFAILURE:\ncurrent V3 root has no Gradle project layout.\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nTurn /opt/Android/Machina/project into a valid Android Gradle\nproject WITHOUT restoring the legacy Machina application source.\n\n==================================================\n1. FIND LAST WORKING MACHINA GRADLE PROJECT\n==================================================\n\nLocate the most recent known-working Machina source containing:\n\nsettings.gradle\nor settings.gradle.kts\n\nroot build.gradle\nor build.gradle.kts\n\ngradle.properties\n\napp/build.gradle\nor app/build.gradle.kts\n\napp/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml\n\nPrefer the build configuration associated with the last\nsuccessful V2/Machina build.\n\nReport exact source path.\n\n==================================================\n2. RECOVER ONLY BUILD STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nRestore/adapt only required build infrastructure into:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nExpected root:\n\nproject/\n├── settings.gradle(.kts)\n├── build.gradle(.kts)\n├── gradle.properties\n├── gradlew\n├── gradlew.bat\n├── gradle/\n│   └── wrapper/\n├── local.properties\n└── app/\n    ├── build.gradle(.kts)\n    └── src/\n        └── main/\n            └── AndroidManifest.xml\n\nIf libs.versions.toml is required by existing build:\nrestore it too.\n\n==================================================\n3. DO NOT COPY LEGACY APP SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT copy:\n\nold MainActivity\nold Home composables\npatches/\nold Core V2\nold UI\nold Search\nold Settings\nold Kotlin source tree\nold drawable assets\nold wallpapers\nold build/\nold .gradle/\nold outputs/\n\nunless separately required in a later selective migration.\n\n==================================================\n4. APPLICATION ID\n==================================================\n\nPreserve Machina's real applicationId/package namespace\nfrom the previous working build.\n\nDo NOT invent a new package.\n\nReport:\n\nnamespace\napplicationId\nminSdk\ntargetSdk\ncompileSdk\n\n==================================================\n5. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nCreate/adapt a minimal valid V3 manifest.\n\nPreserve only mandatory application properties required to make\nMachina a launcher where already established.\n\nDo not blindly copy obsolete services/providers/permissions.\n\nAudit legacy manifest entries and classify:\n\nREQUIRED_V3\nFEATURE_LATER\nDO_NOT_RESTORE\n\nFor this phase include only what is necessary to compile and\nlaunch the minimal V3 app.\n\n==================================================\n6. MINIMAL V3 SOURCE ROOT\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe earlier bootstrap directories currently under:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/project/core\n/ui\n/features\n\nare architectural directories at project root.\n\nAndroid Kotlin source must live under the Android source set.\n\nCreate/move V3 namespaces under:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\n\npreferred:\n\ncore/\nui/\nfeatures/\n\nPreserve the V3 directory hierarchy already defined.\n\nDo NOT keep two active copies.\n\n==================================================\n7. MINIMAL ENTRY POINT\n==================================================\n\nCreate only the smallest V3 runtime entry required to prove\nthe project builds.\n\nPreferred:\n\nMainActivity.kt\n\nwith:\n\nsetContent {\n    MachinaAppV3()\n}\n\nand a minimal MachinaAppV3 composable.\n\nDo NOT implement the real Home yet.\n\nIt may display a minimal temporary V3 bootstrap surface/text.\n\nThis is infrastructure validation only.\n\n==================================================\n8. COMPOSE CONFIGURATION\n==================================================\n\nReuse the known-working Compose/AGP/Kotlin configuration from\nthe previous Machina build where compatible.\n\nDo NOT arbitrarily upgrade:\n\nAGP\nKotlin\nCompose\nGradle\n\nOffline cache compatibility is more important.\n\n==================================================\n9. TOOLCHAIN\n==================================================\n\nKeep:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home\n\nANDROID_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nANDROID_SDK_ROOT=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nlocal.properties:\n\nsdk.dir=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\n==================================================\n10. OFFLINE ONLY\n==================================================\n\nBuild must use existing offline dependencies.\n\nNo network download attempt.\n\nUse:\n\n--offline\n\nwhere projectctl/Gradle invocation supports it.\n\nIf a dependency is absent from cache:\nSTOP and report exact coordinate.\n\nDo NOT replace dependencies just to force compilation.\n\n==================================================\n11. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nFirst:\n\ncd /opt/Android/Machina/project\n\n./gradlew --offline projects\n\nThen:\n\n./gradlew --offline :app:assembleDebug\n\nThen:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired final target:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\n==================================================\n12. OUTPUT COLLECTION\n==================================================\n\nVerify projectctl exports successful artifacts into:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/<timestamp>/\n\nAt minimum:\n\napp-debug.apk\nbuild.log\nSHA256SUMS\n\nRelease/R8 artifacts according to current projectctl contract.\n\n==================================================\n13. DOCUMENT\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/V3_STATUS.md\n\nSet:\n\nBUILD_INFRASTRUCTURE: VALIDATED\n\nHOME: NOT_STARTED\nCATALOG: NOT_STARTED\nSLOTS: NOT_STARTED\nSEARCH: NOT_STARTED\nPARTICLES: NOT_STARTED\nSETTINGS: NOT_STARTED\nFIRST_INSTALL: NOT_STARTED\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA V3 GRADLE PROJECT SKELETON COMPLETE\n\nBuild skeleton source:\n<path>\n\nsettings file:\n<path>\n\nroot build file:\n<path>\n\napp build file:\n<path>\n\nnamespace:\n<value>\n\napplicationId:\n<value>\n\ncompileSdk:\n<value>\n\ntargetSdk:\n<value>\n\nminSdk:\n<value>\n\nLegacy Kotlin app source copied:\n<n>\n\nExpected:\n0\n\nV3 source root:\n<path>\n\nDuplicate V3 source trees:\n<n>\n\nMinimal MainActivity:\n<YES/NO>\n\n./gradlew --offline projects:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nassembleDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nprojectctl build:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nOutput directory:\n<path/N-A>\n\nV3 STATUS:\nBUILD_INFRASTRUCTURE_<VALIDATED/FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:356:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787288126,"text":"FASE 02 — MACHINA V3 CORE + UI REBUILD\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nSTATUS:\nBUILD_INFRASTRUCTURE_VALIDATED\n\nMODE:\nNEW BASELINE IMPLEMENTATION\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRebuild Machina V3 as:\n\nCORE V3\n+\nUI V3\n\ndeveloped together and connected directly.\n\nThis is NOT an incremental slice.\n\nThis phase creates the new functional baseline of Machina.\n\nDo NOT restore PATCH 001–009 architecture.\n\nDo NOT reuse the old Home skeleton as runtime owner.\n\n==================================================\n0. BACKUP\n==================================================\n\nBefore source changes:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl checkpoint pre-core-ui-v3-rebuild\n\nIf checkpoint fails:\nSTOP.\n\n==================================================\n1. CORE V3 RESPONSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nCore V3 owns ONLY:\n\n- AppCatalog\n- HomeSnapshot\n- P1/P2/Dock slot state\n- SlotRepository\n- LauncherActions\n- AppVisuals\n- default app resolution\n- first-install initialization contracts\n\nCore V3 owns NO:\n\n- Compose layout\n- dp\n- colors\n- padding\n- borders\n- corner radius\n- Search geometry\n- particle rendering\n- Settings visual\n- Home positioning\n\n==================================================\n2. UI V3 RESPONSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nUI V3 owns ALL presentation:\n\n- Home container\n- Fav\n- Search area\n- P1\n- P2\n- external Dock\n- dimensions\n- spacing\n- borders\n- colors\n- corner radius\n- empty states\n- interaction presentation\n- particle surfaces\n\nUI never owns persistence.\n\n==================================================\n3. TARGET SOURCE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\n\ncore/\n  catalog/\n  model/\n  persistence/\n  actions/\n  visuals/\n  defaults/\n  initialization/\n\nui/\n  home/\n  search/\n  settings/\n  picker/\n  components/\n  theme/\n\nfeatures/\n  search/\n  particles/\n  sloteditor/\n  settings/\n  firstinstall/\n\nNo active patches/00x runtime architecture.\n\n==================================================\n4. CORE — HOME MODEL\n==================================================\n\nCreate one immutable:\n\nHomeSnapshot\n\nHard contract:\n\nP1 = 8\nP2 = 8\nDock = 5\n\nExplicit empty slots allowed.\n\nNo UI values inside model.\n\n==================================================\n5. CORE — SLOT REPOSITORY\n==================================================\n\nOne owner only.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n- load HomeSnapshot\n- assign one slot\n- clear one slot\n- persist established layout\n\nUI never writes storage directly.\n\n==================================================\n6. CORE — APP CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nOne AppCatalog owner.\n\nExpose launchable app entries:\n\npackageName\nlabel\nprofile/source metadata if required\n\nNo UI code.\n\n==================================================\n7. CORE — APP VISUALS\n==================================================\n\nOne shared icon resolver/cache.\n\nUsed by:\n\nHome\nSearch\nApp Picker\n\nNo duplicate icon-loading path.\n\n==================================================\n8. CORE — LAUNCHER ACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nOne launch/action owner.\n\nSupport:\n\nlaunch app\nsafe Android/system intent actions\n\nHandle:\n\nActivityNotFoundException\nSecurityException\nuninstalled app\n\n==================================================\n9. CORE — DEFAULT APPS\n==================================================\n\nCreate one DefaultAppsResolver.\n\nTarget semantic Dock:\n\n0 Phone\n1 Messages/SMS\n2 Browser\n3 Music\n4 Mail\n\nNo hardcoded package names.\n\nUnresolved:\nexplicit empty.\n\n==================================================\n10. CORE — FIRST INSTALL\n==================================================\n\nCreate FirstInstallInitializer.\n\nFirst installation only:\n\nDock:\nsemantic defaults\n\nP1:\ntop 8 eligible usage-ranked apps\n\nP2:\nnext 8\n\nExclude Dock packages.\n\nDo not rerun after established layout.\n\nNo continuous UsageStats monitoring.\n\n==================================================\n11. UI — AUTHORITATIVE HOME\n==================================================\n\nUse approved visual model as target.\n\nStructure:\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav\n├── SearchArea\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\nGAP\n\nDOCK\n\nDock is outside Home container.\n\n==================================================\n12. HOME CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nCompact centered module.\n\nTarget:\n\n~88–90% usable screen width\ncontent-driven height\ndark surface\n~24dp corners\nsubtle ~1dp border\n12–16dp internal padding\n\nNever:\n\nfillMaxHeight()\nfullscreen Home surface\nlarge weight-based vertical expansion\n\nWallpaper remains visible around Home.\n\n==================================================\n13. FAV\n==================================================\n\nFav is an independent rounded surface inside Home.\n\nContents:\n\nFav. apps\nApps <count>\nSettings icon right\n\nFav count derives from actual state.\n\nRestore approved visual/animated background language.\n\nNo plain empty black rectangle.\n\n==================================================\n14. SEARCH AREA\n==================================================\n\nSearch belongs between Fav and P1.\n\nCollapsed:\ncompact Search shell.\n\nExpanded:\n\nFav\n↓\nparticle/results/history region\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n\nSearchBar sits at bottom of expanded SearchArea.\n\nP1/P2/Dock sizes do not change.\n\n==================================================\n15. SEARCH BAR\n==================================================\n\nApproved V3 design:\n\nmagnifier left\nquery/input\ncompact rounded/dark Search surface\n\nDo not reproduce rejected bare underline-only skeleton\nunless explicitly required by approved target.\n\n==================================================\n16. SEARCH ENGINE\n==================================================\n\nImplement one SearchEngine under features/search.\n\nUse AppCatalog.\n\nSupport:\n\n- exact label match\n- prefix match\n- contains match\n- alphabetical tie-break\n- max 5 visible results\n- history max 3 MEMORY_ONLY\n\nResults appear ABOVE SearchBar.\n\nNo PackageManager scan while typing.\n\n==================================================\n17. SEARCH HISTORY\n==================================================\n\nMemory only.\n\nMax:\n3\n\nMost recent first.\nDeduplicate.\n\nProcess death:\nhistory clears.\n\nNo keep-alive.\n\n==================================================\n18. PARTICLE ENGINE\n==================================================\n\nOne reusable AnimatedParticleNetwork.\n\nUsed by:\n\nSearch\nSettings\n\nNo second engine.\n\nSearch:\nfills full expanded Search region.\n\nNon-interactive.\n\n==================================================\n19. P1 / P2\n==================================================\n\nP1 and P2:\n\nsame exact dimensions\n8 slots each\n4 x 2 grid\nrounded surface\nsubtle border\nsame padding\n\nTitles:\n\nP1\nP2\n\ntop-left.\n\n==================================================\n20. P1 / P2 EMPTY STATE\n==================================================\n\nWhen empty:\n\nsmall outline cube\n\n\"No apps in this section\"\n\n\"Add your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\"\n\nSame outer geometry as populated state.\n\n==================================================\n21. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock is completely outside Home container.\n\n5 slots.\n1 row.\n\nOwn:\n\nbackground\nborder\ncorner radius\npadding\n\nSlightly darker surface.\n\nMust render real Core Dock state.\n\n==================================================\n22. SLOT EDITOR\n==================================================\n\nImplement under features/sloteditor.\n\nNormal tap:\nlaunch app.\n\nLong press:\nopen App Picker.\n\nOne App Picker for:\n\nP1\nP2\nDock\n\nAssign/remove through SlotRepository.\n\n==================================================\n23. APP PICKER UI\n==================================================\n\nCompact.\n\nUses AppCatalog + AppVisuals.\n\nNo PackageManager enumeration from UI.\n\nSearchable locally if current design requires it.\n\n==================================================\n24. SETTINGS V3\n==================================================\n\nRebuild Settings using approved legacy visual language.\n\nKeep:\n\nlegacy icons\nsystem typography\nDynamic Color\nparticle background\ncompact top-down presentation\n\nNo patch/debug architecture text in normal UI.\n\n==================================================\n25. SETTINGS FUNCTIONALITY\n==================================================\n\nOne Settings preference owner.\n\nReal options only.\n\nInitial candidates:\n\nhapticEnabled\ndynamicColorEnabled\nsearchAutoKeyboard\n\nPlus:\n\nSet default Home\nApp info\nVersion\nChangelog\n\nNo fake placeholder settings.\n\n==================================================\n26. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nOne semantic haptic bridge.\n\nUse:\n\nView.performHapticFeedback(...)\n\nRespect:\n\nhapticEnabled\n\nNo raw vibrator unless strictly required.\n\nNo MOVE haptic.\n\n==================================================\n27. MAINACTIVITY\n==================================================\n\nMainActivity must be thin.\n\nPreferred:\n\nsetContent {\n    MachinaAppV3()\n}\n\nNo business logic.\n\nNo persistence logic.\n\nNo PackageManager scan.\n\n==================================================\n28. SINGLE OWNERSHIP\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nAppCatalog owners = 1\nHomeSnapshot owners = 1\nSlotRepository owners = 1\nLauncherActions owners = 1\nAppVisuals owners = 1\nDefaultAppsResolver owners = 1\nFirstInstall owners = 1\n\nSearchEngine owners = 1\nSearch history owners = 1\nParticle engines = 1\nSettings preference owners = 1\nSlot editor owners = 1\n\nHome UI owners = 1\nSettings UI owners = 1\nApp Picker owners = 1\n\n==================================================\n29. CORE/UI DEPENDENCY RULE\n==================================================\n\nAllowed:\n\nUI\n→ features\n→ Core\n\nForbidden:\n\nCore\n→ UI\n\nCore Compose presentation imports:\n0\n\nUI direct persistence writes:\n0\n\nUI PackageManager scans:\n0\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n0\n\n==================================================\n30. OLD CODE\n==================================================\n\nCurrent legacy/V2 source stays on disk during implementation\nonly as reference.\n\nV3 runtime references to old PATCH 00x code:\n0\n\nDo not delete legacy source yet.\n\n==================================================\n31. BUILD DURING REBUILD\n==================================================\n\nKeep project compiling throughout implementation.\n\nUse:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nDo not finish with partially broken modules.\n\n==================================================\n32. FINAL BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\nOutputs exported to:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/outputs/<timestamp>/\n\n==================================================\n33. STATUS DOC\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/docs/V3_STATUS.md\n\nSet actual evidence-backed states for:\n\nCORE\nHOME_UI\nCATALOG\nSLOTS\nSEARCH\nPARTICLES\nSETTINGS\nSLOT_EDITOR\nFIRST_INSTALL\n\n==================================================\n34. NO FINAL FREEZE YET\n==================================================\n\nAfter successful build:\n\nSTATUS:\nCORE_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\nDo not delete V2/legacy yet.\n\nDo not create final frozen checkpoint until Pixel test passes.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA CORE + UI V3 REBUILD COMPLETE\n\nPre-rebuild checkpoint:\n<path>\n\nCore V3:\n<IMPLEMENTED/FAILED>\n\nUI V3:\n<IMPLEMENTED/FAILED>\n\nAppCatalog owners:\n<n>\n\nHomeSnapshot owners:\n<n>\n\nSlotRepository owners:\n<n>\n\nLauncherActions owners:\n<n>\n\nAppVisuals owners:\n<n>\n\nDefaultAppsResolver owners:\n<n>\n\nFirstInstall owners:\n<n>\n\nSearchEngine owners:\n<n>\n\nSearch history owners:\n<n>\n\nParticle engines:\n<n>\n\nSettings preference owners:\n<n>\n\nSlot editor owners:\n<n>\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nSettings UI owners:\n<n>\n\nApp Picker owners:\n<n>\n\nP1 slots:\n<n>\n\nP2 slots:\n<n>\n\nDock slots:\n<n>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 == P2 geometry:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch results above SearchBar:\n<YES/NO>\n\nCore Compose UI imports:\n<n>\n\nUI persistence writes:\n<n>\n\nUI PackageManager scans:\n<n>\n\nUI UsageStats calls:\n<n>\n\nLegacy PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nOutput:\n<path>\n\nSTATUS:\nCORE_UI_V3_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:358:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787288446,"text":"FASE — MACHINA NEW BASELINE NAMING CLEANUP\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nTreat the current project as a NEW Machina application baseline.\n\nRemove V2/V3/PATCH terminology from the ACTIVE project architecture.\n\nThis is not a migration-named runtime anymore.\n\n==================================================\n1. ACTIVE ARCHITECTURE NAMES\n==================================================\n\nUse only:\n\ncore/\nui/\nfeatures/\n\nNo active package/directory/file names containing:\n\nv2\nv3\npatch\n001\n002\n003\n004\n005\n006\n007\n008\n009\n\nHistorical backup/archive material may keep old names.\n\n==================================================\n2. RUNTIME CLASS NAMES\n==================================================\n\nPrefer:\n\nHomeSnapshot\nSlotRepository\nAppCatalog\nLauncherActions\nAppVisuals\nDefaultAppsResolver\nFirstInstallInitializer\n\nMachinaHome\nFavSection\nSearchArea\nPanelSection\nDock\nSettingsScreen\nAppPicker\n\nDo NOT use:\n\nHomeSnapshotV3\nMachinaHomeV3\nAppCatalogV3\netc.\n\n==================================================\n3. DOCUMENTATION\n==================================================\n\nCanonical docs:\n\ndocs/ARCHITECTURE.md\ndocs/CORE.md\ndocs/UI.md\ndocs/FEATURES.md\ndocs/STATUS.md\n\nMove old migration/version docs to archive/history if needed.\n\nDo not delete history.\n\n==================================================\n4. MAIN ENTRY\n==================================================\n\nUse a normal app entry such as:\n\nMachinaApp()\n\nnot:\n\nMachinaAppV3()\n\nMainActivity remains thin.\n\n==================================================\n5. STATUS LANGUAGE\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nBUILD_INFRASTRUCTURE\nCORE\nHOME_UI\nCATALOG\nSLOTS\nSEARCH\nPARTICLES\nSETTINGS\nSLOT_EDITOR\nFIRST_INSTALL\n\nNo V3 labels in active status.\n\n==================================================\n6. LEGACY\n==================================================\n\nOld V2/V3/patch code remains only under:\n\narchive/\nbackups/\n\nIt must not be active runtime code.\n\n==================================================\n7. APK SIZE BUDGET\n==================================================\n\nRelease R8 target:\n\n<= 7 MB\n\nPreferred:\n4–6 MB\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA NEW BASELINE NAMING COMPLETE\n\nActive V2/V3 names:\n<n>\n\nActive PATCH names:\n<n>\n\nCanonical Core path:\n<path>\n\nCanonical UI path:\n<path>\n\nCanonical Features path:\n<path>\n\nMain app entry:\n<symbol>\n\nCanonical docs:\n<list>\n\nLegacy history preserved:\n<YES/NO>\n\nApplication behavior changed:\n<NO/YES>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:359:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787288532,"text":"FASE — MACHINA CLEAN CORE + UI ONLY\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRemove ALL active patch architecture.\n\nFinal active application architecture must contain ONLY:\n\ncore/\nui/\n\nNo active:\n\npatches/\nfeatures/\nv2/\nv3/\n001/\n002/\n003/\n004/\n005/\n006/\n007/\n008/\n009/\n\nHistorical material may remain only under:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/archive\n/opt/Android/Machina/backups\n\n==================================================\n1. BACKUP GATE\n==================================================\n\nVerify checkpoint exists:\n\npre-remove-all-patches\n\nIf not:\nSTOP.\n\n==================================================\n2. FINAL ACTIVE SOURCE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nTarget:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\n\ncore/\n  catalog/\n  model/\n  persistence/\n  actions/\n  visuals/\n  defaults/\n  initialization/\n  search/\n  settings/\n\nui/\n  home/\n  search/\n  settings/\n  picker/\n  components/\n  theme/\n\nNo third architecture layer.\n\n==================================================\n3. CORE RESPONSIBILITIES\n==================================================\n\nCORE owns:\n\n- AppCatalog\n- HomeSnapshot\n- SlotRepository\n- LauncherActions\n- AppVisuals\n- DefaultAppsResolver\n- FirstInstallInitializer\n- SearchEngine\n- Search history state\n- Settings preferences/state\n- default app resolution\n- slot assignment logic\n\nCORE owns NO:\n\n- Compose layout\n- dp\n- colors\n- borders\n- corners\n- animations\n- Home geometry\n- Settings visual\n- Search visual\n\n==================================================\n4. UI RESPONSIBILITIES\n==================================================\n\nUI owns:\n\n- MachinaHome\n- Fav\n- SearchArea\n- P1\n- P2\n- Dock\n- AppPicker\n- Settings\n- particle animation\n- dimensions\n- spacing\n- colors\n- borders\n- corner radius\n- empty states\n- visual interaction presentation\n\nUI must NOT own persistence.\n\n==================================================\n5. REMOVE PATCH ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nFind all active runtime code under paths/names containing:\n\npatches\npatch\n001\n002\n003\n004\n005\n006\n007\n008\n009\n\nClassify:\n\nMOVE_TO_CORE\nMOVE_TO_UI\nDEAD\nARCHIVE_ONLY\n\nThen remove all active patch package references.\n\n==================================================\n6. REMOVE FEATURES LAYER\n==================================================\n\nDo not keep a separate features/ directory.\n\nMove:\n\nSearch engine\n→ core/search/\n\nSettings functionality\n→ core/settings/\n\nSlot editor logic\n→ core/persistence/actions as appropriate\n\nParticle animation\n→ ui/components/\n\nFirst install\n→ core/initialization/\n\nApp Picker\n→ ui/picker/\n\n==================================================\n7. SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\ncore/search/\n  SearchEngine.kt\n  SearchHistory.kt\n\nOwn:\n\n- query processing\n- app filtering\n- ranking\n- history max 3 MEMORY_ONLY\n\nUI:\n\nui/search/\n  SearchArea.kt\n  SearchBar.kt\n  SearchResults.kt\n\nNo geometry in Core.\n\n==================================================\n8. SETTINGS\n==================================================\n\nCORE:\n\ncore/settings/\n  SettingsStore.kt\n  SettingsState.kt\n\nOwn:\n\n- haptic preference\n- Dynamic Color preference\n- Search auto keyboard\n- other real settings\n\nUI:\n\nui/settings/\n  SettingsScreen.kt\n  SettingsPanel.kt\n\nKeep approved visual design.\n\n==================================================\n9. PARTICLES\n==================================================\n\nMove one shared animation implementation to:\n\nui/components/AnimatedParticleNetwork.kt\n\nUsed by:\n\nSearch\nSettings\n\nNo particle engine in Core.\n\nOne engine only.\n\n==================================================\n10. SLOT EDITOR\n==================================================\n\nCore:\n\nSlotRepository\nLauncherActions\nAppCatalog\n\nUI:\n\nAppPicker\n\nLong press interaction belongs to UI.\n\nAssignment writes go through Core repository.\n\nNo separate slot-editor feature package.\n\n==================================================\n11. FIRST INSTALL\n==================================================\n\nMove all first-install logic into:\n\ncore/initialization/\n\nDock semantic default resolution:\n\nPhone\nMessages\nBrowser\nMusic\nMail\n\nP1/P2 usage ranking.\n\nNo separate patch/module.\n\n==================================================\n12. HOME\n==================================================\n\nSingle Home owner:\n\nui/home/MachinaHome.kt\n\nStructure:\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav\n├── SearchArea\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\nGAP\n\nDOCK\n\nDock outside Home container.\n\n==================================================\n13. MAINACTIVITY\n==================================================\n\nMainActivity must remain thin:\n\nsetContent {\n    MachinaApp()\n}\n\nNo patch routing.\n\nNo feature router.\n\nNo business logic.\n\n==================================================\n14. DELETE ACTIVE LEGACY NAMES\n==================================================\n\nAfter migration active source must contain:\n\ngrep runtime refs for:\nPATCH\npatches\nV2\nV3\n001_\n002_\n003_\n004_\n005_\n006_\n007_\n008_\n009_\n\nExpected:\n0\n\nHistorical docs/archive excluded.\n\n==================================================\n15. DOCS\n==================================================\n\nCanonical active docs only:\n\ndocs/ARCHITECTURE.md\ndocs/CORE.md\ndocs/UI.md\ndocs/STATUS.md\n\nMove patch-era docs to:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/archive/docs-patches/\n\nDo not keep PATCH_STATUS.md as active project status.\n\n==================================================\n16. APK SIZE\n==================================================\n\nRelease R8 target:\n\n<= 7 MB\n\nPreferred:\n4–6 MB\n\nEnsure archived patch source/resources are not compiled.\n\nNo duplicate assets.\n\nNo static particle wallpaper.\n\n==================================================\n17. OWNERSHIP TARGET\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nAppCatalog owners = 1\nHomeSnapshot owners = 1\nSlotRepository owners = 1\nLauncherActions owners = 1\nAppVisuals owners = 1\nSearchEngine owners = 1\nSearchHistory owners = 1\nSettingsStore owners = 1\nParticle engines = 1\nHome UI owners = 1\nSettings UI owners = 1\n\n==================================================\n18. CORE/UI BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nCore Compose UI imports = 0\nUI persistence writes = 0\nUI PackageManager enumeration = 0\nUI UsageStats queries = 0\n\nCore must not depend on ui/.\n\n==================================================\n19. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n20. DO NOT DELETE BACKUP\n==================================================\n\nKeep:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/backups\n/opt/Android/Machina/archive\n/checkpoint pre-remove-all-patches\n\nDo not permanently delete historical source yet.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nMACHINA CORE + UI CLEAN BASELINE COMPLETE\n\nPre-clean checkpoint:\n<path>\n\nActive top-level architecture:\n<list>\n\nExpected:\ncore\nui\n\nActive patches directories:\n<n>\n\nActive features directories:\n<n>\n\nActive PATCH runtime refs:\n<n>\n\nCore files:\n<n>\n\nUI files:\n<n>\n\nAppCatalog owners:\n<n>\n\nHomeSnapshot owners:\n<n>\n\nSlotRepository owners:\n<n>\n\nSearchEngine owners:\n<n>\n\nSettingsStore owners:\n<n>\n\nParticle engines:\n<n>\n\nCore Compose imports:\n<n>\n\nUI persistence writes:\n<n>\n\nLegacy docs archived:\n<n>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nRelease APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease <= 7 MB:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSTATUS:\nCORE_UI_BASELINE_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
