/root/.codex/history.jsonl:371:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787303530,"text":"FASE — RENAME APP TO WORM\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/Machina/project\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRename the active application to:\n\nApp name:\nWorm\n\nnamespace:\ncom.worm\n\napplicationId:\ncom.worm\n\n==================================================\n1. GRADLE\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\napp/build.gradle.kts\n\nSet:\n\nnamespace = \"com.worm\"\n\ndefaultConfig {\n    applicationId = \"com.worm\"\n}\n\nDo not change:\n\ncompileSdk\ntargetSdk\nminSdk\nbuild types\nR8 configuration\ndependencies\n\n==================================================\n2. SOURCE PACKAGE\n==================================================\n\nMove active Kotlin source from:\n\napp/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\n\nto:\n\napp/src/main/java/com/worm/\n\nUpdate package declarations accordingly.\n\nDo not keep duplicate active source trees.\n\nExpected duplicate source trees:\n0\n\n==================================================\n3. APP LABEL\n==================================================\n\nSet user-visible application name to:\n\nWorm\n\nPrefer:\n\nres/values/strings.xml\n\n<string name=\"app_name\">Worm</string>\n\nManifest should reference:\n\n@string/app_name\n\n==================================================\n4. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nUpdate only package-dependent references required by the rename.\n\nKeep launcher/Home intent filters and current application behavior unchanged.\n\n==================================================\n5. IMPORTS\n==================================================\n\nUpdate imports referencing:\n\nit.gaetano.machinahome\n\nto:\n\ncom.worm\n\nNo compatibility aliases.\n\n==================================================\n6. CORE + UI ONLY\n==================================================\n\nPreserve current architecture:\n\ncore/\nui/\n\nDo not recreate:\n\npatches/\nfeatures/\nV2/V3 naming\n\n==================================================\n7. OLD PACKAGE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSearch active project for:\n\nit.gaetano.machinahome\n\nExpected after migration:\n0 runtime/source references\n\nHistorical backup/archive files are excluded from this requirement.\n\n==================================================\n8. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\nRelease target:\n<= 7 MB\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nWORM APP RENAME COMPLETE\n\nApp name:\nWorm\n\nnamespace:\ncom.worm\n\napplicationId:\ncom.worm\n\nSource root:\n<path>\n\nOld active package refs:\n<n>\n\nDuplicate source trees:\n<n>\n\nCore/UI architecture preserved:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nRelease APK size:\n<value>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:372:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787303664,"text":"FASE — FULL RENAME MACHINA → worm\n\nCURRENT ROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nTARGET ROOT:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nAPP NAME:\nworm\n\nAPPLICATION ID:\ncom.worm\n\nNAMESPACE:\ncom.worm\n\nARCHITECTURE TARGET:\ncore/\nui/\n\nNO active:\npatches/\nfeatures/\nV2/\nV3/\nPATCH 00x/\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRename the complete active application and project from Machina\nto worm, all lowercase.\n\nPreserve the current clean Core + UI architecture.\n\nDo NOT reintroduce any legacy patch architecture.\n\n==================================================\n1. SAFETY CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nBefore changing anything run:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl checkpoint pre-worm-rename\n\nRequired:\ncheckpoint created successfully.\n\nIf checkpoint fails:\nSTOP.\n\nReport exact checkpoint path.\n\n==================================================\n2. RENAME ROOT\n==================================================\n\nRename:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina\n→\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nThere must be only ONE active project root afterward.\n\nDo NOT leave a second active /opt/Android/Machina copy.\n\nHistorical backups may retain old names.\n\n==================================================\n3. CANONICAL ROOT STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nFinal root:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/\n\nExpected:\n\narchive/\nbackups/\ncheckpoints/\ndocs/\noutputs/\nproject/\nsnapshots/\nprojectctl\n\nDo not alter /opt/Android/toolchains.\n\n==================================================\n4. PROJECTCTL PATHS\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl\n\nCanonical paths:\n\nROOT=/opt/Android/worm\nPROJECT=/opt/Android/worm/project\nOUTPUTS=/opt/Android/worm/outputs\nSNAPSHOTS=/opt/Android/worm/snapshots\nCHECKPOINTS=/opt/Android/worm/checkpoints\nBACKUPS=/opt/Android/worm/backups\nDOCS=/opt/Android/worm/docs\n\nKeep:\n\nGRADLE_USER_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/gradle-home\nANDROID_HOME=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\nANDROID_SDK_ROOT=/opt/Android/toolchains/android/sdk\n\nNo /root/.gradle dependency.\n\nNo network requirement.\n\n==================================================\n5. GRADLE PROJECT NAME\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\nsettings.gradle.kts\n\nSet:\n\nrootProject.name = \"worm\"\n\nDo not rename unrelated Gradle modules unless required.\n\n==================================================\n6. APPLICATION ID / NAMESPACE\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\nproject/app/build.gradle.kts\n\nRequired:\n\nnamespace = \"com.worm\"\n\ndefaultConfig {\n    applicationId = \"com.worm\"\n}\n\nDo NOT change:\n\ncompileSdk\ntargetSdk\nminSdk\nbuild types\nR8 config\ndependencies\n\n==================================================\n7. APP LABEL\n==================================================\n\nSet user-visible app name:\n\nworm\n\nPrefer:\n\nproject/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml\n\nwith:\n\n<string name=\"app_name\">worm</string>\n\nManifest must reference:\n\n@string/app_name\n\nNo uppercase \"Worm\".\n\n==================================================\n8. SOURCE PACKAGE\n==================================================\n\nMove active Kotlin source from:\n\nproject/app/src/main/java/it/gaetano/machinahome/\n\nor any current active old namespace\n\nto:\n\nproject/app/src/main/java/com/worm/\n\nUpdate all active package declarations:\n\npackage com.worm...\n\nUpdate imports accordingly.\n\nDo not keep duplicate active source trees.\n\n==================================================\n9. ACTIVE SOURCE STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nFinal active source root should be conceptually:\n\nproject/app/src/main/java/com/worm/\n\ncore/\nui/\n\nNo active:\n\npatches/\nfeatures/\nv2/\nv3/\n001_*\n002_*\n003_*\n004_*\n005_*\n006_*\n007_*\n008_*\n009_*\n\nHistorical source may exist only under archive/backups,\noutside active Android source sets.\n\n==================================================\n10. CLASS NAMING\n==================================================\n\nRename active classes where they still contain obsolete product\nor migration names.\n\nExamples:\n\nMachinaApp\n→ WormApp or App\n\nMachinaHome\n→ WormHome or HomeScreen\n\nPrefer simple clean names.\n\nDo NOT use:\n\nV2\nV3\nPatch\nMachina\n\nin active architecture names unless technically unavoidable.\n\n==================================================\n11. MAIN ACTIVITY\n==================================================\n\nKeep MainActivity minimal.\n\nPreferred:\n\nsetContent {\n    WormApp()\n}\n\nor equivalent clean app entry.\n\nNo business logic.\n\nNo package scanning.\n\nNo persistence logic.\n\n==================================================\n12. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nUpdate active package-dependent references.\n\nPreserve only current required launcher/Home behavior.\n\nDo not restore obsolete legacy manifest entries.\n\nDo not change permissions unless required by package rename.\n\n==================================================\n13. DOCUMENTATION\n==================================================\n\nCanonical active docs under:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/docs/\n\nUse \"worm\" for the current product.\n\nPreferred active docs:\n\nARCHITECTURE.md\nCORE.md\nUI.md\nSTATUS.md\n\nHistorical Machina/V2/V3/PATCH documents may remain in:\n\narchive/\nbackups/\n\nDo not rewrite historical documents.\n\n==================================================\n14. OLD REFERENCE AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSearch ACTIVE project/infrastructure for:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina\n/opt/Machina\nit.gaetano.machinahome\nMachina\nWorm\nV2\nV3\nPATCH\n\nRequirements:\n\nOld root active refs:\n0\n\nOld package active refs:\n0\n\nUppercase app label \"Worm\":\n0\n\nPATCH/V2/V3 runtime architecture refs:\n0\n\nExclude archive/backups/history from these counts.\n\n==================================================\n15. CORE + UI ONLY\n==================================================\n\nPreserve architecture:\n\ncore/\nui/\n\nCore owns:\n- data\n- state\n- persistence\n- actions\n\nUI owns:\n- layout\n- visual presentation\n- interaction presentation\n\nDo not add a third architecture layer.\n\n==================================================\n16. PROJECTCTL VALIDATION\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl status\n\nVerify:\n\nROOT=/opt/Android/worm\nPROJECT=/opt/Android/worm/project\n\nNo stale Machina paths.\n\n==================================================\n17. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\nOffline build only.\n\n==================================================\n18. OUTPUTS\n==================================================\n\nBuild artifacts must export under:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/outputs/\n\nNo new outputs under:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina\n/opt/Machina\n\n==================================================\n19. APK SIZE BUDGET\n==================================================\n\nRelease/R8 APK target:\n\n<= 7 MB\n\nPreferred:\n4–6 MB\n\nDo not optimize debug size.\n\nReport:\n\ndebug APK size\nrelease APK size\n\nIf release > 7 MB:\nreport SIZE_GATE_FAILED,\nbut do NOT arbitrarily remove required functionality.\n\n==================================================\n20. POST-RENAME CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nOnly if:\n\nrename complete\nprojectctl status PASS\nDebug PASS\nR8 PASS\nSnapshot PASS\nSHA-256 PASS\n\ncreate:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl checkpoint worm-clean-baseline\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nworm FULL RENAME COMPLETE\n\nPre-rename checkpoint:\n<path>\n\nRoot:\n<path>\n\nExpected:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nProject:\n<path>\n\nApp name:\nworm\n\nnamespace:\ncom.worm\n\napplicationId:\ncom.worm\n\nSource root:\n<path>\n\nActive architecture:\n<list>\n\nExpected:\ncore\nui\n\nOld /opt/Android/Machina active refs:\n<n>\n\nOld /opt/Machina active refs:\n<n>\n\nOld package refs:\n<n>\n\nUppercase Worm app-name refs:\n<n>\n\nActive PATCH/V2/V3 architecture refs:\n<n>\n\nDuplicate active source trees:\n<n>\n\nprojectctl status:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nDebug APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease <= 7 MB:\n<YES/NO>\n\nPost-rename checkpoint:\n<path/N-A>\n\nSTATUS:\nWORM_CORE_UI_BASELINE_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:373:{"session_id":"01a02283-e2e0-7912-87f3-f952abfede67","ts":1787304128,"text":"FASE 01 — worm CORE + UI HOME BASELINE\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/worm/project\n\nAPP:\nworm\n\nPACKAGE:\ncom.worm\n\nREFERENCE IMAGE:\n824.png\n\nARCHITECTURE:\ncore/\nui/\n\nIMPORTANT\n\n824.png is the AUTHORITATIVE visual reference.\n\nImplement ONLY the Core + Home UI baseline necessary\nto reproduce this Home.\n\nDo NOT create:\n\npatches/\nfeatures/\nv2/\nv3/\nPATCH naming\n\nDo NOT implement advanced functionality yet.\n\n==================================================\n0. SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nCreate checkpoint before source changes:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl checkpoint pre-home-core-ui\n\nIf checkpoint fails:\nSTOP.\n\n==================================================\n1. ACTIVE SOURCE TARGET\n==================================================\n\nUse only:\n\napp/src/main/java/com/worm/\n\ncore/\nui/\n\nExpected:\n\ncore/\n  model/\n  catalog/\n  persistence/\n  actions/\n  visuals/\n\nui/\n  home/\n  components/\n  theme/\n\nNo third architecture layer.\n\n==================================================\n2. CORE RESPONSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nCore owns only:\n\n- HomeSnapshot\n- slot model\n- P1/P2/Dock state\n- AppCatalog contract\n- SlotRepository contract\n- LauncherActions contract\n- AppVisuals contract\n\nCore owns NO:\n\n- Compose layout\n- dp\n- colors\n- padding\n- borders\n- corner radius\n- animations\n- Home geometry\n\n==================================================\n3. HOME MODEL\n==================================================\n\nCreate one immutable HomeSnapshot.\n\nHard contract:\n\nP1 = 8 slots\nP2 = 8 slots\nDock = 5 slots\n\nExample concept:\n\nHomeSnapshot(\n    p1: List<HomeSlot>,\n    p2: List<HomeSlot>,\n    dock: List<HomeSlot>\n)\n\nHomeSlot must contain only stable app identity.\n\nNo Drawable.\nNo ImageBitmap.\nNo UI state.\n\n==================================================\n4. INITIAL BASELINE STATE\n==================================================\n\nFor this phase explicit empty slots are valid.\n\nDo NOT implement UsageStats autofill yet.\n\nDo NOT invent fake apps.\n\nP1:\n8 empty slots\n\nP2:\n8 empty slots\n\nDock:\n5 empty slots\n\n==================================================\n5. UI RESPONSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nUI owns:\n\n- Home positioning\n- Home outer container\n- Fav surface\n- Search surface\n- P1 surface\n- P2 surface\n- Dock external surface\n- borders\n- colors\n- corner radius\n- spacing\n- empty-state presentation\n\nUI never writes persistence.\n\n==================================================\n6. AUTHORITATIVE HOME STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nMatch reference 824.png.\n\nRequired hierarchy:\n\nHOME CONTAINER\n├── Fav. apps\n├── Search\n├── P1\n└── P2\n\nGAP\n\nDOCK\n\nDock is completely OUTSIDE Home container.\n\n==================================================\n7. HOME POSITION\n==================================================\n\nHome must be:\n\n- horizontally centered\n- compact\n- lower/middle portion of display\n- surrounded by visible wallpaper\n\nDo NOT:\n\nfillMaxHeight()\nfill whole display\ncreate fullscreen black panel\n\nTarget width:\n\napproximately 86–90% usable display width.\n\nUse responsive constraints, not absolute screen coordinates.\n\n==================================================\n8. HOME OUTER CONTAINER\n==================================================\n\nMatch screenshot.\n\nRecommended starting values:\n\nbackground:\nvery dark, approximately #0F0F11 family\n\ncorner radius:\n24dp\n\nborder:\n1dp subtle\n\nouter/internal padding:\n12–16dp\n\nheight:\ncontent-driven\n\nNo vertical weight expansion.\n\n==================================================\n9. FAV SURFACE\n==================================================\n\nFirst section inside Home.\n\nMust visibly match reference.\n\nContents:\n\nFav. apps\n\nApps 0\n\nSettings gear at right\n\nStyle:\n\nindependent rounded surface\n24dp corners\nsubtle border\ndark surface\n\nFav must NOT be plain rectangular text over outer container.\n\n==================================================\n10. FAV VISUAL AREA\n==================================================\n\nReserve visual/background area exactly in the Fav surface\nas shown in reference.\n\nFor this first Core+UI baseline:\n\nuse lightweight code-generated presentation only.\n\nDo NOT bundle large wallpaper/bitmap assets.\n\nAdvanced particle animation comes later.\n\nKeep visual hook ready but simple.\n\n==================================================\n11. SEARCH SURFACE\n==================================================\n\nSearch must already exist visually.\n\nReference target:\n\nrounded dark search surface\n\nmagnifier icon left\n\ntext:\n\nSearch apps...\n\nNo Search algorithm yet.\n\nNo keyboard logic yet.\n\nNo results yet.\n\nThis is UI baseline only.\n\n==================================================\n12. SEARCH SIZE\n==================================================\n\nCompact.\n\nSame internal width family as P1/P2.\n\nDo not render rejected style:\n\nmagnifier + bare text + long underline only.\n\nUse the rounded surface from 824.png.\n\n==================================================\n13. P1 SURFACE\n==================================================\n\nP1 is an independent rounded panel inside Home.\n\nTitle:\n\nP1\n\ntop-left.\n\nHard data capacity:\n\n8 slots\n\nfuture grid:\n\n4 columns x 2 rows\n\nFor empty baseline show centered empty state.\n\n==================================================\n14. P2 SURFACE\n==================================================\n\nSame component and geometry as P1.\n\nTitle:\n\nP2\n\ntop-left.\n\nRequired:\n\nP1 width == P2 width\nP1 height == P2 height\nP1 radius == P2 radius\nP1 padding == P2 padding\n\n==================================================\n15. EMPTY STATE\n==================================================\n\nP1/P2 empty state exactly follows reference hierarchy:\n\nsmall outline cube\n\nNo apps in this section\n\nAdd your favorite apps to access\nthem quickly.\n\nTarget:\n\ncube ~28–32dp\n\nprimary text:\nmedium emphasis\n\nsecondary:\nsmaller / muted\n\nDo not make empty content huge.\n\n==================================================\n16. P1/P2 HEIGHT\n==================================================\n\nCurrent previous implementations were too tall.\n\nUse compact fixed/measured panel height appropriate for\nfuture 2x4 grid.\n\nDo NOT use:\n\nweight(1f)\nfillMaxHeight()\navailable-space expansion\n\nP1 and P2 must remain compact.\n\n==================================================\n17. SPACING\n==================================================\n\nFollow reference proportions.\n\nUse shared tokens only.\n\nStarting target:\n\nHome padding:\n12–16dp\n\nFav → Search:\n12–16dp\n\nSearch → P1:\n12–16dp\n\nP1 → P2:\n8–12dp\n\nHome → Dock:\n16–20dp\n\nNo stacked duplicate Spacers.\n\n==================================================\n18. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nDock MUST be outside Home container.\n\nCompose hierarchy must conceptually be:\n\nColumn {\n    HomeContainer(...)\n    Spacer(...)\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\nNOT:\n\nHomeContainer {\n    ...\n    Dock(...)\n}\n\n==================================================\n19. DOCK STYLE\n==================================================\n\nIndependent compact rounded surface.\n\n5 slots.\n\n1 row.\n\nBackground:\nslightly darker than Home internal panels.\n\nCorner:\n24dp\n\nBorder:\nsubtle 1dp\n\nPadding:\ncompact\n\nFor now, with empty Core state:\n\nrender five empty slot positions subtly\nor keep visual slot structure clean.\n\nDo NOT show giant empty-state text in Dock.\n\n==================================================\n20. THEME\n==================================================\n\nCreate minimal theme under:\n\nui/theme/\n\nKeep APK lightweight.\n\nUse:\n\nsystem font\nMaterial/Compose primitives already available\nvector/system icons\n\nNo custom fonts.\n\nNo image libraries.\n\nNo large asset packs.\n\n==================================================\n21. COMPONENT REUSE\n==================================================\n\nUse one reusable panel component for P1/P2.\n\nUse one shared surface style/token family.\n\nAvoid duplicated Compose code.\n\n==================================================\n22. MAINACTIVITY\n==================================================\n\nMainActivity remains minimal.\n\nConcept:\n\nsetContent {\n    WormApp()\n}\n\nWormApp renders the Home baseline.\n\nNo business logic in MainActivity.\n\n==================================================\n23. APP ENTRY\n==================================================\n\nCreate clean:\n\nWormApp.kt\n\nNo:\n\nV3\nMachina\nPatch\n\nnaming.\n\n==================================================\n24. NO FUNCTIONAL SEARCH YET\n==================================================\n\nSearch surface is visual only.\n\nDo NOT implement:\n\nquery engine\nhistory\nIME\nresults\nPackageManager filtering\n\nThese come only after Home baseline is approved.\n\n==================================================\n25. NO SETTINGS YET\n==================================================\n\nSettings gear may be visible.\n\nClick callback can be inert/temporary.\n\nDo NOT build Settings screen in this phase.\n\n==================================================\n26. NO SLOT EDITOR YET\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT implement:\n\nlong press\nApp Picker\nslot assignment\n\nOnly Core contracts and Home rendering.\n\n==================================================\n27. NO FIRST INSTALL YET\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT implement:\n\nUsageStats\nPhone resolver\nMessages resolver\nBrowser resolver\nMusic resolver\nMail resolver\n\nOnly prepare clean Core interfaces if needed.\n\n==================================================\n28. CORE/UI BOUNDARY\n==================================================\n\nRequired:\n\nCore Compose imports = 0\n\nUI persistence writes = 0\n\nUI PackageManager calls = 0\n\nUI UsageStats calls = 0\n\nCore → UI dependencies = 0\n\n==================================================\n29. ACTIVE ARCHITECTURE\n==================================================\n\nAfter implementation active source architecture must be:\n\ncom/worm/\n  core/\n  ui/\n\nNo:\n\npatches/\nfeatures/\nv2/\nv3/\n\nActive Patch/V2/V3 runtime refs:\n0\n\n==================================================\n30. APK SIZE BUDGET\n==================================================\n\nRelease R8 hard target:\n\n<= 7 MB\n\nPreferred:\n4–6 MB\n\nDo NOT add dependencies unnecessarily.\n\nNo raster wallpaper bundled.\n\nNo GIF/video.\n\nNo custom font bundle.\n\nNo duplicate assets.\n\n==================================================\n31. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n32. OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nExport through projectctl under:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/outputs/\n\nDo not use Gradle output directory as final artifact location only.\n\n==================================================\n33. STATUS\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/docs/STATUS.md\n\nSet:\n\nBUILD_INFRASTRUCTURE: VALIDATED\n\nCORE: IMPLEMENTED\n\nHOME_UI: DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED\n\nCATALOG: CONTRACT_ONLY\n\nSEARCH: NOT_STARTED\n\nSETTINGS: NOT_STARTED\n\nSLOT_EDITOR: NOT_STARTED\n\nFIRST_INSTALL: NOT_STARTED\n\n==================================================\n34. DO NOT CHECKPOINT FINAL BASELINE YET\n==================================================\n\nPixel visual validation is required.\n\nDo NOT mark Home frozen.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT FINAL\n==================================================\n\nworm CORE + UI HOME BASELINE COMPLETE\n\nPre-change checkpoint:\n<path>\n\nActive source root:\n<path>\n\nActive architecture:\n<list>\n\nExpected:\ncore\nui\n\nHomeSnapshot owners:\n<n>\n\nP1 slots:\n<n>/8\n\nP2 slots:\n<n>/8\n\nDock slots:\n<n>/5\n\nHome UI owners:\n<n>\n\nHome compact:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome fullscreen:\n<NO/YES>\n\nFav rounded surface:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch rounded surface:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 title visible:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP2 title visible:\n<YES/NO>\n\nP1 size:\n<value>\n\nP2 size:\n<value>\n\nP1 == P2:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDock outside Home:\n<YES/NO>\n\nHome → Dock gap:\n<value>\n\nCore Compose imports:\n<n>\n\nUI persistence writes:\n<n>\n\nUI PackageManager calls:\n<n>\n\nActive Patch/V2/V3 refs:\n<n>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDebug APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease <= 7 MB:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSnapshot:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nSTATUS:\nHOME_UI_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
