ues for this device/density,\nwith WindowInsets only for safe system bounds.\n\nResponsive redesign comes later.\n\n==================================================\n5. NO SEARCH\n==================================================\n\nReference has no Search.\n\nExpected active Search UI:\n0\n\nNo:\n\nmagnifier\nunderline\nSearch text\nSearch space\n\n==================================================\n6. HOME OUTER\n==================================================\n\nBuild fresh.\n\nProperties derived only from reference:\n\nx\ny\nwidth\nheight\ncorner radius\nbackground\nborder\n\nNo:\n\nfillMaxHeight\nweight\nArrangement.SpaceBetween\ngeneric screen-centering\nold width tokens\n\n==================================================\n7. HOME POSITION\n==================================================\n\nReference requires:\n\nlarge wallpaper area above Home\n\nHome lower-middle on display\n\nDo not position below status bar automatically.\n\nUse measured reference top position.\n\n==================================================\n8. FAV\n==================================================\n\nFresh component.\n\nRender exactly:\n\nFav. apps\nApps 0\ngear right\n\nNo functional Settings.\n\nNo animation.\n\nNo additional subtitle.\n\nMatch reference bounds.\n\n==================================================\n9. P1\n==================================================\n\nFresh component.\n\nEmpty state only:\n\nsmall outline glyph\nNo apps in this section\nAdd your favorite apps to access them quickly.\n\nMatch reference panel bounds.\n\n==================================================\n10. P2\n==================================================\n\nReuse same component as P1.\n\nRequired:\n\nP1 == P2 geometry exactly.\n\n==================================================\n11. DOCK\n==================================================\n\nFresh external component.\n\nEmpty surface only.\n\nDo not place inside Home.\n\nMatch reference width/height/radius/gap.\n\n==================================================\n12. REMOVE OLD GEOMETRY\n==================================================\n\nAudit active source for Home-affecting:\n\nfillMaxWidth fractions\nheightIn\nrequiredHeight\nweight\noffset\npadding\nSpacer\nBoxWithConstraints calculations\ndisplay adaptation\ntop positioning\nAlpha geometry constants\n\nRemove all conflicting active paths.\n\nExpected geometry owner:\n1\n\n==================================================\n13. REFERENCE COLORS\n==================================================\n\nMatch only the visible dark hierarchy:\n\nwallpaper\n→ very dark Home outer\n→ slightly lighter Fav/P1/P2\n→ external dark Dock\n\nDo not introduce Material elevation/shadows not visible\nin reference.\n\n==================================================\n14. REFERENCE BORDERS\n==================================================\n\nUse subtle outlines only.\n\nNo heavy borders.\n\nNo double outlines.\n\n==================================================\n15. WALLPAPER\n==================================================\n\nActual system wallpaper remains visible.\n\nDo not bundle reference image.\n\nDo not bundle wallpaper.\n\nRoot background:\ntransparent / wallpaper-aware.\n\n==================================================\n16. STATIC ONLY\n==================================================\n\nNo:\n\nSettings\nDebug\nSearch\nparticles\ngestures\nhaptics\nfirst install\nautofill\nDock apps\nP1/P2 apps\n\nUI/001-r2 is visual baseline only.\n\n==================================================\n17. DEBUG SCREENSHOT DATA\n==================================================\n\nFor DEBUG build only, log once at composition/layout completion:\n\nHome bounds\nFav bounds\nP1 bounds\nP2 bounds\nDock bounds\n\nDo not log every frame.\n\nThis is only to compare actual device bounds to reference.\n\n==================================================\n18. FEEDBACK\n==================================================\n\nUpdate UI-001.md:\n\nUI/001-r2\n\n○ Home position\n○ Home width\n○ Home height\n○ Fav\n○ P1\n○ P2\n○ Dock\n○ Gaps\n○ Corners\n○ Borders\n○ Wallpaper\n○ Reference parity\n\n==================================================\n19. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nworm UI/001-r2 EXACT REBUILD COMPLETE\n\nPrevious UI/001:\nARCHIVED\n\nReference:\n<path>\n\nReference display:\n<px>\n\nReference Home bounds:\n<value>\n\nReference Fav bounds:\n<value>\n\nReference P1 bounds:\n<value>\n\nReference P2 bounds:\n<value>\n\nReference Dock bounds:\n<value>\n\nActive Home owners:\n<n>\n\nGeometry owners:\n<n>\n\nOld geometry refs:\n<n>\n\nSearch active:\n<NO/YES>\n\nSettings active:\n<NO/YES>\n\nMotion active:\n<NO/YES>\n\nHome actual bounds:\n<value>\n\nFav actual bounds:\n<value>\n\nP1 actual bounds:\n<value>\n\nP2 actual bounds:\n<value>\n\nDock actual bounds:\n<value>\n\nCore modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSTATUS:\nUI_001_R2_DEVICE_TEST"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:414:{"session_id":"01a028ac-a922-71c0-a1e8-5a6a45b32a97","ts":1787388909,"text":"FASE — FULL RENAME Machina → worm / com.worm\n\nCURRENT ROOT:\n/opt/Android/Machina\n\nTARGET ROOT:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nAPP NAME:\nworm\n\nAPPLICATION ID:\ncom.worm\n\nNAMESPACE:\ncom.worm\n\nBASELINE:\n19-08-2026 device-approved baseline\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nRename the restored Machina project completely to worm,\nincluding project root, package namespace and applicationId,\nwhile preserving current functionality and device-approved baseline behavior.\n\nDo NOT redesign UI.\nDo NOT add features.\nDo NOT change runtime behavior.\n\n==================================================\n1. SAFETY CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nBefore rename:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina/projectctl checkpoint pre-worm-full-rename\n\nIf checkpoint fails:\nSTOP.\n\n==================================================\n2. ROOT RENAME\n==================================================\n\nRename:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina\n→\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nDo not leave a second active Machina copy.\n\n==================================================\n3. PROJECTCTL\n==================================================\n\nUpdate:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl\n\nCanonical paths:\n\nROOT=/opt/Android/worm\nPROJECT=/opt/Android/worm/project\nOUTPUTS=/opt/Android/worm/outputs\nSNAPSHOTS=/opt/Android/worm/snapshots\nCHECKPOINTS=/opt/Android/worm/checkpoints\nBACKUPS=/opt/Android/worm/backups\nDOCS=/opt/Android/worm/docs\n\nPreserve current Android SDK / Gradle toolchain configuration.\n\n==================================================\n4. GRADLE\n==================================================\n\nUpdate app Gradle config.\n\nRequired:\n\nnamespace = \"com.worm\"\n\napplicationId = \"com.worm\"\n\nDo NOT change:\n\ncompileSdk\ntargetSdk\nminSdk\ndependencies\nbuild types\nR8 settings\n\n==================================================\n5. SOURCE PACKAGE\n==================================================\n\nMove current active source package to:\n\napp/src/main/java/com/worm/\n\nUpdate all:\n\npackage declarations\nimports\nmanifest class references\n\nRemove active references to old package namespace.\n\nDo not duplicate active source trees.\n\n==================================================\n6. APP LABEL\n==================================================\n\nSet user-visible app name:\n\nworm\n\nUse:\n\n<string name=\"app_name\">worm</string>\n\nManifest should reference:\n\n@string/app_name\n\n==================================================\n7. MANIFEST\n==================================================\n\nUpdate only package-dependent references required by rename.\n\nPreserve launcher/Home behavior exactly.\n\nDo not add/remove permissions unless strictly required by namespace/package rename.\n\n==================================================\n8. PROJECT NAME\n==================================================\n\nUpdate Gradle root project name where present:\n\nrootProject.name = \"worm\"\n\n==================================================\n9. OLD NAME AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nSearch active project/infrastructure for:\n\n/opt/Android/Machina\nit.gaetano.machinahome\nMachina\nmachinahome\n\nExpected active runtime/build refs:\n0\n\nHistorical backup/archive/docs may retain old names.\n\n==================================================\n10. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl build\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nSnapshot = PASS\nSHA-256 = PASS\n\n==================================================\n11. OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nworm FULL RENAME COMPLETE\n\nRoot:\n<path>\n\nApp name:\nworm\n\nnamespace:\ncom.worm\n\napplicationId:\ncom.worm\n\nSource root:\n<path>\n\nOld Machina root refs:\n<n>\n\nOld package refs:\n<n>\n\nDuplicate active source trees:\n<n>\n\nRuntime behavior changed:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSTATUS:\nRENAME_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
