/root/.codex/history.jsonl:424:{"session_id":"01a028ac-a922-71c0-a1e8-5a6a45b32a97","ts":1787400145,"text":"FASE — worm BETA 001 VALIDATION\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/worm/project\n\nBASELINE:\n19-08 restored stable\n\nPACKAGE:\ncom.worm\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nValidate the current restored baseline.\n\nIf and ONLY if all build checks pass, promote this exact source\nstate to:\n\nBETA 001\n\nDo NOT modify Home.\nDo NOT modify Core.\nDo NOT modify gestures.\nDo NOT add features.\n\n==================================================\n1. PRE-CHECK\n==================================================\n\nVerify:\n\n- Gradle wrapper exists\n- namespace = com.worm\n- applicationId = com.worm\n- old package refs = 0\n- source tree exists\n- no duplicate source tree\n\n==================================================\n2. CLEAN GENERATED BUILD STATE\n==================================================\n\nRemove generated state only:\n\nproject/.kotlin\nproject/.gradle\nproject/build\nproject/app/build\n\nDo NOT modify source.\n\n==================================================\n3. DEBUG BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\ncd /opt/Android/worm/project\n./gradlew clean assembleDebug\n\nRequired:\n\nSUCCESS\n\nRequired APK:\n\napp/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk\n\n==================================================\n4. RELEASE / R8\n==================================================\n\nRun the current release/minified build task.\n\nPreferred:\n\n./gradlew assembleRelease\n\nRequired:\n\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\nDo NOT disable minification to force success.\n\n==================================================\n5. APK AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nReport:\n\nDebug APK path\nDebug APK size\n\nRelease APK path\nRelease APK size\n\nRelease target:\n<= 7 MB\n\n==================================================\n6. SHA-256\n==================================================\n\nGenerate SHA-256 for available APKs.\n\nVerify hashes.\n\n==================================================\n7. SOURCE SAFETY\n==================================================\n\nVerify after build:\n\nHomeScreen modified:\nNO\n\nMachinaCore modified:\nNO\n\nLauncherInteractionPatch modified:\nNO\n\nRuntime behavior changed:\nNO\n\n==================================================\n8. BETA PROMOTION GATE\n==================================================\n\nPromote to BETA 001 ONLY if:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\nold package refs = 0\nduplicate source trees = 0\nrelease <= 7 MB\nunexpected source modifications = 0\n\nIf any fail:\n\nBETA 001 = NOT CREATED\n\n==================================================\n9. BETA STATUS\n==================================================\n\nIf gate passes:\n\ncreate/update:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/docs/STATUS.md\n\nwith:\n\nAPP: worm\nPACKAGE: com.worm\nBASELINE: 19-08-2026 stable\nCHANNEL: BETA\nBETA: 001\nBUILD: PASS\nDEVICE VALIDATION: REQUIRED\n\nDo not add new features.\n\n==================================================\n10. CHECKPOINT\n==================================================\n\nIf projectctl is available:\n\n/opt/Android/worm/projectctl checkpoint beta-001\n\nIf projectctl is not available:\n\nreport CHECKPOINT_PENDING\n\nDo NOT fake checkpoint success.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nworm BETA 001 VALIDATION\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nDebug APK:\n<path>\n\nDebug APK size:\n<value>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nRelease APK:\n<path>\n\nRelease APK size:\n<value>\n\nRelease <= 7 MB:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSHA-256:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nOld package refs:\n<n>\n\nDuplicate source trees:\n<n>\n\nHome modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nCore modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nRuntime behavior changed:\n<NO/YES>\n\nBeta gate:\n<PASS/FAIL>\n\nBETA:\n<001 / NOT_CREATED>\n\nCheckpoint:\n<path / PENDING>\n\nSTATUS:\n<BETA_001_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED / BUILD_FAILED>"}
/root/.codex/history.jsonl:425:{"session_id":"01a028ac-a922-71c0-a1e8-5a6a45b32a97","ts":1787400495,"text":"FASE — worm BETA 001 ADD FAV/SEARCH UP REVEAL\n\nROOT:\n/opt/Android/worm\n\nPROJECT:\n/opt/Android/worm/project\n\nBASELINE:\n19-08 restored Home\n\nPACKAGE:\ncom.worm\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nAdd back the missing interaction:\n\nSWIPE UP\n→ Fav/Search area expands\n\nwithout redesigning the restored Home.\n\nDo NOT modify:\n\n- Home base geometry\n- P1 geometry\n- P2 geometry\n- Dock geometry\n- Home colors\n- Home width\n- Home collapsed appearance\n\n==================================================\n1. SWIPE UP\n==================================================\n\nRestore vertical swipe UP interaction.\n\nWhen accepted:\n\nstate:\nCOLLAPSED → EXPANDED\n\nThe expandable area belongs between:\n\nFav\nand\nP1\n\nP1/P2/Dock remain anchored.\n\n==================================================\n2. EXPANDED STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nExpanded order:\n\nFav\n↓\nSearch reveal area\n↓\nSearchBar\n↓\nP1\n↓\nP2\n\nDock remains outside Home.\n\n==================================================\n3. SEARCH BAR\n==================================================\n\nRestore the previous Search visual:\n\nmagnifier LEFT\nquery/input\nONE underline\n\nNo filled pill.\nNo rounded Search card.\nNo enclosing border.\n\n==================================================\n4. SEARCH REVEAL\n==================================================\n\nThe expanded space must open fully.\n\nNo partial settled state.\n\nUse explicit:\n\nCOLLAPSED\nEXPANDED\n\nOn release:\nsettle completely to one state.\n\n==================================================\n5. PARTICLE NETWORK\n==================================================\n\nRestore particle-network animation inside the expanded Search area.\n\nRequired:\n\n- moving dots\n- visible connection lines\n- fills the whole reveal area\n- presentation only\n- no touch interception\n\nOne particle engine only.\n\n==================================================\n6. SEARCH AREA\n==================================================\n\nParticles/results region sits ABOVE SearchBar.\n\nSearchBar stays at bottom of reveal region.\n\n==================================================\n7. KEYBOARD\n==================================================\n\nWhen Search receives focus:\n\nkeyboard opens\n\nP1:\ndoes NOT move\n\nP2:\ndoes NOT move\n\nDock:\ndoes NOT move\n\nOnly Search/reveal region may react to IME space.\n\n==================================================\n8. DOWN\n==================================================\n\nSwipe DOWN from expanded:\n\nEXPANDED → COLLAPSED\n\nReturn to exact restored Home geometry.\n\n==================================================\n9. HAPTIC\n==================================================\n\nUP accepted:\none short semantic haptic\n\nDOWN accepted:\none short semantic haptic\n\nMOVE:\nno haptic\n\nUse supported:\n\nView.performHapticFeedback(...)\n\n==================================================\n10. GESTURE ARBITRATION\n==================================================\n\nVertical gesture accepted when:\n\nabs(dy) > touchSlop\nAND\nabs(dy) > abs(dx)\n\nOnce vertical:\nlock axis.\n\nDo not interfere with horizontal gestures.\n\n==================================================\n11. HOME LOCK\n==================================================\n\nCollapsed state must remain visually identical to the current\nrestored 19-08 Home.\n\nP1/P2/Dock dimensions:\nUNCHANGED\n\n==================================================\n12. BUILD\n==================================================\n\nRun:\n\n./gradlew assembleDebug\n./gradlew assembleRelease\n\nRequired:\n\nDebug = SUCCESS\nR8 = SUCCESS\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nworm FAV/SEARCH UP REVEAL RESTORE COMPLETE\n\nCollapsed Home modified:\n<NO/YES>\n\nUP reveal:\n<YES/NO>\n\nFull expanded state:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearchBar:\n<YES/NO>\n\nSearch style:\n<UNDERLINE/OTHER>\n\nParticles:\n<YES/NO>\n\nParticle engine owners:\n<n>\n\nP1 moves:\n<NO/YES>\n\nP2 moves:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDock moves:\n<NO/YES>\n\nDOWN collapse:\n<YES/NO>\n\nUP haptic:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDOWN haptic:\n<YES/NO>\n\nDebug:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nR8:\n<SUCCESS/FAILED>\n\nSTATUS:\nBETA_001_DEVICE_VALIDATION_REQUIRED"}
